  ('zcrm_1579374000104823003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063690010', 'Maggie Blandford', NULL, 'Member updated their payment information.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-07 09:51:03', '2022-10-07 09:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104808008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094599002', 'Nathanael Huff', NULL, '10.7.22 - Nathan called because he went to the ENT and he has a $1,035.00 bill to pay. Nathan wanted to know how to open a "claim" to get the bill paid. I explained to Nathan that he is responsible for his IUA amount of $1,000 for that bill and then anything else above that can be submitted to Zion Health for payment if it is eligible. I sent Nathan the instructions on how to open a Need with Zion and he will call the concierge team if he needs any assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-07 09:22:04', '2022-10-07 09:22:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104808003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '10.7.22 - Brooke called because her husband, Tim, is having back pain and may need an MRI. Brooke thought that the concierge could get a referral to her but I let her know that we are unable to do so. Brooke is going to try to start with CirrusMD for a referral and if she feels that Tim needs to go to the ER then she will take him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-07 09:10:14', '2022-10-07 09:10:14'),
