  ('zcrm_1579374000104787078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082307002', 'Massimo Giammarco', NULL, '10.6.22 - Max called in because he is having issues getting a prescription for Xanax redone correctly by his current doctor. Max wanted to find out if there was anything we could do on our end to assist him, but I had to inform him that all of our options will not fill any controlled substances. He is going to see if he can keep reaching out to his provider for the correction. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-06 12:42:04', '2022-10-06 12:42:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104783059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', NULL, 'Received itemized bills from member via email and a second email with the following note:

Also was never informed about a rate increase I’ve sorted through all emails I have found nothing, and can I decrease my voluntary portion that I contribute to the account? Can I move it from the 375 to lower since it doesn’t pay

Will review with Operational Team on Friday, 10/7/22', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-10-06 12:29:04', '2022-10-06 12:30:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104797028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, 'Betsy called in and asked about her membership with us.  I gave her the pricing and advised her of the 20th of the month billing date.  She will be putting a CC in to pay I will send her the PU form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-06 12:27:41', '2022-10-06 12:27:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104799015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779372', 'Donna Ryan', NULL, '10-6-22 She didn''t show any new Life Change Event. But, it looks like they approved it. She had been paying into Anthem for 15 years until C4 told her to cancel in order to get APTC plan through C4. So, she did and doesn''t really have a LCE. But, perhaps they can see her membership ended and they approved a new one. Who knows...

Dear Donna Ryan - 202992827,

We’re excited to let you know the validation process for your application has been completed! Your application has been forwarded to our Member Services Team to finalize.

Initial premium payment is required to complete your enrollment for coverage. If you’ve already paid this amount, great!

You can pay your first month’s premium online at https://payment.anthem.com/CO. This is for your first payment only and cannot be used for future payments.

    You’ll need your application ID Donna Ryan - 202992827 when paying online
    You may also call Member Services at 1-855-453-7031 to make your payment.

If you have additional questions or have trouble making a payment, please call Member Services at the number above.

We know you have many options when choosing a health plan and want to thank you for your business. Thank you.

Individual Enrollment Support Team
1-844-430-3659
