  ('zcrm_1579374000104787063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001375013', 'Betsy Gustafson', NULL, '10.6.22 - Betsy called for her prescription "coverage" information. I let Betsy know what our prescription quote form process is and sent her one via email. She stated that she will use the form next time but didn''t realize she didn''t have prescription coverage. I also sent Betsy a welcome call scheduler because I noticed she did not have a call yet. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-06 09:30:03', '2022-10-06 09:30:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104797008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072820022', 'Erik Horton', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after the price increase and some issues w/Cirrus.  Jan is aware of this.  She shared that they would be going direct /Zion.  I will cancel in A123 &amp; Cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-06 09:21:14', '2022-10-06 09:21:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104787058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '10.6.22 - Macay called regarding his wife having back pain from her pregnancy. She wants to have physical therapy done, so I advised them to get a treatment plan from the PT office and submit it to Zion Health for pre-approval. He also asked about his shoulder injury and if he would use the same process to open a need and I confirmed. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-06 09:20:33', '2022-10-06 09:20:33'),
