  ('zcrm_1579374000104771065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080107001', 'Lorna Mulkey', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2324 Question : Hi, I have an HSA account with MPB Zion. I have an IUA of $1000. I am pretty healthy and I''ve never used this insurance since I''ve had it a year now. But I need to see a vascular surgeon regarding some circulation problems I''m having in my legs. If they recommend surgery, would I be qualified for coverage after the first thousand dollars? I just want to make sure I understand how it works. Thank you, Lorna Mulkey', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-05 23:13:10', '2022-10-05 23:13:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104783039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '10-5-2022;  LM for Janet re: Care Conn info we need to proceed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-05 18:01:51', '2022-10-05 18:01:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104783031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092940002', 'Curt Freeman', NULL, '10-5-2022:  Curt called to see if we could help w/his labs.  Last time they were ~$800.  He doesn''t have a DPC, so they cannot help w/pricing.  I sugg getting ''cash-pay'' pricing ahead of time and we walked thru JasonHealth.com.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-05 16:39:04', '2022-10-05 16:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104783026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '10-5-2022:  Maya called to see how to handle a visit for her daughter when she has an ear infection.  We went over their 1k IUA &amp; how to present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a discount, and to call us if it looks like this will continue (ie: tubes).  Made sure she knows 6mos deadline.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-05 16:15:33', '2022-10-05 17:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104783021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '10-5-2022:  Jatin called to see if they could get their flu shots at Costco &amp; have Planstin pay.  We went over must be in ntwk &amp; how to get their shots cov.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-05 15:59:57', '2022-10-05 15:59:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104783016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497146', 'Jon King', NULL, '10-5-2022:  Jon called - he got ins through his employer.  I sent him the CE form since his advisor is inactive &amp; he now has other insurance.  He will get this sent in by the 15th of the month so they have time to cancel his auto pymt on the 20th.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-05 15:49:21', '2022-10-05 15:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104783011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086032', 'Fadi Malouf', NULL, '10-5-2022:  Fadi called to cancel.  He''s already tt Charles, so I reminded him to have Charles sent Patti approval to process.  I walked him thru how to get to the form.  He says this is a temporary cancellation.  Hopefully, Charles went over pre-x, etc., but Fadi is a producer as well, so I assume he knows all the implications of starting and stopping.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-05 15:47:06', '2022-10-05 15:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104727038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101748002', 'Thomas Nezbeth', NULL, '10.5.22 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-05 13:43:14', '2022-10-05 13:43:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104727033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103256002', 'Vanessa Edwards', NULL, '10.5.22 - Attempted to do the members welcome call but the husband advised me that I would be doing the call with him. I let David (Vanessa''s husband) know that we need to have a permission letter signed by both him and Vanessa and then we will reschedule the welcome call for another time. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-05 13:28:23', '2022-10-05 13:28:23'),
