  ('zcrm_1579374000104783006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '10/5/2022:  Robin &amp; her husband are okay with the pre-x implications for his recent carpal tunnel surgery.  I sent her the MPB Memb Chg form &amp; asked her to submit it by the 15th.  I let her know their Oct 20th draw will go to $625 for Memb + Spouse = their Novemeber monthly healthcare contribution.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-05 12:51:01', '2022-10-05 12:51:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104727023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583361', 'Renee Rowe', NULL, '10.5.22 - Renee called for fair pricing on a transvaginal and pelvic ultrasound. I sent both to Renee via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-05 12:24:35', '2022-10-05 12:24:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104775008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099052002', 'Jeffrey Schmitz', NULL, 'Jeffery called in and stated he did sent his Advisor. Whitney Kline, and email stating that he needs to cancel his plan. So, since he did at least try to reach out to her, I sent him the link to the cancellation form via email. I explained to him what to do and that the form will go back to Patti Baron who takes care of all the cancellations, along with that I will personally let Patti know and to be on the lookout for his form. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-05 11:19:38', '2022-10-05 11:19:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104721031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101717002', 'Eamon Quinlan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-05 10:44:36', '2022-10-05 10:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104775003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189260', 'Quentin Green III', NULL, 'Quentin called in and said his login credentials that he was given did not work for him to get into his Member Portal. I tried as well and nothing was working, including trying the Forgot Password. So, I spoke to John and he showed me that there is a completely different member portal for the Sedera Conversion Members through Admin123. I got the link, tried Quentin''s login info, and I was able to get in no problem. I called Quentin back and let him know, along with emailing him the link to that portal with his login info again. Secondly, he asked about if with Zion if it is the same type of process for a Need as it was with Sedera, and being cash pay with his IUA, etc. He is going to be having Knee surgery in the future. I told him yes exactly the same, emailed him the How to submit a Need with Zion email, and lastly told him to call Zion now and tell them that his Knee surgery is going to happen, etc. Zion will be able to walk him through everything with ease. He was super happy and understood everything. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-05 10:34:23', '2022-10-05 10:34:23'),
