  ('zcrm_1579374000104629046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '10-4-22 Janet needs a major hysterectomy for a large fibroid and she''s missed being outside of the pre-x clause by 1 month. Her Dr. told her it will cost $60K-$70K. I suggested she calls the MPB Concierge Team to get a fair price for her exact procedure. If she waits until March 2023, she will have $25K in sharing. If it will be more than $25K, she can hop onto ACA for Jan. 1st. She will let me know what she learns from MPB Team.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-04 16:46:40', '2022-10-04 16:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104653018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081593002', 'Heather Bacchus', NULL, '10-4-2022: Heather called.  She needs an Abdominal CT w/contrast.  I resent her the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail &amp; we walked thru HCBB to find it.  She really appreciated learning how to access this.  She just got the diag today.  After her CT she will call to get help w/sub a ''med need''.  She understands there is a 6-mo deadline.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-04 16:38:31', '2022-10-04 16:38:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104653013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601108', 'Kevin Fechtmeyer', NULL, '10-4-2022:  Sarah was having trouble getting into her CirrusMD acct.  When I walked thru it with her, we got in.  She''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-04 16:15:29', '2022-10-04 16:15:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104653008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921182', 'Shanna Cochran', NULL, '10-4-2022:  Shanna called to cancel.  Somehow I had 2 callers on the line at the same time.  Asked her if I could call her back, but then she did not answer.  LM asking for her to call me again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-04 16:12:51', '2022-10-04 16:12:51'),
