  ('zcrm_1579374000104647038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', NULL, 'Spoke to Jeff on 10/3/2022 regarding why he is so upset with the price increase.  Explained that the price change emails were sent out several times ahead of time and that I spoke with his agent as well to reach out to him.  He stated that Zion had not paid his bills and that he was very upset and needed answer.  I asked him to reach out to me via email with all his concerns and I would look into it for him.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-10-04 14:02:36', '2022-10-04 14:02:36'),
