  ('zcrm_1579374000104651018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628002', 'Timothy Crotty', NULL, 'Sabrina called in and said she wants some info about the entirety of her plan as she is a new member. I asked if she had her Welcome Call and she did not. I pulled her up and her Call is scheduled for 10.6.22 in 2 days from now. I told her that all of what she needs to know is going to be discussed on that call. She specifically said that her husband has a Treatment plan for his chiropractor and she stated she heard in order for chiropractic care to be shared it has to have a treatment plan. So, she wanted to know where to mail or send it in to. I directed her to Zion Health, gave their #, and transferred her. All set until her Welcome Call on Thursday 10.6.22. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-04 11:36:47', '2022-10-04 11:36:47'),
