  ('zcrm_1579374000104569031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103277001', 'Kim Robinson', NULL, '10.4.22 - Kim called looking for PHCS network providers for mammography, colonoscopy and family practice. I sent her all search results and a wellness visit script to use while scheduling her appointments. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-04 10:54:59', '2022-10-04 10:54:59'),
