  ('zcrm_1579374000104594043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107380001', 'Edward Barlow', NULL, 'She called in on tuesday oct 4th and wanted to know about our plans as well as telehealth and specialists and her asthma coverage and her husbands back pain. She is 39 her husband is 42 and they live in north carolina charlotte. They have 4 children and she said she wants to look around for other options first and then will give us a call back. I let her know how to se the enrollment page and explained the various benefits of the plan to her. I also explained the pharmacy discounts.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-04 08:55:38', '2022-10-04 08:55:38'),
