  ('zcrm_1579374000104646023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086945001', 'Christian Staas', NULL, 'Member called in wanting information on where they could get the  DPT booster so they can see their granddaughter.   They are under a time constraint.  I advised that she should reach out to Planstin to see if she could pay out of pocket and be reimbursed.  She told me that Planstin told her to call me.  I suggested that due to network issues she pay out of her HSA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-04 08:17:03', '2022-10-04 08:17:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104647003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Rhonda returned my call on 9/22 around 920am.  Wanted to know that she needed a colonoscopy and also alluded to the fact that had she still been on the plan she would have had a plan in place to cover the colonoscopy.    I told that in the state of Washington, Healthshare is no longer available and at this point we could not help her for that reason as well as she has 6 months before she ages up.

