  ('zcrm_1579374000104641016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, '10-3-2022:  Sophia needs to sched an MRI, but it will need to be sub for a ''med need'' there if it is going to go over her $500 IUA and is qual (she''s done something to her shoulder).  She knows there is a 6mos deadline &amp; will call when ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-03 17:33:19', '2022-10-03 17:33:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104641008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080304002', 'Marcell Hetenyi', NULL, '10-3-2022:  Marcell called asking questions about insulin.  His doc is using it for weight loss (50lbs).  He knows it''s out of pocket, but didn''t know strengths or quantities.  I just priced the lowest strengths &amp; either a single pen or carton for him.  The 3 items were ~ $890 - $1300+.  I showed him how to sub an RX Quote form, made sure he knew the details we need, went over sometimes the mfg offer better pricing, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-03 17:11:11', '2022-10-03 17:11:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104627018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '10-3-22 David is aging into Medicare for Nov and needs to remove himself from Ilyse''s plan. I told him to call C4 to remove him and they will contact Anthem about the removal and updated payment amount. He will have Lori Ilyse Streim do that part since she''s the primary person on the plan.  He thinks his income is still accurate at $46,500 for 2022 even though he had a new job and made more money this year. His account seems to be good to go still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-03 17:05:24', '2022-10-03 17:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104641003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, '10-3-2022:  Hillary''s been trying to get help w/a skin issue via CirrusMD.  She knows we are trying to fix the issue.  We talked about opt for ''cash-pay'' for a derm, no ntwk for issue, call us to sub a ''med need'', deadline for ''needs''.  
     - Had quest on her mammograms due to dense tissue.  She''s going to conf w/Planstin what they would consider paying for.  Knows IF ''prev'' all entities must curr be in ntwk.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-03 16:54:32', '2022-10-03 17:21:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104588029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 2318 Question : Hi - need to know if when I see a dermatologist tomorrow, if I say I have insurance - going to see someone from the provider list through Multiplan - or if I say self pay. This is for an issue that has come up but would also like a skin check if possible - just dont'' know what is or not covered by my plan. Thank you.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-03 16:39:45', '2022-10-03 16:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104613036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103458001', 'Jason Morton', NULL, '10.3.22 - Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-03 14:47:59', '2022-10-03 14:47:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104627013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, '10-3-22 Michelle changed her IUA due to the large price increase.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-03 14:45:55', '2022-10-03 14:45:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104591010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095808002', 'Barbara Brannock', NULL, 'Barb called in and asked the process of getting her Mammogram for her yearly checkup, as she has not had to utilize her plan as of yet. Explained the Preventative Process and how she needs to stay in the PHCS Network, show her Planstin card, and the provider bills Planstin directly. She also needs a referral to get a Mammogram and said she needed to do her yearly Physical as well. Looked up her provider, he was not showing in network. She is going to call him and ask if they participate in network. If not, she will look up a provider. I sent her the email with the link and instructions, along with the list of Radiologists in her area for her Mammogram once she gets her referral. All set for now. She said she felt a lot more comfortable with how simple this is and that she has the Concierge whenever she needs. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-03 14:38:57', '2022-10-03 14:38:57'),
