  ('zcrm_1579374000104627003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104626002', 'Matt Wohlgemuth', NULL, '10-3-22 Matt just removed himself from Raissa''s membership and re-enrolled in CARE+ as of Nov. 1st 2022. Their original start date was April 1st, 2021. $185/$1000. He was super appreciative of my help and will do the Welcome Call to get back up to speed and I mentioned he will need to make sure he gets the Virtual Healthcare app working again since always a problem with plan changes. I will follow through.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-03 10:20:02', '2022-10-03 10:20:02'),
