  ('zcrm_1579374000104555078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '9-30-29 He called and is super bummed about the price change and feels stuck. Between this and Hilary''s plan they are now paying $1000 a month for entire family. He says he needs to go make more money now. Ugh. He was nice about it though.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-30 16:34:32', '2022-09-30 16:34:32'),
