  ('zcrm_1579374000104506114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079033002', 'Lakshmi Murthy', NULL, '9-30-2022: Lakshmi called asking if he can use CirrusMD - sounded like he thought he could use them as his PCP.  So we went over what they can do for him.  He sounded good with it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-30 16:24:40', '2022-09-30 18:07:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104555068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '9-30-22 Called about the price increase of $50 which was a shock and tough for her. Her husband is on Medicare. Her best guess at household income is $50K-$60K. So, she will call me end of Oct. early Nov. to see what the new plans and rates look like for ACA instead and weigh the pros and cons.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-30 16:16:03', '2022-09-30 16:16:03'),
