  ('zcrm_1579374000104555023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, '9-30 Daryl is all set with price increase. Their area prices are insane for insurance. So, he understands the need for age banding but he says he a good risk. :-) They are healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-30 14:50:24', '2022-09-30 14:50:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104555018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '9-30-22 Received Bright Health''s approval email but I still can''t make the payment for her yet. Check back on Monday. I spoke with Christine with strong accent and she can''t make the payment yet either bc it''s still processing on their end.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-30 14:43:21', '2022-09-30 14:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104555013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '9-30-22 I just called Krista to let her know they are standing strong with the decision per her appeal for sharing cost of about $1995 for a Need that wasn''t submitted within the 6 month deadline. 

Tim''s response was this, "This one has been thoroughly looked at by our appeals committee. I cannot see how our why our team would look at this any differently based on the member’s circumstance. Her IUA was exceeded on 1.31 (she says it was not reached until May?)and payments made by her on 3.15. Her first communication with us regarding the whole event was not until 9.15. Her points about a computer malfunctioning or bill not arriving until May (we show EOS from Plastin were sent in March) do not justify waiting until September.   

Looking back at this circumstance it would have been best to advise this member to open a needs request back on 1.31 or at least on 3.15 when payments were made that exceeded her IUA. If she had been actively working with us and delays happened there could have potentially been more leeway. We could have potentially assisted her with her providers and delays that she may have been having. It is not the outcome any of us want, but this one will be finalized, and our hope is that the member can be understand of our position for the community. Fortunately, her out of pocket in a normal more expensive traditional plan would not have been less, but her premium would be more. Wendy, I know with you I am preaching to the choir, but hopefully this member can understand the full scope of this circumstance."

She will be looking elsewhere moving forward. I let her know we are also always looking for new, great options. We don''t have anything else to share with her today but that might change soon. She might be a good candidate for Sedera if we partner with them again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-30 14:23:07', '2022-09-30 14:23:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104555008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104871002', 'Hannah Wilson', NULL, '9-30-33 Hannah is 30 and works for Counseling and Education Center (CEC) . They pay for DPC Appleton Clinics. Since she''s young and doesn''t need mammo or colonoscopy and price was a bit too high for DIRECT, I realized CARE+ will serve her well. $1000/$240 or $2500/$185. She used to have asthma as a kid and no longer, no meds for it, only birth control meds, no tobacco. She will do her wellness visit at Appleton Clinics. I explained no other wellness included with membership other than what she can get at Appleton Clinics.  She will ponder and we have an appt next Friday to enroll if she decides to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-30 13:34:08', '2022-09-30 13:34:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072708018', 'Lara Forsyth', NULL, '9-30-22 See notes under Lara Vazquez from her original account. She has free CARE for 24 months until Aug. 2023, it looks like.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-30 13:27:43', '2022-09-30 13:27:43'),
