  ('zcrm_1579374000104448041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '9-29-22 I left vm for Robin since she sent a notice to Patti about price increase from $275 to $325. I explained the timing and reasoning for the increase. I also told her to check spam since she has gmail. I will send her an email now as well showing her how to update her address.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-29 16:30:38', '2022-09-29 16:30:38'),
