  ('zcrm_1579374000104448026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107380008', 'Brady Litts', NULL, '9-29-22 Brody was referred by his girlfriend Madison Abbott since he doesn''t have insurance right now. He changed jobs and lost insurance about July 1st. So, he''s missed his SEP. Only option is MCS. I sent him the link to the site to watch the video and just tried calling him back. No answer. He''s healthy, just has slightly high blood pressure but hasn''t started on any medications yet. No tobacco. He''s a seasonal worker and will earn about $50K, so not likely to get an APTC at age of 26. Hopefully he''ll call me back when he''s free.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-29 15:16:59', '2022-09-29 15:16:59'),
