  ('zcrm_1579374000104448013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '9-29-22 Normandie is enrolling now and we talked about her pre-x condition again and she''s planning to keep her current plan for the first year of this membership to protect her in case of any issue with her lung disease. They are joining SECURE $1000/$915 for Nov. 1st start date. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-29 14:41:55', '2022-09-29 14:47:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104448008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485451', 'Bernhard Donaubauer', NULL, '9-29-22 Bern called bc he received the letter stating his price increase to $365 but he''s aging into Medicare in Oct. Patti said the letter went out 2 days before she cancelled his membership. There''s nothing more for him to do and he can disregard the letter and price change. I left a vm for him letting him know what I learned.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-29 14:24:02', '2022-09-29 14:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104448003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '9-29-22 Martha was surprised by the drastic increase and the Urgent email. She hadn''t received any prior notification, so she was worried something was going wrong with MPB/Zion. I explained the reason for the change. She''s going to stay put for now, unless something better comes along. I told her I''d let her know if anything changes. She was appreciative of my call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-29 14:20:36', '2022-09-29 14:20:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104415003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079988002', 'Wayne Jatsek', NULL, '9-29-2022:  Melanie called.  She has surg sched tomorrow for a nasal mass biopsy.  She''s super concerned because Zion has not yet determined if the surg is approved (her doc''s off uses a 3rd pty to sub med rec & they haven''t done that yet).  Now she''s thinking she may cancel until she knows.*
     - IF this is det pre-x (which it doesn''t sound like but we cannot guar), she''s in her "waiting period" and it would all be out-of-pocket until past Dec 1 2022,
- This surg is 17k.  Somehow she did not understand the Care Conn process at all.  (What she heard is she''d save $500, but we''d chg everything & she''d have no choices). 
     - This surg is a biopsy to see if they can operate & remove the mass.  So, they may have a 2nd surg.  Again if pre-x, even after her ann date, 2 surg could be way more exp than the 2nd yr 25k.
     - IF she resched until they appr or to get to anniv date - she may be willing to see if Care Conn can help.
     - HCBB lists her dr as high quality, using high priced facilities:  Kenneth D. Rodriguez, MD Otolaryngology - Higher than average overall doctor quality. Usually uses high cost facilities
4.6 of 5 star patient satisfaction rating.  (216) 844-6000
     * I sugg she call surg off BEFORE deciding to cancel.  Does cancelling put her health at risk?  Have to weigh they risks.  She wanted me to decide.  I told her only MD can offer med advice.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-29 13:49:31', '2022-09-29 13:49:31'),
