  ('zcrm_1579374000104334027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628002', 'Timothy Crotty', NULL, 'Member called in and was basically asking a number of questions about her plan.  She had questions about Chiropractic & the MSEAP.  Asked about the how the plan works and Preventative.  I advised that she didn''t have preventative.  She talked about possibly Changing to Secure also asked about $5000 IUA pricing.  I went over the Chiropractic treatment plan submission and that it could not be "open ended".  Mentioned discounts on Whole Health Living for Maintenance.   This all should have been decided on prior to enrollment.   Member should be more secure in their decision 2 days prior to starting plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-29 10:45:18', '2022-09-29 10:45:18'),
