  ('zcrm_1579374000104335003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032070', 'Danielle Hatch', NULL, '9.29.22 - Left Danielle a vm regarding which card she should present at the provider''s office for sick visits for her child. I advised Danielle that she is self-pay and went through the process in the message but I also told her to give us a call if she needs any further assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-29 08:59:30', '2022-09-29 08:59:30'),
