  ('zcrm_1579374000104288013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081205002', 'Tessa Tarr', NULL, '9.29.22 - Tessa called just to verify that they do not have a copay for their well women''s visits, I told Tessa that the office needs to bill Planstin directly for this visit since they are an in-network provider. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-29 08:34:33', '2022-09-29 08:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104318003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758457', 'Bradley Steele', NULL, 'Spoke to Brad Steele about possible health insurance contacts and new advisors....he will direct a few people he knows and speak to co-workers about SECURE Plan.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-09-29 08:33:32', '2022-09-29 08:33:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104308003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code cards to member and husband. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-29 08:25:23', '2022-09-29 08:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104276013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082411001', 'Clement Wong', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking w/Wendy.  I will notify Planstin.  Member had not been charged so no refund necessary.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-29 08:15:14', '2022-09-29 08:15:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104288008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '9.29.22 - Jody called with a different script for Synthroid. I sent her the new coupon. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-29 08:09:07', '2022-09-29 08:09:07'),
