  ('zcrm_1579374000104217059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '9-28-2022: Sent e-mail notification WHLC Registration link now working.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 17:16:52', '2022-09-28 17:16:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Sent e-mail notification that WHLC Registration link now working.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 17:16:14', '2022-09-28 17:16:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104219028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, '9-28-22 Rita is cancelling due to the increased rate. She found Impact Health and will pay $240 for $5000 IUA or AUA and $260 for $2500.  So, I can''t argue. She''s struggled with this membership since inception. She can try another and see if she comes back. Says no pre-x for 12 years. Takes some meds though.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-28 17:00:02', '2022-09-28 17:00:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103044012', 'Timothy McCoy', NULL, '9-28-2022: Saundra called.  She was concerned she hadn''t rec''d an RX card yet &amp; she''s leaving town.  So we disc how we price RXs on the disc sites.  I ran one of her son''s meds &amp; she was very pleased.  When she gets home later, we''ll walk thru how to find the RX Quote form online.
     - Saundra says they haven''t rec''d the MPB.Health cards, but their employee did.  It seems a bit too soon to ask Kelly to resend.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 16:24:44', '2022-09-28 16:24:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103277001', 'Kim Robinson', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Kim called to verify I could see her 1099 - yes, &amp; it''s readable.  She set up her ''Welcome Call'' for after 10/1/2022.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 15:38:43', '2022-09-28 15:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Never heard back from Michelle or Rick.  Our prices must have been &gt; than what they found.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 15:13:13', '2022-09-28 15:13:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104219023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, '9-28-22 Melody wants to explore other options and started talking to another broker not knowing that I can help with that too. They spend most money on healthy living and don''t want to pay $915 a month when they never use their membership. The other agent told her she can get an APTC at $125-$140K income and choose a Cigna PPO (not true) and pay only $600+. I find this hard to believe! She had to run and was glad to now that I can help still. She''ll call me back. No SEP for them now. So, will have to wait until Jan. 1st. This other agent seems to be offering erroneous information or she''s not understanding it correctly. She''s stressed and knows the time is shortening to make a decision. Perhaps change to higher IUA to make it work for them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-28 15:05:50', '2022-09-28 15:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080966010', 'David Ebaugh', NULL, '9-28-2022:  David wanted to know the process for everything.  He has never done his ''Welcome Call'' so I sent the temp &amp; he''s going to have that next week.  He will call after that so we can use the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail as a resource &amp; walk thru things he''s still uncertain of.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 14:59:52', '2022-09-28 14:59:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104188170', 'Avshalom Blum', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 14:28:17', '2022-09-28 14:28:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104169063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105428002', 'Steven Vertz', NULL, 'He also has his own real estate business qualifying him for the secure plan, he said he would likely be buying for the first effective date of november.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-28 14:17:34', '2022-09-28 14:17:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104169058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105428002', 'Steven Vertz', NULL, 'Steven called in to the hotline looking for a plan for him and his family, it''s for him, his wife, his son and his daughter. He had some concerns in regards to the coverage of his wife''s high blood pressure and his daughters birth control. We spoke on the various benefits of our secure plan and also reason he was switching insurance. he was tired of overpaying for traditional insurance and didn''t want to continue with temporary 6 month insurance plans as he feared that he would not be covered in between plans. He is also health conscious and him and his wife are very into alternative and holistic medicine (which made MPB HEALTH more appealing to them given our connections to the alternative and wholistic health space.him and his family are from wisconsin and his wife is a nurse, his daughter is in college and he''s a whiskey/beer guy over wine.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-28 14:16:22', '2022-09-28 14:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Carolyn called very upset.  She took her daughter to her well-child visit.  The doc ordered labs that were prev, why weren''t they pd for?  "You need to pay for those."  We did educ on what the ACA MEC is & that the gvmt decides what is & is not pd for.  She was upset that she didn''t know.  I referenced the e-mail sent to her by Vanessa in Feb & pointed to the link so she can see what the gvmt says is a part of the plan.  If she has questions, referred her to Planstin, but we do not determine what is & is not cov.  She''s going to call the lab to see if she can get ''cash-pay'' price. (let her know once it goes thru the system they often will not chg the pricing, but it''s worth a shot).    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 14:04:55', '2022-09-28 14:06:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104093002', 'Gretchen Bruner', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 13:57:41', '2022-09-28 13:57:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411262', 'Michael Hicks', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Michael called.  He was working w/some man yesterday, who said he''d send an e-mail, but Michael hasn''t rec''d anything.  I see John Kach was in his file yesterday &amp; from Michael says they were working on, I think he was working with John .  Trans him to John''s line.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 13:53:43', '2022-09-28 13:53:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104087002', 'Eric Galey', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 13:53:15', '2022-09-28 13:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104076002', 'Troy Ireland', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 13:49:56', '2022-09-28 13:49:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103922002', 'Gary Zoz II', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 13:46:38', '2022-09-28 13:46:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290291', 'Fred Blum', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Fred called about re-instating his son, but thought it might be cheaper to just have his son sign-up on his own.  We priced it up &amp; that''s corr.  He''s going to contact his advisor Charles Frohman for help &amp; to see if there''s a short term option Charlie might have since 11/1/22 will be the earlies eff date.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 13:46:20', '2022-09-28 13:46:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103921002', 'John Greene', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 13:38:08', '2022-09-28 13:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103573008', 'Jacob Needham', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Sharon called again.  She wants to have her &amp; Jacob on a ''Welcome Call''.  Sent her the temp to sched.
     - Sent the ''Perm to Discuss'' form as well so Jacob can sign &amp; submit since Sharon will be doing much of the work on this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 13:23:24', '2022-09-28 13:23:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409010', 'Julie Macki', NULL, 'Member 10/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM-9/28 Spouse called in and they have a new CC they did not get my email.  I directed them to the website to grab the form.  They will submit new Payment info. 9/29-member submitted PU form I will update &amp; rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 13:18:00', '2022-09-29 09:54:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937155', 'Edwin Horney', NULL, 'Member''s 10/22 payment declined 1st notice sent out via email &amp; VM-9/28 9/30-Member left VM to rerun pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 13:13:22', '2022-09-30 08:39:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104187026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062151025', 'Diana Lim', NULL, 'Member''s 10/22 payment declined (billed 9/27) 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 9/28 9/30-member called in and said that she hadn''t received email I sent.  I resent out of Outlook.  She will be updating Pmt Method.  Member submitted PU form I will rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-28 12:53:56', '2022-09-30 09:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104219018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082411001', 'Clement Wong', NULL, '9-28-22 Clement wants to cancel because of the huge price increase that isn''t feasible and pissed at the last minute notice. He found something that covers medications and is better for him since he''s a tobacco user. I think it''s better for him since he''s 50+ and has significant limitations bc of tobacco use. He was fine with the membership until the price change. Nice and will complete cancellation on his own when not driving.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-28 12:44:48', '2022-09-28 12:44:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104219013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104626002', 'Matt Wohlgemuth', NULL, '9-28-22 Talked with Matt bc he and Raissa are splitting up. He will keep his membership as EO on CARE+ at $2500 IUA/$185. He''s super healthy and really just wants catastrophic, no wellness. He has his own tree cutting business that he''s built for past 10 years and PT at Beaver Creek in winter. He will buy out Raissa and stay in house at current address. I will help him remove himself from her membership and help him re-enroll in his own membership on Monday, Oct. 3rd for Nov. effective. They are working to unwind all of their connected payments and such.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-28 12:34:25', '2022-09-28 12:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104219008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '9-28-22 Ryan wanted to better understand their membership to decide if it''s best for them. He took many notes. He had wellness visit and I coached him about coding as preventative and resubmitting bill to Planstin since was charged for entire wellness visit, $258 for Dr. visit and crazy high cost labs for basic PSA, cholesterol, etc. He learned of Direct Labs from his client. So, he understands the value of contacting the MPB Concierge Team for help with that and everything else I coached him on. His son had an in-grown toenail procedure after meds didn''t work. It was about $800 plus few other costs. Might slightly exceed $1000. He now knows of 6 month time limit, so he''ll submit everything in case there are more expenses. Also, both boys had dermatology visits that are ongoing for some skin issues.  He thinks most everything is within the past 6 months. So, he''ll work on submitting all of it.  He and wife have colonoscopies scheduled in Oct. and Dec. He will discuss it all with his wife. But, realizes this year was a learning year and will better utilize Concierge for all needs. He''s on track and very appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-28 12:29:50', '2022-09-28 12:29:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Raissa Wilkes', NULL, '9-28-22 Talked with Matt bc he and Raissa are splitting up. He will keep his membership as EO on CARE+ at $2500 IUA/$185. He''s super healthy and really just wants catastrophic, no wellness. He has his own tree cutting business that he''s built for past 10 years and PT at Beaver Creek in winter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-28 12:21:54', '2022-09-28 12:21:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104633001', 'Cathy Gibbons', NULL, 'Just finished speaking to Cathy. She''s a little upset that her doctor isn''t available all the way until March 9th so we are going over the list of PHCS providers to help find her a new one. She is getting the SECURE plan for her &amp; her husband. She told me she will try to get the application done today but forsure by the end of this week.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-09-28 12:17:51', '2022-09-28 12:17:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104217003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Sent Asiye RX Quote for the following.  Meijer was cheapest, but she doesn''t have a Meijer near her:
     - Sertraline HCL (Gen Zoloft) 100mg., #90 - Costco''s Retail Price of $13.53   (no coupon attached)
     - Hydroxyzine HCL  25mg., #180 = $21.38 at Costco on Good RX
     - Levothyroxine 75mcg, #90 = $14.10 at Costco on Good RX     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 12:16:23', '2022-09-28 12:16:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104169048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105287009', 'Christina Rampone', NULL, 'I''ll call back at friday 1 P.M. She was interested in the SECURE plan. and wanted to make sure she got coverage for her OBGYN and PAP SMEAR. She is 27 years old and learned of us through her mother who is currently a member with us. She is an accountant with her own business and works remote. She lives in miami and is paying 560 a month for her current insurance and is looking to save money on insurance.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-28 11:33:24', '2022-09-28 11:33:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104169043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103065002', 'Lisa Dannen', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-28 11:20:01', '2022-09-28 11:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571152', 'Wayne Porter', NULL, '9-28-2022:  Wayne called.  He seems very conf about this plan.  Asked if we will pay for ER visits.  We disc when to go there, when to call CirrusMD, Urg Care Cntrs, present as ''cash-pay'', call us for help if ''med need'', etc.  I think he understands?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-28 11:19:13', '2022-09-28 11:19:13'),
