  ('zcrm_1579374000104072040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100808002', 'Kimberly Steinbruck', NULL, '9-27-2022:  Rich and Kimberly called.  Rich has a bump on his hand &amp; wants to get it looked at. I sent invites to both for Cirrus MD &amp; helped them get set up on their cell phones.  Also went over how to handle a reg doc, ''cash-pay'' to $2500 IUA, call us for sub a ''med need'' if nec before 6 mos deadline.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-27 18:04:51', '2022-09-28 15:16:33'),
