  ('zcrm_1579374000104092013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081762001', 'Michael Gaffey', NULL, 'Contacted client to discuss increase of monthly payment for program.   Client called back and needed some answers, but was OK with increase of monthly fees.   Further instructed client to contact MPB Health concierge team re questions they have.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-09-27 17:14:09', '2022-09-27 17:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104072032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083214', 'Jesse Chatham', NULL, '9-27-2022:  Jesse called re: his colonoscopy.  We found his doc in ntwk, he''s going to ck if the facility &amp; anesthesiologist are in ntwk too.  We went over screening vs diagnostic &amp; moving to healthsharing w/1k IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-27 16:24:47', '2022-09-27 16:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104082069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077866084', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, '9-27-22 Judy just did her mammo and wellness a Jeff is aging into Medicare for Jan. 2023. He can wait to do his wellness. They don''t fund an HSA. So, she decided to change to CARE+ from SECURE.  She completed the online form just now for Oct. 1st effective date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 16:14:15', '2022-09-27 16:14:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104082061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082742002', 'Kara Baas', NULL, '9-27-22 Talked with Kara and they will stay put with the higher rate. They want to keep wellness and I advised her to call MPB Concierge next time she wants labs or to do wellness bc she did wellness at non-insurance accepting provider. So, wound up paying for labs and wellness visit. She knows to call Concierge for labs now too to get best cash price.  All set. Husband can get employer coverage but it was $800+ for crappy, high ded plan. Alone it''s still $3500 Ded, so still doesn''t make sense to move him either.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 15:54:36', '2022-09-27 15:54:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104072027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103545002', 'Stephen Villegas', NULL, '9-27-2022:  Tony Manzanares called.  Michael McKenny referred Stephen to MPB (but is not showing as a referral source) wanted to make sure Stephen''s appl went through &amp; he''s set for 10/1/22.  I sugg Stephen ck his e-mail because there are ''Welcome'' items there (maybe in spam?).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-27 15:53:41', '2022-09-27 15:53:41'),
