  ('zcrm_1579374000104092003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080943002', 'Roy Ellis', NULL, 'Called client to possible concerns with monthly increase....Called number on clients file...no voicemail, no answer.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-09-27 15:47:33', '2022-09-27 15:47:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104072016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171361', 'Nathan Padilla', NULL, '9-27-2022:  Nathan Padilla called totally frustrated. He says he''s been bounced around by about 10-people &amp; he''s just trying to cancel his membership. I asked if his advisor Darius Kohanim was one of them &amp; apparently that''s not one of the people he spoke to. Due to his mood, I showed him how to sub a cancellation online, then notified Patti of the situation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-27 15:13:02', '2022-09-27 15:13:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104032101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075397002', 'Scott Tallman', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change IUA from $1000 to $2500.  I will notify Planstin &amp; Change plan in A123  (outlook)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-27 14:49:41', '2022-09-27 14:51:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104082053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '9-27-22 Patricia was a bit on fire about the price increase from $235 to $300 but it should only be up to $245 bc she has a $2500 IUA! She was pissed about her experience with her wellness visit bc she had two issues she discussed with her doctor which were carpel tunnel and a shoulder issue. The follow up call for her shoulder or carpel tunnel was at her cost which frustrated her. Some of the blood work was at her cost and she thinks out whole system is a failure. She also refused to get carpel tunnel surgery since she doesn''t believe in that for this type of issue. Believes she''s the perfect steward of the membership and doesn''t use it much.  But, she now understands the differentiation of Planstin for wellness and Zion for MCS and virtual healthcare and Life Care. She will ponder CARE+ over night at $185/$2500 CARE+ and remove the wellness and HSA part since that was her challenging aspect. She''s a hypnotherapist and studied Dolores Cannon part life regression!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 14:36:45', '2022-09-27 14:36:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104082048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163125', 'Sharon Linnebur', NULL, '9-27-22 Sharon called to ask about acupuncture and mole removal. I left a vm explaining high level what''s involved and told her to call MPB Concierge Team for assistance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 14:15:15', '2022-09-27 14:15:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104082043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844140', 'Kevin Pfaff', NULL, '9-27-22 Talked with Kevin and gave him CARE+ and DIRECT options and IUA changes and he decided to stay put with the increase from $500 to $625 ES. He needs a colonoscopy in the next year or so and wife gets mammograms and wellness stuff. They will leave well enough alone. They are in Venice, FL directly in the line of the oncoming hurricane right now! It may hit land by midnight tomorrow night. They are bracing themselves. UGH! Super nice and appreciative of my call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 14:03:51', '2022-09-27 14:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104082038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073109042', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, '0-27-22 Kim called about price change but is fine with it. Email indicated that she should call me so she did. They seem to be all set. I left her a vm just now in case she still needs to talk.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 13:52:06', '2022-09-27 13:52:06'),
