  ('zcrm_1579374000104082033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712271', 'Carey Dubois', NULL, '09.27.22:  Texted Carey re: the price increase.  Asked him to contact me and let me know if he''s ok with the increase or if he wants to change his IUA or plan.  Told him he will be billed at the new price tomorrow starting the month of October.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-27 13:26:56', '2022-09-27 13:26:56'),
