  ('zcrm_1579374000104082028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '09.27.22:  Texted Liz & Steve, advising them to let me know if they are ok with their price increase or if they want to change their IUA or plan.  Asked them to respond today as they will be billed at the new price tomorrow.
Saw an email dated 9.23.22 from Liz, letting me know that although it will be a hardship on them to keep the plan at that increased price, as Steve''s pay was cut this year, they intend to stay with the plan - don''t want to go with employer health insurance.  Liz said she is now interested in setting up an HSA and would like to discuss this process.  
I texted them back and apologized that I didn''t see their email until this afternoon.  I also emailed Liz to thank her for her response and told her to contact me when she''s ready to get more info. on setting up an HSA.  Patti was copied on this email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-27 13:19:02', '2022-10-27 15:34:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104032075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  After I cleared w/Wendy I will cancel him.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel &amp; refund 10/22 share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-27 13:10:50', '2022-09-27 13:10:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104082023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '9-27-22 Carolyn wanted to discuss different options to lower monthly but wants to keep HSA and doesn''t want to raise IUA, so she''ll keep it as the new rate of $625/$1000. She also has a skin thing she wants removed. She thinks it may only cost a few $100''s. I suggested she find out the cash price. If it''s below $1000 IUA then just get it done. If above, then wait until Jan. 2023 when sharing is up to $25k.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 13:09:54', '2022-09-27 13:09:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104063025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, 'Spoke to client and he was a little concerned about price increase.  He understands the reasons and he will probably lower his IUA in the very near future.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-09-27 13:07:46', '2022-09-27 13:07:46'),
