  ('zcrm_1579374000104082018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '9-28-22 Quentin called to see if his OPD price is changing. I talked with Patti and there''s no indication yet of a change. So, we will leave it alone. Admin123 doesn''t have a new product yet. He also needs to remove his payment method by Oct. 20th bc his divorce is final. I left a vm for Betsy Green and send an email with instructions to update it. Hopefully she will follow through.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-27 12:55:32', '2022-09-27 12:55:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104052018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '9.27.22 - Jody did not inform me that she needed the brand name for Synthroid. I redid her script quote with a new coupon for Hyvee, please see attached coupon. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-27 12:34:05', '2022-09-27 12:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104072008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '9-27-2022:  Jani called. We went over a lot:
