  ('zcrm_1579374000104072003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101897001', 'Daniel Kane', NULL, '9-26-2022: Daniel called. Needs to chg eff date of his plan to 11/1/22. Helped him sub req. He also asked about his 2 cards. Told him those will both be imp once he''s eff. He''ll hold onto &amp; sched a ''Welcome Call'' for after 11/1/22. - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-27 10:41:41', '2022-09-27 10:41:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104063013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090892002', 'Amy Morin', NULL, 'Phillip, Amy''s husband who is under her on their plan here, called into the Concierge while I am covering the line, and he said about a few weeks ago now, he had gone to the ER. He is just now getting the bills in the mail and needed to know what to do now. I explained to him that this is a perfect example to explain to him how anything like this is going to work. I told him that he is going to be subject to pay out of pocket ONLY up to their $1k IUA, not a penny more, ask to be billed the rest is the bill(s) are more thank $1k, but he already has the bills now which is great, and he is to contact Zion Health, submit the proof of his $1k IUA payment(s), the rest of the billing, and Zion will set Phillip up with a case worker and walk him through the entire process. Once Zion has all the documentation they need, they will contact the Provider Phillip went to directly, and negotiate on his behalf, and finally Zion will pay the provider directly as no more cost to Phillip. I sent both Phillip & Amy, his wife who is the primary on their plan, the email explaining how to do all of this, along with Zion''s contact # at the bottom. Phillip was very grateful and seemed surprised how easy this was. He left happy and satisfied, all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-09-27 10:29:52', '2022-09-27 10:29:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104032043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102643002', 'Kimberly Yeager', NULL, 'Member''s 10/1 share amount declined 1st notice sent out via email &amp; VM - 9/27 Member submitted PU form I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-27 10:27:34', '2022-09-27 12:15:07'),
