  ('zcrm_1579374000104032030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'Member''s 10/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 9/27  9/30-snd notice sent via email &amp; VM 9/30-I was in contact with member who told me that he would have $ on 10/14 I told him until 10/5.  He advised me that he would try to get me the money.  10/13-finally received word from member that he had $ available.  He wants me to take October &amp; November I will rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-27 10:18:31', '2022-10-14 06:59:31'),
