  ('zcrm_1579374000104052013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282132', 'Amanda Hoskins', NULL, '9.27.22 - Amanda called because she is PREGNANT! I spoke to her about starting a Need with Sedera and we got her warm transferred so that she could speak with them about anything else she may need to do to open this maternity need successfully. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-27 10:05:12', '2022-09-27 10:05:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104052008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '9.27.22 - Matthew called in quite rudely regarding a bill he received for his recent colonoscopy. He wanted to know why he pays ME to send him to RCI. I tried to explain to Matthew that RCI is the company that makes the determinations when it comes to paying for his preventative care. Matthew insisted that I needed to talk to RCI on his behalf, and when I told him that I couldn''t he continued to get angry. I attempted to stay on the phone with Matthew while I transferred him to RCI but I lost him as soon as I hit transfer. I will be speaking to Wendy regarding this members attitude towards the concierge team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-27 10:02:55', '2022-09-27 10:02:55'),
