  ('zcrm_1579374000104004029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256010', 'Marc DiNunzio', NULL, '9-26-2022:  Marc called.  His rate inc went from $235 to $325  &amp;  his IUA went from 2500 to 1k without his req it.  Also, on the notification e-mails, it''s showing To: = Blank, so he did not rec notices of the increase.  It didn''t sound like his advisor had the chance to tt him either.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-26 17:43:02', '2022-09-26 17:43:02'),
