  ('zcrm_1579374000103979028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, '9-26-2022:  Mandy e-mailed that her CirrusMD issues were never resolved &amp; wanted me to fix them.  Went in &amp; it looks like it was taken care of as promised back in Jan.  I was able to send invites to both Trent &amp; Mandy at their unique e-mail addresses.  Then let Mandy know to look for their invitations in their unique e-mail accts &amp; they can both add their minor children.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-26 13:34:09', '2022-09-26 13:34:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103950018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081884002', 'Amit Singh', NULL, 'Leah Garcia, Amit''s Healthcare Advisor here that enrolled him and his wife into the plan, messaged me on SalesIQ a few minutes ago, and said she needed the Cancellation Form to send Amit and his wife. I explained to her the usual process of cancelling members and she said she has spoken to the both of them already and tried to save it. They are going direct with Zion because it is much cheaper for them and will be saving a lot of money. Leah DID try and save it, so, there is not really anything further that can be done. I pulled Amit''s CRM profile up here and it shows that Patti Baron about 23 minutes ago, already cancelled Amit and his wife''s account. So, I explained this to Leah, and that she doesn''t need to send the cancellation form to them as they are already cancelled per Patti''s doing. Leah said that is perfect and everything is all set then. I sent Leah the cancellation link so she can have it for future use, she thanked me and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-09-26 13:24:53', '2022-09-26 13:24:53'),
