  ('zcrm_1579374000103936023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104048', 'Lori Goldman', NULL, '9.26.22 - Lori called regarding her CirrusMD services, and I advised her that I tagged her on a support ticket to CirrusMD. I answered a few of her questions regarding going to a PCP to get referred to a cardiologist. I sent Lori a list of PCP''s in her area and she is going to go from there. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-26 09:58:19', '2022-09-26 09:58:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103979008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101104002', 'Tennison Barry II', NULL, 'Spoke to client to confirm enrollment....she had a lot of questions, but she and spouse have not completed welcome conference call...advised client to set up welcome call to answer any questions.  Client stated she will set up the welcome call.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-09-26 09:36:09', '2022-09-26 09:36:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103936018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081605001', 'Mary Harper', NULL, '9.26.22 - Mary called in with many questions regarding her plan since she has yet to use it. She was a tad bit confused because she received that Zion Health newsletter that stated she had $250.00 to use towards a wellness visit. I had to explain to Mary that it was specifically for Zion Health''s members who purchased a specific plan through Zion directly. I explained the self-pay process with Mary and she asked to speak with her agent directly so I transferred her to Kevin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-26 09:16:42', '2022-09-26 09:16:42'),
