  ('zcrm_1579374000103910056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, '9-23-2022:  Erin needed help with two things:
     - Her daughter used to have activity induced asthma.  Now they are moving to a more all the time asthma?  She was curious if they will look at it as the same thing.  Her daughter is going to she a pulmonologist & while she''s there she will get more details, pres as ''cash-pay'', save the det inv w/med coding, receipts, etc, then we can look at sub a ''med need'' if she''d like to see how Zion looks at it.  We also talked about the pre-x phase in amts, dates, etc.
     - Her daughter needed an inhaler.  It''s expensive, so we got her the best price for today & I''ve sub info to Reid to see if he can source for refills down the road. E-mailed it to Erin & she will fwd to her daughter in Durango, CO  81301.  Here''s what I sent:
        Generic Flovent 110mcg HFA Inh = $124.16 at Walgreen''s on GoodRX.     - CA

Reid replied super quickly tonight so I followed-up the first e-mail with his quote & contact info:  Flovent 110mcg x 3 inhalers = $145.23 + $9.95 s&h     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-23 17:37:06', '2022-09-23 17:50:28'),
