  ('zcrm_1579374000103896008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, 'Spoke to Agent regarding options for her plan.  If she has an open Need, she will need to stay with Sedera.
Sedera will be sending out emails with the links for re-enrolling members in the next couple of weeks.
If no NEED, she can move to Zion.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-09-23 09:02:27', '2022-09-23 09:02:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103833018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'He said he would be looking to start for november 1st or december 1st depending on whether or not he can cancel his last insurance payments earlier.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-23 08:53:52', '2022-09-23 08:53:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103862008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095868002', 'Joshua Platt', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-23 08:48:14', '2022-09-23 08:48:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103833013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'Leo helped me explain the liquidity and other things regarding the plan.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-23 08:47:27', '2022-09-23 08:47:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103833008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'He was interested in knowing the liquidity of our health sharing component as well as having it be compatible for his health savings account. He has a wife and 2 children. he is also the director of the chiropractors association in his city. He is very well informed on the insurance industry and is currently on blue shield paying 1,500 a month for him and his family. his wife has a thyroid condition but no other preexistings for the rest of his family.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-23 08:47:03', '2022-09-23 08:47:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103896003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103782023', 'Lukas Baker', NULL, 'Completed training and E&amp;O.  Waiting on Sales Funnel Request', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-09-23 08:45:14', '2022-09-23 08:45:14'),
