  ('zcrm_1579374000103833003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'Cameron told me thursday that he would call me on friday at 10:00 am.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-23 07:16:13', '2022-09-23 07:16:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103779048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '9-22-2022;  Sara called.  We went over', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 17:54:55', '2022-09-22 17:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103779040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677099', 'Marcelee Cognito', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Marcelee called in while I was on the phone, I tried back &amp; LM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 17:53:37', '2022-09-22 17:53:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103779035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Kelly called saying she sub an RX Quote last week & never heard anything.  I can see Jennifer sent out 5 coupons on 9/16/2022.  Kelly finally found them, but was having a hard time believing we found KS to be least expensive, was sure we had some reason for sending all KS coupons that was not advantageous for her and quite upset.  I went over we check 6-8 discount sites (she kept sugg GoodRX, so I confirmed that is one of the sites) and try to send the best prices.  If she has a chosen pharmacy we can try to accomodate that.  After working w/her for quite some time I finally asked Jennifer if she could try helping Kelly since she knows what she did on these quotes.  From my understanding, Kelly asked all the same things & just didn''t understand why we sent the coupons we did.  Jennifer will have to fill in details if this comes up again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 17:17:45', '2022-09-22 17:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103779030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Hillary came into SalesIQ asking about vision.  When I tried to determine if it was maintenance or medical she said both.  It seemed like a much better Concierge Line verbal conversation.  She says she doesn''t have the energy for that tonight, so she''ll call the concierge line tomorrow.  Just too many details &amp; I don''t want to make assumptions or miss anything in the chat.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 16:35:01', '2022-09-22 16:35:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103779022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061045043', 'Kurt Benfield', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Jill called very upset by the contribution increase.  I sugg she talk w/her advisor Misty Berryman & she says "she didn''t have any answers" (I let Michele Rebal know Misty might need some guidance?)  Jill is sure we are discriminating against older people to push them out & only have young people.  She''s quite upset that we aren''t very "Christian".  And claims we waited until Oct 1st to leave them in the lurch because it''s not open enrollment & they can''t go anywhere else.  I did my best to explain the situation, answer her questions, etc, but in the end she wanted to talk to someone in the billing dept, at which point I trans her & told her to plez LM because it looks like Patti is on the line.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 15:14:57', '2022-09-22 15:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103831003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103782023', 'Lukas Baker', NULL, 'Spoke with Agent and gave brief overview of plans.  He has several DPC groups that want him to write businesses outside their office.  He is looking for a solution for this as well as offering clients more options', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-09-22 14:55:09', '2022-09-22 14:55:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103779017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Laurie Lee (James'' new spouse added 9/1/22) submitted a Team chat to Patti because Laurie didn''t get added to the CRM file.
     - Sent Laurie 2 coupons for her RX Quote because the cheapest shows the location she goes to, but does not have the logo on it.  She knows why there are 2:
             Doxepin HCL 10mg caps, #90 = $13.60 on WellRX (no logo)
                 and  Doxepin HCL 10mg caps, #90 = $14.85 on GoodRX     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 13:44:51', '2023-01-17 10:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103788013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086124001', 'Cyndi Freeman', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change plan from Secure to Care +.  I will notify Planstin &amp; Change in A123 then bill.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-22 13:22:39', '2022-09-22 13:22:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103774008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677099', 'Marcelee Cognito', NULL, '9.22.22 - Marcelee called in very overwhelmed and frustrated that the list of PHCS network doctors that she received was not accurate. I do not see where anyone from MPB.Health sent her any PHCS network lists prior to mine that I sent out today. After getting her calmed down and reassured that she can always lean on the concierge team, we finally got Marcelee an accurate list of OBGYN''s in her area. Marcelee will call back with any further questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-22 12:53:43', '2022-09-22 12:53:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103788008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467623', 'Christopher Bonelli', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to change IUA from $1000 to $5000.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change in A123 then bill', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-22 12:51:15', '2022-09-22 12:51:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103788003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to update IUA from $1000 to $2500.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-22 12:29:10', '2022-09-22 12:29:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103779003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Jim is quite the talker! Jim called &amp; has questions regarding his rate increase.  We talked in depth about how MCS works &amp; why they would need to inc the 50-65 age bracket most.  What happens if they don''t make these chgs, etc.  He''s frustrated that it''s 20% all at once.  Feel like he''s in a good place at the end of the call (fingerscrossed).
     - HMA - had questions, disc on very basic level.
     - HSA = gvmt &amp; tax advantaged     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 12:17:20', '2022-09-22 12:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103774003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796049', 'Andrew Sutton', NULL, '9.22.22 - Ashley called to get the instructions on how to submit a need for Andrew with Sedera. I sent her the instructions and then Ashley asked to be transferred to Sedera so that she could get information on any prepayment arrangements for surgery. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-22 12:13:13', '2022-09-22 12:13:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103666131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '09.22.22:  Adam called and spoke w/Jennifer re: cancelling his plan, as he has had health benefits with his company since September and just got notice of MPB billing him for October 1.  He said he wasn''t aware he had to cancel by the 20th of the month.  Jennifer transferred him to Patti. He called Jenn back and said he needed to speak with someone who could help him as Patti told him she couldn''t do anything because his advisor was on vacation.  I took the call.  Adam said he has cancelled his plan before and re-enrolled and he was refunded some money. He mentioned that to Patti and she said they don''t do that now.  He asked if he could be credited back for September and October, since he had insurance w/his company.  I told him we couldn''t do anything for September, but I would look into October, since he was just billed today.  I called Wendy to apprise her of his need to cancel.  She told me to have him complete the cancellation form and have Patti refund his October payment.  I called Patti and relayed to her my conversatons with Adam and Wendy.  Patti said she sent Adam the cancellation form and to have him complete and return it to us and she will refund his payment for October 1.  Called Adam. Asked if he received the cancellation form link from Patti.  He said he didn''t as yet and it''s not in his spam folder.  I sent it again to him and told him to let me know if he doesn''t receive it by later this afternoon.  I relayed that Patti told me when he submits the cancellation form for October 1, she will refund him for that month, which will probably be next week.  Adam said he''s fine with that and thanked me for the help.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-22 12:01:34', '2022-09-22 12:01:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103715020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081769002', 'Robert Henchel', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Robert called.  He had to go to the ER twice about 1 mo ago, both for the same head injury in diff locations.  He was driving &amp; will call back when we can walk him thru beg a ''med need''.  He says he''s not very good on the comp, so he''ll be at his comp &amp; we can help him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 11:52:26', '2022-09-22 11:52:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103715015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '9-22-2022:  Danna called.  She''s on Direct &amp; wants to have her colonoscopy.  I sent her Zion''s Direct plan ''prev'' guidelines brochure.  Since it''s a prev benefit I sugg she call Zion to make sure she''s using the best proc for this benefit &amp; gave their ph #.  Did remind her of the 5k limit.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 11:42:26', '2022-09-22 11:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103715010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080574002', 'Stephen Caruso', NULL, '9-22-2022:  We rec''d a quick 2 rings from this ph #.  I tried calling back &amp; the VM is not yet setup.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-22 11:41:22', '2022-09-22 11:41:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103722043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106027002', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, 'Eileen called me back from the list of calls i made; she was a client before; i sent her direct and secure plans; ill follow up early next week as she proposed', 'Jonathan Goldfarb', 'Jonathan Goldfarb', '2022-09-22 11:33:01', '2022-09-22 11:33:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103743067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032445', 'David Hammer', NULL, 'Member submitted Change to change plan from Secure to Direct.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change in A123.  then bill memebr', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-22 11:28:23', '2022-09-22 11:28:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103743062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, 'Member ok w/Price increase per email to Charlie.  I will bill.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-22 11:22:43', '2022-09-22 11:22:43'),
