  ('zcrm_1579374000103752003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089437001', 'Tracey Rominger', NULL, '9.22.22 - Tracey called because she saw a CirrusMD doc who told her that her daughter needs to be seen in person by a pediatric dermatologist. I explained the self-pay process to Tracey and let her know to contact us for any prescription needs or if she needs further assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-22 09:49:42', '2022-09-22 09:49:42'),
