  ('zcrm_1579374000103681093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'Cameron called in to the hotline on wednesday at 5:30 p.m. and asked me if I could send him an email with a quote and more information on our products. I told him I''d send him an email and then give him a call to answer any questions.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-09-22 08:43:01', '2022-09-22 08:43:01'),
