  ('zcrm_1579374000103729013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079573002', 'Jason Mihalick', NULL, 'Spoke to member regarding plan increase.  He stated that he needs to keep the SECURE Plan because of his HSA.  He doesn''t like the increase but he is willing to keep the plan.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-09-22 07:43:11', '2022-09-22 07:43:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103729008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Had a phone appointment with her this morning at 9am EST.  No Answer, Left message.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-09-22 07:04:48', '2022-09-22 07:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103688053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322148', 'Mike Gold', NULL, '9-21-2022:  Mike wants to have his annual appt & had no idea how it works.  He does have his ''P''lantstin card = ''P''rev care only.  Sent him the ''prev'' temp & we walked thru what the links provide.  We walked through EVERYTHING Planstin, all prov must be in ntwk, labs cov, screening colonoscopy vs diagnostic w/$2500 IUA, etc.  Sent him the HCBB instructions, but he''s on an older plan & it''s not allowing him access.  Last I heard everyone should now have access so I''m requesting that for him.  He will call if he has further quest.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-21 18:54:48', '2022-09-21 18:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103688045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '9-21-2022:  Patricia said she didn''t know why she was charged more this month, but she''s done.  I asked if she''d received the notice of the contribution increase & she did not answer, just replied she wants to make sure she gets her money back.  I let her know the only person that could help her with money issues is our Ben Admin Patti & she says she already LM for her.  Then asked me to make sure "someone contacts me right away".  I sent Patti a Teams chat to make sure she rec''d the message.  
     Patricia''s advisor Wendy Scipione is out of town right now, so she''s unavailable to help.  Hence I''m letting Patti know since she has to help proc cancellation & deal w/money.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-21 18:32:37', '2022-09-21 18:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103688040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724007', 'Brenda Flowers-Specht', NULL, '9-21-2022:  Brenda''s husband used to be on the plan, was a Dr, but is now on Medicare.  Since she''s paying for this she wants to start utilizing.  We did a lot of educating:
     - She wants to utilize the ''prev care'', but did not understand at all how it works (was thinking you present as ''cash-pay'' etc,), so we went over EVERYTHING ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative ONLY.  We tried to find the doctor she''s interested in Navazo near her, but he''s not coming up.  Sent her the ''prev'' temp & we walked thru the links.  I made sure she was able to access the Family Practices listed.  She''s going to zone in on a doc, make sure they are still in ntwk, then may call if she cannot access HCBB (she''s on an older plan) to see if the doc is listed.  [went over doc''s off must bill, everything must have ''prev'' med coding, sep any diag/treat for best pymt, etc]
     - Her concern was labs.  We went over healthcare.gov & curr we know "lipid panel" is covered.  They may also pay for the STD panel, but we''d need to confirm that one if she''s interested.  Talked about sep orders for cov vs not cov tests for easiest method. 
     By the end Brenda was in a much better place.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-21 18:10:05', '2022-09-21 18:46:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103688035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '9/21/2022:  Robin contacted me asking about adding her husband to her plan.  I pulled my records &amp; the reason we hadn''t included him was due to his having carpal tunnel surgery.  I called her &amp; we talked.  She''s aware that would pre-x for him &amp; we talked about all the implications, the waiting period, then the phase in levels.  She''s going to tt him &amp; get back to me.  She knows the earliest we could add him would be 11/1/22 &amp; we''d need to sub the req to do so by 10/15/22.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-21 16:52:24', '2022-10-05 12:48:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103741016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '09.21.22:  Called - l/m to Steve and Liz.  Repeated the message I left on 9/17 and asked them to call or text me with their decision.  Also, if they want to further discuss options or have any questions, I''d be happy to discuss it with them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-21 16:34:51', '2022-09-21 16:34:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103741008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '09.21.22:  Called and spoke w/Diana.  They decided to stay with their SECURE plan and change their IUA from $1000 to $2500 to lower their monthly share fee to $765.  Guided her through completing and submitting the Member Change Form.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-21 16:23:14', '2022-09-21 16:23:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103741003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712271', 'Carey Dubois', NULL, '09.21.22:  Called Carey, l/m.  Reminded him of increase beginning 10/1/22.  Told him he could increase his IUA to lower his monthly share fee, if he feels the need and to let me know either way by phone or text.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-21 16:21:20', '2022-09-21 16:21:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103688030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '9-21-2022:  Nancy called & after a long drawn out story, she said: "I''m utilizing your counselor you sent me to & she''s telling me you haven''t sent her the referral so she can get paid.  You need to do that."  I let her know we do not handle any of that, it goes through the MAP program component.  That company, Mazzitti & Sullivan, will be able to help her.  She was driving, so could not take their #, I trans her directly.  She asked what she tells them & I let her know to explain the situation so they can help her.  She''ll call back if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-21 15:23:26', '2022-09-21 15:23:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103666118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083935002', 'Henrik Andersen', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove dependents from membership I will notify Planstin &amp; change plan in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-21 13:44:25', '2022-09-21 13:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103683018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '9.21.22 - Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-21 13:30:42', '2022-09-21 13:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103688025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088055002', 'Deborah Sonnentag', NULL, '9-21-2022:  Debbie called very confused by how to handle her ''annual'' appt.  Jennifer accidentally sent her the ''Prev Care'' temp for the MEC.  I apologized &amp; got her Zion''s Direct plan''s "prev guidelines''.  We went over the limitations together (off visit ONLY towards the $125 + pap if billed along side that visit).  She knows she can choose whatever doc she likes, how to present, if she knows the chg for that appt I gave her Zion''s # to see if she can get a pre-pd cc for the visit.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-21 13:29:22', '2022-09-21 13:29:22'),
