  ('zcrm_1579374000103683003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '9.21.22 - Whitney called in to complain about CirrusMD. He tried to have the CirrusMD docs take a look at pictures of a rash his 17-year old son has. Unfortunately, due to the fact that his son was not physically present with Whitney at the time of the photos, the CirrusMD docs said they could not help him. Whitney is upset because he doesn''t feel as though that should be a factor in the docs giving their opinion. I did let Whitney know that we have to go by CirrusMD''s rules but I will pass along the information he provided to me. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-21 10:19:37', '2022-09-21 10:19:37'),
