  ('zcrm_1579374000103577042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063240002', 'Ryan Cyphert', NULL, '9-20-2022:  Ryan called re: a bill for his son''s shoulder from March that just showed up!  We went over a lot, incl: his will be ok since it''s the first time they''ve billed him - they will go by the billing date.  
     - Sent him the temp for sub a ''med need'' & we disc all the steps.
     - His daughter took his son in & he''s not sure what "ins" card she supplied.  This new bill says his "ins" didn''t pay.  He''s going to contact the billing off & let them know he''s a ''cash-pay'' pt, no ins, find out who they billed, & ask for a ''cash-pay'' disc, etc.  Then will sub the ''need''.   [One of the items on the billed, had been prev rem''d & now it''s back on too.  He''ll get that removed again when he calls them.]
     - He pd for some x-rays back in March (which he doesn''t have receipts, invoices, etc for.  It wasn''t a ton of money, but it is past the 6mo mark).  I sugg he call to get receipts immed if he wants to incl it.  Maybe since the primary bill just arrived they''d consider it?  He knows he''s at the 6mo deadline so may just let it go.
     If he needs further assistance, he''ll call again.  It was really nice at the end of the call.  He said "thank you for talking me off the ledge" and was far less stressed when we got off the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-20 23:31:52', '2022-09-24 13:48:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103577037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, '9-20-2022: Joy''s son hurt his finger &amp; she couldn''t remember how to get help via CirrusMD.  I was able to help her get in &amp; she was going to get William &amp; hit continue to tt a doc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-20 23:31:07', '2022-09-20 23:31:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103577032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '9-20-2022:  Advisor Leah Garcia asked for me to call her (after she tt Jennifer for quite some time).  She''s struggling with the difference in what we say we''ve done to help Michele and Michele''s story that we aren''t helping her.
     It sounds to me like:  Michele is not following through with the information we are providing [ie: the PHCS prov in her area, the PHCS Search temp w/inst, holding long enough to tt RCI to req her new cards while also asking about the date of her last ''Well Woman'' visit, etc.]  
