  ('zcrm_1579374000103527008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'Spoke with Dena to let her know we were waiting on the information from CirrusMD regarding her case.  She said that she felt she was being put into a pre-ex state and that is why they will not prescribed to her any longer.  This is also what she stated on her cancellation form.

