  ('zcrm_1579374000103439103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089148022', 'Jeff Weisberg', NULL, '9-19-2022:  Jeff called.  He tried getting his memb # from Zion &amp; they are telling him they cannot find him.  They were telling him his eff &amp; end dates were both 4/1/2022.  I can see in Admin123 his memb chg''d from one plan to another on that date.  Tried trans him to Patti, but GoTo not wking.  Gave him Patti''s dir # so he can call her - she''s the one that sb able to help him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-19 17:48:56', '2022-09-19 17:48:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103439095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096786002', 'Jonathan Lampert-Hiller', NULL, '9-19-2022:  Jonathan called for several items:
