  ('zcrm_1579374000103439090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080107001', 'Lorna Mulkey', NULL, '9-19-25022:  Lorna called for guidance on getting a bone density test.  She qual for the test, but neither of us can tell if it''s annually or a diff time table.  The only location listed near her in ntwk is:  	Planned Parenthood Columbia Willamette-Bend, Birthing Center, Laboratory, Radiology, 2330 NE Division St, Ste 7, Bend, OR 97703,  888-576-7526.  She''s going to conf: they are still in ntwk & offer this test.  Then, I made sure she has Planstin''s ph# to conf if she can get it annually.
