  ('zcrm_1579374000103439085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725103', 'Kim Sanderson', NULL, '9-19-2022:  Kim called.  She''s having lower back pain & wanted to get instructions on what to do for seeing and orthopedic doc.  She''s been told she has stenosis, can''t remember when it orig started & they told her, so we disc worst case scenario if it''s pre-x (phase in period - at least waiting period is over).  We disc presenting as ''cash-pay'' & asking for a disc, paying up to 1k IUA, keeping receipts, det invoices, etc, to sub a ''med need'', deadlines, what to do if they prescribe PT & the prior appr req''d, etc.
