  ('zcrm_1579374000103439069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '9-19-2022:  Diana tt Joan &amp; Joan told her to go online &amp; look at the price sheet.  She couldn''t find it.  I got her to Joan''s site &amp; showed her how to get to the new price pdf.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-19 15:55:17', '2022-09-19 15:55:17'),
