  ('zcrm_1579374000103429026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '09.19.22:  Diana called. Told me hr UH agent said their deductible would be $6000/person and $12,000 for the family at $775/mo.  I told her with her current SECURE plan, with a $2500 IUA they would pay $765/mo. and, a maximum for the family of $7500 for 3 medical needs/yr.  A much better solution. She agreed and said she would discuss with her husband if they should change their IUA or leave it as is and let me know by tomorrow.  I told her they have a few more days before the deadline - just for members whose increase is more than $100.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-19 15:43:52', '2022-09-19 15:44:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103439059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103260002', 'Beth Fults-osburn', NULL, '9-19-2022:  Beth called.  She tt Leonardo &amp; realized she signed up for both Secure &amp; Essentials not realizing Essentials is a part of Secure.  Leo told her she can just CE the extra.  I sent her the CE form and she''s sub it right now to cancel the extra ''Essentials'' membership.  Since it''s an enrollment, I did not know if they would have already proc the pymt or if we are catching it in time.  If she has questions, she will let us know.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-19 15:32:17', '2022-09-19 15:32:17'),
