  ('zcrm_1579374000103439013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089148022', 'Jeff Weisberg', NULL, 'Member called in saying he had not received ID cards or any fulfillment pkg from us.  Said he spoke to Zion who told thim he did not have any active plans with them.  I spoke to Zion and they did not have any active plans with them.  I told them that I did as they had directed and made new plan when member changed to Care + and that is showing as active in A123.   They said that they would backdate membership until 4/22 and bill us.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-19 14:10:02', '2022-09-19 14:10:02'),
