  ('zcrm_1579374000103429008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101113002', 'Bradley Plummer', NULL, '9.19.22 - Marcy called in because she has to open a Need with Zion regarding her husbands recent injury and PT. As I was trying to explain to Marcy that the concierge team has no way of confirming whether or not the doctor''s office has the correct codes on her bills, she kept interrupting me and would not let me finish. I finally had to offer Marcy the chance to speak with another concierge representative and she declined and apologized for not letting me help her through her issues. Marcy is going to get everything uploaded to Zion and then if they need more info she will get an email notification from Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-19 13:57:54', '2022-09-19 13:57:54'),
