  ('zcrm_1579374000103364113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '9-19-2022:  Michele called trying to figure out who is an option for an in ntwk mammogram in her area.  My system has been an issue all day & not working prop.  She''s w/RCI, has no idea where her card is, & is frustrated w/trying to work within the ntwk.  
     I made sure she has RCI''s ph # & trans her dir to them.  She''s going to:  ask for new ID cards and see if they can help her w/finding an in ntwk mamm cntr.  I reminder her to make sure she tells the imaging cntr the provider reading the images must  also in ntwk.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-19 12:46:02', '2022-09-19 12:47:52'),
