  ('zcrm_1579374000103364073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '9-19-2022:  Danna called.  She has 3 things she wants to start ''med needs'' on.  Part of her concern is they are moving to the $2500 IUA on 10/1/22 due to the pricing increase & since all of the started during the 1k IUA, she wanted help knowing details on how to handle sub these ''needs''.
