  ('zcrm_1579374000103353003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077989104', 'Heather Strazinsky', NULL, '9.19.22 - Heather called because she is wanting to cancel her plan. I also spoke with her regarding her issues with Quest/Planstin paying a lab bill for her son. I advised Heather that as soon as I get to the bottom of the issue I will let her and Diane know the result. Per Diane, I will be sending Heather a cancelation link email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-19 09:16:25', '2022-09-19 09:16:25'),
