  ('zcrm_1579374000103272008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '9.19.22 - Holly called to get assistance with her CirrusMD services. She could not remember how to access CirrusMD, so we walked through that. She needed to reset her password and was going to call if she needed any more assistance. I also sent Holly the information on how to search the PHCS and advised her to call the concierge team if she needs any assistance with the PHCS search. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-19 07:39:26', '2022-09-19 07:39:26'),
