  ('zcrm_1579374000103272003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082048002', 'Maginel Galt', NULL, '9.19.22 - Maginel called in because she had questions regarding a payment that was taken off her credit card. I explained that for that issue, I would need to transfer her to Patti Baron. Maginel then asked about acupuncture and chiropractic services and I explained that if it is part of a need that she currently has open or is part of a need that she may be opening, she can get prior authorization through Zion health for those services. Maginel is someone who does not let you finish or even begin to answer her questions, please be nice but firm with her so that she understands you are trying to help her with her questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-19 07:11:04', '2022-09-19 07:11:04'),
