  ('zcrm_1579374000103232057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '9-17-2022:  Samantha e-mailed back & I happened to see it even though it''s a Saturday.  I got the reply ready, but I will send it Monday.  She tt a CirrusMD doc who told her to go to a PCP to get a referral to an endocrinologist.  She wants to jump to an endocrin doc & the CirrusMD told her she had to have a referral.  
     - I wrote back & let her know: she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt to 5k IUA.  "Ins" often requires referrals.  IF an endocrin doc is willing to see her without it, it''s not an issue on this for us.  Sent her a list of endocrinologists near Austin, TX (it would not pull up her zip code).
     - Let her know TX has a strong "ins" lobby gr & that can sometimes sway how the doctors want to work w/patients.  Let us know if you need help.
     - Sugg''d either way, finding & creating a relationship w/an in ntwk PCP is a good thing.  They will do her annual appt & ''prev care''. thru her RCI.  Then, next time she''s sick she will have a pre-existing relationship w/a doc that can help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-17 14:23:40', '2022-09-17 14:30:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712271', 'Carey Dubois', NULL, '09.17.22:  Called Carey, l/m.  Asked if they received our email re:  price increase.  Explained reason for increase from $500 to $625.  Offered option of higher IUA to decrease monthly cost. Asked to call me w/any questions. Said they need to make IUA change by 9/20, if they decide to do so.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-17 14:01:02', '2022-09-17 14:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '09.17.22:  Called John, l/m.  Asked if they received our email re:  price increase to $520 w/1000 IUA.  Explained reason for increase and gave IUA change options.  Asked John to call me w/questions or to further discuss.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-17 13:43:40', '2022-09-17 13:43:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '09.17.22:  Called - l/m.  Asked if they received our email re:  price increase.  Explained reason for increase and advised, if they want to reduce their monthly fee from the new price of $860 to $710 for the Direct plan, they would have to change their IUA to $2500. Asked them to call me w/any questions or to further discuss.  Told them they must make a decision by the 20th to avoid the $860 price increase.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-17 13:26:03', '2022-09-21 16:33:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '09.17.22:  Called, spoke w/Sean.  Asked if they received our email re: price increase. He said Amy mentioned it to him.  I gave him option of changing his IUA from $1000 to $2500 to lower his monthly fee, but warned him, if they had med. needs, they''d be paying out much more.  He said they are okay with the monthly increase.  I asked if he would like to do a video commentary for us but he said they really haven''t used the plan enough to comment.  I advised him we are also accepting questions and suggestions from members.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-17 13:03:58', '2022-09-17 13:03:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '09.17.22:  Called & spoke w/Brian.  He didn''t see our emails re: the price increase.  I explained the reason for it and that their fee will go from $500 to $625.  I said I had some options for him.  He told me he had a fantastic experience w/Zion Health paying his bills and helping him through his med. need when he fractured his ankle last May.  I asked if he would do a video commentary about it (particularly how Zion gave him a credit card with a  $ limit for him to use each time he went for PT) and he said he definitely would do so.  He said he needs to discuss some changes in his new situation and would like to do that this coming week. I explained he''d have to make any changes to his plan by the 20th to avoid the price increase which starts Nov. 1.  He said that''s ok.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-17 12:35:21', '2022-09-17 12:35:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '09.15.22:  Cindy called.  Said she''ll keep her current membership status until November 1.  Then, she''ll have both Drew and Clay enroll each in Care+ w/a $5000 IUA.  I told her we''ll need to schedule a call to complete the enrollment for the boys.  She will have to complete the Member Change Form to M&amp;S  and submit it.  She said she will call me in early October to do this.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-17 11:23:18', '2022-09-17 11:23:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093902001', 'James Buckley', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after getting Empolyer Coverage Lou ok''d.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-17 10:06:57', '2022-09-17 10:06:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103254023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel at Wendy''s direction.Has employer coverage.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-17 10:00:30', '2022-09-17 10:00:30'),
