  ('zcrm_1579374000103208013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2260 Question : How do I update my monthly payment amount that starts October 1st?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-09-16 21:46:16', '2022-09-16 21:46:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '9/16/2022:  Walked Kyle through starting a ''medical need'' for the bone graphing to see if they will look at it as a ''medical'' need.  Since it''s so sever we''re hoping, but she knows it''s not guaranteed.  While we were on the phone she was working on sub this.  We disc all the details, watch your e-mail closely, sign form asap, etc.  She seemed to get it as she was uploading the ''treatment plan'' the doc had provided.
     - We disc the mo cont increase as well.  I think she''s good where she is right now, but may want to discuss options down the road.  If we do get the ''prev care'' w/no ntwk, that would add value for her.  Although, I let her know we do not know if/when that will go thru & it could have a sm bump in mo cont as well.
     - Her mom lives in Superior.  She asked if she''s visiting sometime could we meet?  She''s super sweet and I told her of course!  I''d love to take her to lunch or something.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 18:02:08', '2022-09-16 18:02:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918048', 'Bryan Schiff', NULL, '9/16/2022:  I called Bryan again today.  tt Bryan & Susan.  They are unsure how plan works.  Would like to sched their ''Welcome Call'' so I sent them the invite & walked thru the process.  They were sched as we talked.
     - Susan & their daughter had their pap-smears, but presented as ''cash-pay'' & were unsure how to get reimb.  We looked up & at least they''d seen a doc listed in ntwk: 	Goodman, Reid A, M.D., Ob & Gyno, 8200 E Belleview Ave, Ste 320C. Greenwood Village, CO 80111.  They do know where their Planstin cards are so will see if off can bill their ''prev care'' so they can get reim.
     - Susan also had her mamm.  I had a hard time telling if the ''Sally Jobe'' location she went to is in ntwk, so she''s going to do the same thing here.
     - I encouraged them to always call the Concierge Line for direction when planning things.  ie: Susan will be getting a colonoscopy at some poine & we can walk thru how to handle.  Did discuss esp w/colonoscopies, it can move from the ''prev care'' component = free screening, to the diagnostic & healthshare component w/1k IUA.  
     - They both seemed to understand the imp of calling us first.
     - We also disc the increase of mo cont for both this & Rebecca''s memberships since they still pay both.  They know Rebecca does not have ''prev care'' curr.  We may disc that somewhere down the road.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 17:56:30', '2022-09-16 17:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081920003', 'James Platt', NULL, '9/16/2022:  James wanted to know how much of their monthly cont was tax ded.  Let him know the IRS considers the ''Prev Care'' component "insurance" &amp; for a Memb + Fam = $135/mo cont, which over a full year = $1620.  That a req for the tax doc from the Ben Admin each year gives him what he needs to claim it.     
     - Also offered to go over other options if he''d like, although I think this SECURE 1k IUA is exceptional.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 17:22:34', '2022-09-16 17:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '9-16-2022:  Elizabeth called & was unsure if she has a pap-smear for her daughter & wondered what all her plan helps pay for.  We disc the components of her plan, which does NOT include ''prev''.  She''s staying w/Sedera & this plan due to pre-x/open need.
     - Went over what components her plan does have & even helped her register for WHLC because she''s seeing a chiro on a reg basis.
     - Orig she mentioned wanting to look at other plans & I asked if she''s tt her advisor Wendy.  She said she hasn''t tt her in a long while, but with the above issues, there''s really not anything at this time that can be done anyway.  She was glad I brought up Wendy''s name though, because she''d forgotten she could reach out to her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 16:25:22', '2022-09-16 16:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924034', 'Scott Robinson', NULL, '9-16-2022: Scott called.  They''ve sched his emerg surg to rebuild/repair his finger for Tues &amp; the doc is req''ing a dep.  He tt Zion &amp; they knew about the dep &amp; said they would take care of it, but he wanted to notify us that it''s happening on Tues!  I made sure he has Zion''s ph # &amp; trans him dir, told him to select #5 = the need dept, because they are the ones that can help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 15:41:13', '2022-09-16 15:41:13'),
