  ('zcrm_1579374000103232018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '9-16-2022:  Samantha called saying she was looking to find a doc in ntwk.  As we talked I realized this is more of an emergency, not ''prev care'' where we need to worry about in ntwk.
She suffers from low blood sugar & was monitoring it today.  Nothing she''s been told by docs before is helping. 
     - Before I knew how serious it was, we tried to get her into CirrusMD & I think since she chg''d plans 7/1/2022, it''s not allowing her in.  I sent a support e-mail to CirrusMD & they confirmed late in the day they sent her the e-mail to get in.
     -  She does not have a PCP, so her thought was to find one.  She seemed to want to cont looking for a doc, so we went over the PHCS Search Tool together (so the doc she sees for this can do her ''prev care'' later.  HCBB won''t allow her in.  Sent a Teams Chat to John Kach & asked for help.  
     - As we talked, she''s describing her sugar level being near the critical level where she''ll go into convulsions!  I encourage her to get to an Urg Care or go to the ER.  She''s overwhelmed by the financial side burden of the 5k IUA.  When she finally did call an Urg Care & they tell her she needs to see her own doc or go to the ER.  I called the one Urg Care near her (12.7 miles from her)with 5-stars, they will take her as a walk-in, so I sent her their info.
     - I told her just make sure you take care of you - ultimately you will be a ''cash-pay'' pt for the first 5k IUA and we can help on the backside.  Seeing an Urg Care, or even if she goes to the ER, is going to be cheaper than ending-up in the hosp!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 12:45:38', '2022-09-16 18:16:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103212008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091034', 'Darryl Hadfield', NULL, '9.16.22 - Script quote done ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-16 12:20:44', '2022-09-16 12:20:44');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796008', 'Nancy Micloskey', NULL, '9-16-2022:  Nancy called for help w/2 items:
     - W/the new increase in mo cont, she wanted to sign into her portal.  I was able to get her in, but the form is in the updates.  So I showed her how to get to it and walked her all the way thru the process.  She''s going to sub a req to inc her IUA to 5k & had it primarily ready when we got off the phone.
     - She wanted info on the counseling.  W/her doc above on her comp, we just talked.  I told her how to get into MAP site w/access code, made sure she has their assistance #, & described how the prog works.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 11:58:29', '2022-09-16 11:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103175050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081238002', 'Joseph Scaturro', 'New Plan eff 10/1/22', 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 11:57:30', '2022-09-16 11:57:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103175045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081238002', 'Joseph Scaturro', NULL, 'Member submitted cahnge form to change IUA from $1000 to $5000.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change plan in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 11:49:03', '2022-09-16 11:49:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, '9-16-2022:  Martha called.  They rec''d the new prem notification &amp; cannot afford the new price.  She''s left messages for her advisor over the last few days (I think she said 2 days?) and has not heard back.  I trans her to Patti to get help with adj her plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 11:30:14', '2022-09-16 11:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103232003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212027', 'Kristen Henry', NULL, '9-16-2022:  Kristen called.  She has a toe infection (&amp; is a diabetic) and wants to see a doctor, but she was worrying about it being in ntwk.  We went over ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative ONLY.  That when she sees her doc to present for this issue as ''cash-pay'' &amp; ask for disc - do NOT have them bill this to Planstin.  If it''s more than antibiotics &amp; she''s done, she knows to contact us to sub a ''need'' soon due to deadlines.  She''ll pay cash to the 1k IUA, save receipts, det inv, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-16 11:29:41', '2022-09-16 11:29:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103175040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, 'Martha called in and told me that due to the price increase was wanting to switch to the Care + membership.  I called &amp; left msg for Mike to help her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 11:06:56', '2022-09-16 11:06:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103227001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041357164', 'Joshua Lundquist', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2256 Question : From Jane Kassel: I just went to enroll a client and my SECURE product is missing! Help!', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-09-16 10:49:38', '2022-09-16 10:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103175035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678052', 'Dennis Bakken', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request because of cost.  Amy giving him some other options.  I will cancel billing &amp; notify Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 10:14:06', '2022-09-16 10:14:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103212003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, '9.16.22 - Dave called to cancel. Per Patti''s note below, I sent him another cancellation link. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-16 09:52:26', '2022-09-16 09:52:26'),
