  ('zcrm_1579374000103184003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100606002', 'Matthew Cromey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-16 08:23:02', '2022-09-16 08:23:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103175008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095156002', 'Thitiwat Pichidtammarat', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request.  I spoke to Zac prior and there is a language barrier and probably was not a good fit to begin with.  They feel more comfortable with Trad Ins.  I will notify Planstin and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 08:15:45', '2022-09-16 08:15:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103175003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080574002', 'Stephen Caruso', NULL, 'Received cancellation from this member, Karen is giving him options re: increasing IUA and asked me to hold off until 9/19 to cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 08:11:58', '2022-09-16 08:11:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103145023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171053', 'Brian Starling', 'New Plan eff 10/1/22', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 08:01:25', '2022-09-16 08:01:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103171003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100496001', 'Zubin Tantra', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-16 07:55:34', '2022-09-16 07:55:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103145018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171053', 'Brian Starling', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation fro Sedera plan.  RCI &amp; Sedera notified.  Plan Cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 07:48:12', '2022-09-16 07:48:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103145013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081875002', 'Franklin Zhuzhingo', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Karen.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 07:38:37', '2022-09-16 07:38:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103145008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, 'Member left me a VM wanting to cancel his membership.  Wendy out of the office until 9/27.  I will send him the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-16 07:25:49', '2022-09-16 07:25:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100830002', 'Michael Agugliaro', NULL, '9-15-2022:  Mike called he had questions on the following:
     - Had questions about ''Planstin''.  Told the doctor from the PHCS search his ins was Planstin, so he''s going to call & refer to PHCS.  He''ll call for all the guidance on a ''prev care'' appt once he gets closer.  We went over quite a few details on this, but we went over so much, I sugg he call once he makes the appt or shortly before he goes.
        Walked thru the link for healthcare.gov together.
     - Wanted to know how to sug RX Quote.  Showed him how to get to the form & we went over details that are helpful on the form.  Timelines, etc.
     - Helped him get setup, registered, & into WHLC for chiropractic care.  He had picked someone out of the PHCS search, so we discussed prev chiro not included.  [Also, how to hndl if ever a part of a larger ''med need'' on healthsharing = prior approval.]
     - Showed him HCBB & how to get into since he''s looking for new docs as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 19:35:53', '2022-09-15 19:35:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918048', 'Bryan Schiff', NULL, '9/15/2022:  Bryan called the concierge line while I was w/another caller.  It didn''t show the "missed call" until I went to leave.  Since he''s my member, I called him from my off # &amp; apologized for missing his call.  Gave him both my # &amp; the conc # to plez call us back.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 19:27:11', '2022-09-15 19:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '9/15/2022:  Kyle wrote.  She had not rec''d the early notice of the new age band pricing and was shocked that they had so little notice.  I apologized & let her know this was just a reminder since we are so close.  Described why the chg is happening.  1st change in yrs.  She thought the e-mail was saying she is 64 and neither her or her husb are.  Offered to review other options if she''d like & I let her know to make chg''s they must be proc by 9/20/22 for this month''s draw.
     - She says their doc not in ntwk so they aren''t even using.  I let her know we are looking at no ntwk on ''prev care'' but it could add $5-$10 per memb.  They''ll announce IF we can get that through.
     - She''s also experiencing dental issues.  I asked if they are regular dental issues or if they cross into "medical" issues which we could try to get sharing on.  Or we do offer sep dental plans.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 19:12:48', '2022-09-15 19:12:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939370', 'Dave Sutton', NULL, '9-15-2022:  A call from this # came in while I was on the other line.  The "missed call" notice showed up as I was closing out for the night.  I called &amp; LM apologizing for missing his call, left our # and to plez try us back either here shortly or tomorrow 9:00am-8:00pm EST.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 18:13:51', '2022-09-15 18:13:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924034', 'Scott Robinson', NULL, '9-15-2022:  Cheryl called while I was on the phone &amp; the "missed call" notification showed up as I was signing off.  I called &amp; LM apologizing and asking her to call us.  Told her I''d leave the phone on a short time since it''s already 6:10pm or we are open 9:00am-8:00pm EST tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 18:10:20', '2022-09-15 18:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924034', 'Scott Robinson', NULL, '9.15.22 - Cheryl called in because Scott is finally out of the hospital for the infected kitten bite. The doctor did end up doing surgery on his hand to drain the infection out of the bite and Scott will have to have the open incision stitched up next week. The doctor is going to need a deposit prior to him performing the next "surgery". I warm transferred Scott &amp; Cheryl to Zion so that they can discuss pre-payment for this procedure. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-15 14:18:36', '2022-09-15 14:18:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103091075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001038039', 'D. Scott Hinckley', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-15 13:56:37', '2022-09-15 13:56:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100797002', 'Barbara Guth', NULL, '9.15.22 - Welcome call completed! I will be requesting a Zion card for this member. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-15 13:50:21', '2022-09-15 13:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '9-15-22 Krista is super frustrated bc her rate is increasing by 25%. She has a Need for her husband that''s about $3K and she was finally going to submit it having no knowledge of the 6 month deadline. I suggested she still try to submit it and let them know she had no knowledge of the deadline and her computer crashed and she no longer had access to the pdf files to upload. The date of service was in Jan. 2022 and lat bills arrived in May for a prostate issue discovered in his colonoscopy. They did a biopsy and found no problems and therefore no resolution. Husband is 63. I suggested they remove the MEC if they are done with high cost wellness items for at least a year. She is willing to pay cash for mammogram and or blood work since that will be less than the $1260 for the MEC. It brings her cost back down to $520/$1000. That seemed to help the pain of the cost increase a bit. She will talk with her husband and I showed her how to make the change online. She was appreciative. I asked her to let me know if she has any success with the Need submission.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-15 13:37:35', '2022-09-15 13:37:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103091070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change plans from Secure to Care +.   I will notify Planstin &amp; Change Plan in Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-15 13:36:48', '2022-09-15 13:36:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101089010', 'Lauren Ehlers', NULL, '9.15.22 - Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-15 13:32:11', '2022-09-15 13:32:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689074', 'Frank Becvar', NULL, '9/15/2022:  Sent reminder text to Jennifer that this is the month the new age banded pricing takes eff.  Memb &amp; children will now be:  $625 ($130 increase).  I let them know when they began this was coming, so it''s just a reminder.  Down the road we may add Jennifer &amp; move to a Memb + Fam membership.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 13:15:00', '2022-09-15 13:15:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103091065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079033002', 'Lakshmi Murthy', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to adjust the IUA from $2500 to $5000.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change plan in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-15 12:51:54', '2022-09-15 12:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001038039', 'D. Scott Hinckley', NULL, '9.15.22 - Member called to cancel, I transferred him to his agent, Jeff Kanter. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-15 12:46:42', '2022-09-15 12:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '9-15-22 James and family decided to remove the MEC since nobody is in network. Wife came to Boulder for her colonoscopy to be paid. They are done with major wellness items. James just wants basic lab work done for cholesterol, Vit-D, etc. I told him he will need to pay cash for it but the Concierge Team can help him get it at the most affordable rate locally. It will be way less expensive than paying for the MEC for just some lab work. He completed the form now to remove the MEC and move to CARE+.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-15 12:39:03', '2022-09-15 12:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103091060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048538018', 'Diane Border', NULL, 'Diane submitted Change form to remove daughter from her membership.  She has re-enrolled her on her own I will email Planstin to let them know to bridge PreEx.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-15 12:34:14', '2022-09-15 12:34:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', NULL, '9.15.22 - Marguerite called because she says she received a call from John Kach regarding add-on services. She started to ask for pricing for a DPC plan, but I advised her that she would have to speak to her agent for pricing. I transferred her to John Kach. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-15 12:19:11', '2022-09-15 12:19:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103091055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032158', 'Wenda Gao', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change IUA.  I will notify Planstin &amp; Change new plan in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-15 12:18:09', '2022-09-15 12:18:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103091050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695225', 'Kevin Thiemann', NULL, 'Member had been in contact with Sedera about the TeleDoc  feature of the membership.  I reached out to member and let him know that he now has Cirrus MD thru us.  I asked Jennifer to send him a new registration email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-15 12:08:52', '2022-09-15 12:08:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, '9-15-2022:  Elgin called w/a few questions:
     - Got 6 e-mails w/the change of plans - wow, wishes we''d find a way to streamline this...
     - CE on Oct first, was concerned it was CE''d on the 30th, I let him know he will have continuous coverage.
     - His 1099 is coming to him from his accountant, he''ll get that sub asap.  He knows it''s super imp.  He won''t forget.
     - ''Welcome  Call'' - he''ll sched for after Oct 1st.  NEED to notify CirrusMD chg''d plans.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 11:48:50', '2022-09-15 11:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098495002', 'Rebecca Abma', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-15 11:10:37', '2022-09-15 11:10:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, '9-15-2022:  Steve called.  He wants to start a ''med need'' for his wife''s high chol & the monitoring they do each yr.  We talked about it & he may go ahead & start a ''need'', but I''m not sure if they will share anything on this?  It''s started 5 yrs ago, but it''s in the exception gr of pre-x items.  They run a blood test every 6 mos & he thought he should get it going for future appts (he''s not sure if Planstin pd for it as a ''prev'' blood test thru Quest this year, or if they pd for it).  They are in their 2nd yr of memb, so we talked about if some procedure needed to be done around her high chol, worstcase scenario they have the 25k to help sharing on this, and it will increase for years 3 @ 50k, 4th & beyond at 125k.  Since he''s not on the memb, he''s going to have Eliz call Zion to get her memb # & auth him to handle things for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 11:06:12', '2022-09-15 16:44:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103157003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002887157', 'Trevor Mickelson', NULL, 'Julia''s e-mail = jueju@protonmail.com

9-15-2022:  Julia called.  Sent her the temp for updating their pymt form.  She was going to use their debit card, but is now planning to do an ACH so there''s no fee.  She''ll also get that in right away since the next billing cycle is just a few days away (the 20th) &amp; they need time to process her req before that date.
     - Both e-mails on file are Trevor''s, so hers is listed above.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-15 11:06:05', '2022-09-15 11:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103151023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-15 10:47:31', '2022-09-15 10:47:31'),
