  ('zcrm_1579374000103151018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081762001', 'Michael Gaffey', NULL, '9.15.22 - Michael called for HSA info. I sent him the email templates for HSA''s and he was a happy camper. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-15 10:36:51', '2022-09-15 10:36:51'),
