  ('zcrm_1579374000103041043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103065002', 'Lisa Dannen', NULL, '9-14-22 Enrolled just now for SECURE EO $1000/$300. All set and resent many of the emails because they weren''t going through to either email address.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 17:49:47', '2022-09-14 17:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103041038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '9-14-22 James Young got email about price change and isn''t pleased of course. Going from $685 to $915 and they can''t get the wellness visits done in town. His wife came to Boulder to get her colonoscopy done. We can remove the MEC to lower the cost. He will discuss that with his wife. They would like to have the MEC when it''s fixed with the RBP hopefully for Jan. 1st or soon thereafter.  He will call be back tomorrow if need be. I showed him how to change the IUA on his own. They might leave it alone. He''s not sure yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 17:48:46', '2022-09-14 17:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103050023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, '9-14-2022:  Linda called.  She was having trouble remembering how to tt a doc via telehealth.  We got the CirrusMD app dwnloaded to her phone &amp; all the way to connecting with a doc.  Linda is registered w/CirrusMD using the primary e-mail on this account:  linda.james0323@gmail.com     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-14 17:29:38', '2022-09-14 17:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103050018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', NULL, '9-14-2022:  Fariba from Arapahoe Prof Surgical Asst office called trying to figure out if Micah''s "insurance".  He gave them his MPB.Health card.  She''s going to get a receipt to Micah for the procedure & remind him to get with us if this surgery is part of an issue that will be over his IUA, or ongoing.  I told her he''s ''cash-pay'' & should have asked for a ''cash-pay'' discount.  & If this issue goes over his responsibility level, he has a healthsharing comm that may help him pay down the road.  She was very nice and will call back if further questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-14 15:44:37', '2022-09-14 15:44:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103041033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103065002', 'Lisa Dannen', NULL, '9-14-22 Lisa is 35, self-employed with home based biz, healthy, no pre-x, just taking progesterone for fertility benefit. They''re looking to start a family soon and she knows of the 60 day waiting period. She read the Maternity Guide and I told her the pages to read in the Guidelines to assist with learning all that''s included and excluded in the maternity benefits. She watched the video and felt very informed. her husband''s health insurance through his employer is very expensive. We discussed SECURE at $300/$1000 for Oct. 1st start date.  She will call me back today if she can talk with husband and go for it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 15:40:33', '2022-09-14 15:40:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103064003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '09.14.22:  Cindy emailed. Said her sons, Drew and Clay each want to enroll in the Care+ plan w/ a $5000 IUA. She asked if they all could wait to enroll for November 1.  I reminded her she would pay the increased rate for the month of October 1 and asked if that''s ok with her.  I explained what the boys needed to enroll and that all she has to do is fill out a change of member form and submit it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-14 15:23:24', '2022-09-14 15:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103041028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '9-7-22 Estaphania is born in 1995, I think.  Lives in Broomfield, County. She had FL Blue for $284 with APTC of unknown amount. She thought she could keep using it in CO now that she has a new job here. I let her know that''s not the case, that she will wind up having to pay back her subsidy in full if she keeps using it in CO now. We looked at Bright Health Bronze $0 Deductible or Silver $0 Ded to give her the free mental health she wants. She''s earning about $48K or more depending on her hours. She also wants dental and vision. She wants the full $300 for medical that she thinks she''s entitled to from her conversation with Jennifer Abbott. But, if Jennifer chooses to do a % of lowest cost silver plan then she will only get $173 towards her plan. Sean and I will talk with Jennifer about her best plan of action for now and moving forward. Jennifer will have to pay about $494 if she were to hire a 64 yr old at the 75% of lowest cost silver plan. Estaphania also had an ankle issue she had an MRI for and PT.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 14:53:48', '2022-09-14 14:53:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103033028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102402002', 'Rabih Sabra', NULL, '9.14.22 - Rabih called in WAY before his start date to get his online account information. I informed Rabih  that he cannot access anything until after his Oct. 1st start date. He did not seem to happy about this, but I reassured him that this is our process for every member. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-14 14:23:27', '2022-09-14 14:23:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103033023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480314', 'Sean Murtha', NULL, '9.14.22 - Sent a new permission form to Sean for Johanna at: seanmurtha93@yahoo.com ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-14 14:09:27', '2022-09-14 14:09:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103041023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '9-14-22 Andrew wanted to understand the price change and what to expect in the future and see if there are better options out there. For now, I still believe this is the best option for the money. I let him know that I don''t know if/when the next price change will take place if more or less than 1 year. In the past it''s been longer than 1 year, but you never know. He also didn''t realize that typically these are priced based on age. All the health sharing companies are going that direction now from what I''ve seen.  So, he will leave it all alone for now and make sure he''s billed properly this next month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 13:01:26', '2022-09-14 13:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103041018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059112004', 'Salt Garrison', NULL, '9-14-22 Salt thought he had already cancelled Zion on June 13th but he read their email directing him back to MPB. He had a Need with Zion early in the year for his heart issue that is genetic, same as his dad. He had to have his provided resubmit the bill too many times to Zion which became incredibly frustrating. When all was said and done, Zion paid their portion. I did not know that he also has Bright Health! He thinks they are horrific from his experience. He''s submitted a claim to State of CO and learned they''ve had many complaints and have given Bright Health a $1M fine! He will find out hi ded, mop and let me know. He wants to find new health insurance for 2023 during open enrollment but he won''t be getting a subsidy most likely because income will be around $100K and single member household now that kids are gone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 12:52:44', '2022-09-14 12:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103023091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103037002', 'Juliana Chisholm', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-14 12:51:03', '2022-09-14 12:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103050003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165323', 'Kevin Schill', NULL, '9-14-2022:  Kevin is seeing a podiatrist for his foot issue &amp; was worried about in ntwk vs out of ntwk.  I assured him that curr except w/his ''prev care'', no ntwk is required.  He''ll present as ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, save receipt, get det inv w/med coding, etc.  IF it looks like this could be ongoing, he''ll call within the next 2-3 mos &amp; we can show him how to sub a ''medical need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-14 12:47:28', '2022-09-14 12:47:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103023086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103022179', 'Courtney Ross', NULL, 'Member Only Healthcare Essentials', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-14 12:47:19', '2022-09-14 12:47:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103023081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, 'Due all the issues this member had with the membership they have submitted a Cancellation Request.  Due to Cari''s explanation I think it''s for the best as spouse couldn''t understand that she shouldn''t use HSA card for Preventative.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-14 12:29:30', '2022-09-14 12:29:30'),
