  ('zcrm_1579374000103033018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082419002', 'Phillip Brouse', NULL, '9.14.22- Phillip called to request a prescription quote form. I advised him that he can find one on the MPB.health website but then I also sent him one via email. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-14 11:46:44', '2022-09-14 11:46:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103041008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '9-14-22 Left vm for Andrew yesterday and today following up with his vm''s to me. His price change is $515 to $625 w/ $1000 IUA!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 11:46:39', '2022-09-14 11:46:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000103041003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '9-14-22 Spoke with Danna and she''s shocked by the huge price increase from $635 to $860 plus their fees to Nextera. They use Nextera a lot and really like them. Shaina has a thyroid issue they are trying to figure out. She''s had 2 ultrasounds so far and may need another in 6 months or so. They have reached $985. One visit is likely more than 6 months ago and the other is just in the last few months. She will at least submit the most recent one which was the more expensive one anyhow. I told her to call the MPB Concierge Team for help with creating the new Need and also for guidance with the colonoscopy she wants to do. I told her Nextera also has doctors they work with and get a rate of around $1200. As long as it''s coded as preventative, it will be at no cost to her bc she''s past the 6 month waiting period for the Direct membership.  She''s bummed about the major price increase and will discuss it with Dave and determine if they want to change their IUA or not. It doesn''t help the monthly cost all that much.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-14 11:39:24', '2022-09-14 11:39:24'),
