  ('zcrm_1579374000102933003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '9-13-2022:  Chris (=Ernest) called.  He''s realizing that his pre-x might be an issue.  He''s had elevated TSA (for enlarged prostate) for several years and they''ve done MRIs, etc working to bring down the #.  He''s been able to keep it at a 11.8 for about 2 yrs & the dr doesn''t feel like it''s anything.  BUT, we went over the pre-x phase in & max.  He''s just worried if down the road it becomes something & even the 125k 4th yr on is not sufficient.
