  ('zcrm_1579374000102830056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '9-12-2022:  Linda called asking about dental on her plan.  It''s not a ''medical'' issue, so just reg dental = not on their plan.  We went over options briefly.  She''s going to tt her advisor Wendy Scipione re: HMA or a dental plan.  She had her #, so she''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-12 17:20:14', '2022-09-12 17:20:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095959020', 'Mickey Chupek', NULL, '9-12-2022:  Mickey called and we went over a lot.
    - His wife Brooke has a bump on her elbow she''s concerned about.  We went over they are ''cash-pay'' to 5k, keeping receipts, etc, so we can help them sub a ''med need'' if this is going to be ongoing.  They just left Kaiser & she thought she could continue see them since we said you can use any doctor.  I told him, if they will work w/you as a ''cash-pay'' patient that works on our side.  However, I believe Kaiser requires you be their member or they will not see you.
        Sent Mickey a PHCS MultiPlan list of Int Med docs in their area.  If she''s having to start a relationship w/a doc anyway, at least this way maybe the doc can be their ''prev care'' doc as well.  (They''d pref a pediatrician for their child.)
     - Mickey said his dad (Robert Chupek) is talking about chg''ing his family''s IUA to 1k because they are thinking of getting pregnant in 1 yr.  I let him know better sooner than later in case they turn-up pregnant before anticipated.  There is a waiting period after chg''ing IUAs.  The elbow issue will prob be on the 5k IUA due to timing.  He will get w/his dad about chging this.     - CA

He called back:
     - Has a Planstin card, won''t that help?  We disc ''Prev Care'' vs diagnostic and/or treatment.  ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative & how her bump will NOT be incl in their ACA MEC plan.  That when he''s ready for a ''prev care'' appt (annuals, well baby, immunizations, etc.) to call & we can guide them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-12 17:18:10', '2022-09-12 17:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '9-12-22 Mary just had a death in the family and her mother broke her hip! UGH! So, she''s frazzled but sooo nice. They don''t have any open Needs. She told me her son was beat up on CU''s campus last Labor Day Weekend of 2021. It was a student. There''s some game that people play to Jump and Pump or some crazy name like that to beat people up and leave. He had some injuries and a Need from that which should have been closed out around Dec. of 2021 or shortly thereafter and nothing since. They shouldn''t be forced to convert.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-12 16:24:19', '2022-09-12 16:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, '9-12-2022:  Kelly wanted help finding an ENT in Lgmt (80503).  HCBB was quirky today.  When I pulled up the ENT specialists, they were Fam Prac, Cardiologists, etc.  So, no help what-so-ever.  She''s going to look online & will ck healthgrades.com & google reviews.  tt her about being ''cash-pay'' & asking for a discount.  Did NOT go over further (if ongoing need to sub ''med need'', etc.).  So focused on trying to find a doc, that''s all we did.     - CA

Kelly called back.  Her dad told her she could use her Planstin card & just pay a copay.  "That''s what he did."  I went over Planstin = Prev Only.  Disc medical coding, ''cash-pay'' is generally < ntwk disc rate, etc.  She sounded disappointed and frustrated.  She''s concerned not just about the office visit price, but if they scope it and it adds $300, etc., she just can''t afford that.  I totally sympathized with her... this is one of the places that''s tough.  [She has a 1k IUA, so no way to make it less.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-12 15:31:30', '2022-09-12 17:24:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, '9-12-22 Robert called for help with the HMA to update his bank account and to find out about a reimbursement for medications that has been over 6 weeks ago now. I had to send him back to HMA for help with that. He was fine with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-12 15:29:51', '2022-09-12 15:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102795074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101113002', 'Bradley Plummer', NULL, '9.12.22 - No response. Left a detailed voicemail and sent a new welcome call scheduler. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-12 14:33:32', '2022-09-12 14:33:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102834008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628010', 'Hunter Stirm', NULL, 'Spoke to Hunter about enrollment date....arranged for 9/18/22...Will call back with time.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-09-12 14:31:52', '2022-09-12 14:31:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102795069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141341', 'Judy Stachurski', NULL, '9.12.22 - Judy called in because she received a bill and wanted to know "when we were going to pay for it". I sent her directly to Redirect so she could discuss this with them. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-12 14:27:54', '2022-09-12 14:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090892002', 'Amy Morin', NULL, '9-12-2022:  Amy called & sent an e-mail stating we aren''t answering the phones.  I called to try to help (& trouble shoot why we aren''t receiving their calls).  Her husb was calling late Friday & realized we were not open.  Then he tried again & says both times he LM.  I gave Jennifer his ph #: 406-426-0273 so she can work w/Michele & figure out why it didn''t kick to Back Off Betty''s, or where his 2 messages might have gone.
     - Phillip went to the ER Friday night & had a follow-up appt today.  I sent her the temp for sub a ''medical need'' to Zion, asking for ''cash-pay'' discounts, (she''s not sure what her husb did at the ER - he may have presented his Planstin card?), etc.  We walked thru the procedure & form online together.
     - Went thru the 2 cards they have MPB.Health (w/QR Code) & Planstin & what they are for in detail.
     - She conf & was able to get her own list on PHCS MultiPlan site for Int Med docs.  We disc "guide" and how to proceed.  Once she''s ready for the setting the annual appts, she will call to make sure they are following all the ''Preventative Care'' guidelines.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-12 14:04:08', '2022-09-12 14:04:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '9-12-22 Mindy called because she''s SUPER frustrated with Zion. She feels she''s not being heard. Her husband''s need is all related and they are still trying to get to the root cause without success yet. They had Dr. Lee Nelson write a doctor''s note stating the ER visit for heart concern was all related to the same health issues he''s been dealing with all along. Mindy called Zion and was disconnected and tried calling back 7x with no luck. At some point she finally reached Eden again and promptly got disconnected again and Eden never attempted to call her back to resolve the issues. Mindy has spent endless hours trying to get the documentation to show proof of all one health event and completed the appeals process only to be rejected. Rejection due to "past history" which he has none and due to Dr. Nelson''s note came in after the ER visit. How would it come sooner? That makes no sense. She feels Sedera was so incredible and treated her like they cared while she feels like she''s back in the insurance hell with Zion with the lack of human empathy, care and concern. She''s less concerned of paying an additional $1000 IUA but would rather get help and assistance and compassion for the health issue they are tending to. It''s not v related thankfully since they didn''t partake.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-12 13:22:30', '2022-09-12 13:22:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102795061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', 'New Membership eff 10/1/2022', 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-12 13:06:12', '2022-09-12 13:41:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427074', 'Fox Marie Magdovitz', NULL, '9-12-22 Fox called bc she got the email that her plan cost is increasing but then got the email saying it''s not increasing until Jan. 1st. I let her know that date is now TBD and might be put off longer. So, no need to change. Her only possible issue on record is just skin checks and biopsy for spot on face that came back negative. If the price changes enough in the future then we can explore other options. But, for now it''s only $22 cheaper on SECURE vs PSDHC. So, I recommended she stays put for now until her price increases. Then she can pull her records fro derm if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-12 12:57:02', '2022-09-12 12:57:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102795056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change plan to the Care + I will update in A123 &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-12 12:52:08', '2022-09-12 12:52:08'),
