  ('zcrm_1579374000102795046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074214097', 'Cheryl Hendrickson', NULL, '9.12.22 - Cheryl called to find out if she was taking the necessary steps for her preventative care services. She had already verified that the facilities and doctors are in the PHCS network and I explained what bloodwork is included with her preventative care. Cheryl is a perfect candidate for our plans! She''s very hands-on and knows the steps to take in this process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-12 12:29:26', '2022-09-12 12:29:26'),
