  ('zcrm_1579374000102795036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924034', 'Scott Robinson', NULL, '9.12.22 - Leah Garcia, Scott and Cheryl''s advisor, called into the concierge team because Scott was admitted into the hospital via the ER due to an infected feral kitten bite and they need some guidance on what to do. I advised Leah to have the members call the concierge team directly when they need information like this so that the member is not constantly reaching out to her. I called Scott and Cheryl and explained that once he is out of the hospital we will work with them on getting a need open. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-12 12:24:49', '2022-09-12 12:24:49'),
