  ('zcrm_1579374000102830016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, '9-12-2022:  Brian called, asking to confirm info his advisor Paul Cholak gave him on the coming "chgs" to his Secure Plan.  I confirmed he''s talking the new age-banded pricing &amp; he is.  I conf the diff between Secure &amp; Care+ (Paul''s info was 100% accurate), also conf prices he''d been give &amp; everything looked fine.  He sub Patti''s Chg Form to go to Care+ (same 2500 IUA) at $445.  He knows no ''prev care'' &amp; no longer elig for the HSA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-12 12:12:06', '2022-09-12 12:12:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102830011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086032', 'Fadi Malouf', NULL, '9-12-2022:  Charles Frohman sub a tckt saying Fadi has chg''d his e-mail via the chg form, but he''s still receiving e-mails at the old e-mail add.  Both Patti &amp; I searched for a chg form from Fadi, but neither of us see anything.
