  ('zcrm_1579374000102732016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082319002', 'Steven Smith', NULL, '9-9-2022:  Joni called.  Her DPC is an Internal Med doc who just did her annual appt & wants to do 2 diagnostic tests = Ecocardiogram & Cardiac CT  [yes, her PCP broke off and she says he/she is now a DPC, but they have been using their ''prev care'' Planstin too, so maybe it''s a hybid office?]
