  ('zcrm_1579374000102692013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '9.9.22 - Nancy called because she needed access to the MAP program. I sent her all of the information via email and went into more depth about the plan via our call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-09 12:29:06', '2022-09-09 12:29:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102732011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659050', 'Beth Bryant', NULL, '9-9-2022:  Beth called.  Her screening mammogram has them now going further.  She wanted to know how to handle it since the next procedure, etc., will be on her healthsharing.  We disc ''cash-pay'' to 5k IUA, ask for disc, then call us if they will be going further (&amp; deadline, 12-mo period for ongoing, etc.).  She was very nice and seems to be understanding that calling us for directions before non-emerg items is a good way to utilize this healthcare.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-09 12:29:05', '2022-09-09 12:29:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102732003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '9-9-2022:  Kathryn is very confused by this healthcare.  Jennifer mentioned she talked w/Kathryn already, but Kathryn called again.  
     - She''s struggling to understand the difference between ''prev care'' & diagnostic.  
     - She called the ''telehealth'' and they told her she needs to see a doctor in real life.  When I asked did they mean a specialist, or a PCP, she said she thinks a colorectal doctor.  She has hemheroids & the telehealth doc said colorectal specialist.  I sent her a list of gasterenterology offices near her.  She''ll call & tell them about the telehealth doc''s recommendation to see if they still want a referral from a PCP & will call us for that list if she needs it.     
     - Kathryn is extremely concerned about her $2500 IUA.  Says she really can''t afford to pay that.  She may call her advisor Wendy Scipione to look at options for future items.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-09 11:35:32', '2022-09-09 12:11:09'),
