  ('zcrm_1579374000102628003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', NULL, '09.09.22:  Recvd. an email from Lindsay thanking me for explaining the situation w/aging and MCS costs. Said she now understands the need for raising fees for older members. She said she is willing to do a video commentary. I responded thanking her and advising her that MPB has not raised their pricing for any other services in her plan and has, in fact, added excellent services to her plan w/o a price increase.  I asked her to also comment on how she likes her MPB plan in her video.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-09 07:20:26', '2022-09-09 07:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102603031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '9-8-2022:  Jatin called asking for info on getting an annual for his child.  This CRM record shows his "MEC - Planstin - Cancelled".  When I ck Admin123 that looks inaccurate.  Sent Patti Teams chat for Monday & asked her to verify & corr CRM.
     - Went over Planstin = ''Prev'' & ONLY time you will use that card.  They are back in the US, so I went over all the details for utilizing it prop.  It seems like he''s a bit confused, so I''m not completely sure he understands what ''prev care'' is vs treatment & diag.  I tried, but sometimes the cultural diff can be challenging.     - CA     

- Jatin called back.  He must have spoken to Jennifer in between our calls because she mentioned a member called & was told by Planstin that no labs were covered on the Planstin ACA MEC ''prev'' care plan.  So she called & they told her after also telling her no labs were covered, she challenged that & they came back to say only "Lipid & STD" planels are cov & the Vit D panel is no longer included.  Jennifer is going to verify w/Eric when he''s back from a fam emerg.  
        Jatin wanted to know if the kids could get these panels.  I told him Planstin would have to determine that, but I did not think they would run these on children unless the doctor had concerns (=wouldn''t that then be diagnostic?).  He seemed to understand, but I think he just thought if they were covered for everyone he''d request them.  Kind of weird to want an STD test on your child.  W/the language issue, I mentioned I didn''t think they''d do an STD = Sexually Transmitted Disease test on a child and he acted like he "oh, well yeah I don''t want that for my child".  Hopefully, he''s not concerned about that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-08 17:38:04', '2022-09-10 12:12:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102603026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083544002', 'Matthias Hilger', NULL, '9-8-2022:  Mattias'' son is having sinus issues.  His wife works at a healthcare type facility &amp; so they get a bit of free advice.  The doctor his son saw, thinks the son has a deviated septum and wants him to see an ENT specialist.  He had questions about:
     - Presenting his card - educated him on Planstin = ''Prev'' only.  This will be diagnostic.
     - Went over ''cash-pay'' &amp; healthshare prodecure in depth.  He knows to contact us if this will continue &amp; knows deadline.  He''ll pay the 1k IUA.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-08 17:37:51', '2022-09-09 00:18:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102603021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '9-8-2022:  Whitney called for his wife.  Margaret''s doc wants her to have a mammogram.  He & she are unsure if this is a ''prev'' screening, or diagnostic.  So, I sugg they call to conf since it will be completely diff on how it is handled.  He tt his wife & she''s unsure.  We went over basics for both scenarios.
     - Planstin = ''Prev Care'' = Ntwk.  We got online together & went over the PHCS Search so he could see how to access options.
     - Diagnostic/Treatment - moves to healthshare component & ntwk not req''d, but if use ntwk then you know you are covered either way.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-08 17:37:45', '2022-09-10 13:34:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102603016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088964002', 'Christopher Cucullu', NULL, '9-8-2022:  Chris called again re: WHLC because he''s looking for a disc on dental &amp; for vision options.  The site is still not allowing people to register &amp; the link for Dental, Vision, &amp; Hearing products do not bring up anything related to that even if he could get in!  We disc other options.  I created a tckt to make sure John is aware that Chris needs to register too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-08 17:37:13', '2022-09-08 17:37:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102603008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480314', 'Sean Murtha', NULL, '9-8-2022:  Sean''s mom:  Johanna Gillum called.  She''s trying to help Sean (he just started a new bus), but at each turn we ran into issues:
     -She orig called the advisor, Jane Kassel''s office.  Johanna was frustrated because they "certainly made sure to update the payment info, but when they needed help" she felt pushed off.  She rec''d an e-mail with info, but was struggling to understand the "insurance" Sean has.  "If this is bad "insurance" she needs to figure that out."  Sean''s ex-wife set this up, so there may be negative feelings from the old situation shadowing this healthcare.
     - Sean is not feeling well, so we started with me discussing CirrusMD & I sent an invite.  We also discussed being a ''cash-pay'' patient (=non-prev), & Jane''s off had already told her he has a 1k IUA (although she had no idea what an IUA was & kept discussing the ded), we disc what an IUA in Healthsharing is in general terms & how they work: issue spec, 3/memb/yr, 4th & beyond, etc.  Told her to make sure he gets himself taken care of.  Orig he was trying to do his ''Prev Care'' annual appt to find out why he''s not feeling well.  I went over ''prev'' vs illness healthcare & how mixing the two can cause issues with the med coding & pymt.
     - Because she is not authorized on this membership, I told her I could answer general questions, just nothing specific.  So we worked together quite some time.  Lots to change for this to work.
        I went to send the "Perm to Disc" form & we realized the e-mail we have is no longer active, so Sean did not receive the CirrusMD invite either.
     - Walked Johanna thru how to find/have Sean complete the Memb Chg Form to submit to Patti.  Told her he can chg his e-mail add there, then we can get an invite for his CirrusMD, the Perm Form, a Welcome Call Invite (for both Sean & her to attend) to gain a foundation of understanding this, etc.
     - She was in a much better place when we got off the phone.  I told her to feel free to start with the Concierge Line, that''s why we are here.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-08 17:10:29', '2022-09-08 17:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102609014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', NULL, '09.07.22:  Got an email from Lindsay. She recvd. the MPB email re: price increase from Zion. She''s very upset that the healthcare plan pricing is being based on age instead of health status and said she''s very healthy and resents paying more money because she''s older. Pricing should be based on health status, not age. I responded agreeing with her and asking if she''d like to provide a video of her email commentary for our newsletter.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-08 16:18:49', '2022-09-08 16:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102609003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '09.08.22:  I called Diana. Told her I spoke w/Patti who offered to review Diana''s United Health Bronze Plan Design  to see what is actually included in this plan, which Diana was very happy about. I asked her to email it to me and I would sendit to Patti. Diana told me the quote from UH was for her and Ray only.  They are getting a quote for the family from the UH agent.   I also quoted her the mo. share fee for SECURE at a $2500 IUA = $765 for her, Ray and her daughter.  Her son just got married and needs to be off the plan.  Emailed her to summarize our discussion. She and the family are traveling for a funeral and won''t be back until the 19th.  She said she''d contact me then.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-08 15:29:49', '2022-09-08 15:38:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102598033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084286002', 'Jacob Cranman', NULL, '9.8.22 - Spoke with Jacob today regarding his recent experience with CirrusMD. Jacob stated that he wished Paul would have called him back just to clarify what the situation really was. Jacob said that he was feeling very ill at the time and just wanted a naturopathic remedy. He said there is no issue with CirrusMD and that he is very happy with his services through MPB.Health. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-08 14:55:02', '2022-09-08 14:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102598028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '9.8.22 - Jatin called regarding preventative lab work. He stated he called Planstin and they told him there was absolutely no blood work included in preventative care. I called Planstin and spoke with Evette and she told me that an STD panel and Lipid panel are included in preventative care. I called Jatin and left a vm with this information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-08 14:53:38', '2022-09-08 14:53:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102598023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095746002', 'Jamie Gambino', NULL, '9.8.22 - Jamie called in because she had an injury this weekend that resulted in a torn retina. Jamie currently cannot see and needs surgery to fix the torn retina. I transferred Jamie to Zion because Grace from Zion stated that they can help her open her need since she cannot see. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-08 14:21:08', '2022-09-08 14:21:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102598018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079804002', 'Laura McDonald', NULL, '9.8.22 -Called for information about the MAP program. Discussed with member and sent info via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-08 14:20:01', '2022-09-08 14:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102598013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, '9.8.22 - Welcome Call with Kelly completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-08 14:19:30', '2022-09-08 14:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102604002', 'Cynthia Shelden', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 13:38:48', '2022-09-08 13:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401295', 'Laura DeLisio', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking to Jane''s office.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 13:10:25', '2022-09-08 13:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102598008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098262002', 'Justin Wagg', NULL, '9.8.22 - Attempted to call Justin to do his Welcome Call today. For some reason my call would not complete. I did test my phone system by calling several other phone numbers and I also retried Justin with a +1 in front of his phone number to no avail. I believe he could have a blocker on his phone that is preventing us from getting through to him. I sent him another welcome call scheduler so that he can reschedule at his earliest convenience. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-08 13:08:34', '2022-09-08 13:08:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102595016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092125002', 'Debbra Penner', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Leonardo Moraes', 'Visit ID : 2223 Question : how do I create my account?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-09-08 12:49:42', '2022-09-08 12:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102589012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401295', 'Laura DeLisio', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Leonardo Moraes', 'Visit ID : 2222 Question : Hello', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-09-08 12:44:25', '2022-09-08 12:44:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102603003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500010', 'Brian Myers', NULL, '9-8-2022:  Brian called to learn how to submit an RX Quote request.  We walked thru it online together.  He''ll send one in shortly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-08 12:29:51', '2022-09-08 12:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058906061', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Member was in contact with Amy and requested to change his IUA from $2500 to $5000.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change in file.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 12:26:12', '2022-09-08 12:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047639040', 'Keegan Swenson', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy this member submitted cancellation as he now has coverage through his spouse.  I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 11:46:31', '2022-09-08 11:46:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '9-8-22 To Patti in Teams - Talked with John about Traci Hoops. Her product will be CARE+ and the MEC, in essence SECURE but cheaper. I have a vm into Traci to explain. We need to change it in Zoho. I think we need to put it in as SECURE in order to service the account properly but notate she''s getting a better price because of the new discounted MEC at $80 instead of $105. 

 I left a vm for Traci to explain and I''ll send her the SECURE information now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-08 11:41:29', '2022-09-08 11:41:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030251', 'Matthew Jorgensen', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update in Subscriptions', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 11:36:16', '2022-09-08 11:36:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102568018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092125002', 'Debbra Penner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-08 11:22:38', '2022-09-08 11:22:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291664', 'Janice Shayne', NULL, '9-8-22 Called Vic and he never received my emails nor did Janice. Both were sent to Gmail and I tried again. Sent it to Nutriplex email instead. He will review it now and we will reconvene on Monday at 11:30. Vic found Dr. Vaidya in Superior off McCaslin as you go up the hill. He really likes this dr. who does Aruyvedic medicine and has been really helping Vic with his minor problems. I also told him how awesome Alexander Love is for different things. He never had any luck with acupuncture but was happy to hear I had success with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-08 11:19:44', '2022-09-08 11:19:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102598003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656124', 'Lesa Russell', NULL, '9.8.22 - Lesa called about her preventative care and what card to use. We verified that the physician she is going to see is in the PHCS network. I then advised her to present her Planstin card so they can bill Planstin for her preventative care. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-08 10:55:05', '2022-09-08 10:55:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '9-8-22 My note - Hi Patti and John, I just spoke with Ashley in Member Services regarding John Raker''s account. He''s on the list of forced conversion members but doesn''t have an open need. She looked at his account and sees an old need from Aug-Sept of 2021 that she will ask his Needs Coordinator to close out. Then she will ask Mady to notify you two letting you know he can be put on hold for the conversion. His price was increasing by $100 a month for a EO. So, the delay will be a tremendous help to him. I also asked to confirm the forced conversion date for those without an open Need and it''s indefinitely on hold for now as well. It sounds like it will likely be later than Jan. 1st 2023, but she will ask Mady to give you two a more definitive estimate, if possible. They are still trying to sort out how to work the process through Admin 123. They also don''t want to disrupt open enrollment and such. So, we''re hopefully off the hook longer on that front! That''s good news!
I just updated John and asked him to let me know if he still winds up receiving an email from Sedera asking him to convert by adding the new bank account information, etc. If so, I''ll have to make sure Sedera does their part to close out the old need. He''s happy to wait to convert and keep his current price of course. He does have chiro visits through Redirect and PCP visits through Redirect to manage blood pressure and cholesterol. As long as he doesn''t open a Need with Sedera, he can proceed as is with Redirect. I also let him know he has a grandfathered membership that he can''t get anywhere since he was looking on Sedera and trying to find his membership. He was happy to hear that and stay put until further notified.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-08 10:37:12', '2022-09-08 10:37:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102568013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100459012', 'Kelly Matthews', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code card. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-08 10:13:35', '2022-09-08 11:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032313', 'Colette Krasnow', NULL, 'Member will be cancelling her membership and going Direct to Zion as they will sell her the Mini MEC to go with her MCS plan.  We will be able to do that in the future.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 09:40:14', '2022-09-08 09:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102568008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100610002', 'Jenna Kulik', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-08 09:15:12', '2022-09-08 09:15:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102298002', 'Mark Weisman', NULL, 'Received call from advisor that this member enrolled in the wrong plan.  Wanted the Secure membership.  I will change plan and send out Change form &amp; Signature request  &amp; notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 09:14:44', '2022-09-08 09:14:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, 'Member requested IUA Change from $1000 to $2500.  I will notify Planstin &amp; Change in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 08:43:21', '2022-09-08 08:43:21'),
