  ('zcrm_1579374000102546018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, 'Member will be adding her daughter McCall Hoop eff 10/1.  I have notified Planstin and will add the MEC.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 07:51:45', '2022-09-08 07:51:45');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090781017', 'Dawn Chiero', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in and told me that her husband will now qualify for other Insurance.  I advised her that he would have to cancel the member and she would have to re-enroll on her own.  I will send the Cancellation Link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 07:30:45', '2022-09-08 07:30:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645270', 'McCall Hoops', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  As she is now a full time student she will be going on her mothers membership.  I will notify Planstin and cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 07:09:59', '2022-09-08 07:09:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102546003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074214077', 'Brian Trefry', NULL, 'Member submitted PU for I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-08 07:03:20', '2022-09-08 07:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102476033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', NULL, '9-7-2022:  Rachel called, Aron is home from boarding school and having chest pains.  We tried to send her an invitation from CirrusMD & it''s giving me an error message.  I was able to send an invite to Micah, but he''s not home from work yet.  Rachel knows Micah sb able to add Aron to his acct once he''s home since he''s not 18 yrs old yet.
     - We talked aobut what to do:  make sure you take care of Aron.  Just because you can''t tt CirrusMD, Urg Care, or if it gets really bad the ER - present as ''cash-pay'', pay up to your IUA of $2500, save receipts, detailed inv w/med coding, etc.  Then call us & we''ll help you sub a ''medical need''.
     - Sent a supp e-mail to CirrusMD w/all info so they can setup everyone in the family.  She called right before 6pm and I stayed due to the sensitivity of the issue until 7:04pm...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-07 19:04:16', '2022-09-07 19:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102476028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079033002', 'Lakshmi Murthy', NULL, '9-7-2022:  Gopal called, they think one of the kids has a fracture &amp; they are seeing a dr tomorrow.  He wanted to know the procedure &amp; how his plan works.  We went over how to present, etc.  He will call after their appt so we can walk him thru sub a need to Zion.  He was concerned in case the dr wants to do emerg surgery, so we went over those details as well.  He''s very nice &amp; was a pleasure to work with today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-07 17:32:31', '2022-09-07 17:32:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102476023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '9-7-2022:  Whitney sent a question re: Shingles shot on his plan via SalesIQ,  

Here is a portion of what I responded with: 
Immunizations for adults — doses, recommended ages, and recommended populations vary:
Chickenpox (Varicella)
Diphtheria
Flu (influenza)
Hepatitis A
Hepatitis B
Human Papillomavirus (HPV)
Measles
Meningococcal
Mumps
Whooping Cough (Pertussis)
Pneumococcal
Rubella
Shingles
Tetanus

Visitor 119721
OK. So it is covered, but I just need to do it through the right office. Correct?

Cari
You are 51, correct? If so, we''ve been told that as long as you go through the right office, they do pay for the shot & the visit. Planstin (since they administer that portion of your plan) can be reached at: 1-888-920-7526. If you call, please remind them you are an MPB.Health member. We are here if you still have questions.

Visitor 119721
OK. Yes - I''m 51. I''ll give them a call to find where I should go.

Cari
Do you have a PCP (Primary Care Physician)?

Visitor 119721
Yes

Cari
You and I can look to see if they are listed as in network.

Visitor 119721
When I saw him earlier this year he sent a prescription to the local Costco pharmacy for the shingles vaccine

Cari
Yeah, doctors seem to be moving outside their offices for vaccines these days. Maybe your doctor works with another in network doctor that would administer your shot for you? Otherwise, you can ask Planstin, but they''ve been very clear to date: our plan requires an in network doctor administer the immunizations.

Visitor 119721
OK. I''ll give the concierge or Planstin a call to get it figured out.

Cari
Well, I''m a concierge team member. We can go further in depth on the phone, but the suggestion for how to get the shot is the best information we have right now.

Visitor 119721
OK. Sounds great. Thank you for your help!

- CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-07 17:11:51', '2022-09-07 17:11:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102476018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080072002', 'James Romano', NULL, '9-7-2022:  James sent an e-mail to the info e-mail asking for help on how he handles his ''prev'' care annual appt.  I replied letting him know:
     - No ''prev'' care on Care+
     - If int in seeing if he qual for a plan that does include ''prev'' care, please call your advisor: Joan Phelps & sugg he can contact her thru the concierge line until ~3:00pm.  
     - Present as a ''cash-pay'' pt before/when sched appt, ask for disc, know if they quote you it may only be the office visit & other expenses may be involved (lab work, immunizations, etc).
     - I LM so he knew I''d replied at:  (719) 313-6752 = Jim''s VM', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-07 15:55:01', '2022-09-07 15:55:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102494020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082146002', 'Ursa Abernathy', NULL, '09.07.22:  Ursa emailed me yesterday when she got her letter from MPB advising of the rate increase for her Care Plus plan from $165 to $190.  She asked if there are any other options for her.  I emailed her to say she has the least expensive plan we offer but since it''s still under $200/mo., it is an excellent value for all the quality services she has and we have several new ones being launched to help keep her costs down.  I told her to call me with any questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-07 15:49:27', '2022-09-07 15:49:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102492031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645270', 'McCall Hoops', NULL, '9-7-22 We are cancelling McCall''s membership to combine with her mom''s membership Traci Hoops. McCall needs the MEC for her school to be compliant and she''s no longer employed. She''s a full time student now. Traci has self-employment to show. I asked Patti to provide the email to give instructions to do so. The MEC is $105 per Patti, I believe. Full cost I''ll figure out and post in Traci''s account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-07 15:29:21', '2022-09-07 15:29:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102492023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '9-7-22 Patti gave me the thumbs up to be able to combine McCall''s membership with Traci''s and to add the MEC to appease her college. I just left a vm for Traci to finalize this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-07 14:56:53', '2022-09-07 14:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102492018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, '9-7-22 Just talked with John and he realized he made a mistake on the Direct/DPC pricing with the conversion. I also left a vm with Angel and Aubrey to discuss the price increases. But, I left the vm before I figured out the mistake and spoke to John.  John will fix it in the morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-07 14:49:11', '2022-09-07 14:49:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102481008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290291', 'Fred Blum', NULL, 'After speaking with Charlie who laid out some options for him member decided to do 2 things  1) Remove dependent from Plan (he will re-enroll separately later) and 2) Increase IUA to $5000.  I will make these changes &amp; notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-07 14:09:01', '2022-09-07 14:09:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102476013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091055002', 'Steven Meath', NULL, '9-7-2022:  Dawn called to see if they had any help w/influenza shots.  We went over their plan does not have any ''prev'' & they are ''cash-pay'' pts, so when the pharmacy/county asks if they have "insurance" they can honestly say they do not.  The county will only chg them $12 ea.
     - She was unaware we help w/RX pricing & mentioned she picked-up 2 items today (first time not on ins).  Her clobetasol top sol 50ml was $90+ today.  I told after cking 1 site, I found a coupon for $13-$26.  She will definitely get coupons from us next time & is willing to trans from Walgreens (today Costco was least exp).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-07 13:16:37', '2022-09-07 13:16:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102492013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, '9-7-22 Deanna left vm to confirm new cost. I called back and left her vm to let her know it''s $751.28 + $25 = $776.28. Told her to call me back if she has any other questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-07 13:13:05', '2022-09-07 13:13:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102492008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '9-7-22 I tried calling to warn Jeffrey that his membership is cancelled and I can''t leave a vm, it just hangs up on me. My text did not go through either. Emails are going through but no responses. I don''t know how else to reach him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-07 12:05:12', '2022-09-07 12:05:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102494003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '09.07.22:  Recvd. an email from Cindy.  Said she still wants to stay with the $5000 IUA for her son, Drew for Care Plus.  Her son Ryan doesn''t know when he''ll be able to get on his employer''s health plan yet and Clay is still finding his way to see what is best for him, so Cindy isn''t going to make any plan changes quite yet until her two sons have their health care needs fulfilled.  Said she''d let me know when that happens.
I responded to her email  acknowledging the situation and told her to call me if she or her sons want to further discuss their options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-07 12:04:16', '2022-09-07 12:06:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102492003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, '9-7-22 Ann called be she had a preventative mammogram completed and was billed $414 after trying to use her old Apex card. That card is not relevant bc she cancelled that 2/1/20. I suggested that she lets the provider know her card is old and that she is a self-pay patient and needs the cash price on this. She will do that. Sedera is forcing her to convert since she''s submitting a bill for her mammogram. I calculated her new cost to be $801.65 from $687 at $1500 IUA. I cc''ed John and bcc''ed Patti on the email to her with the new rate and info about the mammo. Results were clear and it''s the only time they''ve used their membership. The rates to switch to CARE+ is only slightly cheaper at $780/$1000. Not sure if it''s worth switching at this point. Who knows when Zion will change their pricing and with Sedera they get the high cost wellness items included with no IUA. So, best to stay put.
UPDATE!!! I misquoted Ann and her new rate will be $691.65! I sent her an updated email. John also looked at the sharing guidelines himself and is now in agreement that the wellness mammo is included without the IUA. I checked all recent past and newest guidelines and this seems true for all versions of the guidelines. Sedera changed this in 2020 to include high cost mammo and colonoscopy for preventive with no IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-07 11:57:54', '2022-09-07 15:01:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102481003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, 'With so response from this member I will cancel him eff 8/31/22.  Planstin notified and I will cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-07 11:23:19', '2022-09-07 11:23:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102476008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974147', 'Mailys MM Nasrallah', NULL, '9-6-2022:  Donna from Mailys'' doc off called.  Mailys told her she saw them listed on the PHCS MultiPlan site, but Donna wasn''t sure what insurance is supposed to be billed.  We went over Mailys Preventative Care ONLY thru Planstin &amp; on the PHCS ntwk.  Anything else Mailys is a ''cash-pay'' patient.  Donna was very nice and I trans her dir to PHCS so she could confirm they are or are not a part of the ntwk since she wasn''t sure.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-07 11:10:55', '2022-09-07 11:10:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102476003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063248011', 'Amanda Salzman', NULL, '9-6-2022:  Amanda sent an e-mail to Wendy, but cc''d both Jennifer and me.  Amanda was frustrated that she''d get thrown on hold & disconnected at the 10-minute mark.  In looking at the day she was calling, it was Labor Day so we were closed.  Jennifer was also pinged on this and when I was working on it, she let me know she''d already sent an e-mail to Amanda on how to start a ''maternity need'' before I came in.  About 4 hours later, Wendy sent me another e-mail (prior to Jennifer & I talking), so I called Amanda.  She was able to use Jennifer''s e-mail guidance & got the need sub, uploaded the doctor''s visit bill she''s already paid, etc.  She''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-07 11:08:34', '2022-09-07 11:08:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102389010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047639040', 'Keegan Swenson', NULL, '9-7-22 Left vm and sending an email now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-07 10:54:38', '2022-09-07 10:54:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102465003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083233002', 'Heidi Holliday', NULL, '9.7.22 - Heidi called in because she cannot get her children on her CirrusMD account. She had already emailed member services at CirrusMD but thought we could get it fixed for her. I advised her that I would also email CirrusMD member services to get assistance with this issue. She then asked me to give her medical advice regarding her 1 year old child. I advised Heidi that we here on the concierge team are not equipped to give any medical advice, she then stated "why am I paying you $700 if the concierge team cannot give me any medical advice?". I let her know that''s what CirrusMD is for and she told me that our conversation was pointless and hung up on me. I did send a support email in to CirrusMD member services to assist Heidi with her issue. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-07 10:52:41', '2022-09-07 10:52:41'),
