  ('zcrm_1579374000102375024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '09.06.22:  Diana called.  Got the letter increasing their share fee from $685 to $915 - too high for them. They got a better deal w/United Healthcare - Bronze plan - she wasn''t sure if it was $625 or $521 w/ a $6000 deductible and $6000 out-of-pocket per person (check this out) and a $814 tax credit. I told her I''d look into it and get back to her tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-07 07:01:15', '2022-09-07 07:02:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102375016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '09.06.22:  Emailed Cindy alerting her to the risk of taking a high IUA amount, if Drew has 1 to 3 medical needs and provided the share fee figures for the lower IUA amounts.  I received the email MPB sent to Dale &amp; Cindy announcing the new Zion pricing as of Oct. 1.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-07 06:40:25', '2022-09-07 15:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102381049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, '9-6-2022:  Kelly (the daughter) called, she wasn''t able to do the ''Welcome Call'' w/her father (not sure they even tried), but she called to see if we had time before we closed to do it now (it was 5:35pm Mtn).  I let her know that the call needs to be done by our ''Welcome Call'' team & sent her the temp to sched a call.  She only listed her first name, so I sent a Teams chat to Jennifer so she knows who that is.  It sounds like she has pre-x items?  She actually seems to have a grasp on "diff components", etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-06 17:56:31', '2022-09-06 17:56:31'),
