  ('zcrm_1579374000102381044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '9-6-2022:  John called.  Wow, has no clue what he''s purchased, how it works, etc.  Spent a ton of time working with him.  All components, how to get in, the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail &amp; how to use it.  Was on w/him forever.  He was super frustrated and not very nice quite often.  At the end, he thanked me sooo much for my patience as he knows  he can be difficult.  Said it really helped.  It looks like we''ve done this mult times w/him though, so we''ll see...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-06 16:09:28', '2022-09-06 16:09:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102381039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077989104', 'Heather Strazinsky', NULL, '9-6-2022:  Healther called.  She says Quest has billed Planstin mult times, but they have now been turned into collections because it''s never been pd.  Let her know Planstin is the one that can help see if they''ve received it &amp; if so, it''s status.  Made sure she has Planstin''s #, then trans her directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-06 16:07:00', '2022-09-06 16:07:00'),
