  ('zcrm_1579374000102381031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '9-6-22 I called Thomas and he shared that he broke his leg on a ski trip in Chile and his travel insurance should cover that part that took place in Chile and Sedera will likely kick in for the remainder that''s necessary for his care now back in the US. He has called Sedera and they provided a form to share with the travel insurance company. He will call the MPB Concierge Team once he''s further in the process for assistance and updates.  He was grateful for my call. He only missed 2 days of skiing and the rest were amazing. He''s back in the US.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-06 14:26:27', '2022-09-06 14:26:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102381026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290291', 'Fred Blum', NULL, '9-6-2022:  Fred submitted a support ticket to chg his IUA to 5k &amp; to make his son''s membership ind, rather than on their family plan.  I sent him the link to Patti''s membership chg form in reply to the ticket &amp; let him know how to find that form for next time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-06 13:23:57', '2022-09-06 13:23:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102391003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084286002', 'Jacob Cranman', NULL, '09.06.22:  Paul Cholak called.  Said  Roy Cranman called him yesterday and Jacob is upset re: CirrusMD for telling him to use Sudafed when he said he could barely get out of bed he feels so sick. Roy said Jacob and his entire family have Covid.  Paul asked me to have a concierge consultant call Jacob to find out if he is ok.  We need to find out what exactly Jacob texted CirrusMD and what was the outcome of his experience. Paul thinks Jacob may cancel his plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-06 13:03:15', '2022-09-06 13:03:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102375008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086853002', 'Carol Ann Kowalski', NULL, 'Carol has messaged me on SalesIQ and asked about the EAP program we have and she needs to use it. I pulled her up here in the CRM and emailed her the instructions and information on how to contact Mazzitti &amp; Sullivan to start counseling sessions. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-09-06 13:03:04', '2022-09-06 13:03:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102348046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078533002', 'Candy Rogers', NULL, 'I will be cancelling this member because she has not been in contact with me about her decline.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-06 12:51:52', '2022-09-06 12:51:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102381021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '9-6-2022:  Thomas called back.  He broke his leg when he was traveling internationally.  He purchased a travel policy that will help w/the initial expenses, but they are asking for his "ins" info.  I let him know his healthsharing company Sedera, will be able to provide the answers he''s looking for.  That they will be secondary to his other policy, but  after his IUA of 1k, the healthsharing will look at his extended treatments, etc.  He''s going to call them &amp; already had their info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-06 12:39:16', '2022-09-06 12:39:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102348041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081882009', 'Raymond Diaz', NULL, 'I will cancel this member due to Non Payment. I had no response from member on this. 4 emails &amp; VM sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-06 12:34:40', '2022-09-06 12:34:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102318018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '9.6.22 - Thomas called for his MPB.Health member portal information. I sent him his info via email through Admin123. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-06 12:10:23', '2022-09-06 12:10:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102381013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002887157', 'Trevor Mickelson', NULL, '9-6-22 CONCIERGE TEAM!!! Please notify me if any family member is removed from this account or if the bill goes unpaid. I will contact the appropriate family member to have it resolved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-06 11:35:50', '2022-09-06 11:35:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102381008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098026002', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '9-6-22 Spoke to Connie again and explained it will be best to let the facility know she doesn''t have insurance and she needs the cash price. She will pay the $1000 as a deposit and have them bill the rest. She is in the Cambridge, MA ER since Sat. They had to leave her there since it was Labor Day Weekend. They''re hoping to move her to the psych facility asap. Connie wants me to make sure to notify her of any delinquent payments for her monthly fee and she will pay it if necessary. She wants to make sure her account is up to came come the Sept. 20th billing.  She''s not sure if Jessica will be well enough to be taking care of her finances at that time. Notify Connie at 917-690-2647.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-06 11:34:04', '2022-09-06 11:57:24'),
