  ('zcrm_1579374000102380011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411262', 'Michael Hicks', NULL, '09/06/2022: Michael called asking why he was told by ASI that he didn''t have any policy with them when he tried to make his annual blood work. He was told that their policy changed in March. I offered him a call back. He said that he works until late today so in the case he can''t answer the call we can leave a voicemail and an email as well. - Marginne Téllez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-09-06 11:07:22', '2022-09-06 11:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102381003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098026002', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '9-6-22 Connie Hamilton, Jessica''s mom called bc Jessica was admitted to the ER for a mental health emergency and she got injured in the process somehow, but Connie doesn''t know what that looks like. She will be there for a few days at the very least. I explained the mental health isn''t included, but that I''d inquire to see if there''s anything else that might help in this situation. I''m waiting to talk with Jennifer in a little bit. Sounds like Jessica is out of state which doesn''t matter. But, she definitely doesn''t have money to pay for multi-day visit to ER or psych facility.  I''m not sure if they moved her out of the ER or not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-06 10:51:58', '2022-09-06 10:51:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102380003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093926001', 'Carolyn Haskin', NULL, '09/06/2022: Carolyn called she wanted to confirm if the mammogram it''s included on her plan and where she needed to go or what X amount will be covered. I explained her that the mammogram it''s included in her plan and I transferred to Planstin for a better assistance. I was asked for the member ID number by the Planstin''s agent but I was unable to locate it in CRM. - Marginne Téllez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-09-06 10:37:07', '2022-09-06 10:39:17'),
