  ('zcrm_1579374000102348018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522143', 'Steve Remmel', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to remove son Ryan Remmel from membership.  I will notify Planstin.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-06 10:15:51', '2022-09-06 10:15:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102375003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090811002', 'Kristopher Stewart', NULL, 'Kristopher emailed me asking that he needs to have his son, Benjamin, removed from his plan due to his and his now ex-wife''s divorce was finalized recently. I emailed him back and let him know what he needs to do after I send him the Member Change form, Patti Baron will take care of it and he will be notified once it is all done. He is all set and happy with the easy short process. I also privately emailed Kristopher after that and let him know that I understand what he is going through with the Divorce, and that we are very understanding people here, and will always be there for him anytime he needs. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-09-06 10:08:44', '2022-09-06 10:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102318013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077371001', 'Linda Blake', NULL, '9.6.22 - Linda called because she has a visit with her PCP coming up and wanted to know what the process is. I explained to her about presenting her Planstin card, verifying that the doctor is in the network (which he is), and explained which labs are covered. Linda was happy and just needed a refresher. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-06 09:52:02', '2022-09-06 09:52:02'),
