  ('zcrm_1579374000102227026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '9-2-22 Excellent testimonial for Jennifer''s work from Krista! 
"Hi Wendy:  I''m getting in touch to let you know what a pleasure it has been to have Jennifer as my (somewhat new)  MPB  Health concierge.

She has been nothing but extremely professional, very responsive and pleasant during the past months of email contact. We had a chance to talk by phone today, which was just a delightful experience. I l discovered we have a lot in common:  I went to university in the Upper Peninsula of Michigan, where she lives; we both have a lot of connections to Michigan; we both have rescue dogs; and we both recently broke a toe Emoji among other things.

