Krista Van Lewen Rogers"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-02 16:57:32', '2022-09-02 16:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102248016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095156002', 'Thitiwat Pichidtammarat', NULL, '9-2-2022:  Rattinan called to find out what he needs to do for a dental visit.  I let him know this plan does not have ''dental'' unless they are having a ''medical'' procedure.  Sugg his advisor Zach Masters may be able to help him with a dental policy.   [WHLC disc site curr does not list anything dental.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-02 15:34:38', '2022-09-02 15:34:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102248011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '9-2-2022:  Elsa called from the pediatrician''s office.  She''s there for her child''s wellness visit & they were telling her they could not bill ''Planstin'' because it was healthsharing.  She put me on the line with the gal & I helped her understand for the ''prev care'' visit, everything will go thru Planstin (which is NOT healthsharing) confirming since they are listed as part of the PHCS Network: Gursahaney, Aneel P, M.D., Pediatrics, 4745 Arapahoe Ave, Ste 310, Boulder, CO 80303.
     - All 3 of us discussed how everything in this visit must be coded ''prev'' to be covered. Elsa has something more to tt the doc about, but, she''ll try to separate that to another visit/discussion so it''s coded accurately.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-02 15:32:13', '2022-09-02 15:32:13'),
