  ('zcrm_1579374000102227003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '9-2-22 Ian called bc he has a shoulder surgery coming up on Sept. 14th. He''s going to Steadman Hawkins clinic and I believe having surgery with Dr. Millett. The good faith estimate through normal ins channels is $48K and the self-pay price is $20K. It good be more if he needs another nerve blocker or something like that. I advised him to communicate with his Needs Coordinator, Sarah. He''s tried calling and can''t reach her. I suggested email. It goes to a main email now to Needs@Sedera.com or something like that. But, they will be able to pay him the necessary deposit or amount necessary above his IUA for his surgery.  He talked with Fletcher Yaw who had a surgery and who was advising him on how to handle the Need. He sounds confident again. He''ll submit both estimates so Sedera can see the great price discount he''s getting as self-pay. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-02 12:19:27', '2022-09-02 12:19:27'),
