  ('zcrm_1579374000102125039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604206', 'Patricia Moran', NULL, '9-1-2022:  Patricia sent in an RX Quote w/2 items.  Here''s what she needed & what I sent:
     - Climara BRAND 0.0375mg/day 1 patch weekly, 4 patches per pkg, req''d 90ds & says it''s an oint/cream.  BUT:  I ck''d online & I only see this avail in a patch.  4 patches = 28ds x 3 = 84ds = what I quoted.  This BRAND is quite expensive.  None of the disc sites help & per GoodRX the retail price at several pharmacies is cheaper than using any coupon I found.  Ck''d w/Reid and he cannot source this strength.  Since the other RX is cheapest at Harris Teeter, I let Patricia know this is reg ret price of $198.79 there.  Told her we can reprice for generic if she''s interested.  The mfg site does not have coupons for this item.
     - Progesterone100mg, #90 (Her req says tabs, but only caps come up on the sites.)  Sent a coupon for #90 caps at $20.02 at Harris Teeter from Sngl Care (non-sign up price).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-01 21:13:05', '2022-09-01 21:13:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102125031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148008', 'Emily Watkins', NULL, '9-1-2022:  Emily sub an RX Quote.  Here''s what I sent:
     - She said she wants a 60-ds of this cream.  Since it''s a bit more exp &amp; difficult to know how much she uses, I sent her 2 coupons for diff sizes so she can choose.  The lgr is best price, but at least she can spread out the expense if the smaller would last a while.
        Tretinoin Cream (gen Retin-A) 0.1%, 45gms = $63.50 at Publix on RXGo
        Tretinoin Cream 0.1%, 20gms = $32.57 at Publix on RXGo     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-01 18:02:52', '2022-09-01 18:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102125026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '9-1-2022:  Ryan called.  He''s been having trouble w/his knee & is thinking that since he''s 40 now he should have a ck up.
     - Went over Planstin ''prev care'' & all the details.  Sent him the temp for finding an in ntwk doc, healthcare.gov, etc. and we walked thru how to find a fam prac doc near him.  Also disc separating his ''prev care'' visit/expenses from his knee issue so everything gets coded properly.  Knows to only use his Planstin care for ''prev'' & nothing else.
     - For his knee:  can see his new PCP on a sep visit/inv (tt the doc) for med coding & prop ''prev care'' pymt, but let him know no ntwk for his healthshare component.  When he sees a doc for his knee, he will contact us to sub a ''need'' & if PT or alt therapy sugg, he''ll get a ''treatment plan'' so we can sub it for pre-appr before going for that treatment.
     He''s super nice and at least seem to understand quite well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-01 17:00:26', '2022-09-01 17:00:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102125018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '9-1-2022:  Karen Torsoe called, Melissa called her regarding the same thing from Jennifer''s detailed message for Rich yesterday.  Saying she doesn''t want to make any other calls, just wants help filling out form.  Tried to explain to Karen why we have to refer the memb to Zion &amp; Planstin, but she''s now gone to Joan.  Jennifer also sent details to Karen.  Hopefully, the member will just call real quick to get the forms req''d.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-01 14:30:57', '2022-09-01 14:30:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102151014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '08.31.22:  Recvd. a video commentary from Jim. Very well done!  Will include it in our first MPB newsletter.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-01 14:27:54', '2022-09-19 16:08:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102151006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '09.01.22:  Called, spoke w/Cindy.  Discussed her son, Clay, aging out of their plan.  Since he is starting his own business, he can choose either SECURE or Care Plus.  She said she will talk with him about it and decide which he wants.  She recounted her experience w/a medical need she had and had use the ER.  She only paid $1000 and Zion took care of the rest.  She was very pleased with the process, which was quick and easy.  I asked her to do a video about it. She said she is camera shy but would play with it and let me know.  I sent her my website link so she could look over the plans w/Clay.  We will schedule a time to enroll him in Sept. I also told her that as of October 1, 2022, the monthly share fee will change due to Zion''s need to utilize age-banding.  She will see the new pricing on the website I''m sending the link to.
Received an email from Cindy. Her share fee increased to $915/mo. - too high for her. She suggested enrolling her son, Drew in a separate plan (Care+ at $5000 IUA = $140/mo.) and her changing her Secure plan membership to M&S.  This would bring her total fee amount to $765.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-09-01 14:24:54', '2022-09-07 06:38:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102086008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085046010', 'Mary Stavros-wells', NULL, '9.1.22 - Completed Mary''s welcome call. She seemed very confused that she needs to stay in a network for her preventative care (she stated that Robin told her she can go anywhere for any of her care). She said Robin also told her that her thyroid issue would not be considered a pre-ex, which it is and I had to break that news to her as well. I will be reaching to to Michele to speak about this members concerns with this plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-01 13:59:32', '2022-09-01 13:59:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102125013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082313013', 'Patrick McGrath', NULL, '9-1-2022:  Patrick called.  His endocrinologist is ordering his annual labs  & he wanted to see if there was help for those.  We disc the 2 labs cov on ''prev'', but that''s not this.  He''s going to go to LabCorp & ask what the ''cash-pay'' price is - knows these tests are outside the scope of his MPB Healthcare.
     - He lost his MPB.Health card.  tt Kelly F & she was able to get it ready to go right then & there, so it''s on its way.
     - He mentioned have quite a few RXs, but he was unaware that we can look at the best price near him.  It sounds like he likes a local pharm, but he''ll keep it in mind for down the road.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-01 13:29:01', '2022-09-01 18:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102125008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '9-1-2022:  Brandee called to thank us.  She was so worried about everything when Cole was in the ambulance &amp; how their healthcare in the past has not helped, that when she saw Zion paid today, she called us to say thank you.  It was great to hear how relieved she was.  I let her know we are looking for testimonials and she seemed open to sending one in.  She has my e-mail from the prescriptions, so if she does one, she''ll send it there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-01 13:25:19', '2022-09-02 15:50:55'),
