  ('zcrm_1579374000102125003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, '9-1-2022: Rob called, he''s trying to figure out the re-application process w/Sedera.  He was concerned about losing his longevity w/them &amp; I assured him that will stay intact.  I trans him to Patti (he''ll LM if he doesn''t catch her), but mentioned she may want him to tt his advisor Jill Clark.  I just don''t have Sedera memb, so I wasn''t sure of the best process.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-09-01 11:31:50', '2022-09-01 11:31:50'),
