  ('zcrm_1579374000102114003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103567009', 'Melissa McDowell', NULL, '9-1-22 Melissa is 55 and husband 56.  Came to me via Linda Lebsack in OR. I momentarily was thinking OR wasn''t allowed, but that''s WA.  Once I got passed that she was on board. She likes HSA. She and her husband are healthy, no meds, no tobacco. She also goes to a Functional Medicine Dr. She has been a LHS member and her employees have traditional health ins. She will pay 100% for her employees. She wants an Oct. 1st start date and I told her the Sept. 10th deadline.  She has 3 employees that are under 26 and 1 on parent''s plan, 2 in 30''s, 1 in 50''s. She wants to give this option to her employees and husband. Owns small business.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-09-01 11:05:34', '2022-09-01 11:22:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102111003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, 'Member called in and left VM re: removing one of her children.  I sent her the Change form email and returned her call explaining how to fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-01 10:55:20', '2022-09-01 10:55:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102086003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005980641', 'Matthew Freeman', NULL, '9.1.22 - Matthew called because he was wanting to know what the outcome was regarding his unusual IUA amount. I just spoke with Matthew Freeman who has already opened a Need with Zion for this issue. He started off not feeling well, went into the urgent care where they told him to get to the ER because his BP was 220/110 and he also had a very low heart rate. They are trying to clear the blockage they found with medication but this could also result in a pacemaker. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-01 10:08:36', '2022-09-01 10:08:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102074023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099516002', 'Stephen Berigan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-01 09:48:35', '2022-09-01 09:48:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101502002', 'Debra Workman', NULL, 'Member''s enrollment fee &amp; 1st month''s share amount declined.  I left VM and will send out email to member-9/1 9/1- Member submitted PU form with updated Acct#.  I will rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-01 09:45:17', '2022-09-01 12:27:15'),
