  ('zcrm_1579374000102074013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080702012', 'Jonathan Bill', NULL, '9.1.22 - Jonathan called in because he has quite a few bills that stemmed from a visit with his PCP. I advised him to open a Need ASAP and to make sure that he gets itemized receipts and bills from the providers offices, hospitals, and imaging centers. He wanted to just upload plain receipts and such, but I advised him that Zion would not accept those. He wanted a guarantee that this would be under 1 Need but I told Jonathan that it was not up to MPB, that Zion would pull his medical records and make their determination. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-09-01 08:47:12', '2022-09-01 08:47:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102074008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100830002', 'Michael Agugliaro', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-09-01 08:33:35', '2022-09-01 08:33:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089965012', 'Michele Palumbo', NULL, 'Member submitted Change for to add spouse to membership on 8/24 after deadline of the 20th .  So that was pended to a 10/1 start.  On 8/30 she submitted a change form to remove same.  She left VM explaining.  I had not made any changes to her plan as yet anyway.  I left VM advising member I would just delete the 2 Change form as if they never happened.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-09-01 07:59:41', '2022-09-01 07:59:41'),
