  ('zcrm_1579374000102035054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692197', 'Scott Ritterbuck', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Scott called & we went over a lot:
     - He will be traveling & is getting a ton of vaccinations at Von''s Pharmacy & wanted to find out how to get reimb.  We went over a ton:  cannot get vaccinations on his ''prev care'' Planstin at a pharmacy on our plan (he says they told him he has ins & were billing that - but he doesn''t even know what ins).  We talked about his ''prev care'' thru Planstin covers a few select items, but his covered vaccines must go thru an in ntwk PHCS doc.  I walked him thru his post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & showed him the healthcare.gov site, what adult vaccines, etc.  Sounds like he unfortunately already got all the items that would have been covered.  He''s going to ask what ins they show he has so he at least knows.  The pharmacy suggested trying GoodRX for immunization coupons, so we tried his ''rabies'' on GoodRX, which brought up nothing.  However, RXGo offered a $72+ savings, so I sent him the link & they can try to use that site for savings.
     - He & his daughter are going to be traveling (he''s headed to some 3rd world countries & she''s going to Scotland ?).  We talked about no ''prev care'' while gone.  If accident/emergency, make sure they both have Zion''s ph #s so they can call asap to get help.  We also disc they may want them to become stabile, then get home (which they will sometimes help with) for further treatment, so call asap.
     - He wanted to sub a ''med need'' to Zion re: his ankle.  It at $1150 right now & they want him to do PT.  Told him to make sure he gets this started & sub a ''treatment plan'' on the PT for prior approval.  Sent him temp for sub & went over all details.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 17:06:18', '2022-08-31 17:51:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752344', 'Judith Anderson (Knizewski)', NULL, '8-31-2022:   Judy called to get an RX Quote.  Her dental implant has failed &amp; she''s going in Tues to get it rem''d.  Here are the coupons I sent over.  Recently, WellRX hasn''t been accepted everywhere, so I also included the 2nd cheapest coupon just in case.  Hopefully, one of these will work!:
     - Amox 500mg, #28 = $5.97 at KS on WellRX
     As a backup I included the next cheapest:  Amox 500mg, #28 = $6.83at KS  on RXGo.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 15:55:45', '2022-08-31 18:00:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093811009', 'Sharon DePauw', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Sent e-mail to Sharon re: RX Quote (she doesn''t need for about 4 weeks).  SEE CRM e-mail below for DETAILS.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 15:55:22', '2022-08-31 18:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082419002', 'Phillip Brouse', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Phillip called, we walked thru sub his ''med need'' &amp; how to do it after I sent him the temp.  He sounds tired &amp; knows if we need to do another fill of his expensive RX we may want to make sure it''s &gt; $500 to qualify for pymt by the ''need'' - BUT, ck the guidelines to make sure that''s the case.  He will let us know once he sees the doc mid Sept.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 15:55:10', '2022-08-31 18:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102033021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100614035', 'Judy Doherty', NULL, '8-31-22 Judy is still getting charged double for her plan. They combined the two separate enrollments into 1 double enrollment now.  Talking with Ellen now with C4 and she finally sees the problem and put me on hold to look closer.  Ellen is creating a ticket because she can''t reach anyone with management team after being on hold for 20 minutes. It looks like there is progress on their end because she sees the correct $771.22 full cost and $505.86 client cost of Cigna Connect Flex Gold 2250.   TKT # 220831-000788. She thinks it might be updated in system by tomorrow and recommends to call back tomorrow once system hopefully reflects the change.  I made sure she created the ticket to document our attempt to correct this before the deadline with no avail.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-31 15:32:51', '2022-08-31 15:48:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098610002', 'Kurt Wenrich', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Cheryl wrote back that she went w/diff quantities on her RXs and the pharmacy just gave her GoodRX pricing.  I replied I''m glad she got her needs taken care of.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 14:52:44', '2022-08-31 14:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102056023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098500002', 'Shelley McLaughlin', NULL, '8.31.22 - Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-31 14:44:31', '2022-08-31 14:44:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102056018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032244040', 'Michael Forakis', NULL, '8.31.22 - Michael called for instructions on how to submit a need to Sedera for his wife who had seizures and was diagnosed with sepsis. I explained how to open a need with Sedera and sent him the instructions on how to submit a need to Sedera. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-31 14:28:50', '2022-08-31 14:28:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102056008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, '8.31.22 - Nancy called because she needs to open a Medical Need with Zion regarding dermatology. I explained how to open a Need, sent Nancy the instructions on how to submit a Need. I then transferred her to Zion for her member number. Nancy was very happy with her service. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-31 14:25:33', '2022-08-31 14:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079988002', 'Wayne Jatsek', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Melanie is still stuck on ''deductibles'' - had to go over ''cash-pay'', asking for a disc, basically everything again.  She''s going for an MRI, so we ck''d HCBB for fair price in her area = $775 IF we have the right scan: Brain MRI (with and without contrast).  She likes the place she got her CAT scan, so we ck''d them & they are just listed as a yellow on price.  I told her she now knows what fair price there is, so if they are $800 = prob fine.  If they are 2k, she now knows she can use the fair price as a negotiation tool.  Honestly, since we''ve been over this several time, she may not retain what''s being said.
     BUT, they are actually looking at a mass in her sinuses, trying to figure out if it''s in her brain as well, so I told her to call us and we will walk her thru the steps.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 14:00:32', '2022-09-29 12:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102056003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '8.31.22 - Cynthia called in because she has tendonitis and is in need of physical therapy. I transferred her directly to Zion so that she can go through the pre-approval process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-31 13:55:24', '2022-08-31 13:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102047017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102036065', 'Kimberlee Kelso', NULL, 'Member only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-31 13:36:43', '2022-08-31 13:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Karen called for RX pricing.  But, the doc just gave her 3 names of inj.  She expected me to go over the sugg dosages online, determine how she''ll presumably be using them (per dosing online), then contact our worldwide shopper for prices.  We walked thru the first, started the 2nd, and I finally let her know that we can price once we have the info, but for me to be doing this portion was difficult because of the number of people calling in.  She allowed me to go, but may call & ask for me since we''ve already talked (per her).
     [Phone was ringing the second I got off.  She seems to think we are here to provide more than our scope of expertise?]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 13:32:23', '2022-08-31 13:32:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102047006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096076002', 'Darcie Johnston', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-31 12:54:20', '2022-08-31 12:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102033013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, '8-31-22 Calling Jeffery Bryan regarding his late payment for Sept. I can''t leave a vm, so I sent a text. Not sure if he has a cell phone. I believe his only phone is cell, if I remember correctly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-31 12:50:44', '2022-08-31 12:54:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100797002', 'Barbara Guth', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Barbara called to make a pymt w/Patti.  She asked about amt.  Since she uses a debit card, I added the 3% fee = $7.95 + $265 = total of $272.95.  Trans her to Patti''s line &amp; she will LM if she doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 12:45:11', '2022-08-31 12:45:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439212', 'James Backes', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Jennifer called - she hurt her arm & wondered if she has to have a referral to see a specialist.  She''s sure an orthopedic will be necessary for the injections she''s expecting & since she doesn''t have a PCP can save that expense.  We walked thru HCBB together & she sees 2 women on the list.  She knows to present as ''cash-pay'' when she makes the appt, get det inv w/med coding, pymt receipts, etc., & to call us for sub a ''medical need'' w/Zion.  Also disc Care Conn should surgery come into the pict & we need ~ 4-wks for that convenience.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 12:40:49', '2022-08-31 13:06:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102033008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041616103', 'Kai Philipp Olshausen', NULL, '8-31-22 Dr. Kai Phillip O called out of surprise that the price increased by $300+! They have the $500 IUA which is having the largest price increases. His fee is going from $687 to $997.65+$30. He can choose the 1000 IUA at $720.65+$30 or $1500 IUA at $646.55+$30 OR go to SECURE EF $1000/$715.  I left him a vm to discuss his options now that I confirmed the price increase is accurate after talking with John Kach.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-31 12:11:00', '2022-08-31 12:11:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102035003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471317', 'John Kline', NULL, '8-31-2022:  Whitney called to find out how her ''prev'' care works.  She was confused since it''s the old APEX.  She did find the new RCI card Patti sent her, so we talked details.  As an advisor, she''s aware of Planstin''s rules, so we just discussed how this is just a diff comp, but basically the same.  She knows to conf PHCS & sees that on the card.
     - She was curious about the MPB.Health cards w/QR Codes too.  Kelly F is sending new cards for them & I conf the add for her since there are 2 John Klines.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-31 11:46:43', '2022-08-31 11:46:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000102033003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291664', 'Janice Shayne', NULL, '8-31-22 Vic watched the video and let me know he''s now 65 on Medicare but not yet on Part B. I let him know he doesn''t qualify to be on MCS now that he''s 65 but Janice at 63 can join. They are almost 100% naturopathic in their health choices. No prescriptions, except Janice got an ear infection about a week ago and went on antibiotics for a week to resolve it. All set. They do not do annual wellness visits. So, CARE+ is the best option for Janice at $265/$1000 and daughter who''s 37 or 38 might also be interested at $240/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-31 11:44:23', '2022-08-31 11:44:23'),
