  ('zcrm_1579374000101989008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '8.31.22 - Called Rich and left him a vm regarding requesting a Proof of Benefits letter for his daughter college. I gave him both phone numbers to Zion and Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-31 08:27:47', '2022-08-31 08:27:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101989003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086967002', 'Kris DiNucci', NULL, '8.31.22 - Kris called in with questions regarding his daughter using the MAP services. I sent him the MAP template and put the MAP phone number on the template. I also advised Kris on how to receive a Letter of Benefits to provide to his daughter''s college from both Planstin and Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-31 08:15:35', '2022-08-31 08:15:35'),
