  ('zcrm_1579374000101975003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001284049', 'Natasha Heath Thrasher', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking w/Wendy.  I will cancel her HES membership ahead of the billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-31 07:05:36', '2022-08-31 07:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101937054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089510002', 'Tyler Farrish', NULL, '8-30-2022:  Bria called.  She was just diagnosed w/scoliosis and wondered if this is something healthsharing may help with.  I told her we should sub a ''medical need'' &amp; Zion will determine that for her.  We also disc how to handle alternative treatment (a scoliosis specialist = a chiropractor), sub a treatment plan, &amp; it must be pre-approved.
     - She asked if contacts are covered on her MPB plan &amp; I let her know it does not incl dental or vision.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-30 17:57:16', '2022-08-30 17:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101937049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085046010', 'Mary Stavros-wells', NULL, '8-30-2022:  Mary called to get help sched her ''Welcome Call''.  She knows they will call the ph # she puts into the calendar.  She may not be the best fit for this plan as she said : "I just don''t have much time.  I just like to present my card and go."  Hopefully, w/guidance she''ll be okay.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-30 16:45:17', '2022-08-30 16:45:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101967008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101953021', 'Teresa Saul', NULL, '8-30-22 Teresa and I kept missing each other. She didn''t come to our scheduled appt. But, she just told me she got a new job with benefits. So, she''s all set for now. Came to me via Joy Lanzano.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-30 15:29:49', '2022-08-30 15:29:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101967003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001284049', 'Natasha Heath Thrasher', NULL, '8-30-22 Tasha and her husband sold their business and are now working for a company that provides health insurance. They already cancelled LHS and just needed to cancel HES as well. She successfully completed the cancellation form just now and should be reimbursed for Sept. She was super sweet as always.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-30 15:18:11', '2022-08-30 15:18:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101937035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '8-30-2022:  Helen called to make sure her son is still on their membership (Lucas).  Dbl ck''d Admin123 &amp; he is listed as an active dependent (all three kids are).  She was wondering about counseling for Lucas.  Since she''s on Redirect, I sugg she call them since I am not 100% sure on this plan.  She may also ck w/Sedera.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-30 15:17:50', '2022-08-30 16:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101931018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098690002', 'Samantha Hernandez', NULL, '8.30.22 - Samantha emailed in with the name of her medication, Azithromycin. I will be sending her a coupon via email today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-30 14:18:13', '2022-08-30 14:18:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101931013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, 'Dependent Clay will be aging out of plan eff 11/1/2022.  I will send out 1st notification to member&amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-30 14:08:05', '2022-08-30 14:08:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101937018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, '8-30-2022:  Rachel called to see what she needs to do for a mamm.  We looked at healthcare.gov guidelines:  "Breast cancer mammography screenings.  Every 2 years for women 50 and over.  As recommended by a provider for women 40 to 49 or women at higher risk for breast cancer."  She''s 46 so she''s going to ck w/her doc to see what they recommend &amp; will call us if they decide to move fwd to get full details on how to use her ''prev care''.     - Ca', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-30 13:59:00', '2022-08-30 14:43:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101937013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095683002', 'Jeramiah Carr', NULL, '8-30-2022:  Jeramiah called.  His child fell down the stairs today and was knocked unconcious.  His wife took the child to Urg Care & the child started throwing-up.  They are now sending the chid to the hosp.  I went over how to present at the hosp ''cash-pay'', disc?, ask to pay (IUA) $2500 & have them bill him for discounted bal.  He knows to save det inv w/med coding, pymt receipts (from Urg Care, ER, etc. Issue specific), to sub for the ''med need'' & will call us in a few days to get help starting the ''need''.  He appreciated knowing how to present.  Says otherwise, he''d have presented the wrong card & struggled.  I made sure he knows most imp thing right now - take care of your child!  We are here to help on the backside of this emergency.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-30 13:35:16', '2022-08-30 14:49:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101937008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082159001', 'Katherine Avinger', NULL, '8-30-2022:  tt Katherine.  Went over Planstin.  Their pediatrician is curr listed in the PHCS Search (thank goodness since their appt is today):  McCorkle, Van S, M.D., Pediatrics, 1500 Langford Dr, Bldg 100, Watkinsville, GA 30677.   We disc how to present Planstin card & ONLY for ''prev'' care & why.  She seems to have a good grasp of how to handle this.  She wanted to make sure his immunization will be covered so we pulled up healthcare.gov together from the link in her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail.  She knows to call Planstin if anything not on the list for proper guidance since they determine/interpret the items cov by the ACA MEC plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-30 13:35:08', '2022-08-30 14:52:17'),
