  ('zcrm_1579374000101913003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654206', 'Elizabeth Burlingame', NULL, '8-30-22 Maya emailed a 1095-C form that she received from Redirect showing they were members from July 2021-Dec 2021. This is Not correct. They cancelled as of 12/31/20 and joined SECURE as EF Jan 1st, 2021.  I spoke with Patti and she will contact Redirect to get them to resolve this. I let Maya know it''s an error on Redirect''s part. They are paying the correct amount to MPB for their SECURE membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-30 11:53:03', '2022-08-30 11:53:03'),
