  ('zcrm_1579374000101867003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084501002', 'Emre Ozturk', NULL, '8.30.22 - Emre called because they believe his wife is pregnant (she took 6 pregnancy tests) and wanted to know what steps they need to take at this point. I advised Emre to go ahead and open a Maternity need with Zion ASAP. I sent him the instructions on how to do so and I also sent him the Maternity guidelines so that they can go over them per Emre''s request. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-30 08:04:21', '2022-08-30 08:04:21'),
