  ('zcrm_1579374000101832052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098493010', 'Ann Tucker', NULL, '8-29-2022:  Ann called & seemed upset that I had run the RX Quotes w/the quantities she req''d.  She decided she wants #30 only on the Naproxen, HCTZ, & Lisinopril.  I explained that will cost more in the long run, but she still wants to go w/the lower qty (ie: Naproxen #30 = $7.99, #60 = $10.97).  Told her I would send over the adjusted coupons today.  As I''m re-doing the coupons, I realized Ann seemed confused between qty #30 & 30-ds, so I supplied both - see below.     - CA

