  ('zcrm_1579374000101790018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '8.29.22 - Michelle called because her husband was in a vehicle accident last night on his return trip from taking their son to Arizona for college. He is currently in the hospital and will have to stay for another 6-12 days. I advised Michelle to get a Medical Need opened with Zion ASAP even though she does not have any bills or receipts as of yet. She will be calling back when she needs more assistance for this Need. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-29 12:26:05', '2022-08-29 12:26:05'),
