     - She also sub an RX Quote - but she doesn''t need this for about 4 weeks.  In her mind, CirrusMD would just write her a new yr RX.  We discussed this will need to come from her reg Dr, but she''s been moving a lot, so she''s cking w/Amazon to see if she has refills, if so what''s they qty of the refills so we know how long/what qty, and their price so we can see if we can find her better pricing.  She''s taking the BRAND of her bc''s Necon.  I let her know if it''s exp we can try our worldwide shopper too & for that we want to order the refill 2+ weeks ahead.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-29 11:50:44', '2022-08-29 11:53:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101832008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, '8-29-2022:  Analisa called trying to figure out why Tal''s colonoscopy bills are coming to him.  I was asking questions and we realized if Tal (or his wife Amy) can call to let me know true details, I can help them figure out what is happening.  I told her, otherwise, I''m really just guessing and that''s not very productive.  Analisa seemed ok with that.     - CA

