  ('zcrm_1579374000101790008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098690002', 'Samantha Hernandez', NULL, '8.29.22 - Samantha sent in a prescription quote form without the name of the medication. I called and left a vm and also emailed Samantha for this information so that I could start working on her prescription quote. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-29 07:32:43', '2022-08-29 07:32:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101790003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409002', 'Blake Sieck', NULL, '8.29.22 - Blake called for instructions on how to handle his sons injury. I explained that he could still see the NP that they have an appointment scheduled with along with keeping the appointment they have with the Pediatric Orthopedic Specialist. I explained the self-pay process, HCBB fair pricing for any imaging they made need for his son, and sent him instructions on how to open a Need with Zion. Blake was under the impression that he had to meet a $5,000 IUA but I advised him that he actually has a $2,500 IUA per incident. He may be able to open a Medical Need for his daughter''s recent injury since they are coming up on the $2,500 mark. I advised Blake to open a Medical Need immediately for his daughter''s injury, even if it may not go above the $2,500. Blake will call back with any other questions or for fair pricing when he needs it. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-29 07:29:42', '2022-08-29 07:29:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101788003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101333002', 'Johnathan ONeal', NULL, 'He did enroll, trying to get in contact with him to qualify him as he never spoke to an agent. On my third attempt, sending an email now.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-08-29 07:25:38', '2022-08-29 07:25:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101785003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047519124', 'Forrest Coleman', NULL, 'Analisa has been non responsive to this member.  I sent him the link to the cancellation.  I will process when I receive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-29 07:19:04', '2022-08-29 07:19:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101708016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089999002', 'Sean Covel', NULL, '8-26-2022:  Sean wants to see a psychiatrist, looking for treatment of ADHD.  He wondered if we have any help for that.
     - He''s going to touchbase w/CirrusMD to get guidance.  Knows it''s not a covered expense, but they may be able to guide him.  CirrusMD error code told me: "no matching info", but when I sent a support tckt, they said he is already registered and sent him a link to reset his pw.
     - Also let him know he has access to (MAP) prog & counselors.  Went over setup.  In case he wants to look into that down the road.  He''ll call, for now he wants to start above.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-26 16:06:00', '2022-08-26 16:06:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101708008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, '8-26-22:  Gretchen called.  Her doc is trying to find a mamm cntr near them in ntwk, but no one she''s called is.  We used the PHCS tool together & the closest is 37 miles or 1 h - 1 1/2 h away (& $30 in gas right now w/CA gas prices).  Reminded her to have doc conf people reading the images also in ntwk.  Let her know we are trying to chg syst, but ntwk fine until at least end of Sept & maybe further. 
     - She''s also has arthritis in her jaws & wking w/Zion for surgerical fix.  She had questions, but consistenly interupted before I said more than a few words re: this, so I''m not sure why she was asking questions.  She''s not int in Care Conn & Zion has already told her they''ll pay whatever, so, she''s set here.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-26 16:03:17', '2022-08-26 16:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101648072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084968002', 'Robyn Seaton', NULL, 'Member''s 9/22 payment declined 1st notice sent vai VM &amp; email 8/26 8/31-final notice sent 8/31 I received updated Pmt info from member I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-26 14:04:33', '2022-08-31 12:25:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101648067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066461517', 'Jeffery Bryan', NULL, 'Member''s 9/22 declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 8/26 8/31- Final notice sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-26 13:56:44', '2022-08-31 09:46:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101648059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604259', 'Christine Riley', NULL, 'Member''s 9/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via VM &amp; email- 8/26 8/26-member updated Payment info after this had been ran.  I reran w/new acct info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-26 13:44:49', '2022-08-26 13:55:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101648054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '8.26.22 - Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-26 13:15:43', '2022-08-26 13:15:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101708003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '8-26-2022:  Carolyn called.  She needed several items.  [Note: Carolyn is a retired doc, so feels it''s diff for her to find a doc she''ll see.]:
     - ''Prev'' Care:  Carolyn found a doc she wants to see: Dr. Jennifer Johnson who is showing in ntwk.  She''s wanting to have her colonoscopy.  The doc is a concierge doc (which we disc is not a shareable exp) and has a waiting period.  They think maybe Oct?  We disc her seeing someone else first & chging...  but, 1x/yr ''prev'' appt will not be avail w/2 docs unless it''s a yr apart.  She decided to wait to see if she can do all of this thru Dr Johnson once she can get in.
     - Pre-x:  Waiting period - Carolyn has shoulder issues & instead of rotator cuff surgery, she had an alternative.  She knows it''s pre-x, so we went over what happens after 1- yr waiting period.  How alt need to be pre-approved, and the steps.  She may call to see if this is something Zion would help w/once she''s past the waiting period.  If nothing else, she knows to save det inv w/med coding, pymt receipts, a get treatment plan, if it''s something we can help sub a ''medical need'' for.  She''s thinking she''ll wait until after 1/1/2023 & will call after her 1st appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-26 12:45:56', '2022-08-26 16:23:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101707003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101645106', 'Larry Jones', NULL, 'After listening to phone call recordings from 8/15/22 - Leonardo spoke to agent and told him he would give agent his name and number to Michele to  call back regarding becoming an active agent.

On 8/19 Guy spoke to same agent and asked him to email Guy at his email address and he would be sure to pass it on to Michele to return his call.

Neither Guy nor Leonardo let Michele know.  It was found out due to Julia reviewing calls from the call log.

I have left 3 messages on 8/23 - 8/25 & 8/26 with no response or call back from Larry.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-08-26 12:00:01', '2022-08-26 12:00:01'),
