  ('zcrm_1579374000101663037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893072', 'Elaine Roth', NULL, '8-26-22 I called Dr. Jeff Roth back just now. He has called after 5:00 on Tuesday and Wednesday when I was packing and traveling to FL for our meetings. He called again while in FL  in meetings.  I just got all 3 vm and he had already taken care of updating the payment with Patti. Patti had already informed me they were all set, but I still wanted to let him know why he hadn''t heard back from me. He seemed to be in a rush and said he figured it must be because I was traveling or something. They are all set for moving forward with an updated payment method.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-26 09:47:50', '2022-08-26 09:47:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101699003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, '8.26.22 - Caterina called in to access her CirrusMD services. I could not send her an invitation successfully so I sent CirrusMD an email with Caterina tagged on it. ~JTS

