  ('zcrm_1579374000101655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100610002', 'Jenna Kulik', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of September 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-26 07:33:27', '2022-08-26 07:33:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101628016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439212', 'James Backes', NULL, '8-25-2022:  Jennifer''s # shows as a missed call, but it never rang here.  Called &amp; LM on her VM.  Since it hadn''t rung here, I dbl ck''d volume, &amp; refreshed.
     - Going to leave I see another missed call!  I''ve been working on RX Quotes &amp; it did not ring.  Tried calling her at 6:10-ish &amp; the # is busy.  I have no idea why it''s not ringing.  The tab is NOT muted, the volume is up, etc!
     - Tried her one last time before I close down my GoTo at 6:28pm.  ILM again w/our hours tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-25 17:26:37', '2022-08-25 18:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101628008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098138001', 'Barbara Rickford', NULL, '8-25-2022:  Barbara sub RX Quote w/4 items.  3 look like RX meds, the third OTC?  Here''s what I sent:
     - Progesterone 200mg, #30 caps (30ds) = $12.13 @ KS on RXGo.  [Gave her 90ds pricing in case she stays on this: curr = $26.38.]
     - Liothyronine 5mcg, #120 tabs (60ds) = $21.81 @ KS on RXSaver [Incl 90ds if continues this = $29.72.]
     - Levothyroxine 75mcg, #90 (90ds) = $10.31 @ KS on SnglCare (non-signup price)
     - Testosterone "BRAND" 1mg, #90 - this shows as an OTC at this strength & is not a "brand name".  Asked her for more specifics so we can price.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-25 17:11:11', '2022-08-25 17:15:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101628003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089233002', 'Alexander Myers', NULL, '8-25-2022:  Rec''d RX Quote for 2 items.  One very expensive & Reid cannot source:
     - Albuterol Sulf HFA 90mcg, 8.5gm Inh = $15.02 at Walgreens on WellRX 
     - AirDuo RespiClick "BRAND" 55 mcg/14mcg Inh = $138.58 at Walgreens on RXSaver.  Included the mfg website pg for pt asst:  https://www.myairduo.com/teva-patient-assistance-program  so they can see if they qualify for help.
I let Shannon know they can save ~$13 if they want to pick-up the 2 items at diff pharm (Kroger & Hy-Vee, but that''s 2 stops, neither @ their pref pharm, & takes the interactive software out of the pict.)     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-25 16:50:11', '2022-08-25 16:50:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101586003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101284002', 'John Kotrosa', NULL, 'QR Code for 5th dependent Spencer: H06E3.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-25 14:12:20', '2022-08-25 14:12:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101584003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893072', 'Elaine Roth', NULL, '8.25.22 - Jefferson (Elaine''s husband) called in because he has been trying to reach Wendy since she left him a voicemail regarding updating his payment information. I sent Jefferson the payment update form and also the MPB.Health portal log-in information per Elaine''s approval. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-25 14:11:31', '2022-08-25 14:11:31'),
