  ('zcrm_1579374000101517003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171447', 'Dorian Merrill', NULL, '8-25-2022:  Dorian called.  She thinks she broke her wrist & didn''t know how this works.  I told her first & foremost take care of you.  Unsure where to go (she''s curr in Maine, not home in CO), we got her into her CirrusMD.  That Dr can guide her since she''s not sure how to proceed... Urg Care, ER, or?  She asked about calling for pricing.  I told her IF she feels up to it, that''s always appreciated, but do NOT risk your health.  She''s going to present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a discount, get inv w/med coding, pay up to her $1500 & save the receipts, then call us tomorrow-sh once she''s taken care of so we can help her w/sub a ''need'' to Sedera.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-25 11:34:45', '2022-08-25 11:34:45'),
