  ('zcrm_1579374000101438003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '8.25.22 - Jennifer called looking for the fair price for a chest x-ray in Kalamazoo, MI. The fair pricing was $50 so I sent her that information along with a list of facilities that may honor that price. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-25 07:45:42', '2022-08-25 07:45:42'),
