  ('zcrm_1579374000101392039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098500002', 'Shelley McLaughlin', NULL, '8-24-2022:  Shelley called &amp; wanted to know how to handle a doc appt.  We disc she does not have ''prev'' care on her plan, which she seemed to understand.  Mentioned she is elig for an HSA, or she could talk to her adv Zach Masters re: HMA = both used by memb to pay for non-cov items.  
     - Sugg she sched her ''Welcome Call'' to get a better pict of her healthcare.  Sent invite.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-24 18:22:03', '2022-08-24 18:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101392031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '8-24-2022:  Michele called her advisor Leah Garcia & Leah called the Concierge Line to have us all go over a few items Michele has questions on (we were all on the phone together):
     - Michele absolutely did NOT understand how her ''prev'' care works, even w/everything Jennifer did with her on the 18th.  Her plan was to pay & be reimbursed.  I went over RCI in detail: all entities in ntwk, you pay 0 & RCI pays for your ''prev'' appt - make sure all items coded as ''prev'', even included comment in e-mail w/the 6 gynecology providers in her area (she thinks a PCP will be hesitant to order a mamm) to make sure ''reader of the film'' is in network.  Make sure your keep it to the gvmt mandated ACA MEC items (call RCI to confirm). 
       We decided she is calling RCI to:  order pdf & hard copy cards because she does not know where hers are & to confirm it''s been > than a yr so she can have a ''Well Woman'' visit covered.     -CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-24 17:42:00', '2022-08-24 18:16:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101392023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104534011', 'Yu Deng', NULL, '8-24-2022:  Yu called.  This is a lot for her.  
     - Her ''prev'' PCP visit included labs at Quest, but not everything got pd.  We went over what we know is cov.  She''s going to ask Planstin, if all the items were medically coded as ''prev'' so we know whether that is the issue.  She said the bill isn''t much, so she may drop it after that, but she may also call us again.  She seems to understand the in ntwk thing & even understood w/a mammogram both the imaging comp & the comp that reads it need to be in ntwk.  She has a good grasp on that part.
     - I suggested she feel free to always call the Concierge Line prior to any appts, so we can guide her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-24 15:43:05', '2022-08-24 15:43:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101349039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085646002', 'Karen Lapchinsky', NULL, '8.24.22 - Karen called to ask about the appeals process with Zion because he son was denied surgery to put tubes in his ears. I explained the appeals process and gave her an idea of what documentation to provide from the ENT for the appeal. I also explained what she will need to have to open the Medical Need for her other son who had a burn incident and was taken to the ER. Karen was very appreciative but also stated that she is not happy with this plan and has spoke to her advisor, Karen, about how she feels about the plan. I apologized and told her to call us whenever she needs anything. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-24 14:18:57', '2022-08-24 14:18:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101349034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005980641', 'Matthew Freeman', NULL, '8.24.22 - Matthew called in for help with opening a Medical Need with Zion. I explained the process and explained what type of documentation he will need to upload to Zion. Matthew was very happy with the assistance and will call back with any questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-24 14:14:54', '2022-08-24 14:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101392018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091034', 'Darryl Hadfield', NULL, '8-24-2022:  Darryl is needing a refill on his RX, but hasn''t seen a doc in several yrs.  Orig we discussed starting a relationship w/an in ntwk doc, but this prescription has to be prescribed by a gastro specialist.  So, he''s going to present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a disc, for an appt w/his curr spec: Dr Joseph Seibert on 9/12/2022 to get his prescription renewed.  I sugg qty 90-ds w/refills for the year.  Then call us & we''ll find lowest price.  It''s sulfasalazine for his ulcerative colitis (? per GoodRX).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-24 13:17:12', '2022-08-24 13:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101392013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951263', 'Christina LeBoeuf', NULL, '8-24-2022:  Christina called because she couldn''t remember how to get into CirrusMD.  She hadn''t downloaded the app, so we got her in online.  I sugg when she''s done, the app is super important in case of emergencies.  She was clicking "connect" when we got off the phone.     -CA

She called back & we walked thru a ton...  
     - She''s very overwhelmed with this healthcare & frustrated that her derm items are not part of the ''prev'' items.  Disc & went to the ACA MEC Healthcare.gov site together so she has access to what the gvmt has decided they include in the MEC.  Went over a ton on Planstin = ''Prev'' and how it works, including going to the PHCS search site together.
         We discussed finding a gynecologist in her area.  Even through we were on together, the searches were bringing up extra docs on my end, so I e-mailed her that list.
     - She DOES NOT understand IUAs!  We went over in depth, multiple times, and at the end she still wanted to submit her derm expenses towards her IUA ("you know, my deductible"). 
 Disc issue specific, 3/membership/yr, how 4th & beyond are hdld.  How to present at a hosp/ER in case that happens, etc.  This is a struggle because I was super clear on all things IUA.  Hopefully, she''ll grasp this moving fwd.
     - Christina is super nice, yet struggling to grasp how her healthcare works.  I encouraged her to always start (unless it''s an emergency, then just take care of yourself) by calling this line & we can help her understand how each situation/issue is handled.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-24 13:13:14', '2022-08-24 17:18:52'),
