  ('zcrm_1579374000101341045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529830', 'Joseph Lopez', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know why we were charging him extra for the past couple of months.  I let him know that was because he had turned 60.  He expressed that he could probably get a better deal on the ACA.  I told him to get in touch with Jane and she would have some options for him.   I ended up having a nice conversation with him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-24 10:57:59', '2022-08-24 10:57:59'),
