  ('zcrm_1579374000101349029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082411001', 'Clement Wong', NULL, '8.24.22 - Clement called in wanting to use CirrusMD for his maintenance med refills. I explained to Clement that he can get refills through CirrusMD but they will eventually ask that he goes to a physician for follow up testing for his pre-ex conditions. Clement had an issue with every invitation I sent him being expired so I reached out to CirrusMD support for assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-24 09:59:56', '2022-08-24 09:59:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101349024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '8.24.22 - Brandee called in because she took her husband to Urgent Care and required her husband to be transported to the hospital via ambulance due to extremely high blood sugar levels. Brandee wanted to make sure that she is presenting correctly as self-pay and she is very informed on what she needs to do. I advised Brandee that if the hospital staff gives her a difficult time as a self-pay patient to have them call the MPB.Health concierge line and we will explain their plan to the hospital staff. Brandee will be calling once her husband is stabilized and we can discuss how to open a Medical Need with Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-24 09:43:19', '2022-08-24 09:43:19'),
