  ('zcrm_1579374000101349016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, '8.24.22 - Steven called because he is having a procedure done for calcium buildup in his arteries. He received the cash price and was wondering what his next steps should be. I advised Steven that we need to get  Medical Need open with Zion Health ASAP and explained what detailed billing statements and receipts he will need to upload to Zion''s site once he opens his Medical Need. I sent him the email with instructions on how to open a Medical Need with Zion. Steven had an understanding of what he needs to do but will call us with any other questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-24 09:10:42', '2022-08-24 09:11:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101349011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '8.24.22 - Jeni called in because she is not feeling well and wanted to use her CirrusMD services. She admitted that she is struggling with this plan because there are just "way too many components and it is too hard to use". We got her started with her CirrusMD services and she was grateful to have an actual human on the other end of the phone. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-24 08:54:24', '2022-08-24 08:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101341009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032313', 'Colette Krasnow', NULL, 'I spoke to this member and she wants to look into adding Preventative to her membership I told her that she would need to speak to Zac about this.  Later Zac was in contact with me and told me that she had spoke to Zion directly and was quoted a price of $260 for their "Direct " plan w/Mini MEC add on.  He asked about the Mini MEC.  John will be digging into the differences between the 2 options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-24 08:01:31', '2022-08-24 08:01:31'),
