  ('zcrm_1579374000101281124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Jani called.  She rec''d Wendy''s e-mail but can''t ''Create an Acct'' on WHLC.  Let her know we are working to fix it.  Created a tckt to notify John.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-23 18:18:17', '2022-08-23 18:18:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Wendy called &amp; says there is a better way to hndl blood tests on the ACA MEC plan.  I will bring this to Joan &amp; Jennifer''s attention because when I''ve worked w/Planstin I have never heard any wiggle room.  Sending chat to Joan &amp; Jennifer so we don''t forget to discuss.  Would be super cool if there is a way to code other items and have them pd for.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-23 18:12:10', '2022-08-23 18:16:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Jennifer called looking for an allergist.  We walked thru finding HCBB in her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail.  There were a lot docs listed, but only high priced &amp; no care ratings.  She seemed like she was looking for "go to Dr. _____________" like her BCBS used to do.  Talked about heathgrades.com, &amp; other sources for getting input on which doc to see.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-23 17:43:46', '2022-08-23 17:43:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093328002', 'Craig Anderson', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Craig called asking about dentists in his area.  We walked thru how to get in &amp; use HCBB.  At first he was hesitant, but when he saw the tool he was glad I''d shown it to him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-23 17:08:56', '2022-08-23 17:08:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165396', 'Fabio (Gus) Pernetz', NULL, '8-23-22 Gus and girlfriend bought some land in Baja Peninsula, Mexico and will get super cheap insurance there and pay cash for services. So, he doesn''t need this. He will cancel for Sept or Oct. They aren''t moving until October.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-23 16:40:17', '2022-08-23 16:40:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714162', 'Christine Lair', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Glen called.  They want to look at a diff plan that includes prev care.  I sent him Patti''s Plan Chg temp and let him know we''d prob be looking at an Oct 1 effective date.  He''s also going to add his e-mail address to the chg form.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-23 16:39:33', '2022-08-23 16:39:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082060001', 'Shannon Cleary', NULL, '8-23-22 Shannon just got a new job with health ins which started on Aug. 1st already. She has an open Need and I instructed her to do her best to close that out before she cancels. She will call the Needs Request people. I showed her how to cancel online and she will do that once she learns more about her open Need. Told her to choose Sept. 1st cancellation date assuming all is in order with her Need. She was super nice and will do that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-23 16:39:03', '2022-08-23 16:39:03'),
