  ('zcrm_1579374000101281075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095065002', 'Patti Chambers', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Patti called.  7/8/22 got a navel hernia.  She needed to find out how to sub a ''medical need''.  I sent her the temp for sub a ''need'' w/Zion & walker her thru everything!  They are thinking this hernia is linked to potentially colon or digestive issues, etc.  She knows it is std procedure for them to initially put a delay on a ''medical need'' while they look into pre-x.  We also went over what happens if something is pre-x & what the pre-x guidelines are.
     - Went over IUAs & how they work.
