  ('zcrm_1579374000101281052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Isabel called.  In July 2021 she had an obgyn appt to get her bcs.  She''s calling now because it''s gone to collections and PHCS has not pd.  She says per MD off, they billed PHCS in Aug 2021 & never rec''d any form of acknowledgement.  We checked & she thinks the doc she saw was:  Sandsmark, Emilee K, M.D., Obstetrics and Gynecology, 1900 Boise Ave, Ste 300, Loveland, CO 80538 who is at least curr showing as in the PHCS ntwk.  Explained Planstin will need to look at this w/her.  Made sure she has their ph # & got her over to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-23 13:24:29', '2022-08-23 16:40:31'),
