  ('zcrm_1579374000101281039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066173', 'Sherry Gaskins', NULL, '8-23-22 This works better 970-948-5505 Cell when not at home.  She has given up on trying to get any reimbursement for her GI need from E-coli. She did everything Zion asked and they still rejected her Need!  She''s still dealing with issues 1 year later. The traditional doctors want her to have surgery which she''s not willing to do. She''s using Functional Medicine doctors which have been far more helpful to her. But, she''s done with trying to get approval or any of that. However, she was interested to learn that the MPB.Health/CirrusMD app will give her access to a DO, per request. She will not use an app on her phone but she will be glad to access it on her computer when at home and possibly elevate to a phone call. I will send her Concierge # to get that set up on her computer. She was happy to have that help. She''s also managing her husband who''s practically disabled now from an accident in early March. She can barely handle him, no less herself. He''s going in for a neck surgery at the end of August which will hopefully tremendously improve their quality of life.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-23 12:48:35', '2022-08-23 13:03:55'),
