  ('zcrm_1579374000101281026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415044', 'Tina Williams', NULL, '8-23-2022:  Tina called - had no idea what this charge on her business cc was for.  Sent her a ''Welcome Call'' temp &amp; went over basics.  It sounds like she''s going to sched her call right away &amp; she knows to use the ph # she wants the team to call (it will not be on Teams even though it will tell her it is).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-23 12:18:24', '2022-08-23 12:18:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066173', 'Sherry Gaskins', NULL, '8-23-22 "Hi Wendy,

The situation was very disheartening.  I picked up food poisoning e coli in July 2021.  I went to a medical doctor, had stool, urinalysis and blood work.  Also had xrays and an ultrasound.  I saw both regular MD''s and naturopathic practitioners.

When I submitted all original, well documented invoices and receipts,  I was told they had to come from the providers directly.  I contacted all providers and gave them the case # and fax number to send to.  I followed up and they all received fax confirmation.

MPower insisted none of them were received.  I called all over again.  The next correspondence was a denial to share because the non-MD''s were not pre-authorized.

I''m still working with both my MD and OD to resolve the damage to my GI system.  Paying out of pocket as I go.

In March of 2022 my husband was injured and flown to Denver for emergency surgery.  I have been a 24 hour nurse for several months.  His next, and hopefully last surgery is September 28.  We''re hopeful he will be mobile again by the end of October.

I''m exhausted and don''t have the energy to battle insurance.

I currently have an ultrasound showing polyps that may or may not be cancer.  I''m passing on the surgery for biopsy because it''s not worth the brain damage of hassling with MPower again.

I appreciate your concern, and thank you for reaching out.

Kind regards,
Sherry Gaskins"

I''m going to try to reach her over the phone but emailing her now. I just get a high pitched buzz when I call her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-23 12:13:12', '2022-08-23 12:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000101281016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '8-23-22 Melinda called bc she''s struggling with Planstin to get her wellness blood work covered by Planstin. She also wanted her skin check with derm covered and I let her know that''s not included in the ACA covered preventative. She will just pay that. She had called Plantsin at 888-920-7526 and reached Hominy and no ability to speak to a human. I tried the # and it was Planstin with about 6 options, not Hominy with only 2. I emailed her to try to call again. Perhaps she dialed the wrong #. She''s also frustrated bc her husband has some weird things happening with his health that were showing up as neurological issues due to memory loss. They were then going to check his heart to check off the boxes, but then he did have a heart issue in the middle of all of this that manifested with chest pains and sent to the ER. They believe it''s all related but Zion is calling it 2 needs. She got a Dr. note stating it''s related which she will send to me. She''s frustrated that they are separating it all out. 
I also mentioned the billing problem that Patti brought to my attention this morning from the Great Western getting bought out by First Bank and the routing # changed. I let her know they are a few months behind in payment due to this and she said she''s call Patti right away to resolve it. 
Also back to the wellness lab work. She specifically went to Quest to get the best price. It was repriced from $591 to $136 but Planstin is telling her that will count towards her $6K deductible which isn''t right. She believe it was billed as wellness by her doctor, not diagnostic. But, since she couldn''t reach Planstin, she was frustrated. She loves MPB due to our awesome Customer Service. She also appreciates that I answer the phone as well. She''s wiling to do the work but not when she can''t reach a human with Planstin.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-23 12:10:48', '2022-08-23 12:10:48'),
