  ('zcrm_1579374000101022003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052755096', 'Kathryn Sparacino', NULL, '8-19-2022:  Kathryn called, she''s working to get her ''need'' started w/Sedera for her diagnostic mammogram &amp; biopsy.  We disc making her 1k IUA pymt so she can upload the pymt receipt today as well.  She wasn''t sure how pymt works, so we disc.  Made sure she knows if late fees involved, those are not shared.  She did get the bill cut in ~half w/cash pay discount.  Hopefully, she''ll have time to get this done as it''s getting time sensitive due to delays in getting the needed started.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-19 11:20:34', '2022-08-19 11:20:34'),
