  ('zcrm_1579374000100938018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056599004', 'Adam Davis', NULL, '8-19-22 Adam''s income has dropped recently and he needs a lower cost per month. I told him the prices for $2500 IUA or dropping the MEC. He chose to drop the MEC and new price will be $234 a month at the $1000 IUA. He wisely realized the $1000 IUA is much better. He''s 45. He completed the Member Change Form and requested the removal of the MEC for Sept. 1st.  He was thankful. He knows he will have to pay wellness visit on his own and he doesn''t currently fund an HSA. He hasn''t had any medical issues since inception.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-19 09:26:30', '2022-08-19 09:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100905013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088875001', 'Samantha Raskow', NULL, '8.19.22 - Richard called about his HMA card, I explained that he would have to speak with his advisor, Kenneth Garret about this and transferred him to Kenneth. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-19 09:24:34', '2022-08-19 09:24:34'),
