  ('zcrm_1579374000100905003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079841002', 'Cynthia Ramain', NULL, '8.19.22 - Cynthia called to cancel due to financial difficulties. I direct transferred her to Zac Masters to get this process started.  I advised Cynthia that if she does not speak or hear from Zac by this afternoon to call me back because we need to get her cancelled by the end of today so that she isn''t charged for next month (billing is tomorrow). ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-19 08:32:32', '2022-08-19 08:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100876013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update her address.  I will notify Planstin.  I let Wendy know that this may be a problem due to the problems that we have w/PHCS network in HI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-19 08:19:08', '2022-08-19 08:19:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100876008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042343089', 'Carrie Stephens', NULL, 'Member left me a VM after hours after being directed to me by RCI.  She explained to me that she had a Mammogram and submitted it to Sedera for reimbursment.  They in turn directed her to RCI in error.   They told her that they did not have her as a member and that she should be in contact with me.  She has the SD membership that does not include Preventative.  I contacted Sally to reach out to her to explain this.  She will do so.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-19 07:59:56', '2022-08-19 07:59:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100883003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088963002', 'Noreen Knight', NULL, 'I sent out a reminder email to schedule welcome call. Member sent me email back saying (I''ve already done all this.)  I don''t see any record of that. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-19 07:51:46', '2022-08-19 07:53:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100882003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101067002', 'Juan Garcia', NULL, 'Juan called in to the hotline. He is comparing Zion with our plan. He is looking for a September 1st start date. I did inform him of the deadline and he will be making decision by tomorrow.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-08-19 07:50:56', '2022-08-19 07:50:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100876003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098866002', 'Althea Griffith', NULL, 'Wendy let me know that this member would be cancelling her single membership and would be enrolling as a member of a family under Erin Dreistadt.  I will notify Planstin that her start date would have to be retained at 8/1/22.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-19 07:27:27', '2022-08-19 07:27:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100857045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098493010', 'Ann Tucker', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Ann &amp; I are wking on the RXs.  She doesn''t need them for ~ 1mo.  She''s headed out of town, we will talk next week.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 20:23:29', '2022-08-18 20:23:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100857040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Danielle called.  Not in a pleasant place.  She wants to know what''s been billed to us, etc.  She says she''s self-pd ~ 10k in the last yr & wants to know how to get reimb on her annual visits & immunizations.  They have Care+ U& their membership is just recently eff: 6/1/22, so I explained Corey picked a plan w/no prev care.  Those items are not covered.
     - It sounds like she''s mad at Corey for having this "ins" & does not see the point of it.  When I asked if she was on the ''Welcome Call'' she says she doesn''t see the point of that call because she doesn''t understand what this is.  I explained that is what the call does, it goes over what the plan includes and helps people understand better.
     - I tried to discuss how this is not "ins", but MCS & this plan helps protect against larger med exp.  She said something about "ins" & I replied this is a way to have prot against large items, yet far more affordable than "ins" with such high rates these days.  She mumbled something about I have "ins" & hung up.  They have "ins"?  I''m really confused but did not call her back because she''s very upset w/Corey right now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 18:46:44', '2022-08-18 18:46:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100857035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Inga sent me an e-mail w/time sensitive e-mail req.  Sent her a coup for her refill:
     - NP Thyroid 60mg, #90 tabs = $26.57 @ Rite Aid = still cheapest thru RXGo.com     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 18:41:55', '2022-08-18 18:41:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100857027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, '8-18-2022:  City Market #34 Pharmacy, near Eagle, CO  (970) 328-1302 - tt Kay @ pharmacy, this is a super exp item: Nurtec Dose Packs 75mg, #8/dose pack x 2 dose packs [runs ~$800-$900+/pack!].  Let Melinda &amp; Kay @ Cty Mkt know I''m cking w/another source (worldwide shopper).  Told them I''d call again tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 18:38:01', '2022-08-18 18:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100857016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Julie called trying to register for WHLC.  However, the link to ''create acct'' is not working, it just give an error message.  I can sign in, but I already have an acct.  Fwd''d Wendy''s tckt to John Kach &amp; Patti Baron asking where I need to turn for help on this.  Told Julie I''d call when we get this corrected.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 17:15:32', '2022-08-18 17:15:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100859016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '8-18-22 Talked with John and he''ll send the new prices for her with the higher IUA in case she wants to switch to keep her monthly down. Patti says she''s paying low $200''s even though CRM shows $333. New price will be $344.65 at $500 IUA with DPC. Sedera isn''t providing discount for DPC now for some reason. John has not changed her price yet. So, she may get 1 more month at the lower rate.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-18 16:33:30', '2022-08-18 16:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100859011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, '8-18-22 John let me know Melany will be charged correctly this next billing Aug. 20th for Sept onward at $806.97. She got an extra month at the lower rate. She''ll be pleased.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-18 16:17:20', '2022-08-18 16:17:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100857008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Mat called - he rec''d a max notification on his PT & wondered if there anything that can be done. Let him know the 35 visits is listed in the Memb Guidelines, but suggested he create an appeal pckt w:  Treatment Plan & new RX for addition PT due to continued need.  List he is only at 3k (max is listed at $7500) because he negotiated the price down orig to save the community.  Include everything & req an appeal for pre-approved additional visits, or could it come from the special needs fund?  He''ll take care of this & submit asap so he can get an answer re: pre-approval.
     - He also asked about his referral fees for Christopher Cappuccitti, Jennifer Martin (turns out Chris & Jennifer are a couple on the same memb, but this one shows Darrell Porter as referring them & says fee waved) & Darrell Porter (shows Mat for the referral).  Orig it sounded like he thought he''d be receiving 3 referral fees.  I let him know his advisor Wendy Scipione would be the one who could address this with him & that the referral fees generally go out late in the month.   Sent Wendy a Teams chat re: the referral fees.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 15:47:05', '2022-08-18 18:38:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100859003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, '8-18-22 Erin is ready to enroll the entire family now. However, Althea was required to have a sickle cell anemia lab test to comply with new NCAA rules to play in sports in college. She did the test and submitted it to Planstin. It was $97, but then also received a bill for about $24. She''s not sure what to do with the additional bill. I told her to call the MPB Concierge Team for advice on that front. She will.  Per Patti''s instructions, we will enroll Erin and family with a new enrollment and cancel Althea''s enrollment and back date her to Aug. 1st. SECURE $1000/$915 and they own Aspen Moon Farms, so both self-employed. Erin wants to manage the account, so she will be the primary. They aren''t close to aging out. Erin is 48 and husband is 51.  Erin estimated their income at $80K for 2022 and curious what costs will look like for 2023 on C4. She may or may not call during open enrollment, depending on how busy they are. It''s probably not going to be better with the subsidies lowered in 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-18 15:26:15', '2022-08-18 16:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100857003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Stephanie called to get help setting up her CirrusMD.  She already has the app on her phone, so she''s already done this.  I helped her walk thru the steps to get into the app, but we are both receiving error codes.  It''s telling me it''s not finding matching info, so I sub a supp e-mail w/all her info to CirrusMD.  Stephanie knows it will prob be tomorrow & to watch her e-mail for an invitation.
     - Stephanie & I tried to get her into her Memb Portal, but the user name & PW in Admin123 are not wking.  Sent John Kach a req for help via Teams chat.
     - Walked Stephanie thru making a chg of address in the Memb Updates because she''s moved to Hawaii.  Orig she hit the wrong button, so she was going to resub the info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 15:10:36', '2022-08-18 18:21:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100798031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, '8.18.22 - A pharmacy called wanting to verify benefits and also wanted a billing address for a prescription. I explained what type of plan Melinda had and advised what the concierge process is for prescriptions. The pharmacist was going to let Melinda know and have her call us if she has any questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-18 14:15:49', '2022-08-18 14:15:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100809008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Angela sub an RX Quote req for her bcs.  She noted she prefers getting 90ds.  Since she''s on Planstin, her bcs can be free w/a 30-ds thru OptumRX in ntwk pharm, but it''s only $16.97 for a 90ds.  ILM letting her know we have diff options &amp; to please call us.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 13:46:34', '2022-08-18 13:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100798023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '8.18.22 - Michele called with a very snappy attitude asking for us to schedule her a mammogram and to find a referral that she received from the teledoc months ago. I advised Michele that we are unable to make appointments and see any referrals that were given to her by teledoc. Michele then asked "what exactly do you do for me?" and I stated to Michele what our purpose is and she was not happy with that answer but after further discussion about what MPB''s concierge teams responsibilities are, we finally got to what Michele needed. I sent Michele a list of PCP''s in her area in the PHCS network so that she can make a preventative care appointment to have another mammogram ordered. Since it was a year since the last order was requested, this may be the best process for Michele. She will call if she needs any further assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-18 13:31:37', '2022-08-18 13:34:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100798018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965002', 'Robert Houvener', NULL, '8.18.22 - A chiropractors office called to verify benefits for this member. I advised the office of what Robert has for a plan and also advised that before Robert would receive any paid benefits for chiropractic services he would have to get prior approval through Zion Health. The office staff was going to call Robert with Zion''s phone number so that he could request prior approval. I advised that Robert can always give us a call if he needs any assistance or has any questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-18 13:28:52', '2022-08-18 13:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100798013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', NULL, '8.18.22 - Cynthia called because she is having some knee issues and was wanting to know if she had to stay in the network. I advised Cynthia that she can go anywhere she likes, to present as a cash-pay patient, and to make sure to keep all of the receipts in case it goes above her IUA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-18 12:51:41', '2022-08-18 12:51:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100809003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '8-18-2022:  Lisa called.  She had a mammogram, but has rec''d a bill that shows less $ due.  When I asked if she made sure she stayed in the PHCS ntwk, she just replied "I gave them my card when I got there", so I don''t know if she stayed in ntwk.  We confirmed it was her Planstin card she presented.  Maybe they just applied the in ntwk discount?  I made sure she had Planstin''s ph # & trans her after explaining they are the ones who determine what is & is not pd for on her Prev Care benefits.  She will call if she has questions once she has tt them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-18 12:46:45', '2022-08-18 12:46:45'),
