Presentation completed....enrollment will be for 8/1/22 start date.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-18 08:34:37', '2022-08-18 08:34:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100773003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, 'Richard called in stating that his wife has had an ongoing issue with a constant UTI all the time, she has used CirrusMD, and they recommended going into a Gynecologist, etc. Which his wife has. He said that she is now going to a Urologist, and she has to get a bunch of tests and x-rays, etc. So, he know that this is going to go well over their $1000 IUA. I explained what they need to do with not paying anymore than that, and to contact Zion health to start the Need process now. Better to do so early than late. He was thrilled with the easy process, and I sent him over the email explaining how to submit bills to Zion with their phone number. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-18 08:20:55', '2022-08-18 08:20:55'),
