  ('zcrm_1579374000100655102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, '8/17/2022:  Price Increase:  Discussed w/Shari the coming increase to $915/mo contribution for age banded pricing starting with the 9/20/22 draw for the 10/2022 contribution.  It''s an increase of $230.
     -  Sent follow-up e-mail to both Aaron &amp; Shari to make sure he''s also aware.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 19:18:52', '2022-08-17 19:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, '8-17-2022:  Wendy sent joint chat to Jennifer &amp; I, req a card for the son.  Dana @ Redirect is e-mailing a copy to the e-mail we have on file (I assume it''s the father''s):   nastarhq@msn.com  so it can be fwd''d to the son &amp; he''ll have it asap.  I replied to Wendy &amp; let her know it''s been taken care of.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 18:40:38', '2022-08-17 18:40:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098610002', 'Kurt Wenrich', NULL, '8-17-2022:  Cheryl sub RX Quote for 2 items & listed HEB Pharmacy.  I found the 2 items $6.45 less at Kroger, but did not hear back from her, so in case she needs them immediately, I sent her the HEB coupons:
     - Estradiol Patches 0.1mg twice weekly, #24 = 3 cartons = $62.60 @ HEB on RXGo.com
     - Progesterone 200mg caps (she says tabs, but I don''t see tabs for this item), #90 = $47.43 at HEB also on RXGo.com
     Since there are only 2 RXs, I also planned to see if she''d want to get the Prog @ Krog for $26.38, the Estradiol at HEB for $62.60 = the cheapest way to purchase the combo @ $88.98 vs the $110.03 at HEB or $103.58 at Kroger, but I never heard back from her.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 18:14:39', '2022-08-17 18:19:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098493010', 'Ann Tucker', NULL, '8-17-2022:  Ann sub 2 RX Quote sheets = 4 items.  Costco seems to have good prices on all 4 items & it''s considerably cheaper than her curr Walmart (5 min away) source.  She''s ok w/driving to Costco (1/2 h away) but one item may be covered on her Planstin ''prev care'',  tt both Melissa & Anaka (sp?) at Planstin, their OptumRX system is down so they are getting back to me tomorrow hopefully.  Melissa said even if they were using a bc for hormone therapy, rather than bc, she thinks it''s fine & would be cov.  Ann would prefer the free 30-ds if nec since the RX in question is ~$60/90ds.  She''s not in a hurry on these as she still has ~ a 30-ds.  We may wait for me to send coupons until ~ 1wk before she needs them so the coupons are fresh & not expired.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 17:24:59', '2022-08-17 17:24:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100700074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '8-17-22 Bobbi needs to remove her daughter from their plan bc she has new employer coverage that just started. So, take her off for Sept. onward. I called and left vm and recommended they call C4 directly to have her removed bc software issues when we do it. Gave her the phone number to call and let her know it will go into effect Sept. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-17 17:20:52', '2022-08-17 17:24:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093328002', 'Craig Anderson', NULL, '- Lisa''s e-mail address:  lisajanderson7@gmail.com

8-17-2022:  Lisa called & has a lot of pain in her left ear.  PCP looked at it, but his suggestions are not working.  She wants to see an ENT for this.  We talked about possiblity it''s pre-x & how that would be handled, waiting period, then phase in & shareable amts at ea step.  Disc the $2500 IUA, nothing shareable until they''ve pd that for each issue up to 3/yr, & how 4th & beyond work >$500.
     - Went over ''Prev Care'' thru Planstin & how to find in ntwk docs (pediatrician, gyno, etc.).  Worked in PHCS Search together & HCBB for ratings, Healthgrades.com, etc.  Sent her the ''Prev Care'' temp & we went over all the links.  Let her know there are lots of details - she''ll call once they decide to utilize this component.  It was a lot of learning already today.
     - She thinks her husb has their Planstin card.
     - Disc her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail from Vanessa & how to utilize that resource.
     - We talked about the RX quote she sent w/out the med name.  She did not realize we would price refills for them too.  Now she knows for next time.
     - She had questions re: IUAs available.  It sounds like Louis sold her a companion ''Accident'' policy to help cover their IUA?  I let her know he''d have to go over that w/her because it is not a part of the MPB.Health healthcare.  We disc the 1k IUA, price diff, but again I''d have to defer to her advisor Louis Spatafore since I don''t know how he has them setup.  She was confused that it wasn''t all one product.  Maybe Craig was more involved in that decision & knows?  I let her know if they did want to look at the lower 1k IUA, it''s super time sensitive because she''d need to sub the change & wk w/our Ben Admin to have it chaged prior to the monthly contribution draw date of the 20th for it to be updated for the next month.
     - If Lisa would like to add her e-mail, I sent her Patti''s plan chg form temp & explained that''s how it gets updated on the various components.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 16:46:32', '2022-08-17 16:46:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100700064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, '8-17-22 William needs to show proof of ins to his college in CA. I''m requesting the digital card from Concierge team and will send summary of benefits next. They just want to see ded and mop. We''ll see if this document works on not since doesn''t show mop, but shows ACA compliance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-17 16:27:22', '2022-08-17 16:27:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100700056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, '8-17-22 William needs to show proof of ins to his college in CA. I''m requesting the digital card from Concierge team and will send summary of benefits next. I just realized William Madsen is on his father, also William Madsen''s membership. Adding notes to that account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-17 16:11:20', '2022-08-17 16:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, '8-17-2022:  Dhai called.  She wanted instructions on how to have her annual ''prev care'' appt.  Sent her the ''Prev Care Srvcs'' temp &amp; went over the links in there.  She''s going to look &amp; will call me for the Planstin ''Prev Care'' details (she believes she has a Planstin Card).  Once she''s narrowed down her search on docs, she may also call to see if they are rated in HCBB.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 15:16:01', '2022-08-17 15:16:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089441002', 'Jason Roberg', NULL, '8-17-2022:  tt Jason''s wife Cindy called, she needed help getting into their MPB.Health memb portal so she could change their pymt method.  I helped her get in &amp; showed her the form is also avail under memb updates.  She''s going to ck to see if they can chg to ACH (to save the 3% fee = &gt;$115/yr) &amp; was grateful we discussed the diff.
     - She is going to see if both her &amp; Jason can get on a ''Welcome Call'' - I sent her the temp to sched a call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 15:14:59', '2022-08-17 15:14:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100640028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '8.17.22 - Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-17 14:48:25', '2022-08-17 14:48:25'),
