  ('zcrm_1579374000100693003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006871131', 'Marie Schnabel', NULL, 'spoke to member due to her not being able to get through on the 800 line.
I verified that her number was in the system.  There is no record of her calling. 
I asked her how many times she called and she said twice on Aug 15.  No record of her calling.

Her main issue was that she went for her Well Woman visit and was shocked that she was billed for it.  She never had a Welcome call and she didn''t understand the difference between Care Plus and SECURE.

Diane Border will reach out to her to see if she wants to switch to SECURE.

She was pleasant and easy to deal with and grateful that someone reached out to her.  Gave her my direct line in the event the phone situation happens again.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-08-17 10:58:06', '2022-08-17 10:59:51'),
