  ('zcrm_1579374000100655043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089152002', 'Patrick McLaren', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-17 10:50:13', '2022-08-17 10:50:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100640018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095275002', 'Thomas Waldrop', NULL, '8.17.22 - Debra called with questions about being a cash-pay patient and I explained that to her. She seems very confused about what this plan consists of, so I tried to explain it more to her and advised her that if she needs anything to give the MPB.health concierge line a call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-17 10:42:56', '2022-08-17 10:42:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, '8-17-2022:  Shari called, totally frustrated.  We went over a lot!:
     - Cards:  MPB.Health & what the QR Code is.  She requested 2 new MPB.Health cards for their 2 adult children.  Kelly F is going to send those out per my Teams chat req.
         ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventive Care:  she did not know where their Planstin cards were so I e-mailed member@planstin.com & req''d pdf copies to both Aaron & Shari''s e-mail addresses (which I prov) & 4 hard copies so each adult in the family has one.
     - Shari feels like they are just paying for everything.  We checked & the pediatrician they use:  	
Hieber JP  in  Dallas is listed.  She''s going to go back to see if the back-to-school visits the kids had at the end of July can be billed to Planstin so the doc can reimb them (they''ve been using their HSA to pay for all these exp thinking none of it was covered).
         Shari''s doc, Culpepper is not showing, but she''s going to call to confirm this doc is not a participating PHCS ntwk doc as we see another Culpepper at the same clinic (?) in the ntwk.
         She was upset their PCP is not on the PHCS list.  When I asked the docs name, she said it doesn''t matter anymore as this doc retired.  Her phone was dying, so she will call me back and we can discuss this further.
     - Went over what the MEC Plan is & how it works.  Items cov, etc.  According to her the issue has been there are so few docs near them.  I let her know we are trying to find a way for people in this situation to have care, but it''s curr a challenge.  Again, we will work on this when her ph isn''t dying. 
     - I encouraged her to call the Concierge Line for help, then made sure she also has my # as her advisor.  It''s important to have help with the components to this healthcare.  She kept saying "ins" was easier.  So we disc the price diff, benefits, etc.  She seemed far better when we got off the phone, but time will tell.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-17 10:42:18', '2022-08-17 19:22:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089365002', 'Christine Knapp-Phillips', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-17 10:23:20', '2022-08-17 10:23:20'),
