  ('zcrm_1579374000100681003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082586009', 'Kelly Frederickson', NULL, 'Denali Dental plan effective as of 8/1/22, was just approved yesterday 8/16/22. Dental coverage with all information sent via email.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-17 09:58:39', '2022-08-17 09:58:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100640013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081677010', 'James Benjamin', NULL, '8.17.22 - Jim called back in response to his ticket this morning. He hadn''t realized that I had left him a vm and asked if I could schedule him an appointment. I advised Jim that the concierge team does not do any appointment scheduling and that he could start with CirrusMD. He is going to start with CirrusMD but I also explained the cash-pay process in case he goes to an Urgent Care or Walk-In clinic. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-17 09:35:55', '2022-08-17 09:35:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100655008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090048010', 'Phillip Kirby', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-17 09:34:24', '2022-08-17 09:34:24'),
