  ('zcrm_1579374000100648003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084186002', 'Kevin MacMaster', NULL, 'Member called in and left VM about the Cancellation Link.  He says he never received.  I resent Cancellation email and I will FU with him via phone.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-17 08:04:22', '2022-08-17 08:04:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100640008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '8.17.22 - Jocelyn called to find out if she is allowed to go to an urgent care for an injury since she cannot get into her PCP. I advised that she could, explained the cash pay process, and let her know to give us a call if she has to open a Medical Need with Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-17 07:42:43', '2022-08-17 07:42:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100640003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081677010', 'James Benjamin', NULL, '8.17.22 - Ticket:
He is looking to schedule an appointment to get a prescription. He would like to schedule in the next day or two as he is out of town on Friday. His DOB is 3/30/1965. He did not have his membership number with him.

Called and left a vm for James regarding what he should do for a refill on his prescription. I let him know that he can either us CirrusMD if it is a simple maintenance prescription or he can choose to go to an office and present himself as a cash-pay patient. I also advised that if he has any questions to give us a call and we would be happy to assist him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-17 07:27:37', '2022-08-17 07:27:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100600028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084186002', 'Kevin MacMaster', NULL, '8-16-2022:  Kevin called saying he never rec''d the link to CE (although it shows Patti''s e-mail was delivered).  I trans him to Patti''s line, but she''s gone for the day so he will LM for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-16 17:56:51', '2022-08-16 17:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100600023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '8-16-2022:  April & Andrew called.  Even w/all Jennifer has done the last week, they still seem extremly confused by their healthcare.  They''ve been members since 1/1/2020 & never had a ''Welcome Call''.  I sugg they sched one & sent the temp.  I told them it might help them have a firmer foundation to build off of since they are still struggling.  They chose a time they could both attend w/Jennifer & since this is an old plan, I warned her about the coming call.
     - I sent them PHCS searches w/gastroenterology & gastroenterologists in their area, which were 77 & 99 options = plenty to choose from!  She was saying she couldn''t find anyone who uses an in ntwk facility.  Hopefully, this will help.
     - I''m sure they will be calling again.  Our e-mails do not seem to resonate with their learning styles...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-16 16:52:10', '2022-08-16 16:52:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100600018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '8-16-2022:  Marta wants to get her shingles shot at a pharmacy.  I let her know it has to be thru an in ntwk PCP.  We went over the options &amp; I sent her a list of the docs near her.  She kept asking about going to a pharmacy &amp; I let her know for it to be pd for on her Planstin ''prev care'', it cannot go thru the pharmacy, but must be done by an in ntwk doc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-16 16:46:28', '2022-08-16 16:46:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100577058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100614035', 'Judy Doherty', NULL, '8-16-22 C4 Account 6708300010.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-16 16:43:50', '2022-08-16 16:43:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100577053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100614035', 'Judy Doherty', NULL, '8-16-22 Judy is 60 and just moved here from CA.  Moved to Wesminster and lives in Adams County, 80031. She''s self-employed. Sounds like she''s a photographer bc spoke of doing a shoot the rest of the week. Income is about $60K. Super healthy, no meds, no tobacco and currently no insurance.  She came to me via Kim Gangwish. She was eager to have Cigna bc she looked at reviews on Reddit. She chose the Cigna Connect Flex Gold 2250
Gold/EPO for $771.22 and her APTC is $265.36, so her cost is $505.86. I helped her enroll now and gave her a list of items to discuss when she calls C4. She will have them change her billing address to her current new Westminster address, not Louisville, remove the duplicate plan in her account due to technical issue, request Sept 1st start date and contact Cigna directly to make her payment and set up ongoing payments. Told her to wait 72 hours before she calls them. She agreed to do it and and wrote it down. I explained SECURE to her as well and she''s not comfortable bc it sounds fishy. She doesn''t want to go in as a self-pay patient. But, she will read about it and perhaps if she learns more over time she will be interested at a later date. She''s happier to pay $505 now for something she knows and trusts.  She''s all set. I also showed her how to upload proof of her move from CA to CO with lease or home purchase doc. She moved July 25th or 26th, I believe.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-16 16:42:33', '2022-08-16 16:44:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100600013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084170014', 'Michael Misko', NULL, '8-16-2022:  Michael called &amp; needed help getting into his MPB.Health memb portal.  We got him in &amp; he''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-16 16:41:18', '2022-08-16 16:41:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100613011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '08.16.22:  Have not heard back from Jim re: his Rx info.  Texted him to remind him to send it to me as well as the enrollment date coming up quickly. Asked to let me know how he wants to move forward.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-08-16 15:36:20', '2022-08-16 15:36:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100613003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '08.12.22:  Spoke w/Jim. He has Crohn''s Disease which he as battled for years.  He doesn''t have symptoms currently but his doctor suggested as a preventative Tx a very expensive new Rx drug ($20,000 for 3 mo. supply) as a maintenance medication.  He got an insurance quote for $1200/mo. with a $3000 deductible = $14,400/yr. which will allow for this Rx (find out price?).  His wife is healthy and likes his current MPB plan.  Her name is Laurie, D.O.B is 2/23/64 and she needs a 9/1/22 start date. He didn''t have the name or dosage of the Rx when I spoke w/him but said he would get it for me.  I told him I would ask about an Rx insurance plan for him. Emailed him the link to open a Need.  I also reminded him to send me his Rx info. so we could research pricing for him.  Also reminded him of the deadline date to enroll or make changes for a Sept. 1 start date.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-08-16 14:53:40', '2022-08-16 15:34:32'),
