  ('zcrm_1579374000100577048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918128', 'Kimber Eastman', NULL, '8.16.22 - Kimber called with questions regarding reimbursement for her husband''s bills they received for his visit for his shoulder. I went over how and IUA works and Kimber doesn''t believe that her husband will need surgery, so she decided not to open a Medical Need with Zion for the $400.00 in bills they have received. I reminded her that if he does need surgery in the future, no bills that are over 6 months old from the appointment that determines he needs surgery will be accepted towards their IUA. She understood. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-16 14:31:51', '2022-08-16 14:31:51'),
