  ('zcrm_1579374000100600003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282132', 'Amanda Hoskins', NULL, '8-16-2022:  Felicia from a GA infertility clinic called to confirm Amanda''s "ins" coverage.  I explained Amanda has MCS &amp; what that is, plus I ck''d Sedera''s curr &amp; 10/1/22 Memb Guidelines which both show NO cov for infertility.   I let her know once Amanda''s pregnant, that is a shareable expense, but not the infertility treatments.  Then, I gave Felicia Sedera''s ph # &amp; trans her directly there just so she can be sure since Sedera is the expert.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-16 11:26:39', '2022-08-16 11:26:39'),
