  ('zcrm_1579374000100413078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '8-15-2022:  Got a funny e-mail today from Don &amp; Shirley.  When I told them to wait until the second week of Aug to sched their ''Welcome Call'' they assumed it was because the ''Welcome Call'' person was on vacation until then.  I replied &amp; explained I just wanted all of their components to be active and let them know it''s safe to sched the call now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-15 17:29:07', '2022-08-15 18:10:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912010', 'Fred Fong', NULL, '8-15-2022:  Fred called very confused by the e-mail''s Jennifer sent last Friday and how to get his shingles shot, so I tried to walk him thru the ''Prev '' care/Planstin e-mails so he knows how to use the resources she sent.  Then I sent him 2 lists: Fam Prac & Int Med docs near him and how to conf when you make your appt, arrive, etc.  Went over healthcare.gov link/site.  Make sure all entities (labs, etc) in ntwk, etc.  
     - Called & tt Carmen at Planstin to see if he has to get his immun thru a PCP.  Since we do not utilize OptumRX, she says that''s the best way for our memb to get their shots.  
     - It sounds like he''s understanding better, but he''s quite overwhelmed by all of this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-15 17:09:41', '2022-08-15 17:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063248011', 'Amanda Salzman', NULL, '8-15-2022:  Wendy cc''d me on an e-mail from Amanda letting her know she''s pregnant.  I replied all to the e-mail & let Amanda know Zion requests a ''maternity need'' be started as soon as you realize you are pregnant.  Amanda let me know she''s going to the doc''s on 9/3/2022 & that will be her first appt & confirmation that her home test is accurate & she is in fact pregnant.  I replied to Amanda to keep track of any expenses for that appt, & to connect w/the Concierge Line after that appt so we can help her get her ''Maternity Need'' started.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-15 16:59:04', '2022-08-15 16:59:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100510043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092077036', 'Daniel Sosalla', NULL, '8-15-22 Dan called bc his Dr. says they aren''t in network and that''s why he chose Friday Health. Dr. is still showing up in the C4 search feature as in network but Dr. won''t accept the plan. He''s bummed but he will choose a new PCP for now. He understands we will need to start looking at new options Nov. 1-Dec. 1st for 2023. He was still nice in the face of this issue.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-15 16:20:48', '2022-08-15 16:20:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153215', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, '8-15-2022:  Luis called to get help w/back-to-school physicals.  We ck''d & their pediatrician: 	Kelly, Leslee F, M.D.  Pediatrics  7720 N 16th St, Ste 110,  Phoenix, AZ 85020  is currently listed in the PHCS Network Search.  He will however confirm when he makes the appt, arrives, & w/any other entites providing ''prev care''.  Their last appts were in 9/2020?, but > a year ago, so they sb fine.
     - He doesn''t know where his RCI card is, so I called Reg Care & tt Gina.  She sent his pdf copy while we were on the ph to the e-mail I conf w/both Luis & Gina, & will send hard copies as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-15 16:06:23', '2022-08-15 16:06:23'),
