  ('zcrm_1579374000100492079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, '8-15-22 Melany had recent dental work and her husband has work getting done tomorrow. They''re trying to decide if the y want dental insurance. I explained ins. vs HMA and she''s very interested in the HMA for their dental cleanings, future dental work, chiro care and possibly the IUA, etc. I sent her the HMA info and described $40 and $140 levels. I think she really like the $140 level for all of their out of pocket items. She super interested in the alternative care aspect if/when they include that as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-15 13:51:02', '2022-08-15 13:51:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '8-15-2022:  Brian e-mailed asking about a ''Well Woman'' visit for Pamela.  She had her annual appt &amp; wanted to know how it works.  Similar to her annual.  Responded and let them know to please call us so we can go over the details.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-15 12:54:28', '2022-08-15 12:54:28'),
