  ('zcrm_1579374000100439013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100134002', 'Billy Alexander', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2135 Question : I have not received the invitation for CirrusMD and am having trouble signing up for this', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-08-13 19:27:24', '2022-08-13 19:27:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100492038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098386002', 'Maria Merrifield', NULL, '8-12-2022:  Maria is a Spanish speaking member.  Her husb called to sched her ''Welcome Call'', so I resent the temp and he was on looking for a good time while we were on the phone.  He asked if we had a Spanish speaking concierge & I mentioned having his ''Welcome Call'' w/Jennifer because she is currently training a Spanish speaker who might be listening to learn while they are on the call together anyway.  He will attend the call w/her so they both hear it, but he''s asking for future reference.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-12 17:09:15', '2022-08-12 17:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100492033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '8-12-2022:  Jody e-mailed asking if the tetanus shot Daniel just got was covered somehow.  I let her know the ''Direct'' option is designed to work w/your DPC & does not include adult immunizations via the healthshare (confirmed no adult imm w/Eric Belair @ Planstin/Zion first).
     Let her know a diff plan (that does not coordinate w/her DPC) would include adult immun, but she''d want to tt her advisor Louis Spatafore for details.  Also mentioned this other plan req self-emp (she''s a writer, so might qual), is more exp because it includes more ''prev care'', and is not set up to wk w/a DPC.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-12 17:07:43', '2022-08-12 17:07:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100492028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083676002', 'Shannon Carley', NULL, '8-12-2022:  Shannon called to find out if a psychiatrist could be covered for Michael.  He had an issue & I think the doctor told him he should talk w/a psychiatrist (?).  We walked thru the options we provide:
     - I sent an invitation for Michael to accept w/CirrusMD.  Let her know it''s best to call during normal business hours because they have 2 staff member docs that can help guide him with mental health guidance.  They won''t be able to treat him, but will be able to help him know what direction to go in.
     - Helped her get to MAP pg & she can see the assistance ph #.  We talked about what they offer re: counseling.  It may or may not fit their need, but it''s available and might dovetail into other treatment or be something for the future.  Talked about their ntwk & options to increase what''s available.
     - Read her ''mental health'' clauses in Zion''s curr Memb Guidelines as well.
     - Reminded her that if medications are prescribed, we can often help find the best prices near them.
     She seemed to appreciate having a starting point even though it may not be shareable.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-12 17:00:42', '2022-08-12 17:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100492023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002887157', 'Trevor Mickelson', NULL, '8-12-2022:  Trevor called looking for the same info Julia called for on 7/28/2022 (they hadn''t discussed it yet).
     - Let him know someone at CirrusMD may be able to guide him towards the proper care.  They won''t be able to do the care themselves, but will be of assistance in finding the right path.  He knows it''s best to call during their normal office hours so their mental health staff are in.
     - Tried sending an invite to him for CirrusMD & it says they do not have matching information.  Sent a supp ticket to CirrusMD once I could gather everything.  It''s late on Friday, but CirrusMD notified me they''d sent him an invite before I even had his info e-mail ready to go, so I let him know to look for the invite.
     - Sent him the MAP Prog info & Assistance Ph #.  Let him know this is counseling, so it may not suffice, but it is our other mental health option.  Told him to call the asst # and they can work together to see if it''s an option.  Full details are in the e-mail sent from the CRM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-12 16:05:01', '2022-08-12 18:41:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100415048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100495009', 'Jace Perry', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-12 14:42:37', '2022-08-12 14:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100492018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '8-12-2022:  Dave called & he lost the prev e-mail thru an issue w/his e-mail.  I resent the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion & reviewed all the steps/link, etc. of sub the ''medical need''.  It sounds like this issue has become more complex, but he says everything is interlinked.  Hope Zion looks at it that way so he only has one IUA, but he knows they will discuss that with him.  He will closely monitor his e-mail for their forms and during this process.  [Stroke in his eye, caused the heart issues, etc.]  If he needs further assistance he''ll give the Concierge Line a call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-12 14:37:27', '2022-08-12 14:37:27'),
