  ('zcrm_1579374000100413028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '8-12-22 Talked with Dave and he''s planning to submit a new Need. Cari spoke with him earlier and is helping him. He asked if his membership automatically renewed in Aug. and it did. I let him know he might possibly have  rate change in Oct. but I''m not certain if his membership will be included in that change or not. He''s fine with it and appreciative of the help. He''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-12 13:35:08', '2022-08-12 13:35:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280030', 'Andy Ackerman', NULL, '8-12-22 Andy Ackerman is 60 and his wife is 56. He''s employed now by a health company of some kind but looking to possibly get his life insurance license to do burial insurance. He needs a high base salary to take the leap. Kate Paulin''s husband offered him to work with him but the base salary isn''t enough to cover his current expenses. He has hypertension and takes blood pressure medication and can use generic of Olmesartan. Prices are all over the charts at $15-$500+ for 90 day supply of 40 mg.  He also takes sinofibrate but he''s not sure it''s helping and might stop. He''s currently only paying about $300 per month with his employer plan. He asked about dental but they don''t have any dental issues, they just do 2 cleanings per year. I explained the HMA and he''s interested in that but didn''t seem too eager unless he changes jobs and loses his dental insurance. He also is currently funding an HSA it sounds like. So, he understands how that works and likes it. He initially thought he wanted the $5000 IUA until I explained it better and then seemed to agree the lower IUA is better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-12 13:26:07', '2022-08-12 13:26:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912010', 'Fred Fong', NULL, '8.12.22 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-12 13:14:09', '2022-08-12 13:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098690002', 'Samantha Hernandez', NULL, '8.12.22 - Samantha called for reimbursement for her mental health services that she sought outside of the MAP program. I explained to Samantha that they do no reimburse for mental health services through Zion, and next time she should use her MAP program services. I explained how to open a medical need with Zion as well as the cash pay process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-12 12:42:06', '2022-08-12 12:42:06'),
