  ('zcrm_1579374000100418011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070912052', 'Anna Edwards', NULL, '8-12-2022:  Anna called for two items (the call kept going in & out, not sure which end was the issue, but I think she heard the instructions for both):
     - She wants to update her pymt method.  We disc using ACH would remove the 3% proc fee & she seemed to like that idea.  Mentioned making sure she lists the routing & full acct # w/prop # of zeros.
     - She needs to sched her ''Welcome Call'' for a Monday.  I sent her the link so she can go to the Mondays & sched for a good day. 
     She says she''s terrible with links.  If she has any issues, I told her to call us and we can walk through the forms/sched w/her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-12 11:24:47', '2022-08-12 11:24:47'),
