  ('zcrm_1579374000100418006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '8-12-2022:  Diana called, so some ins guy is contacting them regarding end-of-life benefits, etc.  They wanted to know if there is anything w/their curr plan thru MPB.  I sent them an e-mail w/an excerpt showing the End of Life Assistance from the curr Zion Member Guidelines.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-12 10:55:26', '2022-08-12 10:55:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100413008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, '8-12-22 Angela went in to have her IUD replaced around June 9th and as self-pay it cost over $1600 plus an ultrasound. She has CARE+, so no preventative included. I explained this to her and Don when they called just now. I don''t believe it will be shared since it''s for preventative. He first described it as a procedure and I asked if it could be considered pre-x, then they told me it was for an IUD. Therefore, likely no sharing is included. But, I recommended they call the MPB Concierge Team to get their assistance/advice first.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-12 10:25:59', '2022-08-12 10:25:59'),
