  ('zcrm_1579374000100413003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '8.12.22 - Lindsey called because she was supposed to receive a list of in-network providers from RCI and she never did. I sent her a list myself of in-network PHCS gastroenterologists. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-12 08:18:41', '2022-08-12 08:18:41'),
