  ('zcrm_1579374000100363018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002834005', 'Anthony Moreno', NULL, '8.11.22 - Anthony called because he tried to use his teledoc services and he was told that he was no longer a teledoc member. I advised Anthony that we now use CirrusMD, but it appears that they are having issues with their CirrusMD accounts. I sent CirrusMD an email regarding this issue and tagged the member and his wife in the email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-11 18:02:27', '2022-08-11 18:02:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100363013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, '8.11.22 - Michael''s wife, Patty, called in with questions regarding the bills she is receiving from Michael''s ER visit. I explained the process of opening a medical need with Zion and exactly what type of documentation she will need from the hospital. Patty is going in to the hospital tomorrow to pay a bill that she will receive 40% off of if she pays it in full tomorrow. I advised Patty to collect all of the receipts as well and if she needs any assistance to give us a call and we would be happy to help her with opening the medical need. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-11 17:45:16', '2022-08-11 17:45:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100330039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117525128', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '8-11-22 Account # 4008728483.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-11 16:16:55', '2022-08-11 16:16:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100330034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117525128', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '8-11-22 Brian is 34 and has Life Change Event due to change in job. Current ins will end 8-31-22 and new company will pay $250 towards HRA for new plan. We looked at Bright Health Bronze $0 ded plan since he has diabetes and needs insulin. His LANTUS SOLOSTAR U-100 INSULIN
SUBCUTANEOUS INSULIN PEN 100 is in Tier 3 and looking to be $200 per month. He will request generic from his dr. to get it at no cost with this plan. The Bright Health plan is $287.29 and he''s happy to pay the difference.  He will call me back when he''s reviewed it all further and I will help him enroll, select start date, submit proof of SEP and ensure proper payment on time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-11 16:15:35', '2022-08-11 16:15:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100363008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002076', 'Collin Brice', NULL, '8.11.22 - Collin called to cancel. I explained that Zac would have to start the cancellation process for him and I transferred him to Zac. I also advised Collin to give us a call tomorrow afternoon if he hasn''t heard from Zac yet and we will try to get in touch with him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-11 14:55:25', '2022-08-11 14:55:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100330029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '8-11-2022:  Matt called looking to make an annual appt and wanted to know how his RCI MEC plan worked.  He has his card and we walked thru in depth how to handle:  all entities must be within the PHCS ntwk, ''prev'' vs diagnosis or treatment, staying w/in ''prev'' on RCI, don''t use card for other non-prev items (''cash-pay'' is gen cheaper).  Sent him a list of Fam Prac near him (he''ll confirm at all turns, labs, etc, in ntwk).  Showed him how to get to healthcare.gov and see the guidelines of what''s cov.  Disc how colonoscopies work chg from ''prev'' to healthshare. He''ll call if he has other questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-11 14:28:21', '2022-08-11 14:28:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100330024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '8-11-2022:  Angela called - she''s having labs done at Quest.  They are telling her the ''cash-pay'' price for the non-lipid &amp; Vit D panels is $800, but they are covered and it will only be $200.  That makes me super nervous so she''s going to call Planstin to conf what is and is not going to be paid for and why are they telling her those items are covered.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-11 14:19:45', '2022-08-11 14:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100379008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100370002', 'John Hebert', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-11 13:09:11', '2022-08-11 13:09:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100379003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063312179', 'HONGMEI LI', NULL, 'I spoke to member''s husband and he told me that he has since married Hong Mei and she wants to change her name.  I advised that she would would have to submit the change form.  He advised that he has a smart phone and no computer.  I told him to call me back if he did not receive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-11 13:05:23', '2022-08-11 13:05:23'),
