  ('zcrm_1579374000100272043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, '8-10-2022:  Inga called & the hospital is struggling to give her ''cash-pay'' price (they had the gvmt financial aide office call her).  She''s trying to get their billing dept to give her a ''cash-pay'' price and she knows to go ahead and pay her $2500 IUA once she has that price.  Then she''ll call us so we can walk her thru how to start a ''medical need''.  
