  ('zcrm_1579374000100272016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '8-10-2022:  Brandi is looking for a dermatologist.  I helped her access HCBB, but it doesn''t seem to be working properly.  Finally got a list of dermatologists w/in 20-miles of her 80304 zip & e-mailed her.  I called to let her know I e-mailed the list.
