  ('zcrm_1579374000100194003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081352001', 'Eileen Tierney stone', NULL, 'Eileen called and had a CirrusMD chat, they think her son has something wrong with his lung and tissue. CirrusMD suggests an in person visit and to get a biopsy done. So, she was calling to see what the process would be as in where to go. If Urgent Care does that type of thing. We suggest she call the Urgent Care first and ask before going and spending money. We will research and send her places that do so. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-10 07:51:38', '2022-08-10 07:51:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100192003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088055002', 'Deborah Sonnentag', NULL, '8.10.22 - Debbie called because her son is very sick and they don''t know what to do. She has Direct, but does not have a DPC that she can use. I let Debbie know that at this point because it is not preventative care, she can take her son anywhere and present as self-pay. I explained the process and Debbie wanted to know if she would be reimbursed for this. I explained that if this goes above her responsibility of $1,000, then she would reach out to the MPB concierge team to assist her with opening a medical need with Zion. I sent Debbie a list of PCP''s in her area, unfortunately an OBGYN also popped up on the list. I also let Debbie know that I will have Leonardo reach out to her to assist her in finding a DPC. Hopefully all goes well for Debbie and her son. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-10 07:45:52', '2022-08-10 07:45:52'),
