  ('zcrm_1579374000100122033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509019', 'Sameera Reddy', NULL, '8-9-2022:  Sameera sent an RX Quote.  It came in late in the day, so I sent the 2 cheapest coupons because it is already 9:20pm in Boca.
