     - I didn''t want her waiting for us to talk in case she needs these immediately, so I sent her the following:
          - Guanfacine HCL 1mg tabs, #30 = $15.66 at Kroger from RXGo
          - Atomoxetine HCL 18mg caps, #30 = $22.56 at Kroger from RXGo
          - Guanfacine HCL ER 1mg tabs, #30 = $13.29 at Kroger from WellRX
* I think these are for ADHD, so did not sugg larger quantities.  When we talk, we can discuss 90-DS which could bring down the price.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-09 18:43:38', '2022-08-09 18:43:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100122023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090781017', 'Dawn Chiero', NULL, '8-9-2022:  Dawn called to make sure she''s setting up her ''prev care'' appt prop.  
