  ('zcrm_1579374000100122008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '8-9-2022:  Re:  Auvi-Q  BRAND  0.15mg x 2 auto-injectors [spec brand of Epi-Pen Jr, but it verbally gives instructions for the user, which since it''s her teenage son, she really likes].  ILM & sent her an e-mail w/this info.
     - Per Reid, this is a US Market ONLY product,   [Reid can source the Epi-Pen Jr at a great price, but it doesn''t have the talking instructions.  So Michelle decided that''s not the brand she wanted.]
     - Michelle said the Auvi-Q mfg is offering her a cash price of $150 = a great price.
     - RXGo curr has the best price & it is at her favorite KS pharmacy at $252,  I let her know what I found in case she cannot get the mfg price down the road.  These seem to run ~$600-ish even w/coupons, so this price seemed really good.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-09 13:48:22', '2022-08-09 13:48:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100105033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855001', 'Tim Whitney', NULL, 'Member requested IUA Change to $5000 I will notify Planstin &amp; update billing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-09 13:47:52', '2022-08-09 13:47:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100131008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817010', 'Erik Guevara', NULL, '8.9.22 - Welcome call complete! I will be requesting a new MPB membership card for Erik and emailing CirrusMD with some issues. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-09 13:45:43', '2022-08-09 13:45:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100133021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '08.04.22:  Recvd. a text from Jenni.  She wants to use her primary care doctor but they aren''t in the PCHS network w/Planstin. She asked if it''s possible to request they be added. I told her she can nominate her PCP for the PHCS network and sent her the link to that form.  I added we can have our Concierge assist her with a search on the Multiplan system if she likes and gave her the Concierge #.
Jenni responded thanking me.  She also said her daughter has had debilitating issues with her back and has tried chiropractors and physical therapists that didn''t help.  She now found a gym trainer that seems to be helping.  Jenni asked if that could be counted towards her IUA. I responded they would have to have a med. or health professional state license to qualify.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-08-09 13:25:38', '2022-08-09 13:25:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100105028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098493002', 'Jeffrey De graaff', NULL, 'Notified by Planstin that this member''s $1000 IUA enrollment has to be termed and one for $5000 sent over.  I will do that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-09 13:18:47', '2022-08-09 13:18:47'),
