  ('zcrm_1579374000100133003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '08.01.22:  Emailed Jim, notifying him his monthly share fee will be increasing as of October 1, 2022 to $325/mo. due to Zion''s age banding. Also, if his wife is added to his membership in September, his new membership fee will change and show the increase for September for them both.  I also asked if she has any pre-x conditions, which would follow the pre-x fee schedule as of her start date.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-08-09 13:11:23', '2022-08-09 13:11:23'),
