  ('zcrm_1579374000100068018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, 'Carol called in and needed a list of providers in her area for a General Practice. So, she can get some referrals for a Mammogram, Colonoscopy, and I explained to her that for the Dermatology appointment she needs, that would be out of pocket up to her $1000 IUA and thereafter submitted to Zion and start a Need. She was happy with how simple that was, and I sent her the corresponding emails. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-09 12:54:41', '2022-08-09 12:54:41'),
