  ('zcrm_1579374000100068008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855001', 'Tim Whitney', NULL, 'Tim called into the Sales line, asking if he would be able to, and what the price change would look like, if he were to change his IUA. I told him the price, and it would be more than what he is currently paying, even though he is wanting to make his IUA higher, so his monthly premium is lower. But the pricing he enrolled with was the pricing before the price change raising. So, it confused me for a second and I transferred Tim over to Patti Baron. Patti would be able to explain everything with changing IUA''s, to Tim better than I could, I did not want to give him a wrong answer. I emailed Tim the Member Change form for him to fill out for changing his IUA. He is all taken care of and happy with the answer. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-09 11:49:57', '2022-08-09 11:49:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100122003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055125026', 'Matthew Bennett', NULL, '8-9-2022:  Matthew called, he''s sched for a colonoscopy and wanted to find out how to handle it.  He didn''t know the name of the doctor, but we found a ton of doctor''s on the PHCS list at the address of the office he''s sched with (suite # & everything).  He''s going to call to conf all entities are w/in the ntwk and will call if he finds out they are not to get help selecting someone who is.  We also went over screening vs diag & what happens if they pull polyps during the procedure (1k IUA & call us so we can show you how to sub a ''med need'' to the healthshare comp).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-09 11:47:15', '2022-08-09 11:47:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100100008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098138009', 'Mary Messal', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-09 11:20:44', '2022-08-09 11:20:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100116003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '8-9-22 Melissa is enrolling in SECURE and saving over $100 per month plus her wellness visits should be easier with the card and in the PHCS network in Boulder County. No pre-x. Just waiting for her colonoscopy to be paid for by Redirect and Christian Vasquez is working on it.  Chose SECURE $325/$1000 down from $410/$1500 effective Sept. 1st 2022.  The 3rd employee, Amy, is still on the fence. So, I told Melissa to just show proof of employment with Dr. Terri Fox who is a member already. They just don''t have enough employees to create a group yet for List Bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-09 11:18:13', '2022-08-09 11:18:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100105008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522128', 'Keira Gannon', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-09 10:51:16', '2022-08-09 10:51:16'),
