  ('zcrm_1579374000100068003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099516002', 'Stephen Berigan', NULL, 'Stephen called in and asked for the number for the Telehealth. I pulled up his account here and let him know that his effective date to use the services are starting on 9/1/22. I could still send him the Registration email to go ahead and get all set up with CirrusMD, but he can''t use the services until 9/1. He seemed confused and said he was made aware and thought they were already into effect. I told him that as of 9/1 that is his Plan effective date. Send CirrusMD registration email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-09 09:20:38', '2022-08-09 09:20:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100021013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067616030', 'Robert Jason', NULL, '8.9.22 - Robert called to update his payment information. I sent him the payment update form via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-09 09:06:42', '2022-08-09 09:06:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000100021008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081352001', 'Eileen Tierney stone', NULL, '8.9.22 - Eileen called with many questions regarding her plan. We are getting her CirrusMD accounts looked at because they are unable to access them and would like to use this service today for her son. I sent a support ticket in with Eileen tagged on it. I also requested a new MPB membership card and sent her the portal log in information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-09 09:06:13', '2022-08-09 09:06:13'),
