  ('zcrm_1579374000100009003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084951011', 'Paul Notartomaso', NULL, '8.9.22 - Meg called because she is sick and needed to use her telehealth. We found that she did sign up for CirrusMD, we located her app on her phone and she is beginning a conversation with a doc now. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-09 07:36:41', '2022-08-09 07:36:41'),
