  ('zcrm_1579374000099972048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099565002', 'Dennis Flannigan', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Christine called to learn how to handle Dennis'' requests.  Went over a ton w/her:
     - Planstin cards, how they will look, who gets one, & when to expect seeing them since they are not eff until 9/1/2022.
     - Why the ''Welcome Call'' was postponed:  need their components to be active when the call is done so they can work together to setup things like CirrusMD.
     - Dennis wants prices for his RXs.  Encouraged her to make sure Dennis has enough of his meds to get him into Sept.  Showed Christine where the form is that Dennis will complete at the time his account is active.  Let her know we''ve been doing the pricing once their accts are active.
     - Noticed Dennis'' son isn''t listed as a dep here in the CRM.  Sent an FYI Teams chat to Patti in case it''s an oversight.  She prob has it on her todo list.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 18:02:08', '2022-08-08 18:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099972043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471317', 'John Kline', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Whitney called asking for directions on how to connect with CirrusMD.  The message upon trying to send her an invite was they did not have matching records.  Sent supp e-mail to CirrusMD with all of Whitney''s info so they can get her setup.  Whitney knows to watch her e-mail.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 17:55:13', '2022-08-08 17:55:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099972038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Angela called - she needs to go for her annual.  We went over a lot:
     - Verified the doc she made the appt w/is showing in the PHCS Ntwk:  Schroeder, Amy L, M.D.
Went over everything ''Planstin'' = keep all entities in ntwk, labs that are cov, how to handle bc refills, don''t have MD off keep card active so they don''t accid bill non-prev, etc.  She does have her card.
     - She will call for RX price comp to on her ''prev care'' for bcs.
     - She had quest on these labs that you purch to kits & sub.  Told her we''ve heard good things on JasonHealth.com & that''s what they do.  She''ll keep cov items in ntwk & look at ''cash-pay'' prices on everything else.
     - Derm appts:  went over how maint vs a health issue work & that she won''t have help on ''med need'' derm unless it''s > her 5k IUA.  Talked about how/when/deadlines, etc. of sub a ''med need'' to her healthshare here.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 17:54:05', '2022-08-08 17:54:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099972033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084946002', 'Tracie Reithmann', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Tracie had to go in for an emerg appendectomy.  Eric called to get help sub a ''med need''.  While they were doing a CAT Scan for the appendix surgery, they also saw a mass and now need to have that checked out.
     - Sent them the temp for sub a ''med need'' & walked them thru the process.
     - E-mailed a list of Urology offices near their zip from HCBB for having the mass ck''d out.  
     - Let Eric know, depending on what they find, it could be 2 issues & 2 IUAs, but once they get this going Zion and let them know specifics.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 17:14:26', '2022-08-08 17:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099972028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '8-8-2022:  I answered Brandee''s question both on SalesIQ and in an e-mail she sent.  Let her know vasectomies are considered sterilization and elective surgery.  Other forms of bc available on the ''prev care'' thru Planstin, but not this form.  Healthsharing does not share either.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 16:02:39', '2022-08-08 16:02:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099974007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 2113 Question : We are members of MPB Health and I am curious if my husband would be covered for a vasectomy.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-08-08 15:02:00', '2022-08-08 15:02:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099972023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963082', 'callie Salmon', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Callie called wondering if she could add dental to her plan.  Made sure she has her advisor''s office ph #, then trans her directly to Jane Kassel''s off #.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 14:49:18', '2022-08-08 14:49:18'),
