  ('zcrm_1579374000099972018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Michelle called for several items.  She was confused:
     - Her daughter is headed to Alaska & she wanted to conf how they handle say an ER visit.  Went over ''cash-pay'' to 2500 IUA, ask for disc, call us & we''ll help them learn how to sub a ''med need''.  Good to pay $2500 if they can & get billed for bal.  She had a good grasp on pymt receipts & det inv w/med coding.
     - Michelle thought she had 3 IUAs for life, & felt that was misrepressented.  I went over how IUAs work.
     - She wanted to know how she got OptumRX?  I told her that is not something coming from MPB.Health (she''s Care+, so we talked that maybe Zion sent it out as like a sales type thing, but it did not come from us).  It was difficult for her to understand we can help with pricing.  So, I''m running a quote for Epi-Pens she needs shortly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 12:48:47', '2022-08-08 12:48:47'),
