  ('zcrm_1579374000099972013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640027', 'Malinda Russo', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Malinda called.  She''s trying to contact CirrusMD, but the message she got when she registered is they''d get back w/in 24 h.  I''m not sure what she did (a support tckt online maybe?).  I was able to send her a CirrusMD invite &amp; walked her all the way to connecting.  If they doc prescribes something, she knows to contact us so we can make sure she gets the best price in her area.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 12:18:49', '2022-08-08 12:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099972008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079988002', 'Wayne Jatsek', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Melanie called a bit confused.  I told her exactly what Jennifer has in her notes (although I hadn''t read the notes at that time), but she just seems to need Jennifer to call her when she''s back in the office.  I sent Jennifer a Teams chat.  I think Melanie just needs us to hold her hand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 12:17:48', '2022-08-08 12:17:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099934018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099979012', 'Daniel Brewer', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-08 12:14:53', '2022-08-08 12:14:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099934013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322438', 'Surya Yalamanchili', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking first to Sedera.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-08 12:06:39', '2022-08-08 12:06:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099934008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099979012', 'Daniel Brewer', NULL, '8-8-22 Daniel works as partner with Ryan and Stephen Padwe. They chose to create a group now with 3 members. Their link is https://joinmympb.com/elitetrialconsultants/ and Daniel just enrolled in SECURE for Sept. 1st, 2022.  Daniel''s DOB is 11/19/83 and he''s healthy, no meds, no tobacco or smoking of any kind. He had ACL surgery in 2008 and nothing since. Only had one dr. visit for a stomach discomfort which he believes was due to some supplements he was taking and since stopped. No issues otherwise. I explained SECURE with ins component/card and network, plus HSA and he watched the video. I let him know he must do Welcome Call and he said OK. He doesn''t need to show proof of employment since part of the group already. Otherwise, he''s all set to go witH SECURE $300/$1000 for 9/1/22.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-08 11:58:25', '2022-08-08 11:58:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099971003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, 'Julie, Steven''s wife on the plan with him, called in and stated that a little while ago she called in and made sure that the provider and everyone that needed to be, was approved and in the PHCS Network for her Colonoscopy to be done. Planstin and us here, verified in the PHCS Network as well. So, Julie went and had everything done for her Colonoscopy, got the EOB from Planstin everything was taken care of and approved and paid for. But then she just got another EOB from Planstin, stating that the Anesthesiologist was not in the PHCS Network, and that Julia would be getting a bill for about $2100 for the Anesthesiologist. I explained to her that if that was approved for her prior, etc. As she stated, then it should be shared as well. I told Julia to contact Planstin directly, as they are the ones that handle the claims and payment between provider, etc. She thanked me and is going to call Planstin now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-08 11:32:26', '2022-08-08 11:32:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099914013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099051012', 'Angelica Valencia', NULL, 'Mailbox full. Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-08 11:11:11', '2022-08-08 11:11:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099934003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062250051', 'Cody Bennett', NULL, '8-8-22 Cody''s pmt to Cigna is late as of 8-6-22 per email notice from Cigna. I just left Cody a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-08 11:06:59', '2022-08-08 11:06:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099914008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912010', 'Fred Fong', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-08 11:06:14', '2022-08-08 11:06:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099902013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090048002', 'Lisa Chlysta', NULL, 'Karen let me know that this member wanted to push their start date to 3/1/23.  I spoke to John and he told em that information had not been sent to Zion as yet so this was ok.  I updated in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-08 10:38:14', '2022-08-08 10:38:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099915003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '8-8-2022:  Matt called.  They just found out they are pregnant (just 5 weeks) & he''s trying to interpret the Maternity Guidelines w/Sedera.  They no longer list home births, etc.  He wishes he had realized they were going to get pregnant sooner, they might have changed to Zion.  
     - I told him to get the maternity need sub.  They will assign him a ''Need Consultant'' and that person can answer all his questions.  He was thinking they had to pay their 5k IUA & he has to pay the 6-7k for their midwife, which was sounding like a lot.  He says the midwife is licesnsed, so he''s going to start the need & get his answers thru Sedera.
     - It looks like Sedera has updated Guidelines coming 10/1/2022, so I did warn him there''s an update coming.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-08 10:34:57', '2022-08-08 10:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099914003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098866002', 'Althea Griffith', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-08 10:29:13', '2022-08-08 10:29:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099902008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, 'I have not heard anything from this member about her refund and the verification of her address.  I just sent out a 2nd email requesting verification of her home address again.  Awaiting a response from her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-08 10:14:16', '2022-08-08 10:14:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099890013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, '8.8.22 - Leron called for a list of Gastroenterologists in his area. I sent him one via email and explained to him that he should verify that the provider is in network when he is calling to make an appointment for his preventative colonoscopy. He seemed very surprised that we do not make the appointments for him and that he had to call on his own. I reassured him that this is simple and to call the concierge any time he has a question. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-08 09:46:27', '2022-08-08 09:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099902003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423040', 'Jacob Mouchet', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to update address.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change in A123 &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-08 09:39:49', '2022-08-08 09:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099890008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086853002', 'Carol Ann Kowalski', NULL, '8.8.22 - Carol called because she wanted to get her daughter signed up for CirrusMD. I added her daughter, Michelle''s email address to Admin123 and sent Michelle an invitation. Carol also had questions about presenting as self-pay and I explained that process along with opening a medical need with Zion. Carol will be calling back with her husbands email address so that we can get a CirrusMD invite sent to him as well. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-08 09:38:04', '2022-08-08 09:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099900003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095275002', 'Thomas Waldrop', NULL, 'A specialist just called into the Sales line, I picked up, and they were looking for the mailing address to send claims to. I confirmed the patient was Debra Waldrop under Thomas here. I explained it would be Zion Health they need to contact, and that Debra should have shown their Zion card, which they did not, they gave the MPB.Health membership card, AND did not pay anything out of pocket yet, which should have been $2500 of their IUA, and THEN Zion comes into play. Debra seemed to not have done anything of this sort yet. Just handed her MPB.Health card and said WE here at MPB.Health handle everything after that. Definitely needs a Welcome Call refresher on how to handle appointments. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-08 09:27:07', '2022-08-08 09:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099890003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, '8.8.22 - Valerie called because she wanted to know why APEX didn''t cover her consultation for her preventative colonoscopy. I warm transferred her to APEX/RCI to discuss this with them. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-08 08:48:30', '2022-08-08 08:48:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077989104', 'Heather Strazinsky', NULL, '8.8.22 - See ticket: Heather needed information on a lab bill she received and why is was not paid by Planstin. She did not have many details so I was unable to assist her on my end, I ended up transferring her directly to Planstin. I am also going to send her MPB portal log-in information to her via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-08 07:39:25', '2022-08-08 07:39:25');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', NULL, '8.8.22 - Answered Lindsay''s questions regarding a preventative colonoscopy. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-08 07:32:40', '2022-08-08 07:32:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099781038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, 'Member tried re-enrolling from India however was denied access since out of country.  After speaking with John he said that we could re-enroll this member and then send him email  to sign. Previous membership 10/2/2021-7/1/2022', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-08 07:32:09', '2022-08-08 07:33:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '8.8.22 - Whitney emailed in requesting a Planstin card for her son who is going off to college. I sent a request to Planstin member services in an email as well as tagged Whitney in the email for her convenience. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-08 07:28:23', '2022-08-08 07:28:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079988002', 'Wayne Jatsek', NULL, '8.8.22 - Spoke with Melanie this morning regarding her message with the Betties. I will be sending her the fair price for a head/nasal CT scan in her area along with the one fair priced facility that is listed. I advised Melanie to be sure to collect all of her detailed receipts and bills in case this goes about her $2,500 IUA amount. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-08 07:24:45', '2022-08-08 07:24:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099781033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099851002', 'Ronald Guerra', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-08 07:12:50', '2022-08-08 07:12:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099810035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2108 Question : My son is going off to college and I need to order another Planstin card he can take with him. Where do I log in to order that?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-08-07 06:26:10', '2022-08-07 06:26:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099848028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '8-5-2022:  Sent Jody 2 RX coupons from her list:
     - Cetirizine HCL 10mg., #90 = $6.96 at Hy-Vee off WellRX = cheapest coupon today.
     - Montelukast Sod 10mg., #90 = $8.28 w/$5 first fill disc on GoodRX.  Slightly cheaper for next fill on 2 other sites at $13.07.
--------------------
     - Sent her the Fin Asst Questionnaire so she has the weekend to look at & fill out.  Her hosp bill from earlier this yr sb pd by Liberty, but the hosp portion alone is $250k & they are having issues.  Told her we can at least see if we can get them asst.  Asked her to return comp & I''ll find out for us.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-05 17:43:06', '2022-08-05 17:43:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099848023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '8-5-2022:  Chuck called.  His ophthalmologist retired, so he wondered if we had a list of any ophthalmology offices we''d sugg.  Sent him the list of offices off HCBB that were 16 miles or &lt; from his place &amp; had both high quality care &amp; fairly priced.
     - He also wants to make an annual appt.  Sent him Redirect''s ph # &amp; let them know they can help with what is covered, what the price will be, &amp; even set up the appt.  Did tell him we can sub supp tckt if he has any issues.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-05 16:36:25', '2022-08-05 16:36:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099848018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885009', 'Julie Hauser', NULL, '8-5-2022:  Julie called re: extremely sore/swollen knee.  It''s not life threatening, so she''s going to start by calling CirrusMD.  Knows if they send her to Urg Care or ER to present as ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA &amp; ask for disc.  I''m here for a few more hours, so if she needs help, she''ll call me back.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-05 15:31:14', '2022-08-05 15:31:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099818044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '8-5-22 Bill will be aging into Medicare in Dec. 2022. I told Marta the time frame to reach out to me to remove him and make her primary, Nov. 1st-20th. I connected her with Andrea if they wish as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-05 14:09:01', '2022-08-05 14:09:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099781028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086853002', 'Carol Ann Kowalski', NULL, '8.5.22 - Carol called regarding COVID testing and I explained that this is currently an out of pocket expense. I also sent Carol a list of mammography centers in her area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-05 13:45:35', '2022-08-05 13:45:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 13:28:48', '2022-08-05 13:28:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099848013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094942002', 'Tim Ottmann', NULL, '8-5-2022:  Tim & Angela called for more direction.  We did more education:
     - CirrusMD
     - ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev care - went over a ton of details inc: ONLY use card for Prev, healthcare.gov site, can chg components (ie: colonoscopy can go from screening & no chg, to diagnostic & now resp for $5000 IUA), must be in ntwk, doc must bill - no reim, etc.
     - Zion is healthshare component.  (Didn''t cover much here because they chg''d the sub to something else Analisa sold them *
     - RXs:  they have 4 meds they use on a reg basis.  Like KS, but we disc issues w/limited options there right now.  Showed them how to access the form on MPB.Health. Also, let them know to give us a few days (& esp if we have to go to our worldwide shopper for shipping), so we have time to work w/them.
     - * They have some added prod from their advisor to help cover emerg funds?  Or their IUA in case of emerg?  I let them know that''s not part of what MPB.Health''s prod includes, so their advisor Analisa Cleland can ans those questiobns.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-05 13:25:16', '2022-08-05 13:25:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095695002', 'Mark Schneider', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation Request.  I will cancel billing and notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 13:21:36', '2022-08-05 13:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099848008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, '8-5-2022:  Yadira &amp; her husb Bill called.  Bill''s completing their taxes &amp; needed the proof of ins form for their extension.  I trans him to Patti''s line &amp; he''ll LM if he does not catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-05 12:11:46', '2022-08-05 12:11:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099847002', 'Dena Pierre', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 10:46:18', '2022-08-05 10:46:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099137010', 'Theresa Neiss', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-05 10:40:17', '2022-08-05 10:40:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099848003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', NULL, '8-5-2022:  Carl called.  I helped him find the ''Chg of Pymt'' Form on the MPB.Health site.  He mentioned using a cc &amp; I reminded him of the fees and he may just update the ACH, but at least he''s aware.  
     - Used the opportunity to also go over the MAP, WHLC, &amp; Uber Doc links while we were there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-05 10:39:24', '2022-08-05 10:39:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099203002', 'Todd Muffley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of September 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-05 09:42:58', '2022-08-05 09:42:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096327002', 'Lucas Battista', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-05 09:32:29', '2022-08-05 09:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, 'I have been dealing with this member about his price increase.  He does not recall receiving the email I sent him and wanted to know why his price went up.  Now he asked if we offer any discounts if members are healthy.  I explained that ant discounts would need to be offered on the Zion level and that we have talked about this in the past with other MCS providers but nothing was ever done.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 09:31:07', '2022-08-05 09:31:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099781023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148008', 'Emily Watkins', NULL, '8.5.22 - Emily called because she needed help opening a Need with Zion. I walked her through the process but I also sent her the instructions via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-05 09:22:56', '2022-08-05 09:22:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099842002', 'Kelly Kichler', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 08:48:30', '2022-08-05 08:48:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099781018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974125', 'Gerard McHugh', NULL, '8.5.22 - Membered called because he needs to have a preventative colonoscopy done. Since I do not work with the Direct plan that often I needed some guidance from Patti Baron. She advised me to transfer him to Zion so that they can give him the details on how to get this done properly. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-05 08:38:12', '2022-08-05 08:38:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097887012', 'Marlon Ballestas', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-05 08:03:16', '2022-08-05 08:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099781013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '8.5.22 - Adam called because he states that Quest labs over charged his wife for some labs and that his EOB from Planstin has a ridiculous amount for the labs on it. He was very upset because he is a physician and knows that the pricing has been "jacked up". I transferred him to Planstin so he could speak with them regarding why they did not pay the lipid panel. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-05 07:56:50', '2022-08-05 07:56:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098613002', 'Lisa McDowell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-05 07:53:02', '2022-08-05 07:53:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645357', 'Karen Haywood', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 07:36:22', '2022-08-05 07:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099834003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098613002', 'Lisa McDowell', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-05 07:32:11', '2022-08-05 07:32:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099831002', 'Kyle Ramos', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 07:32:04', '2022-08-05 07:32:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099832003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099826002', 'Ramon Gines', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-05 07:29:36', '2022-08-05 07:29:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099818039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '8-4-22 Per Patti''s email, "We have determined that you will be moving from the 40-49 to the 50-59 Age Group. Due to that change in age group, the price for your monthly health coverage shared amount will change from $798.97 to $843.97. The change will begin with the billing cycle on August 20th, 2020, reflecting the September coverage."

OK, I looked at Michelle Searles account and I remember now. I originally quoted her $843.97 for the 50-59 price because her husband is in his 50''s already. But, we later learned Sedera bills according to the primary member, not the oldest member. So, she got a bonus of the lower price for a few months. She won''t be surprised by this, from what I remember.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-04 17:27:10', '2022-08-04 17:27:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099818034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057125429', 'John Smieszek', NULL, '8-3-2022:  Kat called asking for help getting into CirrusMD.  After trying to get her in, we realized their account is set up wrong, but it was her 18 yr old daughter Marley that''s needing to tt them today.  Here''s everything we did:
     - Sent Marley an ivitation & went over how to get in w/Kat, why the app, everything CirrusMD, so she can help Marley.  
     - Sent supp req to CirrusMD to straighten out the balance of the members.  They corrected John''s acct to reflect his e-mail.  Sent Kathleen an invite & put her e-mail address on this one (so the e-mails sb corr now).  Added both minor children to John & Kat''s accounts.  
     - Kat knows to monitor their e-mails, make sure they accept any invitations, download the app whenever poss, etc.  They sb all set at this point as long as they complete what CirrusMD sent them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-04 15:20:22', '2022-08-04 15:20:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099753043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', NULL, 'Payment will be sent to member in the amount of $4584 for the 12pmts of  $382.  via 2 day priority mail', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-04 14:40:34', '2022-08-04 14:40:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099825003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, 'Spoke with Inga in regards to why she needed to talk to Wiley.  In reality, she needed to be transferred to Zion.
