  ('zcrm_1579374000099818026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085759046', 'James Brown', NULL, '8-4-2022:  Jim called wanting to get help with his ''prev care''.  Totally frustrated that we aren''t going to get his out-of-pkt pricing for his ''prev care'', ''cuz he helped setup the "exhorinate" payscale and getting pricing upfront is super diff.  Originally he seemed mad, but by the end of the call seemed much better.
