  ('zcrm_1579374000099818018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091190002', 'Robert Anderson', NULL, '8-4-2022:  Has a knee issue from Mem Day weekend that just hasn''t healed.  He wants to see a ortho specialist.  Went over ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA.  He''ll call once he''s seen the doc to start a ''med need''.  Mentioned if PT is sugg we do need to get prior approval by sub a ''Treatment Plan'', but not outside the scope once he''s pd his IUA & if pre-app''d.
