  ('zcrm_1579374000099818013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, '8-4-2022:  Dhai called.  She has her shingles shot sched &amp; wanted to know how to handle payment.  Her appt is w/Walgreen''s so I trans her to Planstin to see if that works.  We went over must be in ntwk (so, if we need to help find a doc, please call us back).  She has her Planstin card in her wallet too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-04 12:33:22', '2022-08-04 14:37:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099818008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, '8-4-2022:  Inga went to the ER per CirrusMD sugg w/Covid.  She''s now wondering how to proceed.  We discussed her presenting as a ''cash-pay'' patient, asking for a disc, paying the $2500, then our working together to sub a ''medical need''.
     - She said she read the gvmt is paying for Covid hosp, so why is she paying $2500?  Let her know I''m not sure how that works, but she could try.  Although, she wasn''t tech admitted, so she might ck on that too.
     - She wants to ck w/Wiley to see if they setup anything to help with her IUA.  She tried calling the # I can see & they were unaware of who he was.  Michele Rebal is going to ask him to give her a ring since I''m not seeing another #.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-04 12:32:30', '2022-08-04 12:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099818003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '8-4-2022:  Chris called mult times this am, so I called him back when I came in.
     - Chris'' most urgent need:  Resources for psychiatry (was full blown additct at age 25).  Been clean for years, but feeling the stress of opening a new div @ wk & struggling.  Looking for help.
        He setup his CirrusMD the other day.  He''s going to see if one of their psychiatrists can talk and point him in the best direction
        Went over counseling thru MAP prog.  He knows this may not fit the bill due to his spec needs.  Can''t hurt to call around to see if one of the counselors in his area can help?  He thought it was worth a try.  Talked about opening it up to virtual in his state if he''s not having luck in their local ntwk.  Made sure he has ph # for MAP asst and went over how the prog works.
        Disc his HSA (doesn''t sound like he''s opened one yet?) could be helpful w/some tax adv in pymt.  
        Mentioned Wendy also offers another prod that could make pymts for non plan related expenses. 
     - He wanted to know about dental.  Since he comp his ''Welcome Call'' yesterday w/Vanessa, guided him to the follow-up e-mail.  He couldn''t look right then because he was driving, but knows it contains info on WHLC incl codes and that includes a dental disc.  Could also use the HSA if/when to help w/exp or again tt Wendy re other prod (he''s not ready to do that right now but will def keep it in mind).
     - Didn''t know how to get into "portal".  Disc diff componenets.  He''s so overwhelmed by all the e-mails he''s rec''d from us, I made sure he knows how to access MPB.Health memb port w/user name & pw and what types of things are on our portal.  Went over other links there as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-04 11:28:09', '2022-08-04 11:28:09'),
