  ('zcrm_1579374000099753018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265053', 'Mary Jo Wood', NULL, 'I was forwarded a email from Accounting from Member asking for her receipts for the last 3 months.  I resent Your MPB Health Plan email that had her login &amp; password and explained that she could go in and access her Payment History.  I also reminded her that the receipts were sent to her every month and to look in her Spam &amp; Junk email folders for them.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-04 09:07:26', '2022-08-04 09:07:26'),
