  ('zcrm_1579374000099701041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098380002', 'Elaine Reynolds', NULL, '8-3-2022:  Elaine & Ed called for several items:
     - They are trying to make an appt for their ''prev care'' & found a doc they like, but she''s unavail until Dec.  What do they do, ''cuz they need their meds.*  ''Prev Care'' = Planstin & does req network.  I found Lauren K Davis DO listed in the curr PHCS search & Elaine ck''d w/the billing off too, so she seems good.
        * Went over IF they get their RXs, that''s a treatment, so imp to be super careful the ''prev care'' does NOT include diagnosis or treatment & can throw off the coding.  They can do a ''walk-in'' appt to get their meds & wondered how that works.  We went over that''s generally out of pocket since it''s not necessarily a covered item, present as ''cash-pay'', ask for ''disc''.  Then once they have their new RXs, we can help w/pricing.  [Elaine tried CirrusMD & due to the type of her RX, they could not help w/a refill.  Not sched.]
     - Ed has a refill left on his RX & is almost out.  I sugg trying a pharm-to-pharm transfer for this last refill on his RX.   Here''s what we found on the disc sites for his RX & what they chose:
        Losartan 50mg., #90 tabs at Vons for $6.44 (w/$10 first fill discount) on GoodRX.  For 2nd fill & on curr RxGo the price is better at $13.49.  He could mail order on Cost+ for $12.50 w/s&h, but he def doesn''t have enough time for shipping this time (so down the road?).
        Elaine''s RX when she needs it looks curr best priced at Walgreen''s & it''s substantial, but she und.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-03 18:19:23', '2022-08-03 18:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098380002', 'Elaine Reynolds', NULL, 'Edward called, Elaine was there as well in the background, but Edward called asking if there was a quicker and easier way for both him and Elaine, to get their Prescriptions for High Blood Pressure & Antipsychotic without waiting until November. November is the next available appointment at their Primary Doctor they go to. So, I let them both know that with CirrusMD, the Telehealth program in their plan, they can actually do it that way. I sent them the CirrusMD email that has instructions on how to register and get started. After I told them that, they were thrilled! This news made them very happy and will now make getting their prescriptions a lot easier. They won''t have to go 3 months without their medication. That was the reason they asked for other options instead of waiting 3 months. They are all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-03 17:37:25', '2022-08-03 17:42:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099701036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097027002', 'Elaine Colter', NULL, '8-3-2022:  Elaine called frustrated they don''t have a card or anything yet, ''cuz Liberty gave them a card & ID #.  We went over how this is similar & slightly diff (diff components, etc):
     - She''s sched for a ''Welcome Call'' on the 10th, but I guided her through a few things.
     - She doesn''t have a DPC, but works w/a Naturopath, so we went over how the healthshare comp will work if they need it:  pres as ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, no card to present, pay 1K IUA, get det invoices w/med coding & receipts, call us as soon as poss & we''ll help you sub a ''med need''.  She thought she just sent everything to us, so we did more educ.
     - She wanted to get into her MPB.Health Member Portal to see all her stuff, I exp what our portal will show.  Says she never rec''d her user name or pw.  I didn''t take time to look but was able to get her into the portal.  She wants to chg pw & I sugg it''s best to leave it as it''s not always an easy or quick fix when it doesn''t work.  Not sure she''ll hear me on this one.
     - CirrusMD = she says she was able to get this done.
     - At least she seems on top of things, which is great!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-03 15:20:00', '2022-08-03 15:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098470001', 'Jen Coggin', NULL, '8.3.22 - Welcome Call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 14:44:09', '2022-08-03 14:44:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070067085', 'Kayla Boettcher', NULL, '8.3.22 - Kayla called inquiring about her preventative care benefits and whole health living choices. We discussed how to present her Planstin card, how to search the PHCS network, and what WHLC contains. I sent her all of the info via email as well and she will call with any questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 14:28:41', '2022-08-03 14:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423040', 'Jacob Mouchet', NULL, '8.3.22 - Jacob called to change his address. I sent him the change form link  via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 14:27:23', '2022-08-03 14:27:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099709008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '8-3-22 Called to update her pmt and will use ACH this time. She also wanted  a refresher as to why she switched MCS from Sedera to Zion. Explained this enabled her to have annual wellness included and HSA compliance. She already used all money in HSA for paying Cloud Medical this year. If she adds 23 year old daughter Grayson then she can add to her HSA for 2022. Right now, ex is paying for Grayson''s ins but that may change soon. I gave her price to add Grayson onto MPB CareZ worksite from her current $344/$1000 to $636/$1000. OR, she switches to DIRECT and price drops to $580/$1000 if she adds Grayson to Cloud Medical with Dr. Tusek as well. She LOVES Dr. Tusek. She''s also referred a number of people to me but I will need to encourage her to send a 3-way email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-03 13:55:34', '2022-08-03 13:55:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099701031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005980641', 'Matthew Freeman', NULL, '8-3-2022:  Matthew is working to sub his ''med need'' &amp; wasn''t sure how to get his Zion memb #.  Made sure he has their ph # &amp; went over which menu item to select to ask them for his #.  Trans him directly when he was ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-03 13:54:50', '2022-08-03 13:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, '8.3.22 - Welcome Call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 13:50:26', '2022-08-03 13:50:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099701026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '8-3-2022:  Jerry called back &amp; Jennifer was on a ''Welcome Call''.  He was trying to get back in touch w/Rach in Zion but her e-mail w/her contact info hadn''t arrived yet.  His wife''s not being allowed to make her appts, so I made sure he had Zion''s gen #, knew how to ask for "Rachel in extended care'', &amp; trans him directly.  I think it relieved stress as they were feeling it was super time sensitive.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-03 13:49:53', '2022-08-03 13:49:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099701021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, '8-3-2022:  Bill called to access his telehealth because he wanted to tt someone today.  Sent him CirrusMD invite &amp; gave app &amp; web instructions.  He''ll call back if needs more help.  [Did not go over adding his child.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-03 13:10:32', '2022-08-03 13:10:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099701013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079988002', 'Wayne Jatsek', NULL, '8-3-2022:  Wayne called conf by the components.  His wife went to a spec because she could not taste her food & pres her Planstin card.  Went over a ton of education:
     - ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative Care ONLY.  Went over some of the ''prev care'' info (must be in ntwk, 2 labs cov, etc), but left it:  call us as you are ready to utilize your ''prev care''.
     - CirrusMD:  Sent invitations to both Wayne & Melanie (melaniejatsek@gmail.com).  Went over app (although they may not have space for any more apps), how to sign-up, & utilize.  Ex: this would be a perfect place to start w/the type of issue Melanie was having.  Board cert phy w/in ~60 sec, for guidance, etc.
     - Healthsharing comp where her non-prev issue will fall.  Because she used her Planstin card w/the ENT specialist, he''s going to try to figure out if they can move that to ''cash-pay'' & get a disc, or to find out what the EOB from them shows.  We went over present as a ''cash-pay'' patient to the $2500 IUA mark, & can they bill you for bal?  He''ll call to tt CAT scan place as well w/''cash-pay'' info.  Then he''ll call back.  It was a lot for him...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-03 13:04:02', '2022-08-03 13:07:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098495002', 'Rebecca Abma', NULL, '8.3.22 - Rebecca called to access her Whole Health Living Choices services. I walked her through the process and she found a discount for the chiropractor she was wanting to use. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 12:54:49', '2022-08-03 12:54:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, '8.3.22 - I emailed Eric with Planstin regarding Melinda''s IUD situation. He said: To answer your question: If she has the HSA Plan and the doctor is billing the service of replacing the IUD as preventive, and the doctor is in network, it will be covered. 

I will reach out to Melinda with this information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 12:32:19', '2022-08-03 12:32:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, '8.2.22 - Welcome call completed! I will be reaching out to Planstin regarding an IUD that Melinda had put in prior to her membership that she is having a lot of issues with. She is wondering if she has the copper IUD removed and replaced with a different type of IUD if it would be covered. I will email Eric with Planstin to find out an answer. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 12:31:16', '2022-08-03 12:31:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099724008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601365', 'Matt Holstein', NULL, '8.3.22 - Matt called because he was unaware that his virtual healthcare and mental healthcare had changed. I sent Matt all of the information for both, an invitation to CirrusMD, and I transferred him over to the MAP program so he could speak with them about a therapist. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 12:27:05', '2022-08-03 12:27:05'),
