  ('zcrm_1579374000099724003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '8.3.22 - Jerry called in because he is frustrated that Colorado University Hospital is not willing to bill him for his wife''s breast cancer treatment she will be receiving soon. Jerry and Lori are very frustrated, and I don''t blame them, so I warm transferred Jerry to Zion to talk about pre-payment. I reassured Jerry that his MPB.Health concierge team is here to help him with this diagnosis and treatment. Jerry is very happy with the service he has received from MPB''s concierge team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-03 12:07:37', '2022-08-03 12:07:37'),
