  ('zcrm_1579374000099709003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '8-3-22 Linda is enrolling now but we are putting her husband Christopher Shane Lebsack as the primary member bc Linda is 61 and C. Shane is 53. They are both self-employed. They decided to include their 12 year old son too since he counts into the household IUA rather than paying $275 for his separately through his work. Using ACH bank draft to avoid fees. Choosing SECURE EF $915/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-03 10:19:21', '2022-08-03 10:19:21'),
