  ('zcrm_1579374000099611132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098610002', 'Kurt Wenrich', NULL, '8-2-2022:  Reid got back to me w/an amazing price on the CombiPatch.  I sent his quote = "Combipatch 50mcg/140mcg x 24 patches $153.03 + $9.95 shipping" to Cheryl mentioning shipping time &amp; offering a local coupon if she needs it sooner.  Locally the best price was 8 patches ~$235 &amp; HEB Granbury''s cheapest coupon was ~$ 245-ish.  ILM for her w/what I was sending over &amp; to let me know if she wanted a local coupon instead.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-03 00:22:58', '2022-08-03 00:22:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099611124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '8-2-2022:  While talking to Jody today, I found out that she had 3 major procedures between ~ 2/22 & 5/22.  It sounds like she realizes those are pre-x:  Covid hosp stay created a hosp bill alone (not any of the other exp for that issue) were $250k.  Then I believe she had (gal?) stone, some kind of stone they could not break up & were large enough they had to be rem''d, the like 2 days later she suff a heart attack.  At least I think that was the order.  I offered to get her information to see if Pratter''s Hops Bill Eraser would work in a post scenario situation.  They are at the point that the pymts are difficult because Liberty hasn''t been help pay them properly.
     - She said her husb lost his job, then when they tried to cont the ins they had w/his emp it was $2007/mo.  Daniel then started a bus & that''s why they were w/Liberty.  But, it sounds like they are struggling because Lib hasn''t stepped up.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-02 22:15:16', '2022-08-02 22:39:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099572033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098026002', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '8-2-22 I sent an email to Jessica with local infusion places to call. Cari found the fair price of infusions at $201 per HCBB. For her to take this every 6 months shouldn''t break the bank. I also left her a vm to make sure she sees my email and to help explain it all. She also realized when she talked with me that she doesn''t need a card and just needs to ask for the cash price. She gets it! Sounds like she panicked earlier with Jennifer and Cari and since calmed down. She also let me know she successfully is able to access Ocrevus through their program, I think at no cost! She''s willing to hire a nurse to give her the infusion if necessary and also apply for a grant if need be. She''s willing to put in the effort to make this all flow and work for her! As long as one of the local places with administer the infusion close the fair price, she should be good to go. Cari can also provide proof the fair price from HCBB if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-02 17:32:45', '2022-08-02 17:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099572028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098026002', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '8-2-22 NOTES from old account - 4-4-22 Jessica recently moved here from NYC to Denver and is setting up her own LLC which she is proud of doing. She''s been on Medicaid in NY and needs to update her status to prompt the cancellation. She has MS and gets infusions called Ocrevus every 6 months. These are crazy expensive but she''s able to join an Ocrevus Co-Pay plan with a $0 copay for the infusions. She''s checking to make sure the Bright Health $0 Ded Bronze Plan will suffice to qualify her for the Ocrevus plan. Bright Health will cost about $274 a month without a subsidy. DOB 8/11/88. She came to me via a Christina who''s part of a sound healing group. The Christina is deaf in one ear. I mentioned Christina Turco and she doesn''t think that''s the right person and I don''t believe BSU Christina Johnson has a hearing problem.  So, she''s not sure. But, she doesn''t qualify for MCS anyhow.

4-25-22 We finalized her enrollment for Bright Health Bronze $0 Ded.

7-13-22 Jessica never made her payments to Bright Health and they terminated her. I called Bright Health and spoke with Javier twice and they are not able to reactivate her account and told me to call C4. I called C4 and spoke with Simone and she told me they are not able to do anything since it''s cancelled due to non-payment. She needs another SEP which she doesn''t have.  So, her only option is SECURE which she''s enrolling in now. She needs to have commercial insurance to get onto a special program to help pay for her infusions. With SECURE she can show proof of the MEC to qualify. She will give it a whirl since she has no options!  She''s joining $1000/$300 at 33 years only. I sent her the video to  refresh her memory again and the email overview to read through so she''s confident. SECURE will begin Aug. 1st. She knows to set up her Welcome Call and show proof of self-employment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-02 17:08:41', '2022-08-02 17:08:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099572023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098026002', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '8.2.22 - Jessica called in quite distressed because she is wanting to get an Ocrevus infusion that she needs due to her pre-ex of MS. I tried to explain to Jessica that this is something that would not be shareable in her first year of membership due to her MS being a pre-ex and it is not a preventative care item. Jessica got quite distraught and started crying because she is very frustrated with this situation. She wanted a copy of her Planstin card to provide to the infusion office because they are requesting it for their records. I did go ahead and request a copy of her Planstin card for her, but I am not sure if this is going to work for the purpose it is intended for which is to get assistance for her $16,000 Ocrevus infusion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-02 15:17:03', '2022-08-02 15:17:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099574079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212158', 'Charlene Gigante', NULL, 'I received Change form to remove spouse that will be turning 65 eff 9/22. I will notify Planstin and update billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-02 14:02:32', '2022-08-02 14:02:32'),
