  ('zcrm_1579374000099574074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she will be aging into Medicare eff 9/1/22.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel any further billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-02 13:51:18', '2022-08-02 13:51:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099574069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, 'Member logged into Sales IQ and asked the question on how his son would be able to use the plan when he was away at college in MA.  I explained it to him that he would use it just like anywhere else and things that would be in network.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-02 13:32:37', '2022-08-02 13:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099574064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611002', 'Laura Carr', NULL, 'Member called in after receiving a $1600 bill from her Preventative provider.  I asked if she had presented her Planstin and she had.  I directed her to be in contact with Planstin to get a status of the sharing related to this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-02 13:30:12', '2022-08-02 13:30:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099642008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, 'Robert (Chad) messaged me on SalesIQ about 30 minutes ago, and he was asking if his current Co-Pay plan would work for his son that is going off to college in MA. I let him know that I personally, don''t have an answer about that for him, BUT Patti Baron does and has answered this exact question to several other people throughout the years here. She is the one that 100% knows the correct information to give him. Patti was currently in a meeting, and I asked Robert if he could give me the best phone number and Patti will call him back shortly with the information he needs to know.  Robert let me know that, unfortunately, he will also be in meetings, and that is best for Patti to email him a follow-up email when she is done with her meeting. I agreed, and said that, of course Patti can send a follow-up email to him right after she is done. I sent Patti and message through Teams, with the email that Robert sent, along with Roberts full name so, Patti can pull up his account and get all the details she might need before sending her follow-up email to Robert. Robert is all set for now, Patti sent her email to him already. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-02 13:12:53', '2022-08-02 13:12:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099574059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401050', 'Sheila West', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request as she will be going on Medicare eff 9/1.  Planstin has been notified and I will cancel any further billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-02 12:07:20', '2022-08-02 12:07:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097032002', 'Lisa Alexander', NULL, 'Vanessa messaged me on Teams and stated that Lisa believes she threw out the Fulfillment Package with her QR Life Code Card &amp; all the Flyers I put together, by accident. So, Vanessa requested that I please send out another QR Card &amp; entire Fulfillment Package. I am putting it together, printing the postage on the envelope, and mailing it out right now. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-08-02 12:04:22', '2022-08-02 12:04:22'),
