  ('zcrm_1579374000099572003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080704002', 'Tom Weiss', NULL, '8.1.22 - Welcome call complete! Melissa wanted to know if the 2 medical needs she opened with Zion will still count towards her 3 for their enrollment year since she changed plans. I spoke with Patti Baron who said that since there was no lapse in coverage that they should still count towards the 3 needs per enrollment year. I also sent Melissa lists of mammography centers and gastroenterologists in here area. I requested a PDF copy of their Planstin cards as well. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-02 07:16:48', '2022-08-02 07:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099556023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098610002', 'Kurt Wenrich', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Cheryl sub an RX quote req.  This is a super exp item, so I''ve sub req to Reid to see if he can source.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 18:22:11', '2022-08-01 18:22:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099556018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271309', 'Liesa Smith', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Liesa moved to WA & was getting other coverage that''s eff 8/1/2022.  She''s going to contact Jill to start the process & knows there will be a form she''ll sub so our Benefit Adm can complete the cancellation.  Her new ins is asking for proof of loss of coverage, so I sugg our cancellation may be adequate.  If not, she''ll ask Patti for further help.  [It sounds like they are concerned w/the issues in WA.]  I''m leaving it to Jill Clark to go over the situation w/Liesa & did not go into anything with her.  I did however, send Patti a heads up via Teams chat.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 18:10:44', '2022-08-01 18:10:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099556013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081135010', 'Quentyn Luna', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Madison called.  She thinks she has mastitis from nursing her twins and wondered what her options are.  I sugg she try CirrusMD, went over how to download the app, and sent an invitation from CirrusMD.  DID NOT mention/see her twins on this plan &amp; therefore did not go over having them on her CirrusMD acct.  Told her if they cannot help, please call us back.  Also, forgot to go over RX w/her.  (my Covid brain didn''t help w/this call).  :(     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 18:04:42', '2022-08-01 18:04:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099556008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148001', 'Ginny (Virginia) Haupert', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Wendy replied to Ginny''s e-mail asking for instructions on their annual appts by adding me in the cc of her reply.  I was out sick.  I replied all to Ginny (&amp; Wendy) apologizing for the delay due to illness &amp; req''d she call the concierge line as there are a ton of details to go over.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 16:43:13', '2022-08-01 16:43:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099556003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Michael & his wife Patty(?) called.  They are very confused by what this plan is.  We did a lot of education:
     - I let them know they really need to start w/their ''Welcome Call'' (which has been sugg multiple times before).  However this time, we walked thru & sched the call while we were on the ph together.
     - We did a quick take on what they purch: various components that take care of various healthcare items.  ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative Care ONLY [this is the card he presented to the ER.  He thinks it just got kicked back, but isn''t sure.  His wife is going to call the ER & ask about a ''cash-pay'' discount before they sub a ''med need'' to Zion.];   Zion = Healthshare component [they thought MPB.Health was the healthsharing comp].  I only went over these 2 components to get to sub the ''medical need''.
     - Sent them the temp to sub a ''need'' to Zion.  We opened  the link & walked thru how to complete, etc.  I sugg they call for the ''cash-pay'' discount which his wife understood, but he seems to have challenges w/too many steps.  So, I think she understood.  I sugg they  pay the 1k IUA and upload the pymt receipt when they sub the ''medical need'' so Zion knows their portion is pd for.  
     - He was having heart palpitations in super hot heat (I asked about anxiety, just to get a feel, but it did not seem to stem from that).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 16:31:29', '2022-08-01 16:31:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099513013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098495002', 'Rebecca Abma', NULL, '8.1.22 - Member needed assistance with her CirrusMD account. I will be reaching out regarding getting her kids set up under her CirrusMD account. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-01 14:36:14', '2022-08-01 14:36:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099513008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '8.2.22 -Sent instructions on how to open a Need with Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-01 14:28:13', '2022-08-01 14:28:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099514003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '8-1-22 Linda and husband live in Hood River, OR area and are both self-employed with a raft company. She found out about MPB through Cami Garrison and WWSRA. Cami speaks very highly of MPB and Zion. They''ve been with LHS and are still owed $19K! They don''t bank on getting that money back at this point. Husband had ACL surgery for which he finished PT within the past 6 months. So, I let her know that''s still in the pre-x zone, so decide accordingly. He is only 53.  They have a 23 yr old son as well. She also wanted Dr. Jeff Horacek to be in network but turns out it doesn''t matter. He''s not the dr. she sees for annual wellness visits. I think she sees him for gut issues. (Might be wrong on this. Going from memory.)  She''s also open to funding an HSA for the small stuff. She currently has an AFLAC policy which is likely redundant with this membership SECURE $1000 / $915.  I forgot to mention that $100 or the $125 is waived as a WWSRA member!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-01 14:16:56', '2022-08-01 14:16:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099513003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098380002', 'Elaine Reynolds', NULL, '8.1.22 - Welcome call complete. I will be requesting MPB.Health membership cards for the Reynolds''. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-01 14:01:20', '2022-08-01 14:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099505008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480088', 'Sheila Finch-Manzagol', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Sheila called.  She''s having vision issues (infections, etc.) that she thinks will be deemed ''medical'' not vision.  When she called Redirect they just told her she does not have vision, so she wouldn''t have help no matter what.  She then called her ''ins'' person who told her to call us (she thought she was calling Sedera).  
     - I walked her thru her $1500 IUA, presenting as a ''cash-pay'' patient, keeping documentation, finding out if it''s a medical vs vision issue, & making sure we sub a need within 4 mos if it looks like this will be on going.  
     - Also, gave her Sedera''s ph #, so she can verify w/them.  Seems like someone at Redirect may have just bounced her off without considering it could be ''medical''.  At least Sedera can help guide her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 13:33:27', '2022-08-01 13:33:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099495024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088964002', 'Christopher Cucullu', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update his address.  I will notify Planstin &amp; update in FTNI &amp; A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-08-01 13:19:56', '2022-08-01 13:19:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099505003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148008', 'Emily Watkins', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Stephen called re: pymt issue.  I trans him to Patti.  He''ll LM if he doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 13:04:10', '2022-08-01 13:04:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099464008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'Cat called bc she''s needing to cancel her membership bc she''s moving to Medicare Sept. 1st. She''s frustrated with Zion bc they aren''t sharing in small costs since she didn''t reach her IUA yet. She just felt an energetic shift with Zion in the way they were handling her potential Needs. It also felt like too much work. She did her part and got a diagnostic scan for $300 instead of $1000''s! But, Zion was saying her Need wasn''t shareable. I explained why since she hadn''t reached her IUA. She realizes she just has a short patience for all of it right now and that no membership seems to be ideal for her.  After explaining everything, she realizes she will keep well enough alone for the final month of August before she moves to Medicare.  She''s already paid for Aug. I will help her with any Needs she has outstanding but it sounds like she''s all set on that front  for now. Zion did reimburse her $125 for one need. She also mentioned a visit for covid that was $180 she wanted shared but that''s a separate need. So, everything is working as it should, she''s just tight on time and money right now. She was appreciative of my help and support and apologized for complaining. All is well. She filled out the cancellation form wrong with Aug. 1st and really wants Aug. 31 but that wasn''t an option. I told her to send me an email confirming her chosen end date and I will relay it to Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-01 11:34:29', '2022-08-01 11:34:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099464003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098026002', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-01 11:30:10', '2022-08-01 11:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099446003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331067', 'Tessa Manton', NULL, '8-1-2022:  Wendy responded to Tessa, who in turn replied all = cc''d me.  Tessa keeps talking about her $1000 "deductible".  I''m allowing Wendy to deal w/Tessa as my being in the loop does not feel productive.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-08-01 11:02:15', '2022-08-01 11:02:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099403023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098610002', 'Kurt Wenrich', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-08-01 10:54:18', '2022-08-01 10:54:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099398013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067985045', 'Robin Mickle', NULL, '8.1.22 - Robin called to verify how her husband is supposed to present at his colonoscopy coming up on the 10th of August. We went over the self-pay process and opening a medical need with Zion. She then asked to be transferred to Zion directly for a specific question about reimbursement. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-01 10:50:21', '2022-08-01 10:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099398008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048283121', 'Belinda Latham', NULL, '8.1.22 - Belinda called because she wasn''t sure what she "bought into". I explained her plan and we went over what bloodwork is covered with Planstin. I also told Belinda that if Quest submits all of the labs to Planstin, she will receive an EOB with her portion that is due. I also advised Belinda that she should have a Welcome Call for her new plan, she agreed and I sent her the Welcome Call scheduler. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-08-01 10:46:45', '2022-08-01 10:46:45'),
