  ('zcrm_1579374000099381003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '07.29.22:  Recvd. email and text from Jim.  Wants to add his wife to his membership and asked how to do this.  I emailed him the change of member form link and told him to complete and submit it. I called Patti to see if I could get her in for August but Patti said it''s too late, they''ve already billed him.  I told him his wife would have to start on September 1.  Jim emailed me back saying they thought her insurance was up at the end of August but it''s up end of July.  Said they will wait and be careful she doesn''t get sick, etc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-08-01 07:00:28', '2022-08-01 07:00:28'),
