  ('zcrm_1579374000099355003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '7-29-22 Ian called bc he has two shoulder issues he''s tending with right now. One is from many years old issues that is arising on the left side and the other is brand new on the right side which may be a torn bicep tendon and part of rotator cuff issue needing surgery. He just got an MRI done on each shoulder at $900 each instead of $3K per MRI! He wants to use Dr. Millet at Steadman''s Clinic.  I instructed him to call MPB Concierge to set up the new Need with Sedera and then connect with his assigned Needs Coordinator from there forward. I let him know they will pay a portion or whatever is required up front to get the surgery moving forward. They will pay him and he pays the clinic. He knows Matt Ross had success for a surgery way back. I clarified Redirect''s role which was super helpful bc they used Redirect partially with Etta''s maternity need. They are on track and feeling more confident bc Ian gave his card to Steadman''s and they said it wasn''t covered. Now he understands!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-29 17:07:22', '2022-07-29 17:07:22'),
