  ('zcrm_1579374000099280039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052755096', 'Kathryn Sparacino', NULL, '7.29.22 - Kathryn called back because Sedera''s office is closed today and she needs assistance logging into her portal. When she attempts to log in with her phone number it is telling her that there is more than one account associated with that number, and unfortunately MPB''s concierge team cannot help with this. I tried calling myself, and the recording states that their office is closed for the day so I sent an email to Sedera''s member support. I called Kathryn back to inform her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-29 13:08:29', '2022-07-29 13:08:29'),
