  ('zcrm_1579374000099280021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, '7.29.22 - Reached out to Deanna via phone (left detailed vm) and email asking her to reschedule her Welcome Call due to the concierge team being short staffed today because of an illness. I also left Deanna information regarding the mammogram she inquired about yesterday and told her to call with any questions or concerns. I sent Deanna a new Welcome Call scheduler. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-29 10:35:13', '2022-07-29 10:35:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099280016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, '7.29.22 - Brian called because his new Planstin card has him very confused about what his telehealth is with MPB. I explained to Brian that he has CirrusMD, and had to ask Brian to let me finish several times so that  we could get him started with CirrusMD. Brian realized that he had already set up his CirrusMD account, we got him signed in and started with a conversation with a CirrusMD doc. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-29 09:30:14', '2022-07-29 09:30:14'),
