  ('zcrm_1579374000099285028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199008', 'Astraea Davidson', NULL, 'Member''s 8/22 payment was declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 7/29 Spoke to member and she has moved monies and directed me to re run.  8/9- After declining again member called in and she had not received any of my email w/link.  I directed her to the website.   AS of 8/10 I had not received any payment update, so I left a VM and she submitted new pmt info.  I will rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-29 09:03:18', '2022-08-10 12:06:42'),
