  ('zcrm_1579374000099280011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082506002', 'Alexander Lombardo', NULL, '7.29.22 - Alex called because his wife recently accepted a job with an employer who offers health insurance. Alex wanted to know if it would be more beneficial financially to keep just himself on the medical cost sharing plan. I transferred Alex directly to his advisor, Traci McCoid for this information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-29 08:13:35', '2022-07-29 08:13:35'),
