  ('zcrm_1579374000099154101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001669077', 'Mark Lackey', NULL, '7-28-22 Mark got a new job with benefits starting Aug. 1st. I just showed him how to cancel his membership. He will do that and he will refer me to anyone needing health insurance or MCS. He was appreciative of my assistance. I think he came to me via Laura Seraydarian or Megan Kram originally. It''s not showing in referral source anymore.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-28 15:08:43', '2022-07-28 15:08:43'),
