  ('zcrm_1579374000099222026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083253002', 'Joshua Hardwick', NULL, '7.28.22 - Erin called regarding an orthopedic specialist for her son who broke his hand in 2 places. I sent Erin the fair pricing for a 45-minute new patient office visit with an orthopedist in her area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-28 14:56:29', '2022-07-28 14:56:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099154091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '7-28-22 Melissa is asking about creating a 3-person group with Boulder Holistic - Dr. Terri Fox, Melissa Bajza and Amy (?). They will join SECURE if/when Amy''s ready. However, Melissa wants to switch from PDHC to SECURE since she''s struggling with Redirect to get her colonoscopy paid for. I''ve sent an email to Christian Vasquez to get that handled. She will need to cancel PDHC and re-enroll since moving MCS company.  It will also save her $110 a month and less aggravation for wellness visits with Planstin/PHCS network in Boulder County. Hoping to get her bills paid so she can feel safe with switching for Sept. 1st start. Amy more likely Oct. 1st start and has family.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-28 14:49:38', '2022-07-28 14:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099222021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098327002', 'Cindy Gordon', NULL, '7.28.22 - Cindy called inquiring about a proof of coverage letter for her daughter''s school. I advised Cindy to call Planstin after August 1, 2022 to request this letter. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-28 14:39:57', '2022-07-28 14:39:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099184059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094006002', 'Kelly Shipp', NULL, 'Member''s 8/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email&amp; VM - 7/28 7/29-Member contacted me and asked me to rerun her payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-28 14:12:36', '2022-07-29 10:36:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099184054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'After member called in and let me know that he would have funds around 7/29, I received notice that his payment declined.  1st notice sent out 7/28 Finally on 8/8 member''s funds came in and I reran pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-28 14:00:12', '2022-08-08 14:32:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099154086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059166', 'Deanna Johnson', NULL, '7-28-2022:  Deanna called.  (I lost all my notes, so I''ll do my best to recreate them.)  She had concerns about her changing from one ''prev care'' service to another.  We discussed her old RCI, is now Planstin ''Prev Care'' (very similar, but different companies).
     - With the chgs she decided she wants to do a new ''Welcome Call''.  While we were on the phone it seemed like she was scheduling the call.
     - She says she hasn''t rec''d her Planstin ''Prev Care'' card, so I req''d both the pdf & hardcopies via e-mail for her.
     - After the fact, I found out she called back & tt Jennifer about a mammogram she had in May 2022 ("?).  It meant she had the mammogram too soon & so RCI declined it. (you are allowed one every 2 yrs & this was ~14 mos apart).  Jennifer said she''s very angry & we are resp for this, saying we chg''d it on her, it sb annually.  I told her it''s been 2 years since I''ve been working with this, but I haven''t been here that long.  Why she did not mention this during out call I have no idea!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-28 13:55:14', '2022-07-28 15:24:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099184049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148008', 'Emily Watkins', NULL, 'Members 8/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 7/28 3rd notice sent- 8/1 Spoke to member her husband was supposed to have taken care of this.  She will look inot his and take care of.  8/1- Member''s husband called said ok to rerun with present info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-28 13:51:58', '2022-08-01 13:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099222016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '7.28.22 - Karen called for instructions on how to submit her needs to Sedera. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-28 13:43:51', '2022-07-28 13:43:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099154081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, '7-28-2022:  Paul called for several items:
     - He just had his annual ck up & wanted to get reimb.  I went over Planstin = ''Prev Care''.  He found his card, but I think it may be one of the misprinted = not ideal, but will work (didn''t mention that to him at all).  Then we ck''d to see if Dr. Monhollon is listed in ntwk.  I don''t see him, but he''s going to call & verify w/the MD''s off.  He''ll get the NPI # if they aren''t sure to call PHCS to conf.  He knows this must be billed by the MD off, must be all ''prev'' or it throws off billing, etc.
        Also went over making sure MD off, once they have his ''prev care ins'' on file, does NOT bill anything else thru that ins or he may end up paying > the ''cash-pay'' pricing.
     - It''s time for a colonoscopy.  Sent him the 33 gasteroenterology off listed near him & went over "all entities" must be in ntwk.  I think he''s starting to understand.  Went over screening vs diag & to call us if they pull polyps & we''ll show him how to sub a ''need'' & it then goes from ''prev'' to diag = 1k IUA & to call us afterwards to get help sub a ''med need'' instead.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-28 13:42:34', '2022-07-28 18:05:39'),
