  ('zcrm_1579374000099154076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, '7-28-2022:  Katie called.  She aged into Medicare in March, but rec''d a bill today saying "your ins denied" something from Feb.  She could not tell me what the service was (prev?, illness?, etc.) or what she''d gone for.  I let her know it''s super time sensitive since her memb has been cancelled for months (&amp; Aug = 6mos after the service).  She''s going to find out &amp; call us back.  It may be too late regardless, but I didn''t even know how to guide her since we don''t know what she had done!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-28 13:15:00', '2022-07-28 13:15:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099184026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, 'Member sent in detailed account of her issues with Redirect &amp; Sedera.  She requested 3 months refund.  I spoke to John and he just wants to refund her the money.  I sent her an email apologizing and letting her know that we would be send her the requested refund.  I asked that she verify her address and after that will send the check out to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-28 13:12:30', '2022-07-28 13:12:30'),
