  ('zcrm_1579374000099184018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087106', 'Jennifer Mangin', NULL, 'This member was on a list the I received from John to double check their billing.  This member has been being double billed since 8/21.  In the transition from FTNI billing to A123, this member was not cancelled in FTNI.  Therefore  being double billed.  I will be in contact with member to explain.  UPDATE:I spoke to Tyler and he was overjoyed and very thankful that we were fixing things and refunding them the monies.  This will help them alot.  I will request check from Karina and update member when it goes out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-28 11:41:07', '2022-07-28 11:51:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099215003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '07.28.22:  Stan emailed. Peggy received a bill dated 7.5.22 for a mammogram screening she had on 11/24/21.  Stan asked if this could be paid by Apex.  I asked Jennifer to contact Apex and find out why this bill was sent almost 8 months after service to Peggy.  Emailed Stan and asked if this was a preventive or diagnostic service and told him Jennifer would contact Apex to discuss it and we''ll get back w/him.
Jennifer spoke with        at  RCI who explained that Peggy was sent that bill because she had a mammogram in September of 2020 and again on 11/24/21.  Her plan is a limited benefits plan that allows for mammograms every two years.  So the member would be responsible for pmt. for this mammogram since it''s only one year apart from the last one.    I emailed Stan this information.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-07-28 11:28:44', '2022-07-28 12:33:11'),
