  ('zcrm_1579374000099184003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'Jane sent an email to "Info" inquiring about this members status w/Sedera as she received a letter urging her to transition to the Select + platform.  She is still active and however Sedera wants all members w/ Needs to transition ASAP.  Jane is also speaking with this member about moving to Zion.  I advised her against this as her need would be classified as Pre-Ex.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-28 08:45:35', '2022-07-28 08:45:35'),
