  ('zcrm_1579374000099057038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, '7.28.22 - Marcia called because her 19 y/o daughter has been diagnosed with heavy metal toxicity. She was inquiring about functional medicine and also wanted to know if she were to open a Medical Need with Zion, would the bills from the Chiropractor and bloodwork that the chiropractor ordered be something that she could submit. I was unsure of whether or not she had to get prior auth for a functional med doctor that is also an MD. I spoke with Grace from Zion and warm transferred Marcia to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-28 08:07:41', '2022-07-28 08:07:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099130039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '7/27/2022:  Sent detailed resp on question re: IUAs.  
     - I can tell they are forgetting things we went over in details, because when they completed their application, I let them know to sched their ''Welcome Call'' AFTER their eff date &amp; preferrably about the 2nd week of Aug so all of their components can be active for the call.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-27 18:08:13', '2022-07-27 18:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099130034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076016', 'Mark Caprio', NULL, '7-27-2022:  Mark called.  He has a hernia, but doesn''t have a doctor.  He says he thinks he did this doing pullups last Tues (so, ie: it shouldn''t be pre-x).  
     We discussed that this will be something his healthshare component may help with, but he is a ''cash-pay'' patient for the first $5000 IUA either way.  That there is no ntwk he must stay in, but we can look at the quality of care & fair pricing of the doc, once he thinks he''s selected a someone, in HCBB if he''d like. 
     [He says he was told he has $250 x one appt they will reimb - it sounds like someone may have confused the plans if he was told this.]
     We also disc Care Connect IF the surgery will be 5k or >.  He asked how it would work if there is > 1 hernia (like say it''s 4 hernias) - this will be determined by Zion.  Sometimes they go by location, but it varies.  That if they determine they are diff locations or say 4 sep issues, it would be 4 x 5k IUAs = 20k in IUAs.  He acknowledges he understood he''d chosen a high IUA.
     He is going to see a doctor for his initail appt (& will call if he needs us to ck on doc in HCBB before he goes).  Then, he''ll call so we can walk him thru sub a need (even though he won''t be at 5k so as not to go past the deadline).  That way, Zion can tell him upfront on IUA(s) if there''s > 1 hernia.  He seemed to understand, but wanted to take it step-by-step.  So, he''ll call in after that 1st appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-27 17:08:27', '2022-07-27 17:08:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099130029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '7-27-2022:  Corinne called re: her daughters ''prev'' appt.  They just got billed & she wanted to know who to send the receipts to.  I ck''d & at least the MD is in ntwk per the PHCS search tool.  She''s going to have her daughter go back to the doc w/her Planstin card & let them know she forgot to provide it when she had her appt (the MD off must bill for ''prev care'' srvcs).  We went over making sure the MD off does NOT bill anything but her ''prev'' items or it can leave them paying > the ''cash-pay'' price for non ''prev'' items.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-27 16:57:58', '2022-07-27 16:57:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099141003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100759002', 'Lucie Lalonde', NULL, 'Spoke with client initially about our programs for travelling nurse.  Gave her website to review and appointment set at 9am on Sat...7/29/2022.    Enrollment will be set for Sept 1, 2022 start date....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-07-27 16:32:11', '2022-07-27 16:32:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099130018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967002', 'Vickie Jan Felan', NULL, '7-27-2022:  Jan called to discuss the doctor''s for the PHCS Planstin ''prev care''.  She called 6 DOs listed &amp; none were taking new patients.  I found an option in the PHCS search she''s going try [= Dr. Luanne Carlson: Yellow $$ in HCBB].  She''ll call back if still struggling.
     She primarily sees her naturopath in SF, so this doc will be a backup/emerg doc if she gets sick.  Hopefully, some of the tests she can share results w/the SF doc too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-27 15:26:58', '2022-07-27 16:49:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099128028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '7-27-22 He sees his charge successfully now, no issues. He has not received any request from Sedera to move to their new platform even though he has an open need. We will leave well enough alone for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-27 15:13:20', '2022-07-27 15:13:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099128023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '7-27-22 Left vm for Alicia to confirm new illustration amount of $400K at $46.73 to finalize her app.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-27 14:27:21', '2022-07-27 14:27:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099128018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096331001', 'Darrell Porter', NULL, '7-27-22 Darrel Porter with Finesse Marketing just called because he was double charged. They just moved from 2 Individual Memberships to 3 Group List Bill for Aug. 1st. He was charged for each member individually at $275, $425 and $525 on the 20th and then again via an invoice which is charging his account again today with the whole amount of $1225.  I''ve sent a note to Karina after asking Patti and Michele. Karina needs to fix this and is out for the day already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-27 14:24:33', '2022-07-27 14:24:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099130013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '7-27-2022:  Melissa called.  She hasn''t rec''d the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & wondered how soon it would arrive.  She ck''d her spam fldr & still nothing.  I let her know Vanessa sent it on 7/22/22, so I sent a copy of that orig (so she can see Vanessa sent it) from Outlook.  She will let me know if she doesn''t rec that copy either.
     - Her daughter has always gotten ''prev derm'' covered & she wondered how it''s handled.  I went over it''s not a covered ''prev care'' item, so she''ll say she''s a ''cash-pay'' patient, ask if they have a disc, & if anything is diagnosed & an issue, we need to sub the expenses before their deadline so please call within the first 4 mos & we''ll help them get that started in case the ongoing exp go over their $2500 IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-27 13:31:52', '2022-07-27 13:31:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099128013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079921029', 'Ryan Padwe', NULL, '7-27-22 Ryan called bc he wants to add their new partner Dan to the SECURE membership and they will now have a group of 3 to List Bill. They also want to add VSP for all 3 and possibly DentalPlans.com. He''s curious to learn more about the HMA but will likely do this part in 2023 when they are more financially stable. He used to have DentalPlans.com for $150 a year and liked it. He recognizes dental insurance isn''t that great. He also just went to a PT today and gave him the Planstin card. The PT didn''t know what to do with it. I explained he only needs to show that for his annual wellness visit and tell the PT he''s cash pay. He doesn''t believe he''ll exceed $1000 for this issue and I told him about the 6 month deadline to create the need from date of service. He understands. I''ll email him all information and they will want to add Dan for Sept. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-27 13:30:25', '2022-07-27 13:30:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099128008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954036', 'Teresa Fox', NULL, '7-27-22 Terri updated her payment information for 7/20/22 payment. She had fraud on her card recently and was also traveling for the past 3 weeks out of the country. She should be all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-27 12:57:57', '2022-07-27 12:57:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099130008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '7-27-2022:  Denise called wanting to find out about seeing a dermatologist for skin concerns.  When I mentioned Redirect would help her with that, copay, etc., she said she had so much trouble with Redirect last year she really doesn''t like working with them.  I apologized for that experience & let her know there could be other healthcare options Joan could look at for her, but then she said no she wants to stay w/Redirect.  
     I let her know if she calls them & has any issue, please call me back right away & I can sub a support request (she says she''ll just call Joan if she has issues).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-27 12:44:14', '2022-07-27 12:44:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099130003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086453002', 'John Burke', NULL, '7-27-2022:  John called.  They got health ins that''s eff 9/1/2022.  I trans him to Joan''s line &amp; he will LM.  He knows she will work with him to get the cancellation going, but he won''t want to sub the req to cancel eff: 8/31/2022 until after 8/1.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-27 11:49:00', '2022-07-27 11:49:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099128003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '7-27-22 Melissa is struggling with Gastroenterology of the Rockies refusing payment for her colonoscopy. She''s going to give me the details when we talk tomorrow. She did call Redirect in advance and got it all pre-approved. She followed the correct protocol. She will also help make sure Dr. Terri Fox''s payment issue is resolved. Finally they are considering creating a 3 person group for the office and add Amy to the mix. I don''t know Amy''s last name.  We are talking tomorrow at 1:00.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-27 11:36:35', '2022-07-27 11:36:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099084073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091189002', 'Sarrah Claman', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 11:17:31', '2022-07-27 11:17:31');
