  ('zcrm_1579374000099084033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093277002', 'Grant Meeker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 10:22:19', '2022-07-27 10:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099060013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063644001', 'Carlos Galvin', NULL, 'Since I cannot do partial refunds out of A123 I will refund the difference in the price ($145) of the MC &amp; the MO out of FTNI.  I have notified Planstin &amp; will change the product to the new products because of the upcoming price increase.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-27 09:59:33', '2022-07-27 09:59:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099084028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093624002', 'Omri Abuhasera', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 09:53:32', '2022-07-27 09:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099057033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095695002', 'Mark Schneider', NULL, '7.27.22 - Mark has called back several times to cancel his plan. Upon speaking with Patti Baron, it appears that Mark would like to cancel so that he can purchase a plan directly through Zion Health. I tried to explain to Mark that there are several components with his MPB.Health plan that he would not receive if he were to purchase a plan directly through Zion, including preventative care services. Mark was uninterested in anything I had to say, he is adamant that he would like to cancel his plan ASAP. Patti is trying to get a hold of Mike Montes so that he has an opportunity to speak with Mark.

**Update** Patti could not get a hold of Mike or Leslie, so she contacted Misty Berryman. Misty is going to try to get a hold of Mike and if she cannot she will call Mark herself. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 09:45:54', '2022-07-27 09:45:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099084023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095555002', 'Kyle Larsen', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 09:40:37', '2022-07-27 09:40:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099084018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095560002', 'Jeanne Higinbotham', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 09:36:51', '2022-07-27 09:36:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099057028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, '7.27.22 - Steven called because he spoke with Christus Medical Center/Cardiology and was told that they do not accept self-pay patients. I called the office personally and spoke with the billing department who informed me that if Steven had been an established patient who lost his insurance, then they would''ve accepted him as self-pay. The accounting staff was helpful and gave me 2 names of cardiologists in the area that accept self-pay patients. I called Steven back with this information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 08:58:54', '2022-07-27 08:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099084013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095949002', 'Delana Winslow', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 08:58:23', '2022-07-27 08:58:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099057023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095695002', 'Mark Schneider', NULL, '7.27.22 - Mark called to cancel his plan. I transferred him directly to Mike Montes to start this process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 08:58:03', '2022-07-27 08:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099095008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099248002', 'Alex Killingsworth', NULL, 'Call from the hotline. He is very familiar with cost-sharing &amp; has had it before.  He requested an email to the application. Will follow up later today to make sure he received said email.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-07-27 08:55:13', '2022-07-27 08:55:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099084008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095964011', 'Benjamin Deweese', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 08:40:40', '2022-07-27 08:40:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099057018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, '7.27.22 - Steven called because he wanted to know the process to go see a cardiologist. I explained the self-pay process, he had the instructions to open a Medical Need with Zion, and I also advised Steven that if the cardiologist suggests a procedure, to give us a call and we will go from there. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 08:37:20', '2022-07-27 08:37:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099084003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099052002', 'Jeffrey Schmitz', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of Sept. 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 08:35:48', '2022-07-27 08:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099057013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '7.27.22 - Cynthia called to inquire about a new virtual Zion Health card. This was something that was new to me and I didn''t realize that Zion was sending out virtual cards to our members. We walked through the email that Zion sent Cynthia, and at the bottom there was a virtual card attached. Cynthia also stated that she received a welcome email from Zion that confused her because it was asking her to choose her add-on products. I told Cynthia to ignore that portion of the email because it does not pertain to her since she has a plan through MPB.  Cynthia is amazing! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 08:34:02', '2022-07-27 08:34:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099060008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099052002', 'Jeffrey Schmitz', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-27 08:14:01', '2022-07-27 08:14:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099051012', 'Angelica Valencia', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-27 08:09:37', '2022-07-27 08:09:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099057008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091125010', 'Leslie Jefferson', NULL, '7.27.22 - Jason (Leslie''s husband) called to inquire about cancelling her membership. He verified all of Leslie''s information and I transferred him to Leonardo to get that process started. It sounds as if Leslie was too embarrassed to call herself since she just recently started her plan in May of 2022. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 08:07:32', '2022-07-27 08:07:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099056008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 08:06:15', '2022-07-27 08:06:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099057003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290256', 'Lynn MacRitchie', NULL, '7.27.22 - Lynn and Charles called with questions regarding seeing an Orthopedist. I explained the self-pay process, collect all detailed billing and receipts, and make sure to start a Medical Need ASAP with Zion. I also advised to call the MPB.Health concierge team if surgery is suggested so that we can guide them on the process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 08:05:11', '2022-07-27 08:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099056003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of August 1,2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-27 08:04:12', '2022-07-27 08:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083107002', 'William Lamb', NULL, '7.27.2022 - William emailed in to Patti Baron regarding his services with CirrusMD. It appears he has already registered so I sent William an email with directions on how to change his password. I reached out via email due to the 3 hour time difference and did not want to wake William and his family at 6:19 AM MST. I advised William that if he is still having issues with logging into his CirrusMD account to let me know and I will reach out to their support team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-27 07:24:16', '2022-07-27 07:42:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659218', 'Julie Harriman', NULL, '7-26-2022:  After starting to work on Gabriel''s note from above, I got to thinking:  if this is diagnostic, we are just going to totally confuse this poor woman by going into ''prev'' info.  I tried calling her &amp; had to LM, asking her to call us so we can gather a bit more info to give her accurate instructions.  [tt Jennifer, so she''s aware of this too.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-26 17:34:35', '2022-07-26 17:34:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, '7-26-2022:  Charles from Care Conn let me know this is such an unusual procedure, it''s not a good candidate for Care Conn.  He tt Rachel Burbidge in Zion''s Ext Care so they know this will just go thru the normal Zion sharing.  Rbt has been requesting reduced prices up front, but I don''t think it will qualify for the reduced rate.  See Care Connect secure e-mail for further details.  I called & made sure Rbt is aware (he tt Charles earlier today).  He seems good & appreciated everyone trying.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-26 16:44:06', '2022-07-26 16:55:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099032018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885418', 'Carolyn Glah', NULL, '7-26-22 Carolyn called back while she''s traveling now and is at DIA. I gave her the new pricing that John Kach quoted me at $862.28 down from $901 for her PDHC at $2500 IUA!  She''s pleased! She''ll complete the process on her end tomorrow when she''s in front of her computer. I asked her to let me know when it''s complete so we can update her account on our end. She understands the change is just their platform, not changes to her membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-26 16:14:11', '2022-07-26 16:14:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099016010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 2083 Question : having trouble logging into my account', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-07-26 15:42:37', '2022-07-26 15:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005980641', 'Matthew Freeman', NULL, '7-26-2022:  Matthew called back worried that he hadn''t been a memb long enough to have this new ''medical need'' shared.  But, we disc the diff between pre-x concerns that have a step-up process and new issues (this is a new issue according to him) so he should be fine.  Also talked more on the process of sub.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-26 15:34:56', '2022-07-26 15:34:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082048002', 'Maginel Galt', NULL, 'Pronounced:  Mag-in-el

7-26-2022:  Maginel called in - she''s traveling &amp; the tour comp is req a neg Covid test.  We discussed options &amp; she understood.  She''s trying Walgreens.  I called back &amp; LM: when asked if you have insurance, you tell them no, because you do not have anything that helps pay for this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-26 14:57:41', '2022-07-26 14:57:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005980641', 'Matthew Freeman', NULL, '7.26.22 - Matthew called and needs to open up a medical need with Zion regarding a recent heart issue. I walked him through the process, but he needs to get a superbill from the hospital. Matthew will call back if he has any questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-26 14:30:07', '2022-07-26 14:30:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967002', 'Vickie Jan Felan', NULL, '7.26.22 - Jan (please make sure to address her by Jan) called for instructions on how to search the PHCS network and how to present her Planstin card. I sent Jan the instructions for the PHCS network search and instructed her on how to present her MEC (Planstin). ~Jennifer Thorin-Savard', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-26 14:08:35', '2022-07-26 14:08:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099034013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070976050', 'Colleen Glenn-Wilson', NULL, '7.26.22 - Colleen called to update her payment information (again?). I sent her the payment update form via email. ~Jennifer Thorin-Savard', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-26 14:06:48', '2022-07-26 14:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099047003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083233002', 'Heidi Holliday', NULL, 'Heidi called and had a TON of questions. Which was great! Since they joined, they have been moving, her husband is a Nurse, and they have a 1- and 5-year-old to take care of. So, she has not really been able to sit down and use the plan except for CirrusMD a couple times. So, she just had some important questions. I answered everything for her and sent her 6 emails that were according to her questions with all the info she could possibly need. She will also be calling Karen, her Advisor, about a few other things Karen should answer and help with. Heidi is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-07-26 13:56:51', '2022-07-26 13:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099028021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967002', 'Vickie Jan Felan', NULL, 'Member called from (760) 532-7875 Jennifer was taking care of another member so I let her know we will reach back as soon as possible member agreed. I forwarded the information to Jennifer. Gabriel Nuñez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-07-26 13:55:44', '2022-07-26 13:55:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099032013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111063013', 'Stephanie Hoffman', NULL, '7-26-22 Pharmacy Checker.com shows this $15.16 for 200 25 mg tablets at Safeway in Erie for Quetiapine fumarate 25 mg. "Quetiapine fumarate is the drug.
Lupin is the manufacturer of the generic I use."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-26 13:19:46', '2022-07-26 16:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099028016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659218', 'Julie Harriman', NULL, 'Julie Harriman called from 949-436-0434 she stated she needs a Mammogram and ultrasound for the right side only she said she needs location and pricing for a diagnosis center, contact info in CRM, zip code 92656. No preferred time to be reached back. I forwarded the info to Jennifer. Gabriel Nuñez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-07-26 13:17:05', '2022-07-26 13:17:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099032008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111063013', 'Stephanie Hoffman', NULL, '7-26-22 Stephanie is 48, husband is 61 and self-employed, son is 16. Only health issue is sleep issues/insomnia for Stephanie. She takes Lupin, and the generic is Quetiapine 3 - 25 mg tablets daily. She''s weaning herself off and taking 2 1/2 tablets daily to be 62.5 mg 1x daily.  She wanted to know the cost through Optum RX. I told her I''d price it out for her via our partners. She''s part of Cloud Medical already and wants to join DIRECT. But, she''s been scoping out Zion''s site directly and is totally confused. She might want the colonoscopy, mammo and childhood immunizations and is fine with 6 month wait for those. She''s paying about $400+ now through employer but might want to leave soon Good with Sept. 1st start date. Also paying about $28 through Walgreen''s for her meds but it could be up to $100 without insurance is her fear. I will find out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-26 13:02:04', '2022-07-26 13:02:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099036003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102133002', 'Micah Starbuck', NULL, 'Spoke to client and completed presentation on products.  Client will speak with Spouse to determine possible enrollment.   Time set for 7/27/22...at 4pm.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-07-26 11:21:47', '2022-07-26 11:21:47'),
