  ('zcrm_1579374000098973013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366134', 'Janell Vennard', NULL, 'Was copied on a letter from members Auto Insurance carrier saying that the letter that I sent didn''t meet the underwriting requirements.  What this member wanted to do was to get a discount so that their "Health Insurance" would cover expenses related to an Auto Accident.  I contacted Zac and told him that this is not possible, that Health Sharing is always secondary.  He will be in contact with the member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-26 08:52:11', '2022-07-26 08:52:11'),
