  ('zcrm_1579374000098966003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098564012', 'Michael Stephens', NULL, '7.25.2022 - Michael booked another welcome call for a date before his plan start date. I sent Michael an email advising that he needs to reschedule his welcome call for a time after his plan start date. I received an email back from Michael stating that he would like to do his call before his start date so that he can prepare to get his daughter''s Occupational Therapy preapproved because this is something she does weekly. I am concerned because this will be considered a pre-ex and I don''t believe that Michael is aware of this fact. I reached out to Michele because I was not aware of who this producer is for this member and advised Michele of my concerns. She will be reaching out to the producer to discuss this member. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-26 07:07:53', '2022-07-26 07:07:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098944018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085342002', 'Michael Meuth', NULL, '7-25-2022:  Michael called for several items:
     - He needed to submit a pymt update form.  Showed him how to access his MPB.Health w/his User Name &amp; PW.  Showed him the form to sub the chg &amp; let him know comm errors &amp; ACH = no fee, but debit &amp; cc = fee.
     - He was curious about other items.  We opened &amp; went thru the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail so he can see it includes things like the MAP pw, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-25 18:12:55', '2022-07-25 18:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098944013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084188002', 'ROBERT Black', NULL, '7-25-2022:  Rbt is looking at cataract surgery - Doc says this will be a ''medical need''.  Per curr Zion guidelines, 1 yr waiting period = need to have done 2/1/2023 or later (I''m assuming = pre-x & phase in occurs = 25k available at that point).  It also says, 1 IUA per eye = 1k IUA x 2.  He has vision care that will pay a portion of his visit where he was diagnosed etc.  May sub bal to see if they will put it twds his his IUA?  He knows they may say no.  Sent him temp to sub a ''medical need'' & went over process.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-25 18:10:55', '2022-07-25 18:10:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098954016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645313', 'Peter Nesbitt', NULL, '7-25-22 Peter Nesbitt got a new job with benefits which already started. So, he''s cancelling for Aug. 1st now. He will continue to work for IGC as consultant only and work for other company with benefits. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-25 16:13:32', '2022-07-25 16:13:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098905023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093328002', 'Craig Anderson', NULL, '7.25.22 - Lisa Anderson''s script quote for Concerta completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-25 14:19:57', '2022-07-25 14:19:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098905018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148008', 'Emily Watkins', NULL, '7.25.22 - Cytomel script quote complete~ ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-25 14:07:32', '2022-07-25 14:07:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098927039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063644001', 'Carlos Galvin', NULL, 'Member emailed Misty and wanted a refund for his children threatened to file a complaint w/BBB.  I explained to Misty in the interest of keeping member happy I could refund through FTNI however he would be charged the new pricing and would only get $145 back.  I sent form link to member however he did not receive and never followed up with me.  I do have to wait until ACH declines come in.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-25 13:48:24', '2022-07-25 13:49:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098944008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093926001', 'Carolyn Haskin', NULL, '7/25/2022:  Carolyn called to find out how much it costs to use the CirrusMD.  We went over it''s just part of your membership &amp; all things around this component.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-25 13:17:57', '2022-07-25 13:17:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098954008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098951004', 'Sam Simonds', NULL, '7-25-22 Sam was ready to go and had followed my instructions to set up his C4 account when I called him back. He had just gotten the application complete and we selected Bright Health Bronze Peak Bronze $0 Deductible Bronze/EPO for $295.17 with no APTC bc making too much money. I told him to contact Bright Health directly in 24-48 hours to make payment. I told him to call C4 now with request Aug. 1st start date. I showed him how to upload his proof of SEP, likely Cobra notice for his Aug. 1st start date. He has all the information he needs to effectuate his plan. He was super appreciative.  $87,632 is his projected income.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-25 12:43:44', '2022-07-25 12:51:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098954003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '7-25-22 Talked with Figge and he was frazzled with his work at the moment. We set a time to talk since he has an open need with Sedera and doesn''t recall being pushed to update his account yet. Also, didn''t see payment go through on his end so he will double check since Patti says it all looks good on her end so far. Patti said it''s going through PNC Bank for $284 on the 20th with acct ending in 6021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-25 12:14:29', '2022-07-25 12:14:29'),
