  ('zcrm_1579374000098944003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670317', 'Teresa Fitzgerald', NULL, '7-25-2022:  Teresa called.  She''s stuggling w/details after the stroke.  It sounds like she got the need started for the hosp from her stroke, but she''s very confused.  She kept thinking she needed to sub the invoices to her HMA, but I tried to explain the diff & that it''s her healthshare company that will be sharing past the 1k IUA if it''s approved as a qualified ''medical need''.  I think I got her straightened out.  Showed & went over Jennifer''s 7/1 temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion.  Showed her how to upload additional documentation, and Zion''s ph #.  (She has been clear w/the hosp that she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt.)  Then trans her directly because she''s struggling to find her Zion memb #.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-25 10:41:06', '2022-07-25 10:41:06'),
