  ('zcrm_1579374000098905013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086318002', 'Zachary Weaver', NULL, '7.25.22 - Parham called because she had spoken with the MAP program on 5.26.22 (please see note below) and the MAP told her to take her son to the nearest facility that had openings and the MAP program would take care of the billing. Parham received a bill and it seems as though the MAP program paid nothing. I transferred Parham over to the MAP program since this is something that Parham and whomever she spoke to at the MAP program agreed upon. Parham would not take the MAP programs phone number from me. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-25 09:14:43', '2022-07-25 09:14:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098905008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095369001', 'Glenn Gross', NULL, '7.25.22 - Glenn called regarding his Planstin card that he recently received in the mail. He wasn''t sure if that was something he needed to keep and he just wanted to verify that it was a component of his plan. We also searched for his provider in the PHCS network and he was in-network: Dr. Steven Welish in Teaneck, NJ. Glenn was going to call his providers office and give them his Planstin information ahead of his visit. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-25 09:03:51', '2022-07-25 09:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098905003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093926001', 'Carolyn Haskin', NULL, '7.25.2022 - Carolyn called about her husband''s blood pressure medication refill. They cannot get in to see his PCP until January 2023 and she was wondering if CirrusMD may be able to help. I advised Carolyn that CirrusMD may be able to help temporarily with a refill. I sent both Carolyn and Robert CirrusMD password resets and they are going to give it a go with CirrusMD about his script refill. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-25 09:01:50', '2022-07-25 09:01:50'),
