  ('zcrm_1579374000098875008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '7.25.22 - Cynthia called with many questions about her new "insurance". We went over the PHCS network and how to present her Planstin card. I also sent her a welcome call scheduler so her and Scott can have their welcome call soon. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-25 07:50:48', '2022-07-25 07:50:48'),
