  ('zcrm_1579374000098846023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '7-22-2022:  Asiye called - she just received the Zion newsletter that mention ''prev care'' & is confused, does she have ''prev care''?  I let her know that''s not a part of her curr option, but we could look at that down the road.
     She''s from Turkey & has always gone back annually.  They offer an incredible ''prev pkg'' that''s everything for about $130.  However, with Covid & now everything else, she''s not sure if they will go back as often, hence her interest in adding/having ''prev'' here.
     She''s retired & does not curr have anyway to qual for Secure, but we discussed options.  Her US community is full of foreigners she thinks would be interested in MPB.Health.  If ''prev'' is of int, she may be able to become a ''referring advisor'' (or whatever it''s called).  I sugg she tt her advisor Stuart Lubline & setup her sending her referrals an e-mail w/Stuart''s contact info & Stuart cc''d.  But, she''ll want to sign the form so it works to qual her.
     I also mentioned: we are hearing the rumblings of a new MEC plan & I have not yet heard if it requires proof of self-empl.  She may call to ck on this Oct-ish.
     - Because she can get such cheap prices in Turkey, I mentioned if she ever needs surgery or something that would be covered by Zion, she could try for PRIOR approval to have it done as ''medical tourism'', but I wasn''t 100% sure of those detials, just it req prior appr.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-22 17:45:10', '2022-07-22 17:45:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098846018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095783002', 'Gregory Lilien', NULL, '7-22-2022:  Suzanne from Jane Kassel''s office called.  Robyn has a horrible sore throat &amp; wants to use the telehealth, but doesn''t know how.  I ck''d &amp; Robyn is already registered.  Went over the process w/Suzanne &amp; told her to have Robyn call the concierge line if she has issues getting into her acct.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-22 15:12:15', '2022-07-22 15:12:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098846013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, '7-22-2022:  Ilan called, he''s having trouble w/a severe infection under his gums on a tooth that had a root canal 30 years ago.  He wondered if it would be covered = depends on if they consider it dental or medical.  Sent him the temp to sub a ''medical need'' to Zion so they can determine if it''s shareable.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-22 15:10:12', '2022-07-22 15:10:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098804025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088967009', 'Jean Melenbrink', NULL, '7.22.2022 - Jean called with questions about going to a physical. She wanted to know if there was a network that we used that is cheaper than if she were to present as cash pay. I explained that with her plan, there is no network and she should get the best cash price for this visit. Jean just wanted to make sure she was on the right track and she was. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-22 13:59:39', '2022-07-22 13:59:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098836023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, '7-22-22 Erin Dreistadt is Althea Griffith''s mom. Althea is starting at Fort Lewis College in Durango and needs insurance to play sports by Aug. 25th. Patti and John have given us the thumbs up to do an Aug. 1st start date. They don''t have insurance and there''s no short-term options in CO and they can''t get on C4. They also want to add the rest of the family if this can qualify for other 21 yr old daughter''s school since she''s paying $500 for that daughter through school. Entire family will be $1000/$915 which is reasonable for family of 5. They are healthy. Althea just has sports induced asthma and has never been to hospital for it and not worried about it. Uses inhaler only occasionally.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-22 13:22:05', '2022-07-22 13:22:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098846008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075377002', 'Alan Thomas', NULL, '7-22-2022:  Alan called re: his aging into Medicare.  He couldn''t find Patti''s e-mail from 7/8/2022, so I cut &amp; paste it into my Outlook &amp; sent it from that system, which he did rec.  He will wait until after 8/1/2022 (which his wife says Patti told her), then sub the form.  Super nice guy!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-22 12:56:12', '2022-07-22 12:56:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098836018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083214', 'Jesse Chatham', NULL, '7-22-22 Patti spoke with Planstin and they will update Jesse''s account at tobacco user and charge $50 more per month as of 8/1/22.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-22 11:51:18', '2022-07-22 11:51:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098804020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, '7.22.2022 - Valerie called to see if dermatology is a covered preventative service. I explained that it is not, but if the appointment and any biopsies (depending on the biopsies) go over her $500 IUA, she would then lean on Sedera to pay for anything above her IUA amount. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-22 11:34:46', '2022-07-22 11:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098857013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098475010', 'Oscar Granados', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of August 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-22 11:22:56', '2022-07-22 11:22:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098857008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098493010', 'Ann Tucker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-22 11:18:55', '2022-07-22 11:18:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098857003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098605011', 'Matthew Walker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-22 11:13:41', '2022-07-22 11:13:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098846003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '7-22-2022:  Lauren from a providers office called to ask if Julia Ellis has active coverage.  I tried to explain that the Planstin she is calling about is ONLY for ''prev'', so please do not bill anything else thru Planstin as the pt is a ''cash-pay'' patient for everything else.  Explained we''ve had issues lately.  She says she knows all about Planstin &amp; Zion &amp; I gave her Planstin''s #.  Hopefully, they won''t bill anything but ''prev'' care thru Planstin.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-22 10:18:22', '2022-07-22 10:18:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098781018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083214', 'Jesse Chatham', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member needs to add the Tobacco Surcharge to his membership.  I contacted Planstin and they added that eff 8/1.   I will update in A123 and Charge member additional $50.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-22 10:15:27', '2022-07-22 10:15:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098836013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083214', 'Jesse Chatham', NULL, '7-22-22 Jesse emailed to let me now he''s back to tobacco user status, but not a lot. I sent him guidelines for when he turns 50 and encouraged him to quit by then and needs 1 year. He thanked me. We are not figuring out how to change his status. Patti''s calling Planstin to determine the process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-22 10:05:15', '2022-07-22 10:05:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098836008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '7-22-22 Figge called bc he says his payment didn''t go through in June. Talking with Patti now who thinks everything looks ok so far...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-22 10:01:46', '2022-07-22 10:01:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098813023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098610002', 'Kurt Wenrich', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-22 09:53:58', '2022-07-22 09:53:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098813018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098614002', 'Joseph Whitman', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-22 09:45:26', '2022-07-22 09:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098836003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '7-22-22 Karen called bc she has a thyroid issue and wanted to remember when the cap is lifted. She also just had an ER visit and I coached her how to handle that. She had given them her Redirect card. I told her to call them and tell them she''s cash pay. The card won''t help her. Pay her $1500 IUA and call Concierge Team to start the Needs process. I explained the rest of the process as well. I refreshed her memory about Redirect, Sedera and Life Care benefits and how each works. She feels better since she forgot how it all works. Her thyroid issue is a concern to her but she''s been paying on her own and sees an endocrinologist 2x per year and might need imaging. I told her Concierge Team can help with accessing that at fair price as well. She said they now have an independent imaging place in Glenwood outside of hospital to help with better pricing on that stuff. Seems confident and appreciative!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-22 09:41:24', '2022-07-22 09:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098813013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098615002', 'Tyler Hazen', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-22 09:38:56', '2022-07-22 09:38:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098804015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818009', 'Troy Conrad', NULL, '7.22.2022 - Carrie called in because she wanted to know what the procedure is to have a preventative colonoscopy. She had already scheduled her facility and physician  (Trinity Twin City Hospital), and I advised Carrie to call the providers office who is doing her colonoscopy to verify that they are in the PHCS network. I also told Carrie that she will need to give her Planstin card information for billing purposes for this preventative colonoscopy. I noticed that they have not had a welcome call yet, so I will also send a welcome call scheduler via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-22 09:37:10', '2022-07-22 09:37:10'),
