  ('zcrm_1579374000098739099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '7.22.2022 - Quentin called to ask what services are covered for his wellness visit. I explained that it is the 64+ preventative services listed on the healthcare.gov website and Quentin was going to check that out. He also asked what bloodwork was included and I explained that a Vitamin D and Lipid panels are included. He is going to check out the healthcare.gov website. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-22 07:26:12', '2022-07-22 07:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098744013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098775002', 'Mark Jones', NULL, '7/21/2022:  Mark found my e-mails finally in his spam fldr & LM on my office VM on the 20th he''s ready to go fwd, but the message came thru to my phone at 6:52am on the 21st.  I ck''d w/Patti & we can manually chg to an 8/1/2022 eff date if he signs up today.
     tt Mark & he will call me when he''s off, just past 5pm Mtn.  In tt Mark, he now has many questions he didn''t before.  but, it''s good.  He lives in WY (near the OR border).  His PCP is in OR.  We checked near him for in ntwk docs, hosp, Urg Care, anything that would be in ntwk for Planstin.  One doc comes up in the next town, but that''s it & not his PCP in OR.  He''s not curr concerned about the HSA and we don''t have a way to pay for out-of-ntwk doc visits yet, so he''s going w/Care+ for now, but Patti knows he may want to chg to Secure when the options open (Mark & I went over deadline for plan chg - call by the 15th so there''s time to do everything before the next draw date.  Sent Patti e-mail req to chg eff date to: 8/1/2022.
     Mark has no pre-x, no medications, single, self-empl, non-smoker.  His primary residence is WY & he pays his US taxes as a full time resident.  He will go back & forth to Mexico during winter months (but, it''s not a permanent thing) & varies now often/long he is gone.  We talked about what to do if something happens while he''s there & an emerg comes up (NO prev while in Mexico).  He''s trying to get the name of his friend who referred him, but I looked w/what he has & didn''t find anyone.  For now', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-22 00:01:15', '2022-07-22 00:02:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098744008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, 'I know I had other notes in here re: the Care Conn & his Zion care person, plus what the surgery was called, because I referred to it yesterday to get her name & the surgical terminology!  I have no idea where those notes have gone...

7-21-2022:  Called Rbt (Andy) to let him know my supervisor is working w/his ''need'' coordinator Rachel. at Zion.  Once the claim approved for his new surgery (again name of surgery was in those notes), our Care Connect group will work towards a pkg to see if we can get him a lower IUA, have everything pd so he rec''s no bills, etc.  
     While letting him know this, he told me he rec''d an e-mail from Zion about 1 h earlier saying it was approved.  I sent chat to Joan so she knows he''s rec''d approval.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-21 17:42:31', '2022-07-21 17:42:31'),
