  ('zcrm_1579374000098702057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095968002', 'Regina Piper', NULL, '7.21.2022 - Regina called because she was trying to submit her proof of DPC but the email that Vanessa sent was invalid. I reached out to Patti who explained that Zion is no longer requiring members to turn in their proof of DPC. I called the member to inform her of this change. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-21 12:39:07', '2022-07-21 12:39:07'),
