  ('zcrm_1579374000098744003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '7-21-22 Christopher called to learn more about the mental health benefits.  He''s looking for a psychiatrist to help him moving forward and he is told he might have ADHD. I explained the virtual healthcare has Behavioral Health Specialists that can help at some level and the Life Care has the 12 sessions with Masters level mental health counselors, not necessarily PHD or psychiatrists. He''s just happy to have the support and guidance from both of these sources to help him move forward with his needs. He also understands controlled substances and refrigerated meds are the toughest to source at a good price and he will have to pay for those on his own. He understands that Concerta or Vyvanse may be pricey. He''s all set for now and has his Welcome Call on Aug. 2nd. Super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-21 10:02:11', '2022-07-21 10:02:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098702021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074214057', 'Anthony Spohn', NULL, 'Members 8/22 Payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 7/21 7/21-Member called in and did not receive the email.  I directed him to the PU form on website.  He will update card. 7/25-2nd notice sent via email &amp; VM Member submitted updated CC I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-21 09:54:50', '2022-07-25 11:32:16'),
