  ('zcrm_1579374000098702003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090892002', 'Amy Morin', NULL, '7.21.2022 - Amy called in FRANTIC because she received bills from her mammogram. At the time of service, she had not received her Planstin card and just went to the appointment. Amy called in later to advise us of that situation. I had told Amy to call the billing department where she had her mammogram to see if they would be able to send her preventative mammogram and it''s components through Planstin. She told me that she did and continued to tell me that I needed to assist her because these bills are not her responsibility. I asked Amy if she verified if the facility, provider, and radiologist were all within the PHCS network and she stated yes. Amy would not let me continue with our conversation due to the fact that she continued to tell me that these bills are not her responsibility. I asked Amy to let me finish so that I could guide her in the right direction. I told Amy to call the facility again to verify that they did, in fact, bill her Planstin services for this mammogram. If they did, then I asked her to call us back here on the concierge line because we will then have to put her in contact with Planstin to find out why she is receiving a bill for this service. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-21 09:24:53', '2022-07-21 09:24:53'),
