  ('zcrm_1579374000098538067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, '7-20-2022:  Bob called to make sure I can see the new employees registration Jeffrey Degraaff (I''m not seeing it in Admin123), but let him know since it''s on a List Bill, there may be a delay? He says they have a confirmation from the registration today.  He''s going to call from CA after 6am his time tomorrow to confirm w/Patti or Karina.  He seemed panicked.  I let him know, esp w/the conf, they can confirm everything is set or help him - he really wants an 8/1/2022 eff date..     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-20 17:54:41', '2022-07-20 18:01:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098538062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098775002', 'Mark Jones', NULL, '7/19/2022:  Sent Mark my contact info with the video because he''s in the very beginning stages.

7/20/2022:  Mark didn''t rec my e-mail, so I resent it while we were on the phone together.  He''s going to call if he still doesn''t receive it.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-20 17:19:27', '2022-07-20 17:19:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098538057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, '7-20-2022:  Inga wondered about some bills she received - does she mean EOB? and patient resp?   The doc''s off billed Planstin automatically since they had it on file.  She doesn''t remember what she saw them for, but it was an illness visit she thought she''d be paying ''cash'' for when they billed her.  She''s decided she may separate and see one doc for her ''prev'' care and then she''ll see a doctor she''s hearing is wonderful for everything else.  She knows now to be super clear when to bill her ''prev care'' ins & when she is a ''cash-pay'' pt.  She was really nice about this considering the price is higher than she anticipated for a ''cash-pay'' visit.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-20 17:00:53', '2022-07-20 17:00:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098538052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974301', 'Gerardo Garcia', NULL, '7-20-2022:  Jessica needed to tt CirrusMD.  She was already registered &amp; when I got her to the site on her computer, she was set to connect.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-20 16:57:45', '2022-07-20 16:57:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098538047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068243106', 'Kimberly Bohler', NULL, '7-20-2022:  Kimberly called.  She started her business & knows no $ is coming in until Sept.  She called to cancel/deactivate/etc.  I went over that they''ve already processed this month''s contribution today & offered to have her leave Patti a VM since it''s after hours.  She decided since this mo is already done, she''s going to see what she can do on her end to make it thru.  IF she decides to move fwd w/cancellation, etc., she will call us back BEFORE 8/15/2022 so there is not another contribution pulled.  She may also call to tt Patti to see if there''s anything else that can be done.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-20 15:50:57', '2022-07-20 17:57:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098538042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, '7-20-2022:  Holly called.  Her oldest daughter (24 yrs old): Taylor, just found out she''s pregnant.  She had questions about how it works since Taylor has ins thru her Univ until Aug.  Told her other ins always primary, but since it ends shortly, the ''maternity need'' dept will walk her thru what to do.  Sent her the temp for starting a ''maternity need'' and went over all the details.  She sb ready to submit now. Reminded her to call us to add baby within 30-days of delivery.  Went over IUA and what happens if issue w/baby even in utero, they will go w/a 2nd IUA for the baby.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-20 15:39:45', '2022-07-20 15:39:45'),
