  ('zcrm_1579374000098571016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '7.20.2022 - Whitney called about a bill he just received from August 2021 that reflects a telephone visit hat his son, Spencer, had with his pediatrician. Whitney wanted to know if there was any way we could negotiate that bill down for him. I asked Whitney if he had called the pediatricians office to see if they offer a discounted cash pay rate since Spencer should have been presented as a cash pay patient and Whitney stated no. Whitney is going to call the pediatricians office to see if they offer a cash pay rate. I don''t believe that this bill was sent from Planstin as the services were rendered back in August 2021 and I have not heard of Planstin sending an EOB to a member almost 1 year after the appointment. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-20 14:19:48', '2022-07-20 14:19:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098571008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088967001', 'Kristen Victor', NULL, '7.20.2022 - Attempt #4 to do a Welcome Call with Kristen. Left a detailed message on voicemail and sent another email to reschedule at a more convenient day and time. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-20 13:32:14', '2022-07-20 13:36:36'),
