  ('zcrm_1579374000098574003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098468012', 'Steven Lichtenberg', NULL, 'I received email from advisor letting me know that this member does not qualify for the Secure membership as he is not a sole proprietor.  Wants to cancel his application.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel application', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-20 12:20:54', '2022-07-20 12:20:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098538021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098675002', 'Tony Costa', NULL, '7/20/2022:  Lauren''s husband contacted me.  He had questions about SECURE since he is self-emp.  Sent him info.  Reminded him about the deadline.  Also they live in FL, so OPD may be an option?  Trying to get him to discuss today.  Haven''t been able to go over pre-x, etc., yet!  Due to the deadline, I sent him Zion''s Memb &amp; Maternity Guideline and Principles even though we have not talked yet.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-20 12:17:03', '2022-07-20 12:35:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098571003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311063', 'Goldy Wareing', NULL, '7.20.2022 - Phoenix Genecology called to verify if Goldy''s visit was covered by her insurance. I transferred them over to Redirect since she is a Redirect member. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-20 12:12:09', '2022-07-20 12:12:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098549003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, 'Scott messaged on SalesIQ about some questions he has. Logging into the portals, and just how to use the plan and when he needs to see a doctor. He didn''t say anything about already being a member with us, but when I put his email into the CRM, it pulled this contact up. So, I sent him an email to schedule a Welcome Call, as he has not had one yet. I told him it goes over everything about his plan and how it all works. He has not had one yet and just started on July 1st. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-07-20 11:08:48', '2022-07-20 11:08:48'),
