  ('zcrm_1579374000098443033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091197001', 'Mira Adhikari', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-20 10:44:17', '2022-07-20 10:44:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098428053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078533002', 'Candy Rogers', NULL, '7.20.2022 - Candy called very confused about her plan and how to use it. She had bariatric surgery 5 years ago and is now having difficulties. Candy mentioned how she has paid over $2,000 of her "deductible" and is wondering when Medishare kicks in for the rest of the payments. She also stated that she has put her dental bills towards her "deductible", to which I explained that unless it was part of an open Need that dental does not count towards her IUA (to which she asked what an IUA was). As I was trying to explain what an IUA was and how they work, GoTo hung up on us. I called Candy back and as we were continuing our conversation, GoTo hung up on us again. GoTo would not allow me to call Candy back and as I was trying to figure out the system issue, Candy called back and GoTo would not allow me to answer her call. I spoke with Joan Phelps about this phone issue, I sent Candy an email asking her to call me back at her earliest convenience, and also reached out to Zach Master''s about this member. Zach stated that he  has spoken with Candy several times and explained her plan, so has Patti, and she doesn''t seem to understand this at all. Zach advised that if Candy does call back to transfer Candy over to him so he can speak to her about cancelling since she is not a good fit for this plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-20 10:30:57', '2022-07-20 10:30:57'),
