  ('zcrm_1579374000098401083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '7.20.2022 - David called because he received a bill from Planstin regarding his bloodwork. I advised David that if it was anything outside of the Lipid and Vitamin D panels, it would be an out of pocket expense to him. He wanted to speak with Planstin directly so I transferred him over. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-20 08:51:59', '2022-07-20 08:51:59'),
