  ('zcrm_1579374000098401068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '7.20.2022 - Jerry called because they found a mass during his wife''s screening mammogram and they want to schedule her for a biopsy. Jerry wanted to make sure that he was going to start things off correctly by opening a Need with Zion. I sent him the information on how to open a Need and advised Jerry to call the MPB.Health concierge team if he needs any assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-20 07:45:00', '2022-07-20 07:45:00'),
