  ('zcrm_1579374000098466044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089798002', 'Kyle Hartung', NULL, '7-19-2022:  Documenting late in the day:  Sent her the temp to sub a ''medical need''.  Went thru details, but cannot remember specifics.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-19 18:48:21', '2022-07-19 18:48:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098466039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, '7-19-2022:  Danielle called for instructions on ''prev'' Well Woman visits for herself &amp; her daughter.  We pulled up her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail &amp; I showed her how to find available Ob-gyn docs in her area thru the search tool (it''s a guide, alway conf) and to find healthcare.gov.  Her daughter won''t qualify for a pap on Planstin ''prev'' until she''s 21, so she''ll make the appt past her Sept b-day.  She''ll call if she needs further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-19 18:45:59', '2022-07-19 18:45:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098466034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '7/19/2022:  Robin orig thought this would be a good option for both herself and her husband, but he''s curr looking at wrist surgery in the next 6mos &amp; will age into Medicare w/in 2 yrs.  Now she''s looking just for herself.  We went over some of the basics &amp; I sent her my video, the Memb &amp; Maternity Guidelines &amp; Principles.  We are planning to talk tomorrow, but she''s concerned the push for the monthly deadline may be too much.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-19 18:29:51', '2022-07-19 18:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098466029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, '7-19-2022:  Bob called re: new employee trying to register on his site.  He says they are paying via List Bill, so I helped him find that in the pymt selections, but he asked about the fees.  I haven''t worked w/the fees lately, but told him I believe they are different for List Bill members.  He will call tomorrow &amp; ask for Karina in Accting to get the correct answer since they are already gone today.  He realizes tomorrow is the deadline &amp; hence will make sure they call early in the day.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-19 17:25:13', '2022-07-19 17:25:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098462008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098951004', 'Sam Simonds', NULL, '7-19-22 Sandy Simonds is mom''s friend from college. Sandy''s helping her son, Sam research ins options. Sam had a bad reaction to the covid vax which gave him pudendal neuralgia in 2020. He might still be taking a medication. He had many visits which was very expensive to deal with the problem. He hasn''t seen a Dr. for the past 6 months or so, but may still have meds. So, MCS not a good option now. DOB 5/7/81. We''re looking at Bright Health $0 ded or Friday  if his drs. accept their networks. Sam is no longer working for Vail Resorts as of June 2022 and he has to accept or reject Cobra by end of July or backpay for coverage. So, he needs Aug. 1st start and has to show proof of SEP in June. Zip is 80424.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-19 17:04:27', '2022-07-19 17:04:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098466021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356826', 'Jennifer Woomer', NULL, '7-19-2022:  Jennifer called super frustrated that her hip replacement billing office(s) keep calling her.  Then she stated she was forced to pay her $3000 ded up front ... to which I asked if she presented her Planstin card & she said yes, "it''s the only card I have".  I let her know Planstin is purely ''prev'' care - nothing else.  That her healthshare component Zion would be the company to work with.  That''s when she told me they had dedied the claim because it was osteoarthritis.  However per their curr guidelines, it may be pre-x, but still has the phase in period.  When we got off the phone she was calling Zion''s ''Need'' Dept.
     - After we got off the phone, I looked up arthritis in the curr Memb Guidelines.  If nothing else, as long as this was after her 11-1-2021 anniversary date, she should have $25k possibly available for sharing.  I called & told her I was following-up.  Went over 2nd yr of memb & w/the phase in period she may have at least 25k help.  Told her to call us if she still has questions.:
     "4. Arthritis Treatment
            Degenerative and arthritic conditions are considered pre-membership medical 
            conditions and may be shareable beginning in the second year of membership. Any 
            treatment costs, including but not limited to joint injections, physical therapy, and 
            chiropractic manipulations, are subject to the pre-membership medical condition 
            phase-in period."  and
     "21. Joint Replacement Treatment
            Beginning in the second year of membership, joint replacement treatment and 
            surgery for degenerative arthritic conditions may be shareable. See “Arthritis 
            Treatments” for more information."     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-19 16:29:32', '2022-07-19 16:34:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098438043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '7.19.2022 - Cynthia needed in-network providers for her screening colonoscopy. I found Dr. Stephan W. Coffman, M.D. who is located in the Providence Hood River Memorial Hospital, both are within the PHCS network. I advised Cynthia that she does need to ask the physicians staff about a PHCS in-network anesthesiologist. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-19 15:08:51', '2022-07-19 15:08:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098438038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924354', 'Darrin Hallman', NULL, '7.19.2022 - Darrin called for his MPB.Health portal information and wanted to request a new RCI card since his have expired. I transferred Darrin to RCI so he could access that information. He also asked for the following script quote but I am currently waiting on Reid to get back to me: Mounjaro 2.5mg/.5ml 4 pens. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-19 15:05:46', '2022-07-19 15:05:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098475002', 'Jennifer Corson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 14:52:02', '2022-07-19 14:52:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098438033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967035', 'Margaret Randolph', NULL, '7.19.2022 - Jennifer spoke with Kimber from the Zion medical advocacy team since the regular Zion concierge team didn''t have anyone available to speak with her about this situation. Zion will pay up to $5,000 for a preventative colonoscopy. Margaret can see any provider of her choosing, and she can arrange for prepayment with Zion by calling the medical advocacy team prior to her procedure at 1-888-399-0017. Now, she can call the Zion advocacy team if she needs assistance finding a provider for her colonoscopy and for negotiations for the colonoscopy to be $5,000 or below.', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-19 14:25:21', '2022-07-19 14:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081135010', 'Quentyn Luna', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add spouse to membership.  I will let Planstin know and adjust billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 14:23:30', '2022-07-19 14:23:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I mesgd Wendy and she was aware that member was considering canceling.  Ok to cancel.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 14:12:23', '2022-07-19 14:12:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098470001', 'Jen Coggin', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 14:08:51', '2022-07-19 14:08:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098469001', 'Gretchen Denner Adams', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 14:06:41', '2022-07-19 14:06:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098468012', 'Steven Lichtenberg', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 14:03:20', '2022-07-19 14:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098466008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967035', 'Margaret Randolph', NULL, '7-19-2022:  Margaret called re:  a colonoscopy.  Dbl ck''d, this is truly Direct & Patti rem''d the listing that said her plan incl Planstin which was incorrect.
     - A friend told her to try Dr Jain @ Rocky Mtn Gasto in Denver.  Dr. Jain is listed as high priced in HCBB & there is a cap for this ''prev'' item (see below).
     - Tried calling her once I was sure this was purely Direct & LM asking her to call us for instructions. 
     - See Wendy''s 11/3/2020 note that says the DPC offers discounts on services.  Maybe this would be one that  her DPC has a relationship with?     - CA

Margaret called back.  Jennifer tt Zion''s Advocacy Team & I relayed this info.  This is the Direct Plan w/Zion that includes certain ''prev'' care::
     - Per Jennifer: "I spoke with Kimber from the Zion medical advocacy team since the regular Zion concierge team didn''t have anyone available to speak with me about this situation. Zion will pay up to $5,000 for a preventative colonoscopy. Margaret can see any provider of her choosing, and she can arrange for prepayment with Zion by calling the medical advocacy team prior to her procedure at 1-888-399-0017. Now, she can call the Zion advocacy team if she needs assistance finding a provider for her colonoscopy and for negotiations for the colonoscopy to be $5,000 or below."
        Margaret is going to ck w/her DPC to see if they have a relationship w/a doc who offers special pricing.  I let her know Dr. Jain is considered high priced, so she wants to be careful due to the 5k cap.  Gave her the Advocacy Team # so she can see if they can setup pymt and maybe keep it below the cap.  She know if it goes above that extra is her resp.
        - Then she asked about mammograms.  Told her basically the same procedure, but I do know in Denver during Breast Cancer Awareness month (she says that''s Oct), there''s a site in Cherry Creek area (I think) that offers $99 mammograms.  But, she could also use the ''prev'' care in her Direct Zion plan.  To make sure both imaging cntr & people who read the films are in ntwk.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-19 13:51:31', '2022-07-19 18:49:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098438028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095870002', 'Anthony Lopez', NULL, '7.19.2022 - Attempted to call Anthony back to go over the information he was given from the NHP team regarding his child''s immunizations. Anthony has Planstin for his MEC, as long as his child''s physician is in the PHCS network, any immunizations that are listed on the healthcare.gov website are covered. Hopefully Anthony will call back so that I may go over this information with him correctly. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-19 13:30:16', '2022-07-19 13:30:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098443013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '7/19/2022: Cynthia called asking to schedule an appointment for a colonoscopy and a prescription for a burn cream. I offered her a call back, because I wasn''t sure if she needed a prescription for a burn cream. She told me that she went to the pharmacy and they told her that it''s not over the counter, so, I advised to download  Cirrus MD. When it comes to the colonoscopy I offered a call back. She understood. - Marginne Téllez.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-07-19 12:58:20', '2022-07-19 12:58:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098443008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095870002', 'Anthony Lopez', NULL, '7/19/2022: Anthony called asking  if he needs to spend his IUA to get his sons 
vaccinated.  I explained him that immunizations are share up to 18 years old. He also asked for a list of clinics in his area where he can get them at a fair price. I sent an email an email with the list of immunizations that I shared with his plan  and I told him that he will get a separate email with the prices and locations for immunization. - Marginne Tellez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-07-19 12:54:17', '2022-07-19 12:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961149', 'Michael Balser', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 12:30:24', '2022-07-19 12:30:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098456013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961149', 'Michael Balser', NULL, 'Michael messaged on SalesIQ just now Tuesday 7/19/22 at 2:15pm Est, to ask to cancel his membership. I spoke with Patti about this due to him being on a House Account with no specific Advisor here. She stated that I can just send him the cancellation form. I sent it to Michael and let him know the deadline is the 20th of the month, which is tomorrow, so if he could please submit the cancellation form asap, by today is possible to not bill him any further. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-07-19 12:20:30', '2022-07-19 12:20:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098438023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361667', 'Deborah Caulfield', NULL, '7.19.2022 - Debbie called because she went to use her teledoc services and was unable to do so. I explained that she has new teledoc services along with mental health services and sent her the invitation for CirrusMD and the information to the MAP program. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-19 12:18:00', '2022-07-19 12:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098461002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961149', 'Michael Balser', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2061 Question : I''m looking to find out how to cancel my account', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-07-19 12:13:08', '2022-07-19 12:13:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098466003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '7-19-2022:  A call from the (541) 399-5895 came in during our concierge meeting.  Tried calling her back within 1 minute &amp; had to LM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-19 12:12:31', '2022-07-19 12:12:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091954002', 'Karina Baldelamar', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 11:47:09', '2022-07-19 11:47:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098438013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089999002', 'Sean Covel', NULL, '7.19.2022 - Sean called in with questions regarding the fact that he had his yearly wellness check done in Colorado recently, but moved to South Dakota and wanted to have a second yearly wellness check done. I advised Sean that this would be an out of pocket expense to him since he has had his one yearly wellness check done. Sean then said that he would be ok with that and would put it towards his yearly "deductible". I advised Sean that unless the bill from this visit is over his $1,000 IUA amount, that it would not be shareable within the Zion Health community. I don''t believe Sean is very sure about how his plan works, but hopefully we will get him situated. I am sending him a list of in-network providers (even though he does not need to worry about a network since this is an out of pocket expense to him) in the zip code of 57701 and 57732. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-19 11:45:24', '2022-07-19 11:45:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098462003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098457001', 'Celeste Styles', NULL, '7-19-22 Celeste is choosing traditional ins over MCS. The RMHP are the better value in her circumstances. She chose Rocky Mountain Valley Gold $5 Primary Care RX Copay
HMO/Gold for $382.37, $2500 Ded/$8550 MOP.  I told her to call C4 to request Aug. 1st start date and gave her the #. I also told her she Must call RMHP/UHC to submit her payment and set up ongoing pmt or her plan will Not be effectuated. I told her to call on Friday and if that''s too early to try again next week. She agreed. She''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-19 11:36:25', '2022-07-19 11:36:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098456003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091954002', 'Karina Baldelamar', NULL, 'Karina messaged me on SalesIQ just now Tues 7/19/22 at 1pm EST, and she is requesting to cancel due to a better carrier and plan that they found. Karina does not have a specific advisor here so Patti told me I can just send her the cancellation form directly. I let Karina know that today is the last day to do so as the 20th Deadline is tomorrow. Karina said she will fill is out ASAP right when she gets it and will submit it then and there. As stated, Patti knows and will be keeping an eye out for it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-07-19 11:09:41', '2022-07-19 11:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098428048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092951002', 'Scott Ewing', NULL, 'Both phone numbers are either disconnected, changed or out of service. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-19 11:09:13', '2022-07-19 11:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098401023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', NULL, 'Member was in contact with RCI to update her payment information.  I responded to Robin Fuller letting her know to send any of our members to me to update this.  I sent out link to this member and I will reach out to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 10:45:54', '2022-07-19 10:45:54'),
