  ('zcrm_1579374000098428013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095061002', 'Alana Helapitage', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-19 10:01:17', '2022-07-19 10:01:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098438008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630187', 'Paula Amicarelli', NULL, '7.19.2022 - Paula called because she was diagnosed with sleep apnea and wanted to know which in-network doctor she should go to for this issue. She has already had the test done, but needed to get the equipment and wanted to know how it would be shareable. I let Paula know that Zion Health does not share in CPAP equipment and sleep apnea testing. I explained the self-pay process to Paula but I am also looking to see if I can find anything to help with the cost of the equipment. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-19 09:40:43', '2022-07-19 09:40:43'),
