  ('zcrm_1579374000098401013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097895009', 'Hanna Levi', NULL, 'After Jane had a meeting with this member she emailed me that she wanted to be cancelled as if she never enrolled.  I will notify Planstin and cancel her in A123.  Also will refund her Enrollment Fee', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-19 08:19:46', '2022-07-19 08:19:46'),
