  ('zcrm_1579374000098294033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', NULL, '7.18.2022 - James called because he would like to go see someone regarding his shoulder. I explained the self-pay process but James seemed very hesitant and said he thought he had a network to abide by. He then let me know that he has been calling Zion Health for lists of in-network doctors and he has been communicating back and forth with Zion regarding this issue. I advised James to always call the MPB.health concierge team when he has questions since we are the brokers for his plan. James insists that this is a very confusing insurance, I explained that this is not insurance and that I know that it can be quite overwhelming when navigating the plans. I advised him to call the MPB.Health concierge team ANY time he has a question or concern. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-18 14:05:36', '2022-07-18 14:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098294028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026291119', 'Lesley Erb', NULL, '7.18.22 - Lesley called because she tried to use her telehealth and it was not working. I informed Lesley that we started our older plan members on CirrusMD recently. I sent her the invitation to get started with CirrusMD so that she could speak with them today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-18 14:04:42', '2022-07-18 14:04:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098342008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, '7-18-22 David and Angie are re-enrolling. Their employees left so they are back to just the two of them. They got rid of their traditional insurance and want SECURE again at $1000 IUA.  Other company called Bleeker dissolved and the former leads need to dig themselves out of a hole. So, David and Angie are scrambling to get their world back in order. He may refer more former Bleeker employees to me. He and Angie were planning to go to the Amalfie Coast, Dolomites, etc. for wedding and work. Now they will still go, just purely for fun!  They are making a crappy situation into an incredible one and will persist with their own company again. David successfully re-enrolled for Aug. 1st start, SECURE $1000/$625 ES. David had a shoulder injury this year with regular insurance. He believes it''s well healed and doesn''t expect any further visits. I repeated the pre-x clause and he said he understands. His wife takes some sort of statin like drug for cholesterol and hasn''t been to hospital for it in past year and it''s well managed. That''s it for pre-x. He let me know Matt Ross is  a realtor now after leaving the mortgage industry during covid when business slowed down a bunch.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-18 13:54:59', '2022-07-18 14:01:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098294023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086456001', 'Nancy Kubas', NULL, '7.18.22 - Nancy called to cancel; I sent Karen a message via Teams since Nancy could not get a hold of her on her own prior to calling the concierge team. Karen will be reaching out to Nancy today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-18 13:43:18', '2022-07-18 13:43:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098333016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '7-18-2022:  Jennifer called to get RX quote.  I found a great price for her locally:
     - Ipratropium Bromide Nasal Spray  21mcg, 30ml canister x #2 units = $30.72 at Rite Aid thru RXGo.  There were cheaper pharmacies, but they were not convenient &amp; it was only about a $5 diff, so she chose this coupon.  [on her old Express Scrips thru BCBS, she was paying $79.50 for the same amt]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-18 13:30:56', '2022-07-18 13:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098273063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608754', 'Dana Schwartz Watts', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request after being in contact with Jane.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-18 13:16:22', '2022-07-18 13:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098273058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request after speaking with Jane, now has "free coverage" thru AZ.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-18 12:21:21', '2022-07-18 12:21:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098294018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081349010', 'Deepak Maragal', NULL, '7.18.22 - Deepak called with various questions regarding Tivity (sent him the email) and his log-in information for the MPB.Health member portal (also emailed to him). ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-18 11:43:16', '2022-07-18 11:43:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098333008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082047009', 'Marianne Leman', NULL, '7-18-2022:  Karen Torsoe called.  Marianne is having a shoulder incident declined as pre-x, but according to Karen it''s not.  We have no record Marianne ever called us on her shoulder, so Karen thinks she went straight to Zion.  When I mentioned the doctor''s records must be showing something prior to her eff date if they are declining as pre-x, Karen has no idea.
     - Karen wants us to advocate for Marianne, but we have nothing to work with, so she asked me to call Marianne since Marianne has never called us even though Karen has told her to call the concierge line.
     - ILM for Marianne to please call us here on the concierge line.
     - Karen also mentioned Marianne''s husband needs to have and endoscopy for his severe heartburn.  We talked ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA, sub a ''medical need'', and Karen says they make almost nothing so maybe ''Bill Eraser''.
     - Marianne was a part of Liberty before.  These members do not seem to understand to start w/the concierge and often think they know all they should about healthshare, not realizing the diff companies handle things in diff manners.  She did have her ''Welcome Call'' w/Vanessa at least.     - CA

Marianne called.  She says she''s most concerned about her husband''s situation.  Heartburn disrupting his sleep.  Doctor wants to do endoscopy & she wondered how to handle.  We discussed having the endoscopy as a ''cash-pay'' pt & then starting a ''medical need'', but this procedure alone is 5k.  The appt is sched for Wed this week!  We discussed pushing that a bit so we can get a ''need'' going with Zion to see if they can help pay for the balance.  She decided she''s going to call & ask if they offer a ''cash-pay'' discount, then go from there.  
     Karen Torsoe asked me to discuss "Bill Eraser" w/Marianne as well, which I offered up, but told her we probably cannot have done as soon as their appt.  She understands & will get back to us.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-18 11:21:03', '2022-07-18 17:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098333003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670004', 'Holly Hill', NULL, '7-18-2022:  Holly called - we went over a lot.  We left it, she''ll call back, because I doubt she absorded everything in this call:
     - She''s having TMJ issues & is going to see a TMJ specialist.  Unsure of actual first symptom. Knows may be dental, orthodontic, or medical depending on type of TMJ, only Zion can determine.  Will call to have us walk thru how to sub ''medical need'' after first appt (= telehealth appt) which she will pay for.  
        At least she''s already in yr 2 of her memb so she''s at 25k healthsharing.  We disc 3, 4th & beyond amts too.
     - Wanted to know how to get reimb on her annual.  We went over everything Planstin.  She doesn''t know where her card is.  I req''d a new pdf copy to holly303hill@gmail.com.
        [She''s traveling between Bozman & Boulder w/a lot of time in Bozman (her father just passed), so I did not req a hard copy at this time.  She may actually have one in her mail in Bldr when she gets home since new cards were sent recently.]
        Went over everything Planstin.  Her PA:  Jennifer Mooney is showing in the PHCS network.  She''ll get them the pdf copy & ask them to bill the appt.  We disc ''prev'' vs diagnostic/treatment, everything being in ntwk, how to handle labs PA wants her to have = bill certain items to Planstin, ''cash-pay'' others.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-18 11:04:24', '2022-07-18 11:04:24'),
