  ('zcrm_1579374000098294013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '7.18.22 - David called because he has been paying bills from a procedure done last year that was scheduled by Redirect health. He has called in to Redirect several times with questions as to why he is receiving bills (he is also paying these bills as they come in) and has yet to receive a call back from a member services rep from Redirect. He is having a colonoscopy done soon and wants to make sure that Redirect will pay the bills. I advised David that Redirect is supposed to schedule his colonoscopy for him, and that''s when he proceeded to tell me again that he has reached out to Redirect several times without any response. I sent in a form via the Redirect website in hopes that they will contact David ASAP. I asked David to call us back at around 3 PM his time (CO time) if he has not heard from Redirect. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-18 10:47:32', '2022-07-18 10:47:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098294008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057253057', 'Tobin Ortenblad', NULL, '7.18.22 - Tobin called because he had an ER visit back in May and is now receiving the bills. Tobin did his due diligence and made sure that he received the cash pay price from all services rendered during his ER visit, the bills went from over $11k to just over $6500; He will pay his IUA amount and submit the rest to Zion for sharing today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-18 10:44:44', '2022-07-18 10:44:44'),
