  ('zcrm_1579374000098294003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967002', 'Vickie Jan Felan', NULL, '7.18.22 - Vickie called because she did not want to participate in a Zoom call for her Welcome call. I explained to Vickie that it is not a Zoom call, but rather a call to the phone number she provider. Vickie was happy because "she doesn''t want to put any more money into Bill Gates'' pocket". ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-18 09:21:32', '2022-07-18 09:21:32'),
