  ('zcrm_1579374000098232031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, '7-15-2022:  Heard from Planstin, saying it''s fraudulent to remove from the "ins" since it was billed already.  My only issue w/that is that the patient did NOT authorize billing the insurance since he knows his ''prev'' does NOT cov this last virtual appt.  I''d think a pt has to auth the billing, but apparently not.
     - ILM for Robert (maybe he goes by Andy?) to please call us.  Need to coach him on how to handle this from now on.  
     - Sugg he go ahead & pay the bill at the ntwk price, because I don''t see them changing their minds.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-15 17:26:33', '2022-07-15 17:26:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098232026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085759046', 'James Brown', NULL, '7-15-2022:  James called.  He got the the pharmacy & his Benazepril HCL coupon did not match the Benazepril/HCTZ prescription so he ended-up paying Walmart''s retail of $42.99.  I tried finding a coupon at Walmart for the combination drug, but at Walmart the best I can do is save him ~$2, $2.50, so he decided not to worry about a coupon this time.
     When he first got home, he called & wasn''t sure what had happened.  After much conv & his waiting on hold for his doc''s off, just to hang-up & call me back, he got his old RX bottle & sees the HCTZ now.  I mentioned that''s why we like to have them fill out the req form so they can see it written out & confirm it is the same as the bottle (we''ll see if that helps for next time).
     This may chg again because they are monitoring his levels.  But, at least today we could have gotten him the RX for as much as $20 less had we realized the corr drug.  I did NOT tell him that, but did let him know the pharmacies are always competing and it could chg between now & his refill.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-15 16:05:01', '2022-07-15 16:05:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098199049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079147423', 'Michael Stocker', NULL, '7.15.2022 - Welcome Call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-15 14:54:47', '2022-07-15 14:54:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098232013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, '7-15-2022:  Sherry was at Walgreen''s to get her COVID vaccine & they wanted her ins info.  I explained she is a ''cash-pay'' pt and her ''prev'' MEC does not include the COVID items.  Let her know I verified:
       Called Planstin & verified w/Karen:  Since our plan does not include OptumRX, the COVID vaccine is NOT included.  Also, any covered vaccines must be thru an in ntwk MD''s office for coverage.
     - Ck''d online, the Walgreen''s on 30th in Bldr is listed as a free Covid vaccine & booster location on the CDC site.  I let her know that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-15 14:48:42', '2022-07-15 15:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098199044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965002', 'Robert Houvener', NULL, '7.15.2022 - Called Robert to do his scheduled Welcome Call but unfortunately he had to reschedule for Monday at 8 AM due to an issue coming up. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-15 13:35:48', '2022-07-15 13:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098214023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063644001', 'Carlos Galvin', NULL, 'Received email forwarded from Karina originally sent to the Concierge wanting to cancel his membership.  I told him that he would have to speak with Misty.  I also advised him of the deadline.  He also asked about pricing if he were to remove his children from the membership.  He might do that.  He will let us know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-15 12:58:44', '2022-07-15 12:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098232008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401050', 'Sheila West', NULL, '7-15-2022:  Sheila called to verify how to not have her $ drawn when she goes onto Medicare 9/1/2022.  She was able to find the e-mail Patti sent &amp; will complete the cancellation form after 8/1, but BEFORE 8/20 &amp; submit it.  I reminded her Medicare doesn''t always pay for everything &amp; her advisor Wendy Scipione can go over some options we have to partner w/Medicare.  She''s aware and will look into that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-15 12:53:05', '2022-07-15 12:53:05'),
