  ('zcrm_1579374000098232003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063952012', 'Donald Schoonover', NULL, '7-152022:  Donald called to get his Zion memb #.  I gave him Zion''s ph #, then trans him there directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-15 10:10:37', '2022-07-15 10:10:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098199039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063952012', 'Donald Schoonover', NULL, '7.15.2022 - Donald called because he is having a colonoscopy done soon. He called to ask what the procedure for payment would be for his colonoscopy. I explained the self-pay process, ask for the best cash price, which he did all of this and it went from $11k to $4,800 for the best cash price. Donald wanted to know if he should pay for the whole procedure out of pocket and then get reimbursed, I warm transferred him to Zion so that he could get their preference for payment. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-15 09:59:57', '2022-07-15 09:59:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098199031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119002', 'Azeem Tajani', NULL, '7.15.2022 - Alice called with a script: Cabergoline .5 mg 1/2 tab 2x''s a week. I sent her the coupon that is attached to this note for Costco. I advised Alice that if it is a different amount of tabs to just let me know and I will see what I can find for her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-15 09:31:46', '2022-07-15 09:31:46'),
