  ('zcrm_1579374000098199008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '7.15.2022 - Robin called because she wanted a list of gastroenterologists and mammograms in her area. I sent her both via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-15 08:14:20', '2022-07-15 08:14:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098199003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042343089', 'Carrie Stephens', NULL, '7.15.2022 - Carrie called to receive her MPB.Health member portal log-in information. I sent it to her via email from Admin123. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-15 08:12:57', '2022-07-15 08:12:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098195003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695318', 'Regina Mailloux Jensen', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Wendy.  I will notify Sedera  and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-15 08:01:26', '2022-07-15 08:33:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098166039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '7-14-2022:  Dave had his annual ''prev'' appt yesterday.  He''s needs to get his Shingles shot &amp; wondered how he does that.  We disc making sure he uses an in ntwk MD &amp; presents his Planstin card.  I sugg he could call Planstin to see if they''ll pay for a Safeway vaccine.  His Dr Stanley Jack is curr showing on the PHCS search in Bldr.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-14 18:08:55', '2022-07-14 18:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098166034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '7-14-2022:  Corinne called, she''s wanting to find out if a pain mgmt doc is in ntwk.  I went over ''prev'' only time need to worry about ntwk.  Dr John Ward not listed in HCBB.  Then we discussed ''cash-pay'', asking for a discount, &amp; this is probably pre-x because of when it started.  Got interupted, so I called back &amp; LM re: IF pre-x, step-up from Yr 1 = waiting period ... all the way to Yrs 4 &amp; beyond in case this continues.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-14 17:19:38', '2022-07-14 17:19:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098166026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, '7-14-2022:  Lafi & I worked together to go over:
     - PHCS Prov Search for his kids.  
     - Healthcare.gov ''prev'' for his kids (he says it shows ADD screenings included) in ''prev'' - we looked for pediatricians.  (I didn''t stop to check during our call, so hopefully he''s seeing this accurately).
     - Ck''d HCBB for a doctor he''s int in (& that shows on the PHCS Search):  Karim, Naheed, M.D. [no listing in HCBB]
     - Got him to MAP Site & gave him Assistance 1-800 # (that doesn''t always show for some people), but he doesn''t think this is what he''s looking for right now.
     - He''s doing a great job of using the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail as a reference & just needed to walk thru some of it together.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-14 17:15:27', '2022-07-14 17:18:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098166018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097895009', 'Hanna Levi', NULL, '7-14-2022:  Hanna called.  She says the agent rushed her into signing-up and now she''s realized she doesn''t want to leave her old ins.  She tried calling Jane Kassel''s office, but Jane is gone until next week.  Hanna is worried because we are so close to the draw date.  Since she''s already tried Jane''s office, I sent a chat to Patti to call Hanna tomorrow.  I have NOT sent the cancellation form yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-14 16:58:30', '2022-07-14 16:58:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098166013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079594002', 'Swati Patel', NULL, '7-14-2022:  Swati needed a list of in ntwk labs near her.  The doc''s off was sugg their in office/hosp lab.  I sent her the list of local labs &amp; went over the 2 cov test and to ask for ''cash-pay'' disc on anything else.  I think she understood, but there may be a language challenge?  It seemed like she understood.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-14 16:36:00', '2022-07-14 16:36:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098169003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096696002', 'Ryan Hafich', NULL, '07.14.22:  Recvd. an email from Ryan asking about his member portal access and how to go about setting up a Welcome Call.  I called him and asked if he received his MPB membership card and he said yes, in a packet of information which he hasn''t yet read through but will.  I told him he could schedule a Welcome Call with a link I would send him or he could call the Concierge to schedule it.  I emailed him the link and the Concierge phone number.  He responded with a thank you and said he appreciated all my help.  He asked it the Welcome Call was required or a recommendation.  I told him it wasn''t actually required, but very highly recommended if he wants to get the most out of his membership services. So he said he''d do it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-07-14 14:53:47', '2022-07-14 14:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098166008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031672389', 'Scott Schemel', NULL, '7-14-2022:  Scott''s son had an ER visit back in March & he was shocked because he just rec''d RCI''s denial of the claim.
     - We did education on RCI = ''prev'' only.  An ER visit = healthshare component.
    - I sent him the temp showing how to sub a ''need'' w/Sedera.  He was concerned he may not remember how to get into his account because his last ''need/ was a while ago.   I pointed out Sedera''s ph # is in the e-mail & they can help him if he has issues.  Plus, they will assign him a ''Needs Coordinator'' to help him thru everything.  He''s going to do it right away since at this point, it''s been a while since the incident.  He''s going to call the provider & let them know he didn''t realize he''s a ''cash-pay'' pt & the card he gave them has nothing to do with this type of issue to see if he can get a discount.  Then he''ll pay the $500 IUA & include the pymt receipt once he sub the ''need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-14 14:49:25', '2022-07-14 17:10:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098166003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153577', 'Joshua Weeks', NULL, '7-14-2022:  Josh was trying to get into his portal.  I was able to help him get in.  [He was using an old portal for prospective advisors.]  He''s all set now though.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-14 13:42:37', '2022-07-14 13:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098151016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413228', 'Michael Christenberry', NULL, '7-14-22 Mike wants to add his daughter Grace to his plan. Grace is losing ins from employer. Her income is about $10K. But, Grace is tax dependent of his ex-wife but lives with Mike. System is asking for ex''s income and she definitely won''t give that to him. I couldn''t connect us to C4 so I asked him to call C4 to have them help with this issue and to let me know if he has any further problems. He was frustrated with their terrible system, needless to say. It just wanted more and more information and wouldn''t let him complete the process.
UPDATE - I called him back to see if he had success with calling C4 and he hasn''t called them yet. He had to get back to work. I asked him to let me know if/when they add his daughter to his plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-14 13:36:03', '2022-07-14 15:07:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098151011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '7-14-22 Kristen Lassalette wants to add MEC for wellness visits when it''s ready with the RPB pricing. She also asked if there are other options. I remembered that maybe she could be put onto DIRECT even without DPC but that might not help bc of the 6 month wait for wellness. Left vm for Rod. Made note to contact Kristen in Aug for hopefully MEC to start Sept. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-14 13:33:32', '2022-07-14 13:33:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098153044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, 'Member Called from (970) 948-7206&nbsp;requesting a prescription quote and labwork location I sent an email with the information needed. Gabriel Nuñez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-07-14 13:21:24', '2022-07-14 13:21:24'),
