  ('zcrm_1579374000098151003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098457001', 'Celeste Styles', NULL, '7-14-22 Celeste works for a family restaurant group in Steamboat and makes about $42K per year, but with some deductions shows $35K on her C4 app. The C4 system isn''t giving her an immediate response likely bc her W2 job might offer benefits. She has to find out. She''s not aware of any. We reviewed the C4 plans at full price and they are $300+ for super crappy bronze plans with $8700 ded and mop. I also explained SECURE and CARE+ to her until I realized she doesn''t currently qualify for SECURE due to W2 employment and no side biz.  She is healthy, no tobacco but she did have a scooter accident a few months ago with an ER visit and stitches from a dentist Gregory Pyles DDS.  She hasn''t received those bills yet. She needs a 3 month follow up and possibly another 6 month or 1 year. Since it''s with a DDS she''s not sure it it will be covered with her current ins or not. With MPB it will be her responsibility. I told her to ask them what the cash price is and also find out cash price for Planned Parenthood for annual pap screening. She''s turning 26 July 16th and all of this is new to her!  She will read through it all and we are meeting again on Tuesday, June 19th.   She''s looking at CARE+ for $215/$1000 or Anthem or RMHP for $300+. She will be without insurance for half of July and needs an Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-14 11:06:25', '2022-07-14 11:59:05'),
