  ('zcrm_1579374000097997044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, '7/13/2022:  Julia had me reach out to answer questions etc., but Melinda completed her application a few hours earlier.  Hopefully, she had accurate information.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-13 16:56:56', '2022-07-13 16:56:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098001023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091727004', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '7-13-22 Jessica never made her payments to Bright Health and they terminated her. I called Bright Health and spoke with Javier twice and they are not able to reactivate her account and told me to call C4. I called C4 and spoke with Simone and she told me they are not able to do anything since it''s cancelled due to non-payment. She needs another SEP which she doesn''t have.  So, her only option is SECURE which she''s enrolling in now. She needs to have commercial insurance to get onto a special program to help pay for her infusions. With SECURE she can show proof of the MEC to qualify. She will give it a whirl since she has no options!  She''s joining $1000/$300 at 33 years only. I sent her the video to  refresh her memory again and the email overview to read through so she''s confident. SECURE will begin Aug. 1st. She knows to set up her Welcome Call and show proof of self-employment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-13 14:33:26', '2022-07-13 14:36:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097978026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070976050', 'Colleen Glenn-Wilson', NULL, '7.13.2022 - Colleen called to update her payment information. I sent her the payment update form via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-13 14:24:52', '2022-07-13 14:24:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097978021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656124', 'Lesa Russell', NULL, '7.13.2022 - Lesa called with questions regarding her preventative care services. I explained the PHCS network and provided Lesa with a list of in-network labs. She has already verified that her provider is in-network and believes that her provider uses a Quest Lab that is in-network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-13 13:32:35', '2022-07-13 13:32:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097997031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659050', 'Beth Bryant', NULL, '7-13-2022:  Beth called in w/questions about her mammogram and papsmear.  We went over ''prev'' care requiring all entities be in network, although, and out-of-ntwk doc can still send labs thru an in network lab and have Planstin pay on cov items.  She seems to understand &amp; I think is set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-13 13:10:27', '2022-07-13 13:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097997023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '7-13-2022:  Jody called, we''ve been keeping track on her large list of RXs.  She wanted to look at the Atorvastatin today.  She has not been diagnosed w/CVD (Cardio Vascular Disease), so it would not be something we could try to get appr on her ''Prev'' Planstin (req waiver).  I sent her the following coupon & Hy-vee is the best location (for all her RXs in one spot at this time):
     - Atorvastatin 80mg, #90  =  $10.34 (w/1st fill $5 disc) at Hy-vee.
       She knows a different disc site might be better on her next fill of this item since the price 
       will be $5 > 2nd fill and on.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-13 13:07:45', '2022-07-13 13:08:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097997018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '7-13-2022:  Rbt called back.  He was receiving the mess he is not a memb, but I got it to ''you''re already registered'', but he''s not receiving the "chg my pw" e-mails.  So, I sent supp e-mail to CirrusMD w/all necessary info so they can straighten out his account.  Rbt knows to watch his e-mail.     - CA

Nestor from CirrusMD replied w/in about 35-minutes.  Rbt was registered w/Cynthia''s e-mail.  Nestor corr &amp; sent a chg pwd link to Rbt w/instructions on how to login.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-13 12:35:32', '2022-07-13 13:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098001013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '7-13-22 Jennifer called back and she got her July 1st start date with Anthem for the 1 month. Her cc has been charged and she got digital cards. She was able to call and get in on a cancellation for her mammogram and she didn''t have to wait the full year since she''s on a new insurance. Her last mammo was Sept. 23rd, but they told her it doesn''t matter. So, she''s moving forward with that since the network with Planstin may not open up until Sept. or later.  She''s happy I let her know and she''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-13 11:17:43', '2022-07-13 11:17:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098001008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '7-13-22 Andre wants to sign up the for HMA 5000 at $84 a month. He''ll do it on his own later. I showed him how to get started. He also has been asked to do a stress test by his cardiologist next week. The cash price with discount is just around $900 through his cardiologist. He definitely doesn''t want to switch doctors. I suggested he call Concierge and submits the new Need just in case he needs to do any follow up down the road, so it''s all included within the 6 months time limit. He will do so. He also had a $200 bill for something related 4-6 months ago. He paid cash and wasn''t concerned.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-13 10:38:40', '2022-07-13 10:38:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097988016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070912005', 'Andrea Farmer', NULL, 'Member cancelled eff 6/1/22 she left employment', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-13 10:37:59', '2022-07-13 10:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000098001003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '7-13-22 I left Jennifer Hooker a vm letting her know the RBP is likely to be pushed out to Sept. 1st. So, if she really needs her mammogram, try to do it now with Anthem if possible. Otherwise, she may have to wait a little longer and I can''t promise the launch date quite yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-13 10:19:49', '2022-07-13 10:19:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097978013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '7.13.2022 - Robert called regarding his telehealth services. He thought that he had to call in to the concierge line in order to use them, but I let him know about CirrusMD and explained how the process works. I sent him a password reset because he was unsure if he had already registered (he did). I called Rob to let him know what I did and had to leave a vm. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-13 09:55:27', '2022-07-13 09:55:41'),
