  ('zcrm_1579374000097732077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096076002', 'Darcie Johnston', NULL, '7-11-2022:  Darcie sent e-mail to Tony Sat, 7/9, which Julia fwd''d to me today.  BUT, it looks like she''s setup for an Aug 1st eff date already.  Maybe she just thought we could move that date to the 19th instead.
----------------
     From: Darcie Johnston <darcie@darciejohnston.com>
     Sent: Friday, July 8, 2022 4:27:21 PM
     To: Extra <tony@mympb.com>
     Subject: RE: PHCS Provider List / Preventive Services list - Tony Manzanarez
 
     Hi Tony-

     I just got a letter from my COBRA and my insurance expires on July 20th.  Is it possible to start my 
     membership on July 19th?  I’m fine with paying for a full month if needed.   Thanks, Darcie
----------------
I responded letting her know appl deadlines and that all our healthcare memb begin on the 1st of the month.  Asked if we can setup a time to go over options.
