  ('zcrm_1579374000097732069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097350001', 'Charles Ridenour', NULL, '7-11-2022:  Jessica called w/questions re: her 1099 &amp; if she needs to be ''primary''.  I trans her directly to Patti''s line &amp; she''ll LM is she doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-11 15:08:39', '2022-07-11 15:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097732064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '7-11-2022:  Dave called to better understand how to handle different appts:  prev, diag, treatments, etc.  
     - He asked about "showing diff cards", so we went over ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative.
