     - He asked about telehealth, but he conf he''s already registered w/CirrusMD.  I let him know he can always start there (but, NOT in an emergency) to see if what he needs is in their scope, when they might refer him to a local MD, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-11 15:03:30', '2022-07-11 15:03:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097732059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, '7-11-2022:  Michel LM w/the NHP Team to have Jennifer call him.  Her ''Welcome Call'' sched this afternoon is full, so she asked me to call him.
