  ('zcrm_1579374000097816003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '7-11-22 Jennifer talked with her husband and he surprisingly gave her the thumbs up to try MCS for at least the rest of the year. If they are happy, they''ll stay put onward. She''s thrilled! Enrolling now in SECURE and Jennifer is self-employed and husband''s new employer doesn''t offer health insurance. They have Anthem for July and she knows she still needs to show  proof of SEP.  She''s a massage therapist for life. Had weird pain under rib 1 year ago and did scan with contrast and all came out clear, no problems! Likely just a soft tissue issue from work. No issue. I instructed her to upload her SEP Cobra letter to make sure her plan is activated with Anthem for July. Her payment hasn''t been pulled yet. But, she enrolled only a day or 2 before the end of the month. So, they are likely still processing. Now C4 at least has proof of SEP. Also all set for Aug 1st start EF SECURE $715/$1000 for 2 months then goes up to $915/$1000 in Oct. She''s aware and fine with it.  She may send a friend my way as well bc their MedShare doesn''t have wellness included but they only pay $500+ for their membership for a family and husband is in 50''s.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-11 13:25:24', '2022-07-11 13:45:13'),
