  ('zcrm_1579374000097732046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, '7-11-2022:  Dana @ MD office - 856-589-9994 = back office # that Planstin can call.  Office is a state entity.  Not a private doctor.  Credential Dept. says they cannot undo something once it''s done.  Dana will put card as inactive so it does not automatically bill next time.  Rbt is going to have to be super specific every time he works w/their office.  She needs Planstin to send denial to allow Rbt to pay cash since they automatically processed it thru Planstin (who adj for in ntwk, applied it to a ded, & did NOT decline it).     - CA.

Jennifer is checking w/Eric @ Planstin.  Now it''s moved to Planstin''s Cust Srvc via e-mail from Jennifer.

I tt Rbt & let him know we are trying to get the declination letter, adj to the billed item, & one of us would let him know what we discover.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-11 13:04:53', '2022-07-11 15:20:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097749026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097349002', 'William Edwards', NULL, '07/11/2022:  Kelly Edwards called asking for the member ID, since she is unable to log in to her account. I offered her to sent her an email with the log-in information. She agreed. I sent it. - Marginne Téllez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-07-11 12:44:27', '2022-07-11 12:44:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097749018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095555002', 'Kyle Larsen', NULL, '07/11/2022: Natalie Lerson called wanting to update her method of payment. I sent her the   MPowering Benefits Payment Update template. She also asked if she can use her HSA account with the plan that she has. I explained her that she can. She asked as well about dental on her plan or if she has to do it with a someone else. I explained her that with her plan she has an annual wellness visit and she can use it for dental, since we don''t offer dental in the plan. She said that''s ok, she will do it through someone else. I add her email, natalie@thenordengroup.com, as a secondary one. - Marginne Téllez', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-07-11 12:39:16', '2022-07-11 12:39:54'),
