  ('zcrm_1579374000097732033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, '7-11-2022:  Wes called.  His wife just got a job that gives them healthcare, so they want to cancel their membership.  He was fine w/me trans him to Jane''s ph line.  If he needs further help, he will call back.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-11 11:13:33', '2022-07-11 11:13:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097732028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090978002', 'Michael McKenny', NULL, '7-11-2022:  Michael owns a bus.  When he orig started his memb he did so for his family alone.  Now they''d like to open it to his employees.  He''s going to call his advisor Leslie Jablonski to see if she can help him.  If not, he''ll call back &amp; I told him we can get someone from the company to work with him.  He couldn''t remember his advisor''s name, but liked that plan once he remembered "Leslie".     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-11 11:12:22', '2022-07-11 11:12:22'),
