  ('zcrm_1579374000097745020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', NULL, '7.11.2022 - Cindy called because she would like to see a dermatologist for some spots that are growing and changing rapidly. I advised her of the self-pay process, sent her the instructions on how to open a need with Zion, and transferred Cindy to Zion per her request. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-11 10:04:02', '2022-07-11 10:04:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097745015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, '7.11.2022 - Carol called because she just received her bill from an ER visit a month back. She did receive the bill with the cash discount from the ER (from $32k to $12k). This had all originally stemmed from a visit with the CirrusMD doctor who sent her to Urgent Care (she paid $150 for the Urgent Care visit and has paid $600 towards the ER visit). I advised Carol on how to upload her information to Zion and start a Need ASAP with any detailed bills/receipts she has in her possession.  Carol will be opening her Need today and will call Zion if she needs assistance with uploading her information to their site. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-11 09:33:25', '2022-07-11 09:33:25'),
