  ('zcrm_1579374000097710013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, '7.11.2022 - Janet was trying to use her Teledoc services, but all MPB members have been converted to CirrusMD. Because Janet is 3 hours behind EST, I emailed Janet with the CirrusMD information and sent her an invitation to register. I will reach out to Janet at a decent AZ time. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-11 07:23:29', '2022-07-11 07:24:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097710008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093412002', 'Aaron Smith', NULL, '7.11.2022 - Dayna called because she received new cards in the mail for herself, Aaron, and for some reason Kristen''s name was on them as well. I advised Dayna that some changes were made to the information on the cards and to keep the newest cards. Dayna also wanted to be sure that all of the children were on the plan since the only child''s name on the envelope with the new cards was Kristen''s. I verified that all 5 children are on the plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-11 07:19:02', '2022-07-11 07:19:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097710003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677073', 'Scott Malz', NULL, '7.11.2022 - Nona called because Scott had an accident this weekend that required him to go to the Urgent Care. Urgent Care suggested Scott go to the ER, and when Nona tried to present as self-pay, they told her they had her Planstin information on file so they would bill that. I advised Nona to call the ER to state that they are self-pay and to not use her Planstin information for billing. Scott does have a broken wrist and is having some complications. I instructed Nona on how to open a Need with Zion and sent her the instructions via email. I also let Nona know that if Scott needs any surgeries, to please contact us here on the concierge team first so that we may put them in contact with Blue Care Connect. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-11 07:17:34', '2022-07-11 07:17:34'),
