  ('zcrm_1579374000097662031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366134', 'Janell Vennard', NULL, '7-8-2022:  Janell called looking for a ''qualified'' ins letter for her auto insurance comp.  I let her know Patti Baron is gone, but I believe she''s the person that can help.  She''s LM for Patti &amp; knows it''ll be next week before Patti is back in the off.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-08 16:36:06', '2022-07-09 00:22:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097662026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085050002', 'Matthew Claycomb', NULL, '7-8-2022:  Tonya called looking for the closest Dexa Scan (= a bone density scan) and pricing near her.  I looked up Dexa Scan on both HCBB & Pratter, but nothing under that specific name.  Went to ''Bone Density Scan'' & sent an e-mail w/the Fair Price in her area.  Also found a site DexaScan.com.  There it lists the closest site as 117 miles away & gives prices between $75 & $115 (included that in the e-mail too).  
