  ('zcrm_1579374000097570008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'This member along with her newborn was added to her husband''s (Christopher Megroz) membership eff 6/1/2022.  This membership has been cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-08 09:03:54', '2022-07-08 09:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097574008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095746002', 'Jamie Gambino', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-08 08:32:22', '2022-07-08 08:32:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097563008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '7.8.2022 - James attempted to use his CirrusMD services yesterday and requested that the doctor called him due to the fact that he was driving. He was told "No" and to pull over so that he could finish the chat session. James only wanted to make us aware of this situation because he did not feel it was convenient for his situation at the time. I will provide this feedback to Joan so that she may follow-up with CirrusMD with this feedback. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-08 08:18:13', '2022-07-08 08:18:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097574003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096121002', 'Sarah Fuquay', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-08 07:50:15', '2022-07-08 07:50:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097570003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497146', 'Jon King', NULL, 'I followed up with member re: the question below about difference in price for his children.  he needed it for a divorce situation.   I advised member of deadline for making changes if he wanted to do so.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-08 07:30:26', '2022-07-08 07:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097562004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '07.07.22:  Spoke w/Eric who said Jordell entered Jessica in their system manually and they sent her her membership card today.  I texted Jessica to alert her to look for an email from Planstin with her digital card.  Joanna texted me back and said Jessica received the email/card and they have already scheduled an appt. for her.  I responded that Jessica must make sure she let''s the provider know this is solely a preventive visit, so she doesn''t get charged for diagnostic care, unless she elects to have any diagnostic services.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-07-08 07:00:01', '2022-07-08 07:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097563003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497146', 'Jon King', NULL, '7.8.2022 - Jon emailed in requesting pricing for his plan if he were to remove his children. His producer, Thomas Berghammer, is not longer active. His parent producer is Rod, so I sent Michele Jon''s information so she may reach out to him regarding the pricing change. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-08 06:55:50', '2022-07-08 06:55:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097521028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080553008', 'Laura Winkler', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Laura called.  She wants to see her reg physician & they say they are on the PHCS network, but she wanted to confirm.  The doc is not listed in the search, however, the doc is new to the office.  She''s going to get Dr Pressley''s NPI # & call the PHCS ph # on the back of her Planstin card to make sure the doc is in ntwk.
     - She had > 1 Planstin card.  We went over the best on to use (the one that shows PHCS on the back), but I let her know to call us instead of using the OptumRX for prescription prices as we can generally get it cheaper for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 18:14:48', '2022-07-07 18:14:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097521023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Angela called.  She''s having trouble w/her IUD, thinks it may have moved and is now painful.  She had questions on finding a gyno near her (sent her the HCBB list for 14 miles or less from her zip) because she does not want to see the same doctor that inserted it (that was a bad experience).  
     - Also had questions about ''preventative'' care.  We went over Care+ does not incl ''prev''.  That may work for her, but she may also call her Advisor Wendy Scipione to see if she could find a way to qualify for the Secure Plan w/''prev'' care (she''s studying to be a stylist, so there may be options now or later, or in a diff direction).  However, I mentioned w/only 1 prev appt per year, it may be less exp than chg''ing plans to have that out of pkt.
     - IF issues w/her IUD (not just having it inserted as she was having done in Jan), we discussed we can sub a ''need'' to get help if expenses increase to > her 1k IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 18:13:24', '2022-07-07 18:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097521018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095968002', 'Regina Piper', NULL, '7-7-2022:  As soon as I asked Gina (see SalesIQ chat above) to call the Concierge Line, I ended up receiving back-to-back calls.  I LM for Gina letting her know our hours &amp; that one of us can help her (in case she tried calling &amp; I was on some other call).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 16:47:46', '2022-07-07 16:47:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097521013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '7-7-2022:  James called &amp; thinks he may be having an adverse or alergic reaction to a drug (he didn''t say which or what).  He wanted to tt a CirrusMD doc, so I helped him download their app &amp; get connected to a doc.  He was on w/them when we got off the phone.  I mentioned we can look for cheapest RX should they prescribe something.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 16:44:27', '2022-07-07 16:44:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097547002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095968002', 'Regina Piper', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 2018 Question : Hi! I''m a new member as of July 1 and am trying to set up my accounts. I don''t see a place to register for my MPB.Health portal, only a place to login once my account is set up. Can you point me in the right direction? Thanks!', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-07-07 15:52:44', '2022-07-07 15:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097521008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Jennifer Richter called to cancel her sched ''Welcome Call'' w/Jennifer Thorin tomorrow.  She was very upset she does not have all her cards yet.  Although, she rec''d their MPB.Health cards & we went over those (which was a HUGE struggle).  I think she finally understood it''s a reference card w/our #, MAP, & her telehealth.  Plus we disc the QRCodes & what they are for, she was easily confused, but I think it''s because she''s asking questions & not really hearing what''s being said, & I think she finally understood.
     - She feels all her "cards should have arrived before their start date of 7/1/2022 - especially since both her husb & her daughter are traveling".  I explained that it can take a bit longer for the cards to arrive & that in her ''Welcome Call'' the cards would be covered.  That the pers doing her call will go over & confirm what she has & what they are for.
     - She''s very upset that Zion hasn''t provided a card.  I explained they do NOT generally send cards since you are tech a ''cash-pay'' pt & that started the loop on how it ought to be again.  She was setting up her ''Welcome Call'', so I told her that''s when they can req a Zion card if she needs it.  [In her mind, she thinks Jennifer should drop everything & do her ''Welcome Call'' the second she wants it, not on a sched (or it looks like complete it - see Jennifer''s note above).  I explained again, our ''WC'' team must set aside everything else they are doing & that''s why it''s on a sched.  So someone else can cover all of their other resp while they focus on the one memb that has the appt.  It isn''t just something that can be done whenever.
     - Let her know to be on the lookout for her Planstin ''prev'' card. To which she went in again on how she should already have it...  I apologized and let her know it should be on it''s way, but again, the ''Welcome Call'' team memb can request one if she needs it.
     It''s so close to the beginning of the month (& a holiday weekend where things are probably a bit delayed, I did not request the cards, in hopes they would arrive in the next few days).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 14:55:56', '2022-07-07 14:55:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097521003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Janet called.  She''s recovering from COVID & wants to see a specialist (for her ears I think she said), but is unsure if she''s already used all her copay appts.  I tried calling APEX (& am not on the approved list of people at our company they can talk to).  So, Stephanie @ APEX brought Janet into a 3-way call with the 2 of us & was able to help Janet.  Stephanie was clear she can only see what''s been billed, so there could be missing appts.  As of today, Stephanie only sees 1 specialist & 0 Urg Care appts this yr.  Janet remembered that because it was ''Covid'' the doc''s off said they didn''t have to have a copay (not sure on this, she just mentioned it).  At the end of the call Janet decided the spec ''cash-pay'' amt is only $250, so if she doesn''t get the copay amt of $50, she''s okay w/that.
     - This plan is older.  I tried to get an update of the copay specifics, but Stephanie said I have to e-mail an APEX address.  Not sure if they will provide the info to me since I''m not on the authorized list, but I''m going to try.  At least for now Janet''s set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 14:41:14', '2022-07-07 14:41:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097431076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067828010', 'Luke Seamans', NULL, '7-7-22 Luke has a new job with benefits which start any day now. His membership goes to the end of July and no further payments needed. He successfully completed the cancellation form. He was appreciative of my help. New ins will cost him less through company.
UPDATE - My vacation vm was still intact even though I thought I had changed it. The change didn''t work. So, I just fixed it now and it will no longer ask the client to contact the Admin Team for assistance. It''s my usual original vm message.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-07 14:30:09', '2022-07-07 14:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097431065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752088', 'Randall Simmering', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to cancel since he is now on Medicare.  Told him I would send the link out to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-07 13:55:47', '2022-07-07 13:55:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097502008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090939002', 'Tamara Haas', NULL, '7.7.2022 - Welcome call complete !JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-07 13:46:40', '2022-07-07 13:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097502003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095963008', 'James Kjellsen', NULL, '7.7.2022 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-07 13:23:29', '2022-07-07 13:23:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097492023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Rbt called.
     - Planstin = Annual Wellness Visit.  1-5-2022 had first appt & then went back to follow-up in Feb 11, 2022.  They chg''d him $325 for visit & adj -$141.61 for in ntwk discount, was telehealth visit & they did not discuss.  ''Cash-pay'' = $158.  He''s going to have Dana (female) call me so I can go over it w/her.
        He rec''d the e-mail discussing Zion no longer utilizing PHCS & was wondering about that.  Let him know this does not impact his Planstin ''prev'' care.  He can ignore.     
     - Colonoscopy doc just sent reminder time for his appt.  Went over everything Planstin = screening, all entities must be in ntwk.  Zion = diagnostic w/1k IUA, ntwk not imp w/diag.  Went over PHCS search for gastroenterology w/him & Prev healthcare.gov site.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 12:52:49', '2022-07-07 12:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097431060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090935002', 'Tracy McKinney', 'New Plan eff 8/1/2022', 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-07 12:24:58', '2022-07-07 12:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097431055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056556027', 'Rikki Mor', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-07 12:15:54', '2022-07-07 12:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097431050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067828010', 'Luke Seamans', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy this member submitted Cancellation form.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-07 12:09:50', '2022-07-07 12:09:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097492018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056556027', 'Rikki Mor', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Rikki called.  They chg''d banks, so she needed Patti''s temp for Pymt chg.  Sent her that via e-mail.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 11:30:57', '2022-07-07 11:30:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097492013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982002', 'Gabriella Carenza', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Gabriella called.  They were waiting on the Teams chat her ''Welcome Call'' confirmation told her to go to.  Not sure why she didn''t have the phone she listed to receive Vanessa''s call.  She was very nice about rescheduling - I let her know the ''Welcome Call'' team will CALL her on whatever ph # she lists when sched her call.  She''s going in right now to resched.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 11:29:48', '2022-07-07 11:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097492008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088951002', 'Kevin Rose', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Jackie called in completely unsure how the plan she &amp; Kevin are on works.  Sounds like Kevin is receiving all of the communication &amp; did the ''Welcome Call'' w/Vanessa alone.  
     - Jackie needs a ''Welcome Call'' so I sent her the invitation.
     - Sent her obgyn &amp; fam prac PHCS Search results so she can start looking.
     - Jackie thinks Kevin needs to stay as primary e-mail, but sent her Patti''s chg form so we can add her as  secondary.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 11:15:29', '2022-07-07 11:15:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097492003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052755096', 'Kathryn Sparacino', NULL, '7-7-2022:  Kathryn e-mailed back:  the biopsy was 7k.  She says she set it up on a pymt plan?  Not sure why.  Not sure she presented as a ''cash-pay'' pt for a discount.  She says she super busy &amp; can''t talk now.  Asked her to connect asap so we can sub the ''need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-07 11:12:36', '2022-07-07 11:12:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097434033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982002', 'Gabriella Carenza', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-07 11:05:06', '2022-07-07 11:05:06');
