  ('zcrm_1579374000097407008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497146', 'Jon King', NULL, '7.7.2022 - Jon called because he needs a letter from Planstin stating that his 18 year old son has MEC. I will be reaching out to Eric from Planstin to see if this is something that they can provide to our member. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-07 08:00:12', '2022-07-07 08:00:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097397014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085972001', 'Tupac Manzanarez', NULL, 'Tupac has enrolled in the Essentials plan and wants to cancel his Secure membership.  I will notify Planstin and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-07 07:55:59', '2022-07-07 07:55:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097401003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080704002', 'Tom Weiss', NULL, 'Changed start date from Jan 1, 2022 to Aug 1, 2022', 'Julia Avalon', 'Julia Avalon', '2022-07-07 07:37:33', '2022-07-07 07:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097397003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044764070', 'Brenda Cooper', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after I directed her to the link in the email that was sent to her.  I will notify Sedera, Redirect &amp; cancel billing. Cancellation emailed directed to Christian @ Redirect.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-07 07:34:09', '2022-07-07 07:37:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094005002', 'Randall Kinzel', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-07-07 07:33:30', '2022-07-07 07:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097321205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088066002', 'Susan Feickert', NULL, '7-6-2022:  Richard (w/Susan in the background) called.  Susan ended up in the hospital last week for chest pains.  He starting to get bills & wondered what the next step was.  I sent them the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion & went over all the details on what to do, watching their e-mail, etc.  He may pre-pay everything, but I let him know they only reimb a few times per year, so he may just want to pay the 1k IUA since they are getting this started so quickly & have Zion pay the balance - whatever they are most comfortable with.  He orig thought he''d wait to have everything, but I encouraged him to get the ''need'' started and he can upload as things come in.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-06 16:33:28', '2022-07-06 16:33:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097351018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094922002', 'Lindsey Frick', NULL, '7.6.2022 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-06 14:56:00', '2022-07-06 14:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097279052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097350001', 'Charles Ridenour', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-06 14:52:08', '2022-07-06 14:52:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097279047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097349002', 'William Edwards', NULL, 'Member &amp;Family $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-07-06 14:48:50', '2022-07-06 14:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097351013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '7.6.2022 - Sent an email to Eric at Planstin regarding the issue with Jessica''s eligibility file. It appears there was some issues with the fact that Jessica had previously enrolled in May, but the enrollment was held due to financial reasons. When she was able to begin her plan, the new eligibility file that was sent to Planstin had a hiccup due to Jessica''s previous enrollment. Eric Belair called me to clarify the situation and that Jordell (Planstin/Zion IT?) was not in today, so they will not be able to fix the issue until tomorrow. Per Joan, I reached out to Jessica and Joanna to let them know that we are working diligently with Planstin to get this resolved quickly; once we have resolved this I will reach out to Jessica and Joanna with Jessica''s Planstin information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-06 14:11:01', '2022-07-08 06:54:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097351008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '7.6.2022 - Left Joan a VM and did not hear back. I sent Joan another Welcome Call scheduler so that she can schedule for another day and time for her convenience. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-06 13:36:43', '2022-07-06 13:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097351003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095683002', 'Jeramiah Carr', NULL, '7.6.2022 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-06 13:27:10', '2022-07-06 13:27:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097321140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '7-5-2022:  Jessica called upset that Planstin is still telling her she is not showing as an eligible member.  She needs her appt & wants to know why she can''t get a card.  Sent Patti Baron a Teams chat so we can sort through this issue.

