  ('zcrm_1579374000097339008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097998001', 'Shirley Questions', NULL, 'Shirley is trying to find a healthshare plan from her husband who is moving from canada to new york within the month and he has his green card. He is self employed but wont be filing his 1099 for 2023 until the end of summer. Shirley asked a million and one questions that I answered with leo. She would like me to send her the aca preventative services list and the whole health living choices list of providers and services within the network. She also wants a payout chart of zion health''s cost sharing finances. Her husband is also a pastor.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-07-06 11:20:39', '2022-07-06 12:18:31'),
