  ('zcrm_1579374000097260033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '7-5-2022:  Finally got Josh &amp; Ashley invitations for CirrusMD after manually providing all the information to the supp staff at CirrusMD.  I know Josh was able to get his appt &amp; I provided him w/a coupon for the RX from the doc.
