  ('zcrm_1579374000097228008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, '7-5-22 Rita contacted me on Sunday July 3rd since she couldn''t login to her CirrusMD app. She''s having an allergic reaction to the booster covid shot and wants a prescription.  She didn''t want to spend money by going to ER since it should be a simple medication fix she thinks. But, she was super nervous! I sent a note to John Kach and Brody Westcott but they were both on vacation. John submitted a ticket to CirrusMD right way this morning. I received no response by 3:00 MST / 5:00 EST. I sent another note to Brody and he let me know Nadia Wilder is our new MPB Account Manager. She responded immediately. She confirmed Rita''s account information and no current end date to membership. Once she did that, they removed the duplicate account in her name to resolve the problem. It''s working now and confirmed by Rita.  She''s nervous about what to do if this happens again. I let her know it should be resolved now once and for all.  Most of our communications were done via text.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-05 16:12:50', '2022-07-05 16:12:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097260028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', NULL, '7-5-2022: Rebecca called.  She''s trying to get back into CirrusMD.  Helped her download the app to her smartphone &amp; get in.  We got off the phone as she was being assigned a doc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-05 16:00:01', '2022-07-05 16:00:01'),
