  ('zcrm_1579374000097201036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080704002', 'Tom Weiss', NULL, '7.5.2022 - Attempted Melissa and Tom''s welcome call for the 2nd time. Melissa was asking for plan change information (i.e. pricing) so I gave her pricing for the Secure plan member + family $915.00 and Care+ plan member + family (Sept 2022 pricing) $780.00. Melissa will be reaching out to Analisa when she makes a decision. We did not do the welcome call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-05 14:50:40', '2022-07-05 14:50:40'),
