7-5-2022:  Josh started texting super early here (probably forgetting the time diff).  As soon as I could, Is sent CirrusMD everything to manually create the account including both Joshua & Ashley''s info: Full names we have on file, dob, unique e-mails, Memb & Dependent ID numbers, genders, & eff date.  Let Josh know to watch his e-mail for contact from them.  IF the doc can help, may prescrib RX (contact me w/info & I''ll get best pricing in your area).  IF they want him to see a doc, plez contact me & I''ll go over how to handle that & those guidelines.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-05 13:46:15', '2022-07-05 13:46:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097260008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104168', 'Elizabeth Dempsey', NULL, '7-5-2022:  Had post menopausal bleeding &amp; they''ve done a bunch to diagnose &amp; treat it = &gt; her 1k IUA.  We went over everything re: sub a ''need'' with Zion and I sent her the temp.  She''s done w/treatment they think &amp; she presented as ''cash-pay'' for everything, so it''ll just be reimb.  But, I think she understands the process well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-05 13:41:13', '2022-07-05 13:41:13'),
