  ('zcrm_1579374000097228003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '7-5-22 Alicia and I completed a NLG App for $500K showing at Standard Rate for $56.76. She doesn''t want to pay this much. As long as she''s rated up any level it should fall within her comfort zone. But, we indicated that she must accept the payment amount via my acceptance once she''s rated. She chose the 15th for the withdrawal date as long as she accepts the rating and monthly fee. She had a breast lump/cyst that turned out to be fine, nothing. Her mom newly has breast cancer and is still alive at 76. No other health issues to report. Medications aren''t for anything chronic, so we couldn''t include those since only allowing and asking for chronic illness meds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-07-05 11:18:25', '2022-07-05 11:18:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097201016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '7.5.2022 - Doug called regarding an address change, so I sent him the form via email. I also advised Doug on how to use his plan when he is in Europe (present as cash-pay, collect detailed billing in English). ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-05 11:17:17', '2022-07-05 11:17:17'),
