  ('zcrm_1579374000097201006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, '7.5.2022 - Followed up with Angela regarding her cancelation. There was no cancelation link sent to her, so I sent her one today and advised for her to submit her cancelation form by the end of business today so that Patti could get her refund processed. Angela was happy with this and will be submitting the cancelation form ASAP. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-05 11:10:10', '2022-07-05 11:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097186003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080057', 'Cara Jakob', NULL, '7.5.2022 - Kevin called in regarding how to submit a dermatological pathology bill for reimbursement. I explained to Kevin that dermatology (including the pathology bill) would go towards his $1,000 IUA amount if it ended up being cancerous. Kevin was not happy with this answer, he insisted that we have a discount pathology center that we could refer him out to. I explained that I can find the best cash price in his area. He was not happy with this answer as well and hung up. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-05 10:04:14', '2022-07-05 10:27:51'),
