  ('zcrm_1579374000097084008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079570002', 'Joel Schoenborn', NULL, '7.5.2022 - Responded to email sent to info@mympb.com regarding his children''s well visits and if they would be covered by his Planstin card.  I advised Joel that as long as the provider was within the PHCS network, the preventative services will be covered and sent him instructions on how to search within the PHCS network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-05 07:16:51', '2022-07-05 07:16:51'),
