  ('zcrm_1579374000097015026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, '7-1-2022:  Jacqueline e-mailed asking how she''s supp to get her arthritis meds if she can''t find a female doc on the PHCS taking new pts.  I let her know the PHCS ntwk is only imp on ''prev'' care, so she can see anyone for the treatment of her arthritis.  Let her know it''s easiest to go over all details on the phone [ie: pre-x? how to pay, etc.]  Asked her to call us after the holiday.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-01 18:09:12', '2022-07-01 18:09:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097015021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094922002', 'Lindsey Frick', NULL, '7-1-2022:  I was able to catch Lindsey on SalesIQ &amp; we talked on the concierge line.  I helped her understand how to present as a ''cash-pay'' patient &amp; why.  Then went over how her $2500 IUA works &amp; that her plan does not incl ''prev'' care.  I did request pdf &amp; hard copy of her Zion card, but explained why it''s not handled the same as just giving the provider your "ins" card.  She seemed to understand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-01 17:22:02', '2022-07-01 17:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096993003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094922002', 'Lindsey Frick', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 1993 Question : I have not been sent Zion information so I can''t login with a member ID. Do I have a member ID? I received the MPB info.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-07-01 15:50:57', '2022-07-01 15:50:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097008033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '7.1.2022 - Attempted Jennifer''s welcome call. She was not willing to let me get through my portion of explaining the plan to her and kept interrupting me and leading the conversation. She would understand the plan more if she let me get through my welcome call information. I have another call scheduled with her for July 8th @ 3PM EST. We spent 40 minutes discussing her questions since she would not let me provide her with my welcome call information. She insisted on trying to push to do another 30 minutes because she could "not wrap her head around the concept" and I had to tell her several times that I needed to end our call because of other welcome calls that needed to be done. She stated that she will be reaching out to Karen as well to see if she can explain the plan to her as well. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-07-01 14:12:56', '2022-07-01 14:12:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097019011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096696002', 'Ryan Hafich', NULL, '06.30.22:  Recvd. an email from Ryan saying he''s been getting a number of emails, all of which are stating an 8/1/22 start date - could I check on this?  I sent John an email to ask him to send Ryan a Confirmation email that his start date was changed from 8/1/22 to 7/1/22, which he did send to Ryan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-07-01 14:02:00', '2022-07-01 14:02:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097015013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095867010', 'Nathaniel Gray', NULL, '7-1-2022: Nathaniel called requesting a PCP for their annual appts.  
     - We disc their Care+ does not have ''prev'' care.  They need their meds, so then we disc options.  Even went so far as to describe how the ''prev'' on the Secure works, having your appt & not getting your meds at that moment to keep as ''prev'' & calling the doc next day for the RXs, or wking w/doc to make it work.  He had questions about diff in prices so we disc & he did not understand how IUAs work, so I went over in details IUAs as well.  He''s considering chging plans (he''s a pastor, I think that was the title) & thinks he is considered self emp in PA for the Secure.  At the same time he may move to the $1000 IUA now that he understands those too.  He will disc w/his wife & will contact us/his advisor before 7/15/2022 for a new eff date w/prev if they decide to go that route, of 8/1/2022.
     - I explained RX Quotes/Discounts we can help w/too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-01 13:10:43', '2022-07-01 13:10:55'),
