  ('zcrm_1579374000097015008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '7-1-2022:  Eric called wanting to setup his son''s annual appt.  He''s on Redirect, so I let him know they will be able to help.  Got him over to them, but before transferring him directly, I let him know:  once you''ve done your initual setup call, they have a great app &amp; they should be able to help you set that up as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-01 11:23:17', '2022-07-01 11:23:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000097015003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047423507', 'Casey Howard', NULL, '7-1-2022:  Casey called.  She''s never used her healthcare, knew she needed to call someone before trying to see the doc, but she''s having issues swallowing...  I gaver her Redirect''s ph # & let her know:
     1) Call to see if they can make the appt for you right away.
     2) Then, call & do your setup call w/them later (if they can do it after you appt instead of before) to get all of your provider choices, etc., setup.
     3) Ask them to help you get the app setup on your phone for contacting them in the future.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-07-01 11:01:37', '2022-07-01 11:01:37'),
