  ('zcrm_1579374000096861024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '6-30-2022:  Timothy sub an RX Quote req for:  Sildenafil  100mg, #30tabs.  I tried  calling Timothy to go over what I''m sending, but did not hear back in the 3 hours interim.  Here''s what I sent w/details on why several options attached to the req:
     - GoodRX offers a $10 first fill disc at Safeway on this RX = $5.32.  If Safeway is strict on refills though (& I can see he got this at Safeway on a GoodRX coupon in March) their price jumps to $15.32.
     - RXGo has a price of $9.93 for Safeway on this RX.  So, first fill = >;  refills are cheaper.  Attached both of these coupons.
     - Timothy lives up in the mountains, so I let him know I found an online mail order site [Mark Cuban''s Cost Plus] showing a price of $10.40 including s&h.  I let him know w/shipping time, we sugg a min of 14-days for delivery.  Even if not this fill, maybe down the road, for the price?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-30 17:59:48', '2022-06-30 17:59:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '6.30.2022 - Krista reached out because she was curious as to why a facility hundreds of miles away from her showed up on her PHCS in-network list. I replied to her email to let her know that it appears that it was a facility that gave a cash discount on top of the cash pay rate. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-30 14:49:09', '2022-09-08 10:46:44'),
