  ('zcrm_1579374000096890013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, '06/30/22 c all from Angela Wilson is canceling her plan she spoke with her Advisor and he was going to reach out to us tomorrow // I will make sure she gets a cancelation form/ she wants her money back. she starts her new INS tomorrow. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-30 14:33:13', '2022-06-30 14:33:13'),
