  ('zcrm_1579374000096857049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, '6.30.2022 - Belinda called with issues regarding 2 colonoscopies she scheduled with 2 different in-network providers who called to verify her Planstin benefits and come to find out neither were in the network. I am working with Desiree from Planstin to find an in-network provider and facility so that Belinda does not have to get so frustrated. I did advise Belinda that the concierge line does not normally go to this extent, that it is the members responsibility but she is very appreciative for us going above and beyond for her. I will hopefully have something solid for her tomorrow. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-30 14:23:17', '2022-06-30 14:23:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, '6.30.2022 - Angela called to cancel her plan because she has insurance kicking in tomorrow. She called and demanded that she is refunded everything but the past 10 days since she is cancelling now. I explained that she needed to cancel prior to the 20th of June in order for her not to be charged and that she also needed to speak with her advisor to get the process started. I transferred her to Richard Willard, her advisor. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-30 14:19:06', '2022-06-30 14:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243659', 'Karen Meyer', NULL, '6.30.2022 - Karen called with questions on finding an in-network provider and how to present her ASi card. I sent her lists of PHCS in-network providers for mammograms and colonoscopies in her area, along with instructions on how to present her MEC. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-30 14:17:13', '2022-06-30 14:17:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096890003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '06/30/22 Call from Jennifer Richter to confirm her welcome call with Jennifer tomorrow 07/01/22 at 1230 pm her time. yes  its confirmed. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-30 14:04:56', '2022-06-30 14:04:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438028', 'Richard Reiter', NULL, '6-30-22 Spoke with Kenda his wife and gave her the new rates and IUA choices. She will call Sedera now to change IUA to lower amount.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-30 13:50:19', '2022-06-30 13:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '6-30-22 Dania confirmed that the members can change their IUA, "In regard to IUAs - absolutely they can modify their IUA when they migrate.  It would not apply to any existing Need, but would apply to any Needs moving forward." So, I just called Shelly and gave her the new pricing to make the change. Current $500 IUA is $783 which will increase to $1100.97. $1000 IUA/$843.97. $1500 IUA/$774.97. She will decide and let me know to make sure billing remains accurate on our end as well. She was totally cooll about it thankfully! She has a new Need and understands that may be kept at the $500 level which is in her favor. I told her to ask Sedera to confirm how that will work. She will.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-30 13:43:23', '2022-06-30 13:43:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '6-30-22 I texted and emailed Sammy to give her new rates at lower IUA and she will call Sedera now to change her IUA once she chooses. She''s completed her conversion yesterday. All set for now. No open needs either. $2500 IUA is $242.97, $1500 IUA is $257.97, $1000 IUA is $279.97 and $500 IUA is $358.97.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-30 13:33:06', '2022-06-30 13:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096862016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079231033', 'Beth Sanders', NULL, 'Members 7/22 declined - payment never made it out of FTNI Code of Invalid ABA.  I sent email &amp; left VM for member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-30 13:28:05', '2022-06-30 13:28:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '6-30-22 Jennifer''s account has been migrated successfully according to  Dania H. Her new monthly fee is $697.97. She''s ok with it all. I''ll send her a quick note to confirm. She''s all set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-30 13:20:01', '2022-06-30 13:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096861019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364020', 'Toni Woods', NULL, '6-30-2022:  Toni called.  She LM on the RCI''s VM (see Jennifer''s note above) but that was 2 days ago & since she hasn''t hear back, she''s wondering if she LM on the wrong ext, or?  I called Jennifer & confirmed:  she was thinking this was the Redirect plan, not Self Directed.  I talked w/Toni, she was very understanding about the confusion.  I e-mailed her a list of PHCS gastro near her (C Springs is where she wants to go) & went over the whole process.  She''ll let us know if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-30 13:10:47', '2022-06-30 13:10:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096862008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034128172', 'Kim Delgado', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Jane.  I will cancel w/Zion.  This is a part of a List bill so Karina will handle.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-30 13:06:55', '2022-06-30 13:12:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096871011', 'Emily Choi', NULL, '6-30-22 Emily 11/27/1965, 36 is in need of SEP bc her ins company that she had for 10 years dissolved bc of wrongful plan, they only covered wellness and seemingly nothing else. She''s not really sure and nobody''s heard of them. They are called Web PPA / Health Insurance Innovations. Emily has an appointment tomorrow to run some tests for possible auto immune problems that are affecting her knee. She wants Dr. Meredith Mayo and Dr. Wael Garas at BCH. No tobacco. Income about $50K as seld employed and she got a $68.08 APTC. She enrolled successfully in Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 Rx Copay for $386.52, APTC $68.08 and her cost $318. Acct # 2605001116, Plan ID 49375CO0060012-01.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-30 13:04:25', '2022-06-30 13:04:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096861011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042343089', 'Carrie Stephens', NULL, '6-30-2022:  Tom called from practitioner''s Cauline Johnson  NPI #: 1932490083, looking to verify coverage for something Timothy Stephens is going thru, including a specialized medication that''s very expensive.  It''s a special online prefilled syringe that he said is quite expensive.  This is not a ''prev'' item, but he gave me no indication of what it''s regarding.  I let Tom know Timothy is a ''cash-pay'' pt, but once the ''Need'' is started Timothy will have a consultant regarding treatment.  He''s going to have Timothy call us so we can help Timothy learn how to start a ''Need'' w/Sedera.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-30 13:00:59', '2022-06-30 13:02:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096862003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547277', 'Flora Schule', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she has coverage thru husband.  I will notify Sedera and cancel w/RCI.  Refund 7/22 pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-30 12:17:46', '2022-06-30 12:17:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096861003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, '6-30-2022:  Belinda called.  She''s set 2 appts w/offices from the PHCS list I sent for a colonoscopy.  Both times, shortly before the appt, she rec''d calls saying they have confirmed &amp; they are not in ntwk, even though when she made the appts, they conf they were.  She''s going to call PHCS directly, let them know the issues she''s having to see if they can help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-30 12:08:59', '2022-06-30 12:09:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096857003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080704002', 'Tom Weiss', NULL, '6.29.2022 - Spoke with member at the beginning of her Welcome Call and she stated that she had been signed up for the wrong plan from day 1. I asked the member if she had spoken to Analisa, her advisor, and she said no. I sent Melissa the plan change form via email and walked her through filling it out. Melissa asked that I have Analisa call her with the price difference between Care+ and the Secure plan. Melissa then decided to reschedule her welcome call for some time after her new plan begins. I reached out to Analisa to have her contact Melissa about the price difference. The phone call with Analisa was less than friendly and Analisa insists that she signed the Weiss'' up for the correct plan and that the office staff entered her information incorrectly in the system. When I asked if Analisa would reach out to the member on 6.29.2022 with the pricing difference, she stated that she would talk to her tomorrow. I then spoke with Patti who confirmed that the plan that the Weiss'' were signed up for originally was in fact the Care+ plan. I''m hoping that Analisa follows up with Melissa to confirm pricing and to make sure she has the correct plan. The concierge team should not have to do the advisor''s work. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-30 11:54:34', '2022-06-30 11:55:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096850003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547277', 'Flora Schule', NULL, '06/30/22 Call from Flora Schule she sent an email last month stating she needed to cancel and she never heard back . I told her we do not accept cancelations via email. Transferred her to Jane Kassel for her to speak with. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-30 11:40:24', '2022-06-30 11:40:24'),
