  ('zcrm_1579374000096838003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072820022', 'Erik Horton', NULL, '6-30-2022:  Erik called today, letting me know they never heard from CirrusMD.  Luckily, I had Luis'' notification of what had happened.  Eric did search their e-mail, but they did not receive the respons Luis sent (link & instructions on resetting their pw).  I sent a new supp e-mail & cc''d both Erik & Pamela hoping Luis can use that e-mail to reply to so they will receive the info this time.  Erik will let us know if they continue to have issues.     
     Pamela is finally feeling better today, but Erik wants to make sure they have access next time they need to speak w/an MD.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-30 10:42:39', '2022-06-30 10:42:39'),
