  ('zcrm_1579374000096774072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104296', 'Roland Jefferson Jr', NULL, 'Member called into me and told me that he needed until the 7th to get more funds.  I told him I would give him until then however no longer.  He to call me either the 6th or 7th to authorize. 7/7-member contacted me and told me to rerun pmt as he now had funds.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-30 08:20:39', '2022-07-07 07:49:13'),
