  ('zcrm_1579374000096753008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '06/30/22 Call from Corinne Piazza asking about Chiropractic visits. Told her unless the order comes from her Provider this typically is not a shareable need and she would just pay cash.  She was ok with this . AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-30 07:29:22', '2022-06-30 07:29:22'),
