  ('zcrm_1579374000096774062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '6-29-22 Jennifer isn''t sure if she completed the conversion or not yet. It sounded possibly vaguely familiar. But, she will look in her email to see if she can find anything from Sedera. I let her know it looks like her monthly amount was $655 and now moving to $697.97. She will look at it all tomorrow and she knows 6/30 is the deadline to complete the process if she hasn''t done it yet. She was appreciative of my call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 16:27:21', '2022-06-29 16:27:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162382', 'Juan Rosas', NULL, '6-29-22 I spoke with Juan''s wife Celeste and she wrote down the new monthly amount from $340 to $344.97. I told her I''m not 100% certain but that''s what I believe it to be. She asked about him doing a colonoscopy and I let her know it''s included in the Apex/MPB/PHCS network at no cost if properly coded as wellness. He''s never had one done before. I gave her Concierge Toll Free # to call for coaching in the process. She was super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 16:17:34', '2022-06-29 16:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695225', 'Kevin Thiemann', NULL, '6-29-22 I talked with Kevin and he believes he completed the conversion with Sedera about a month ago and couldn''t remember what was involved in that. He thinks he payment was $720 and I told him it looks to be $729.97 now. He''s totally fine with that and might not have even noticed. All set for this account!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 16:10:37', '2022-06-29 16:10:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096791017', 'Peter Lehmann', NULL, '6-29-22 Looks like Peter''s monthly amount is changing from $783 to $774.97. I left him a vm letting him know, but expressed I''m not 100% certain this is the accurate amount. He''s welcome to call me if he has questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 16:01:52', '2022-06-29 16:01:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096791017', 'Peter Lehmann', NULL, '6-29-22 Merged two old accounts showing as Leads for Dr. Peter Lehmann. The 360-930-3500 might not be an accurate #. His old address was showing as 19319 7th Ave. NE Ste. 114, Poulsbo, WA 98370.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 15:53:49', '2022-06-29 15:53:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438028', 'Richard Reiter', NULL, '6-29-22 I left a vm for Richard bc he lives in WA and is being forced to move with a new monthly amount looking to be $238.65 with a $5000 IUA! I want to make sure he understands the IUA is not a ded and how it''s different.  Also want him to know the new monthly amount.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 15:41:52', '2022-06-29 15:41:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '6-29-22 I called Sammy bc her new cost looks to be $232.97 but with a $5000 IUA!  She completed the conversion with Sedera but didn''t understand that the IUA is different from a deductible. Neither of us can tell what her previous IUA was. I suggested she doesn''t go any higher than the $1500 IUA and she agreed. She will call Sedera tomorrow to see if she can change that back to a lower one. She doesn''t want that big of a financial risk. Fortunately she has no health issues and never uses her membership. She lives in TX, hence the forced change. I also asked her to call me back or email me to let me know what she changed the IUA back to. She said she will.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 15:36:31', '2022-06-29 15:37:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096787008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '6.29.2022 - I followed up with Jennifer today regarding her conversation with Care (see note below from Cari. Jennifer insisted that I revamp my Welcome Call schedule to fit her time constraints because "my schedule was inconvenient for her". Unfortunately, I am unable to change my schedule and when I told Jennifer, she suggested that I stay later or come in before the start of my shift to do her call. After her back and forth with me trying to convince me to rearrange my work schedule for her convenience, we finally came to a solution regarding her Welcome Call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-29 15:28:11', '2022-06-29 15:28:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '6-29-22 Shelly called bc Sedera is forcing her to convert since she has  a new Need. She didn''t know what to do. The prices are not the same as what she''s paying. John promised to have the accurate price to me by today but he''s not in the office unexpectedly. I let Shelly know to complete the conversion process since he deadline is June 30th. She will do so. I let her know that her price will still remain the same until further notice. She is ok with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 15:24:15', '2022-06-29 15:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096787003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '6.29.2022 - Per Joan''s request, I emailed information regarding preventative services to Jessica and Joanna explaining why she should use PHCS network doctors and how to make sure her preventative care services are coded correctly by the physician''s office. I also CC''d Joan on this email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-29 15:24:11', '2022-06-29 15:24:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096726029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083206010', 'Elgin Hines', NULL, '6-29-2022:  Elgin called to find out how to handle (his son''s?) seizure incident.  They''ve already spent &gt;their 1k IUA.   I sent him the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion &amp; went over all the details.  Trans him to directly to Zion at the end of the conv so he can req his Zion Memb #.   He seems like a super nice guy &amp; very open to learning the processes/components of their membership.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-29 15:22:55', '2022-06-29 15:51:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448053', 'Jonathan Brumbaugh', NULL, '6-29-22 Jonathan Brumbaugh Hiller is enrolling again for Aug. 1st start date with SECURE. He''s doing freelance work and just moved back to CO from NY about 3 weeks ago.  No pre-x, but yes on mental health meds, ceraquil, abilify and fluvoxamine, no tobacco. He''s psyched for the Life Care benefit.  Yes, does his annual wellness visits. I waived the $100 because Jonathan was a previous member. I also let Natalie Lampert know that we don''t pay a 2nd referral fee since she already referred him the 1st time around. She was fine with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 15:16:11', '2022-06-29 15:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121181012', 'Melanie Miller', NULL, '6-29-22 Melanie is choosing to stay with UHC for her final year. She''s not ready to make the leap to MCS for just one year before Medicare. I will connect her to Andrea for Medicare which she''s wanting to get started on that when it''s appropriate. Happy to work with Andrea.  Her son is on Medicaid for special needs and that was a nightmare to set up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 14:36:58', '2022-06-29 14:36:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096774003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121181012', 'Melanie Miller', NULL, '6-29-22 Melanie and I had a meeting now and she didn''t answer. I left her a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 14:04:39', '2022-06-29 14:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096726024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081677010', 'James Benjamin', NULL, '6-29-2022:  According to our member Kelley Winovich, James & Kelley are getting married next week.  She had questions about ''prev'' care, comb their memb, etc:
