  ('zcrm_1579374000096726011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '6-29-2022:  Jennifer Richter called. She says can''t wait until July 1st for her ''Welcome Call'' even though they aren''t effective until July 1st.  Her daughter is traveling & she just can''t wait.  She got rather threatening when I wouldn''t stop right then to do it with her:  "Well, if you can''t help what good is this company" (paraphrasing).  I explained how our ''Welcome Call'' Team Members set aside all their other resp & sched the appt because they focus on that one person for that 1/2 hour.  But, I cannot just do it when they call the concierge line.  I also explained that we can''t do her ''Welcome Call'' until their eff date because their accounts need to be active at the time of the call.  After repeating, and repeating, and being told I needed to do it right then or what good was I, I finally offered to have Jennifer Thorin call her in case she has flexibility I am unaware of.  I also mentioned this is something her Advisor should be able to clarify for her, but she didn''t remember who that was & I cannot tell from the ''Medical Freedom'' listed in her acct.  She seemed to think it was the concierge''s responsibilty to explain to her what she''s purchased...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-29 12:46:30', '2022-06-29 12:46:30'),
