  ('zcrm_1579374000096726003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081302002', 'David Pearson', NULL, 'Due to back-to-back calls, I didn''t get my documentation done until after she''d called back & tt Jennifer (see above).

6-29-2022:  Lisa called in (she sounds horrible).  She caught Covid & thinks it''s getting worse.  We disc calling CirrusMD, going to a doc, Urg Care, or ER & she wanted to try CirrusMD.  CirrusMD says they cannot find matching info, so I sent a supp tckt letting them know Lisa would like to see a doc asap.  She''s going to watch this e-mail:  ld_pearson@hotmail.com & asked them to help setup both their acct.  She wants David''s acct to utilize the ld_pearson@yahoo.com  (yes, they are almost identical).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-29 12:20:26', '2022-06-29 12:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096718003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081302002', 'David Pearson', NULL, '6.29.2022 - Lisa called because she is experiencing COVID-19 symptoms that are scaring her. She was going to wait until we got her CirrusMD account corrected, but her husband advised her to go to the ER or Urgent Care (her husband is a doctor). I told her she did not have to start with CirrusMD and if her symptoms were concerning her enough to go in, then she should go to an ER or Urgent Care. I also advised that if the ER or Urgent Care question her about insurance, to give them the MPB.Health concierge number and ask for Jennifer so that I can explain her plan to them. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-29 12:04:55', '2022-06-29 12:04:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096709008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '6-29-2022:  Jatin called.  The cancellation confirmation e-mail did not make it to him, so I cut & pasted the orig into a new e-mail in my Outlook & he rec''d that one.  He asked about the refund.  I let him know I can see from Patti''s notes she will be processing that for him.  He also asked:  When I''m back in the country a few months from now how to I re-enroll.  I sugg that his advisor Jan Capodi can help him with that.  We discussed deadline & eff dates too.  He know he must sub his appl no later than the 20th of the prev month (we discussed doing it between the 10th & 15th).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-29 11:17:53', '2022-06-29 11:17:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096669051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095950001', 'Jennifer Kries', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-29 11:13:14', '2022-06-29 11:13:14'),
