  ('zcrm_1579374000096709003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091225002', 'Robert Howell', NULL, '6-29-2022:  LM for Gimena on the # in this file: (801) 971-2283.  Then Jennifer gave me this #: 801-971-6687 & I caught her there.  She had the labs done at LabCorp like we discussed back in May, but didn''t do any of the other steps I sugg.  Now she''s thinking maybe they billed her old ins?  I sugg calling them, ask for the ''cash-pay'' prices since she does not have that old ins any longer.  Then let them know Planstin may cover a little but she''s not sure what, so can they please bill the lab work to them & she''ll pay the ''cash-pay'' price when she knows what she''s resp for (or if the disc rate is better, she''ll then have that option).  I think she understood...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-29 11:02:55', '2022-06-29 11:02:55'),
