  ('zcrm_1579374000096669033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096696002', 'Ryan Hafich', NULL, '06.29.22:  Enrolled Ryan today in SECURE w/a $1000 IUA.  Messaged John to switch Ryan''s start date from August 1 to July 1.  No pre-x or meds, smoker but working on stopping.
