  ('zcrm_1579374000096669008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095964011', 'Benjamin Deweese', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of July 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-29 09:32:42', '2022-06-29 09:32:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096680008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '6-29-22 Jen set up her C4 account and watched the MCS video on my site. She has no other options for July unless she joins C4. Then we can have her join SECURE for Aug. 1st onward.
She enrolled in Anthem Bronze Mountain Enhanced X HMO 7050 for HSA for $1395.47 to keep funding the HSA and in case her husband won''t try MCS. This will hold them over for 1 month or til the end of the year. She knows to call C4 now to request July 1st start date and to show proof of SEP with Cobra letter. She also wanted to make sure Dr. Vickerman is in network which she is for Anthem. I didn''t see Friday Health as accepted by CO Mountain Medical. Only Anthem and RMHP/UHC. All set for now. We have another appt on July 11th at 1:00 to further discuss MCS/SECURE for family. She knows $715 for 2 months and then $915 onward once she turns 50. OK with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 09:30:41', '2022-06-29 11:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096680003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967156', 'Alexandria Wright', NULL, '6-29-22 Alexandria wants to reinstate her membership claiming she thought she got the payments all squared away. But, she never paid for April or May. Patti was able to backdate the cancellation to May 1st but she still owes us for April. I''m waiting to connect with her. If she''s willing and able to pay for April then we might be able to get her started again for Aug 1st. I will try to have her pay for April with a different payment method and perhaps doing so moving forward since her bank already has MPB flagged as an entity she doesn''t want to pay for. We''ll see...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-29 09:29:28', '2022-06-29 09:29:28'),
