  ('zcrm_1579374000096642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '06.28.22:  Emailed Joan to thank her for her membership.  Explained what documents she will be receiving with on-boarding instructions and to remember to schedule her welcome call after 7/1/22.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-29 08:24:25', '2022-06-29 08:24:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844213', 'Jeffrey Jackson', NULL, '6-28-2022:  tt Jeff: cholesterol is high, MD wants him to have a heartscore test done.  ''Cash-pay'' is only going to be $99.
     - We discussed saving receipts, inv, etc, in case something shows up and he can start a need.  I lost my orig notes and do not remember everything we went over...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-28 17:55:17', '2022-06-28 17:55:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '6-28-2022:  Jody had her MD appt today & she''s staying on the Synthroid Brand 125mcg.  (Since she had Covid, her body hasn''t been regulating, so it''s been iffy.)  Now that she''s had that appt, the Dr made her new RX for #90.  This is a lgr qty than Reid can usually do, but since it''s mfg size, he can do this for an amazing price:  $65.74 + $9.95 = $75.69.  The cheapest on any of the discount sites today was ~$130.  She''s almost out, so I sent her a coupon for #10, $18.36 at Hy-Vee.  Reid''s info was in the same e-mail so she''ll reach out to him tomorrow.  All together, she''ll get #110 for $94.05 and save a good amt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-28 17:54:16', '2022-08-02 15:18:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096571041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '6-28-22 Jen Hooker was referred to me by Chad Ziegler and they''ve been friends for 20 years and she totally trusts him. He spoke very highly of me! She was curious about Freedom Life/US Health. I gave her my honest opinion but let her know some folks are happy. She won''t bother. Her family is all healthy. They have until June 30th to choose Cobra for $1250 a month which she doesn''t want to do. It has a $6K month ded. They had to go onto a payment plan to even pay off their ded in the past. Finances are better now but it''s not ideal. That was with UHC and cofinity. They live in Vail and she''s a massage therapist. Her husband was with the same company for 20 years and now with a new company who doesn''t offer reasonable benefits. So, they''d like to learn about MCS. We can get them onto C4 for 1 month of July and switch to SECURE for Aug. 1st onward. So, I''ll send her instructions to create C4 account and select agent as well as MCS video to watch before our 10:00 am appt tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-28 17:42:28', '2022-06-28 17:42:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366121', 'Brian Trebus', NULL, '6-28-2022:  Jennifer from the surgeon''s off called for validation of coverage.  Let her know Brian is a ''cash-pay'' patient.  After discussing that Brian has healthsharing & I''d need to find out if Brian what Brian has done, I''d call her back.
     - tt Brian.  He hasn''t done anything towards the ''need'' he started via ph when he called Zion prior to talking w/us clear back at the beginning of June.  He''s going to go into his e-mail to look for the form he must sign for them to start considered sharing.  He now knows Zion is who can confirm financial help.
     - LM for Jennifer @ dr''s off, Brian is going to get some answers for her.  Let her know we do not handle payment confirmations like she''s looking for.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-28 16:28:46', '2022-06-28 16:28:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096569011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096696002', 'Ryan Hafich', NULL, '06.28.22:  Notified by Jennifer, Ryan called, referred by Zion, as he is interested in having an HSA.  He is a real estate business owner and lives in CA, so he is eligible for SECURE.  I explained the plan.  Ryan is age 40 and healthy, no medications, rarely sees a doctor.  He is excited about the plan and wants to enroll for July 1 so he can avoid the CA mandate charging him for not having coverage.  I emailed Ryan the link to my site and the Zion Guidelines.  I also called John to ask if I could enroll Ryan for a July 1 start and John said yes.  Ryan called and I told him we could enroll for July 1.  We scheduled a call to enroll for tomorrow at 12 noon EST.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-28 15:50:29', '2022-06-28 15:50:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096571036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '6.28.2022 - I emailed Joanna and Jessica a list of PHCS in-network OBGYN''s in her area and explained how to present her Planstin card to the office staff per Joan''s request. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-28 14:49:21', '2022-06-28 14:49:21'),
