  ('zcrm_1579374000096571026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068994027', 'Linda Garcia', NULL, '6.28.2022 - Linda called because she is having a procedure done this winter for her Varicose veins. She wanted to know if this is something that is covered by the plan, I advised that she would be responsible for her $1000 IUA but Zion will share in the rest. She stated that she is not having the surgery until this coming winter and said she would call us back in August to get the process started. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-28 14:21:50', '2022-06-28 14:21:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096534066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066423040', 'Jacob Mouchet', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add newborn Charli.  I will notify Planstin and add in A123.  No change in price already a family.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-28 14:16:16', '2022-06-28 14:16:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096563127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094318001', 'Jason Sibson', NULL, '6-28-22 Per Jason, "Yes please cancel all policies, thank you."  I''ve successfully cancelled Bright Health and Direct Benefits/Ameritas. Now awaiting Jason to complete the HMA cancellation form for the final step. He has 60 days to do so. But, I asked him to do it immediately so he''s not billed again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-28 14:06:39', '2022-06-28 16:30:54'),
