  ('zcrm_1579374000096569006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '06.28.22:  Recvd. a text from Jessica. She needs to schedule an annual well-woman visit and asked us to find one for her in her area (in the PHCS network).  She asked us to relay our information to her assistant, Joanna Mangohig, as well,  so Joanna could make the appt. for her.  I responded I will have Jennifer do the search for her and get back to her and Joanna with providers within 15 miles of her residence.  Called Jenn and asked her to follow up on this task.  
Joanna''s email is:  joannamangohig@gmail.com', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-28 13:51:35', '2022-06-28 13:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096565095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844213', 'Jeffrey Jackson', NULL, 'He needs to do a heart scan and it’s not covered by Planstin. I offered him a call back.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-06-28 13:10:51', '2022-06-28 13:10:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096565090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'Monica called asking how she can get reimbursement for her medical bills. I advised her to call Sedera Health to help her to submit a need. I provided her their phone number.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-06-28 12:56:25', '2022-06-28 12:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096565085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061132', 'David Pool', NULL, 'Wendy called asking if she has to show her Planstin card when she does a mammogram or submit a need. I explained her that the mammogram is included on her plan and she has to show her Planstin card. In this case since she said that is self-paid, I advised her to submit the need on Planstin''s website.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-06-28 12:50:00', '2022-06-28 12:50:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096571021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091125002', 'Kevin Whalen', NULL, '6.28.2022 - Kevin called in with questions regarding his upcoming preventative colonoscopy and what he needed to present. He verified that the doctor and facility were in-network and I advised him to present his Planstin card to the desk. Kevin was very happy with his service today! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-28 11:51:39', '2022-06-28 11:51:39'),
