  ('zcrm_1579374000096563107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094318001', 'Jason Sibson', NULL, '6-28-22 I called yet again and can''t leave a vm ever. I''ve emailed multiple times and sent a text as well. No response from Jason about any of his accounts. I successfully removed Jennifer Abbott''s payment method from Bright Health''s portal, I requested the removal from Direct Benefits/Ameritas for VSP and received confirmation that is was removed today. Finally I called HMA and spoke with Jackie and she talked with Geoff Kirk who removed the payment method himself.  I gave Jason until the end of today to respond about VSP. He has 60 days to decide if he wants to pay for the HMA and then they will auto-cancel for non-payment. I notified Jennifer about each one as we worked through the process. She should be all set now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-28 10:58:34', '2022-06-28 10:58:34'),
