  ('zcrm_1579374000096571008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364020', 'Toni Woods', NULL, '6.28.2022 - Toni called to schedule her preventative colonoscopy. I explained to Toni that with her current plan she would have to speak to RCI because they will help her get her coloscopy scheduled. Since she hasn''t used her plan in a while, she was confused as to why I couldn''t schedule her colonoscopy for her. I explained that RCI/APEX likes to help our members schedule their preventative appointments and advised Toni that if she ever has any questions to just call the concierge line and we would be happy to assist her any way that we can. I transferred Toni to RCI to get her colonoscopy scheduled.~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-28 10:10:49', '2022-06-28 10:12:33'),
