  ('zcrm_1579374000096571003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093928002', 'John Stagge', NULL, '6.28.2022 - Angela called because her adult children did not receive their CirrusMD invites that I sent yesterday. I resent the invites and asked Angela to call me back in 10-15 minutes if they hadn''t received them, then I would reach out to CirrusMD. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-28 07:14:15', '2022-06-28 07:14:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096561039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990301', 'Sheri Razee Karner', NULL, '6-27-2022:  Sheri e-mailed and asked if she should still sub her ''need'' so everything would go towards her "ded".  I replied &amp; explained IUA vs ded briefly, but asked her know to call us so we can go over details.  Encouraged her to sub the need asap in case this continues because they only allow 6-mos to sub the earliest expense for inclusion.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-27 18:13:24', '2022-06-27 18:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096561034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355002', 'Linda Reely', NULL, '6-27-2022:  She''s been having issues w/a cough.  1st they thought she had the same issue as last yr = allergies, but that treatment didn''t help.  Now they''ve moved to bronchitis, then they gave her an antibiotic.  They don''t think it''s Covid, but it''s now causing her heart rate to increase and she wants to see specialist.  She says she''s close to her "ded", so we went over this isn''t ins, so it''s not a deductible.
      We talked about pre-x just in case it''s considered pre-x (went over step-up of sharing, etc.).  I sent her temp for sub a ''need'' and at the end of the call trans her to Zion to request her memb # & went over all the details about how to get the ''need'' started.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-27 17:13:29', '2022-06-27 17:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096561026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080704002', 'Tom Weiss', NULL, '6-27-2022:  Melissa called wanting to learn how to utilize their plan.  Saying it''s time for annual physicals, etc.  We started by recognizing that they may have gotten signed-up for a plan that does not have ''prev'' care.
     - I sent her the invitation to sched her ''Welcome Call''  & from the time she picked, I sent a chat to Jennifer that Melissa thinks they need to be on the Secure plan (they are self-employed).
     - Sent Patti''s chg form temp, because Melissa needs to add her e-mail address: melissa@c2team.com.  She thinks things are going to her husb & she''s the one that takes care of things.  Although, after talking it may be a moot point because they are going to have to re-enroll into the correct Secure plan.
     - Melissa knows they must corr the plan enrollment & the earliest it can be eff is 8/1/2022.  She seemed to think her advisor Analisa Cleland was certain this plan had ''prev'' care, so I let her know to please have Analisa contact the office if she has questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-27 17:07:57', '2022-06-27 17:08:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096563018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096555046', 'Anastazia Laubert', NULL, '6-27-22 Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 7000 for HSA, Plan ID 76680CO0220022-01. Account # 9048568059.  Home address 2814 Ridge View Circle, Apartment C, Erie, CO 80516.  Cost $504.86 ending June 30th. APTC was $429.93.  Looks like the APTC was for 2021 and plan cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-27 16:56:59', '2022-06-27 17:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096563013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096555046', 'Anastazia Laubert', NULL, '6-27-22 Anastazia got a new job and has coverage that started on June 11th. She called C4 to cancel and it still looked Active. That''s because it is active through June 30th. C4 did successfully cancel her on 6/16/22 per the online portal. It wouldn''t allow me to cancel since it was already cancelled. I suggested she call Anthem to make sure her payment is cancelled as well. She will do that. She''s also referring me to her friend Susan Santelices at 415-298-9899 who lives in CO and has 2 boys who may be on x-husbands coverage.  Susan can be tough to reach if I try calling her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-27 16:51:54', '2022-06-27 16:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096565012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '06.27.22:  Told John about annual membership fee missing on OPD enrollment form and he fixed it.  Called Joan and scheduled enrollment mtg. for 4:00 p.m. today.  I told her we are waving her enrollment fee of $100 per Primary Partners.  She wants a 7/1/22 start date.
Joan emailed and asked if we could move time to 5:00 p.m., which I did.  She, then, emailed and said she had more work to complete could we change meeting to tomorrow.  I told her the problem is we''re trying to get her enrolled for a July 1 start date and we''re already very late.  I told her it wouldn''t take long and could she find 10 - 15 min. to complete the enrollment.  Have not yet heard back from her.
Enrolled Joan for July 1 start date.  Her enrollment fee was waved, per Mitesh''s approval.  Explained the on-boarding process and told her to schedule her Welcome Call after her start date.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-27 15:05:02', '2022-06-27 16:04:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096565007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '06.25.22:  Called John to check status of rate engine for the OPD enrollment pages.  John said all is ready.  I checked and found there is no field for $25 annual membership fee.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-27 15:02:14', '2022-06-27 15:02:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082307002', 'Massimo Giammarco', NULL, '6.27.2022 - Massimo had many questions, so we did not get through the whole welcome call. We did schedule another call for Wednesday @ 3:30 PM. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-27 14:59:31', '2022-06-27 14:59:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096553030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093928002', 'John Stagge', NULL, 'QR Life Code Card assigned to 3rd child Sam Stagge: H0J7F. No space available where the QR Codes are assigned above. Sending Sam his QR Code today, didn''t see him when I put the families Fulfillment Package together the first time. John also called and spoke with Jennifer requesting more cards for his children as they do not live at home anymore and I guess requested for extra cards. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-06-27 14:25:24', '2022-06-27 14:25:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096563003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, '6-27-22 Gordon just ended his job with Beaumont Healthcare and can choose Cobra but it''s super expensive. He''s happy to rejoin with SECURE as newly self-employed person doing consulting work and setting up LLC today. He''s 54, wife 52 and daughter 22, 3 sons 20, 18, 8. Live in MI and was previous MPB member, so I waived $100 fee. He''s enrolling in SECURE $2500/$765 EF. They do annual wellness visits, he has funded HSA in past. He had a hernia in Dec. 2021 and currently has well managed high blood pressure. Just remembered he had a basal cell spot removed and no further issue. I told him to check his records on that and make sure that nothing else it deemed as pre-x bc they are watching it. Let him know doctors protect themselves not us. One kid had mono at beginning or 2021 and no further issues.  He learned recently that by going in as cash pay the price is half of what is billed through insurance. Some hospitals were audited and this was exposed! He''s from South Africa with a great accent. He lived in Vail for 2 ski seasons. In MI decided to learn to tele ski to have a new challenge.  He''s all set with SECURE for Aug. 1st. Also looked up Dr. Stephanie Bierlein-Timinsky and didn''t show up in network but the entire Beaumont Healthcare site showed that they accept PHCS/Multi Plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-27 14:16:58', '2022-06-27 14:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093928002', 'John Stagge', NULL, '6.27.2022 - Welcome Call done! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-27 14:03:44', '2022-06-27 14:03:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096561021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065203150', 'Karen Weinberg', NULL, '6-27-2022:   Karen called &amp; needed help getting back into her CirrusMD.  Got her in and it sounds like she''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-27 14:02:38', '2022-06-27 14:02:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096551013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, '06/27/22 Steven Tyler called and had some easy questions about his colonoscopy and his cardiac stress test that his provider ordered.  We did discuss that if they do a biopsy its no longer preventative and that cardiac stress test while should be considered preventative are not. He was ok with that. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-27 13:52:57', '2022-06-27 13:52:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096553025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096791017', 'Peter Lehmann', NULL, 'QR Code for 5th child Garrett: H0183. There is no 5th space available to put Garrett''s QR Code in the QR Code spaces with the rest of the family over 18 that gets one. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-06-27 13:15:21', '2022-06-27 13:15:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096553014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, '6/2/22-Sent member 1st notice for the aging into the 30 age band 6/27-sent 2nd notice.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-27 13:04:12', '2022-06-27 13:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096561013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, '6-27-2022:  Gordon was let-go from the hospital job he''d started working with that was providing benefits.  He called to see if he can start a plan w/us again.  Transferred him to his advisor: Wendy Scipione &amp; made sure he has her number.  He''ll LM for her if he doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-27 12:59:46', '2022-06-27 13:08:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, '6.27.2022 - Geoffrey called in to find out if he had to use a network for a cardiologist. I explained that because this is not a preventative service, he does not have a network to worry about and I explained the self-pay process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-27 12:24:34', '2022-06-27 12:24:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096561003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094857002', 'Brenda Reeves', NULL, '6-27-2022:  Brenda called.  She wondered if a ''Sched F'' would work for proof of self-employment.  I wasn''t sure so I trans her dir to Patti Baron.  She will LM if she doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-27 12:16:48', '2022-06-27 12:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '6.27.22 - Martha called in regarding Daniel''s CirrusMD account. I sent Daniel a new CirrusMD invitation and walked Martha through the steps to log into CirrusMD on her computer. She was very happy with her interaction! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-27 11:41:19', '2022-06-27 11:41:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096534018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092843002', 'Madison Yount', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-27 11:22:18', '2022-06-27 11:22:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096551008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032445', 'David Hammer', NULL, '06/27/22 David Hammer  Calling to make sure he still has access to telehealth. Yes, he has already registered with CirrusMD so gave him the website to contact the providers. He has Covid and just wantsto make sure he doesnt need  to see anyone. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-27 10:41:50', '2022-06-27 10:41:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096534013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093792001', 'Michele Bottoms', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-27 10:22:08', '2022-06-27 10:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096553003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add newborn to her membership.  I will notify Zion and change billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-27 09:51:19', '2022-06-27 09:51:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096551003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, '06/27/22 Call from Lafi Abdeljaber Very nice.  He is getting ready to schedule his daughter''s wellness exam for when school starts and was looking for a list of Providers. I did email him a list of Family Practice and Pediatricians in his area. He also requested a hard card for Planstin.  Told him I would request one. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-27 09:49:30', '2022-06-27 09:49:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096534008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199008', 'Astraea Davidson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. 41 min on call. Have to have patience with this member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-27 09:45:55', '2022-06-27 09:45:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, '6.27.2022 - Member''s wife, Elaina, was transferred to us via Planstin. She is upset because she thought that since they paid their first payment to MPB/Empowering Benefits in June 2021 that''s when her plan started. She had an ECG done in June 2021 thinking her plan had started. I explained that when she paid in June 2021, that was for her July 2021 payment. She did not like that answer that I provided. She does not understand any of the components of her plan and has been using her Planstin card to get her prescriptions. I advised Elaina to stop using her Planstin card for prescriptions and to call the Empowering benefits concierge line for any prescription needs. Elaina then told me that she finds us tedious, after many times of interrupting me while I was trying to answer her questions. I tried to explain all of the components to her plan to her, but she just wanted to know if her next ECG would be covered and if I could give her a guarantee. I let Elaina know that I am not authorized to guarantee anything, and at this point she told me to hold on. There was dead silence at the other end of the phone for about a minute. I think our call dropped but I am not sure and I tried calling both numbers on file but no answer and no vm. ~JTS

ALSO, please advise Elaina that they have not done a full welcome call with anyone and it would be very beneficial to do so. She had told me that they did do a welcome call, but upon reading all of the notes I see that they did a "min" welcome call at the beginning of their plan start.', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-27 09:10:50', '2022-06-27 09:30:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096534003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199008', 'Astraea Davidson', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. . Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-27 09:02:52', '2022-06-27 09:02:52');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000096523003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177182', 'Anna Thexton', NULL, '6.27.2022 - Anna called because she went to the Urgent Care this weekend for joint pain and just not feeling well all around. The UC doctor gave Anna Prednisone and wanted her to follow up with her PCP. Anna doesn''t have a PCP, so I will be sending her that list in the zip code of 80027. I advised Anna to keep her detailed billing from her UC visit, along with the bloodwork detailed billing that she had done this weekend. I explained the self-pay process and also sent Anna an address change form to change her address. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-27 08:54:23', '2022-06-27 08:54:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096517003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141140', 'Cami Brecto', NULL, 'Changed start date from Jul 1, 2019 to July 1,  2022', 'Julia Avalon', 'Julia Avalon', '2022-06-27 08:21:38', '2022-06-27 08:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096485003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912010', 'Fred Fong', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of August 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-27 07:27:53', '2022-06-27 07:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096456042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '6-24-2022:  Figge called, KS is no longer accepting GoodRX coupons.  I let him know they did not renew their contract w/GoodRX, but was able to find a great coupon w/RXGo &amp; still at KS (he was willing to consider Costco if nec but they were ~$40 w/coup).  KS turned out to be cheapest again using the following:  Generic Adderall 10mg, #120 @ KS = $29.01.  Figge knows options may adjust w/time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-24 19:54:40', '2022-06-24 19:54:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096456023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, 'NOTE:  Hillary suffers from horrible migraines & prefers e-mail, but I think the difficulty in getting all the info communicated that way may be part of the issue.  I sugg''d it''s always best to start w/the concierge ph line so we can direct her in the proper direction.

6-24-2022:  Totally frustrated, Hillary called the concierge line, via the sales line (now even more frustrated because she''s having to say everything again).  I made sure she had the concierge # for next time & let her know this is the best place to start.
     - Her lab work came back & she wants to know why they didn''t pay it.  I suggested there are several poss reasons:  1) only 2 labs the gvmt mandate includes as part of the ''prev'' MEC coverage  2) Out of network lab?  Planstin sb able to see the bills to know why this came back unpaid.*
         Then, it sounds to me like the doctor may have done treatment(s) during her ''prev'' appt.  She could not remember if the intravaginal ultrasound was in the ''prev'' appt, but that could chg the coding of the ''prev'' appt.  She said the doctor told her follow-up is always covered.  [Not on ''prev'', but I''ll let Planstin go over that w/her.]
         Finally, I let her know we cannot see the bills, etc, but Planstin will be able to see the coding and why things have been declined.  I made sure she had their ph # & trans her directly to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-24 18:58:09', '2022-06-24 19:22:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096444029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176160', 'Kari Mitchell', NULL, '6-24-22 Kari just called me back to understand what she needs to do to show proof of SEP.  She had loss of coverage due to change in job. She will look for a letter or ask her HR from previous employer and read my email to submit it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-24 17:14:36', '2022-06-24 17:14:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096456018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '6-24-2022:  Ryan called.  He just got a new job that will provide healthcare for himself & his kids, but Jackie wants to stay w/MPB.  Since he''s primary, I let him know it''ll take cancelling his plan & having her re-enroll.  Also, they may have to adjust Jackie to one of our new plans, BUT our Ben Admin Patti Baron will be able to direct him.  He doesn''t need this to be effective until 10/1/2022.  I sent him the plan change form since he''s going to need guidance on removing / re-enrolling & let him know he should submit that ~Sept 10th.  Once Patti has a chance to instruct him on how to handle it, he will need a cancellation form for his old plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-24 16:24:22', '2022-06-24 16:24:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096444021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094318001', 'Jason Sibson', NULL, '6-24-22 I emailed multiple email accounts and called Jason. I gave him a Thursday, June 23rd deadline to respond to me as to whether he wants to keep his medical with Bright Health, HMA and vision insurance. He hasn''t responded. I was able to remove Jennifer Abbott''s, his employer''s payment method for Bright Health.  I sent an email to HMA and Ameritas and Direct Benefits for the VSP plan.  I couldn''t leave him a VM but I sent him a text as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-24 16:04:32', '2022-06-24 16:10:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096462013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634019', 'Carol Scott', NULL, '06/24/22 Spoke with Sand Lake surgery Center for Aundre Scott verifying benefits. If he calls back he needs to get his needs started with Zion because this facility will make him pay for everything all up front. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-24 14:39:49', '2022-06-24 14:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096411062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096344002', 'Mark Leubscher', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-24 14:39:15', '2022-06-24 14:39:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096411057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096466002', 'Tamara Doverspike', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-24 14:34:33', '2022-06-24 14:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096411052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-24 14:28:04', '2022-06-24 14:28:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096444016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, '6-24-22 Lewis left his previous employer and his 3 months of Cobra end on June 30th. CRM shows he lives in WA state but he actually moved to UT to be closer to his kids. So, we are still able to help him! His new company offers terrible insurance, so he prefers this. His wife Rhonda is self-employed so they qualify. He chose the $2500 IUA / $765 EF 50-65 age group. They don''t have any health issues, except Rhonda had her thyroid removed at some point and takes meds for it now. Daughter takes Abilify for mental health stuff and that''s it for the family. We are able to get him in for a July 1st start date since he inquired before deadline, but I didn''t think we could enroll him since his old address showed in CRM.  All set thanks to Patti and John!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-24 14:26:24', '2022-06-24 14:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096411047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'Was previous Zion Conversion member frm 8/1/2020 to 12/1/2021', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-24 14:25:16', '2022-06-24 14:25:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096444011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064227248', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '6-24-22 Ann called to understand if her Anthem plan includes a preventative mammogram. I coached her in how to go about it in network, with the card and make sure it''s billed as preventative only. She understands.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-24 12:54:17', '2022-06-24 12:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096456013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '6-24-2022:  Jill called & needed a ton of guidance:
     - 5/13/2022 - Jill had a gardening accident & ended-up w/2 huge gashes on her face.  She went to the ER for stiches @ Swedish Med Cntr & presented as a ''cash-pay'' patient & got a good discount.  Pd the $585 & was told her bill was pd in full.  Now a $732 billed from a phys office is coming in via a text!  She says CO passed a law requiring good faith estimates for all ''cash-pay'' pts, but she never rec''d that.  The hosp told her she must go to CO Attorney General''s office to file the complaint.  These texts are offering a 50% discount if she pays w/in 30-days = $366.  She''s receiving multiple notices via text, but has been unable to confirm w/the hosp this bill is legit. With only 30-days from Fri, June 10th it''s time sensitive.  They are texting her & not sending a bill so she''s not sure exactly what to think.
     Sent her the temp to sub a ''need'' to Zion.  Even if it''s not > than her 1k IUA, they sb willing to verify the charges are legit & advocate for her.  She''ll sub immed due to the disc deadline.
     - In talking, we realized the doctor is doing diagnostic (she thinks) heart testing.  It''s included an MRI, etc & is over her 1k IUA.  It started a few months ago but she''s under the deadline to start a sep ''need'' for this issue as well.  We went over how to sub both ''needs'', to keep them separate, what to submit, etc.,  & that Zion will determine if this is a qualified ''need'' for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-24 12:49:34', '2022-06-24 19:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096462008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064227248', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '06/24/22 call from An. has no coverage with us and she was wondering if she did?  looks like it is with Anthem.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-24 12:40:27', '2022-06-24 12:40:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096456008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072820022', 'Erik Horton', NULL, '6-24-2022:  Erik called totally frustrated.  Pamela isn''t feeling well and they are trying to get into their CirrusMD acct for her.  He says they''ve tried resetting the PW and do not receive the e-mail.  When I try to register both Erik & Pamela, I rec the error mess that they do not have matching records for either of them.  I didn''t try their 25-yr old daughter since I don''t know her unique e-mail.  
     Sent an e-mail req for help to CirrusMD and let them know Pamela''s not feeling well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-24 12:34:15', '2022-06-24 12:34:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096462003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '06/24/22 Spoke with Elsa Abookire she was calling because she needed to know what to do for the order she received to get an endoscopy and colonoscopy from her provider. I sent her the link to Zion and walked her through the steps. She will call back if she has questions. I told her to have her Providers office call us to verify her benefits with us as they wanted her to pre-pay for her procedures.', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-24 12:22:54', '2022-06-24 12:22:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096411039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update in A123. Update- member put erroneous exp date  on Cognito form I left VM for member to get correct date. 6/28- Drew called in and gave me the correct exp date I will rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-24 12:12:13', '2022-06-28 07:40:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096411034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248001', 'Thelma Goucher', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Jane.  She will be receiving Employer coverage.  I will notify Planstin and refund 7/22 pmt already billed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-24 12:00:36', '2022-06-24 12:00:36'),
