  ('zcrm_1579374000096354003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083471002', 'Randall Mass', NULL, '06/24/22 call from Randall Mass he received a referral to a gastroenterologist. Told him to get the cash pay discount and open up a need through Zion emailed him the link and walked him through how to submit a need.  He was good with what he has to do. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-24 07:16:20', '2022-06-24 07:16:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096350003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093902001', 'James Buckley', NULL, '6.24.2022 - Vicki''s script quote from 6/9/22 was completed, Jennifer just forgot to put it in the notes and mark it as completed in Cognito Forms. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-24 07:02:26', '2022-06-24 07:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096346011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '6-23-2022:  Realized today &amp; John Kach confirmed -- this is Redirect!  Redirect does the telehealth, so no CirrusMD.  W/my computer down, my normal info wasn''t at hand &amp; I forgot!
     LM for Anna to call the # I gave her for Redirect for telehealth (&amp; apologized for the delay), then also gave her her user name = @me.com e-mail &amp; PW = 5D0jbhdeco in the mess.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-23 17:57:30', '2022-06-23 17:57:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096346003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, '6-23-2022:  Art called to ask about how to get a diagnostic colonoscopy after issues in his last colonoscopy.  (They want to make sure he''s still okay after some issues @ the 5yr mark from his last ck.  Sugg he ask MD how it will be coded: diagnostic?  so he knows ahead how it will be presented to Sedera.)  Since it sounds like a diagnostic check from last issue, I told him to start a ''need'' w/Sedera sent him the temp w/directional video.  Then, he can confirm they will look at it as diagnostic due previous issue and help share in the expense.  Where after the 1k IUA, they would help, but they will be the ones to help walk him thru this procedure.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-23 17:01:27', '2022-06-23 17:19:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165317', 'Melody Fairchild', NULL, '6-23-22 Called to better understand her plan and Planstin. She thought she had a $6K deductible but now understands that''s irrelevant and it''s the $1000 IUA per incident. Also better understands what Planstin is for and what it''s not for. She was thinking of trying to remove Planstin but now she understands it''s only a small part of the cost and Zion is there for major issues, pluc virtual health there for small issues and the mental health is helpful too. She feels much better now.  Melody also had an Urgent Care visit bc she had a weird heart episode that they deemed to simply be due to dehydration. Right now the only bill is for $169 or so. She''s going to call provider to see if there''s more to the bill that needs to be submitted.  They do not fund an HSA bc they didn''t really seem to understand the value. Not sure if she''ll relay this to Glen or not. Also did a mammo at no cost and they wanted an ultrasound which she paid for and got an ultrasound for weird thing with her groin. All seems well. But, I coached her to call Concierge next time for help with best pricing on imaging and labs, etc. She seems to understand now. She''s getting the hang of self pay.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 16:41:50', '2022-06-23 17:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096343003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, 'Arthur called about getting another colonoscopy. he got previous one 5 years ago. Advised to call concierge team. ( Estefania Andrade)', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-06-23 15:58:12', '2022-06-23 15:58:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502023', 'Rhonda Wildman', NULL, '6-23-22 Rhonda and Bruce Wildman just called bc they are also being forced to convert with Sedera bc Rhonda is opening a new Need for her eyes. The new cost is showing $385 or $383 vs her current cost of $425. He wanted to make sure he should proceed and that this wouldn''t mess up anything on our end. I told him to proceed and that if/when the price changes, we will let them know. For now, it''s the same.
He broke down the cost for Rhonda and they work through the application to convert. She''s in the 60-65 age group. The base fee is $306.15, Bank Fee of $3, 2nd Opinion Fee, $5.13, Member Svc Fee, $65 and discount for DPC is $21. Total is showing $358.28. But, he doesn''t know what our fee is and the full cost for the membership. He''s grateful for the membership and didn''t want to cut us out. Also doesn''t want to pay significantly more such as $200 extra or anything like that.  I''ll bring this to John''s attention again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 15:56:41', '2022-06-23 15:56:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '6-23-22 Chris Cappuccitti 37 and Jennifer Martin 37 are married an both work at Finesse Marketing with Darrell Porter. Chris vapes and is looking to quit. He was pissed about the extra $50 a month', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 15:38:04', '2022-06-23 15:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096327002', 'Lucas Battista', NULL, 'Lucas joined at the $1000 IUA level EO. No pre-x to my knowledge. He''s employee of Finesse Marketing with Darrell Porter''s group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 15:35:33', '2022-06-23 15:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '6-23-22 Laura tried to add their newborn Benjamin but ran into trouble since they don''t have his SS# yet. I tried calling her and vm is full. I sent a text and emailed her to tell her to use an obviously fake SS# until they have the real one to add to the account later. But, she has to add him within 30 days of birth to back date the membership!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 15:23:13', '2022-06-23 15:23:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096341003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '06.21.22:  Confirmed with Patti that she received Jessica''s signature page and Patti put through Jessica''s enrollment submission for July 1.  Texted Jess to thank her for getting it to us.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-23 15:15:49', '2022-06-23 15:15:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096331001', 'Darrell Porter', NULL, '6-23-22 Darrell with Finesse Marketing Inc. will be paying for his employees SECURE memberships. It''s Darrell 32 and his wife, Chris Cappuccitti 37 who''s married to Jennifer Martin 37, plus Lucas Battista.  They have a group. I enrolled them separately because I didn''t know they were ready to add the 3rd household for an Aug. 1st start date. Darrell and Chris both vape and are looking to quit to remove the $50 a month. They know they need to quit for 1 year and have a doctor''s note. Chris and Jen chose the $2500 IUA while Darrell and Lucas chose the $1000 IUA. Darrell is paying for all of them from the ACH Bank draft.  I will ask John and team to create their site and List Bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 14:52:33', '2022-06-23 14:52:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095963008', 'James Kjellsen', NULL, '6-23-22 Jim wants to sign up for the 2500 HMA $40 a month. He will do it on his own because his work computer wasn''t secure enough to put in payment information.  He''s leaving for the weekend and will likely complete this on Monday. I asked him to notify me when it''s complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 14:47:35', '2022-06-23 14:47:35'),
