  ('zcrm_1579374000096325008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '06.23.22:  Called and spoke w/Joan.  Made OPD presentation for OPD Complete w/current age-banded pricing of $370.  She has no pre-x and takes med. for OCD only.  Age 53, interested in $1000 IUA.  LIkes the plan very much and is ready to enroll.  Told her I would call her to help her enroll tomorrow at 12 noon to which she agreed.  Joan wants to join Total Family Healthcare (she likes Dr. Jacob).  I asked Ali to change the pricing on this click funnel enrollment page so John could enroll w/the proper pricing.  Ali said she will send me the link once she has changed it.  The pricing was not changed on the enrollment page, so I called Rod to ask him what to do.  He set up a call w/John who told us the new rate engine is supposed to be completed by tomorrow.  We may be able to enroll Joan if it is ready.  I emailed Joan to tell her I''d get a status report and let her know.  If not tomorrow, we could enroll her Monday.  Joan responded that Monday would be fine.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-23 11:48:55', '2022-06-27 14:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096325003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '06.22.22:  Recvd. notification Joan booked an appt. w/me for 6.23.22 at 11:30 a.m. to learn more about our OPD plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-23 11:44:25', '2022-06-23 11:44:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '6-23-22 Shared the NLG 20 Yr Term Illustrations with her for $500K and $1M. $500K is much closer to her budget capabilities. She''d like to get the payment around $45. At Standard is $56.76, at Select Non-Tobacco it''s $48.40 and at Preferred it''s $37.84. I think it''s best to run it at $500K and hope she gets a better rating than Standard. No issues other than her mom''s new breast cancer at age 78.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-23 11:41:16', '2022-06-23 11:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096298053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095965009', 'William Braun', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of July 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-06-23 11:10:21', '2022-06-23 11:10:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096321003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', NULL, '6-23-2022:  Tomicka called from the CO Orthopedics in Englewood.  Micah gave her his RCI card thinking that''s what would help w/surgery they are looking at on both of his elbows.  I let her know he will be a ''cash-pay'' patient minimally for the first $2500, but possibly $5000 depending on the determination of one or two issues (2 elbows, 1 accident, or?) but he needs to call us so we can get that process started.  He''s been a member w/Sedera now for >3yrs, so w/the longevity clause he should not have any pre-x conditions now.  I let her know this has a different process and it''s super important for us to speak with Micah.  She''s going to call him & ask him to call us.     - CA

Micah called back, he has calcification in his elbows & his PCP (at his ''prev'' RCI appt) referred him to an orthopedic specialist because they think the calcification needs to be removed.  I sent the temp for sub a need to Sedera, went over making sure he does the 2nd MD appt (& explained what it is & why so imp for full pymt).  He''s going to watch the video, setup an acct, & get his ''need'' started right now.  He knows he''ll be ''cash-pay'' tomorrow & sub that info to Sedera after-the-fact.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-23 11:03:46', '2022-06-23 15:05:04'),
