  ('zcrm_1579374000096186021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '6-22-2022:  I tried helping Anna register for CirrusMD &amp; it says "no matching record".  Wrote CirrusMD supp &amp; even w/all of her info they cannot find an acct.  Sent e-mail to John Kach to see if he can help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-22 19:08:54', '2022-06-22 19:08:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096186016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '6-22-2022:  Sean sent an e-mail re: having trouble find a colonoscopy provider.  I tried calling &amp; LM on his line: (916) 716-6509, then sent an e-mail with a full PHCS Search list for gastroenterologists near his zip code.  Included info re: ''prev'' vs diagnostic &amp; told him to call the concierge line to get full info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-22 18:37:12', '2022-06-22 18:37:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096204016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921229', 'Jared Allomong', NULL, '6-22-22 Left vm for Jared per the above note.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-22 17:15:36', '2022-06-22 17:15:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096205003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, 'Mr. Kyle reached us through Sales IQ asking if dental work is part of this program. I explained her that dental is not covered, however, he can change his yearly wellness visit for a dentist visit and it''s share up to $250.00.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-06-22 16:23:27', '2022-06-22 16:23:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096204011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045454012', 'Laura Hanssen', NULL, '6-22-22 Laura''s husband Dan just got a new job with great benefits. They will only have to pay $238 a month with a $2500 ded total for both of them. His portion is free and hers is $238. She did have a health event this year that she used her HSA and spent the entire deductible. So, she was hoping to keep her plan until the end of the year.  But, since they are offered an affordable option through his work, she won''t qualify for a APTC any longer and the full cost of her plan is $895.91. It''s not worth paying that much more for the rest of the year. I instructed her to cancel with C4 and with Anthem directly to end payment for July 1st. She was super appreciative! She thinks they may be back in a year or two for more help. But, Dan decided to go back to work for a little longer bc retirement account is declining.  Their plan with his employer also includes dental, vision and hearing! Can''t go wrong with all of that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-22 16:19:25', '2022-06-22 16:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '6-22-22 Janet called bc she needs a major surgery that she fears might be deemed pre-x simply bc of the timing of an ER visit in April 2022. It might be unrelated which she will talk with her Dr. to help determine. She has a fibroid that is growing and shouldn''t be since she''s post menopause.  She might need a radical hysterectomy which is a full abdominal surgery. She has a baseball size tumor in her uterus and surgery is complicated. Has endometriosis badly in 2006 and no trouble since. If deemed pre-x, maybe she can apply for Special Needs since she was 1 month away from it not being considered pre-x and she can''t get onto ACA out of open enrollment. She''s really stuck now! Aghh.... But, she''s very calm right now.  
I had also previously shared with her the trip to Colombia since I was heading out the door when she called before the trip.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-22 16:01:40', '2022-06-22 16:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096189013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, '06/22/22 call from Melisa Levitt she is thinking she needs to see an eye Doctor, She has been working with CirrusMD but is to the point where she needs to see someone in person. Sent her a list of Providers in the area she is in. she also has some Medical receipts and documentation she needs to submit to Zion I sent her the link to submit receipts and info to on their sight. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-22 14:44:46', '2022-06-22 14:44:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096154016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, '6.22.2022 - Spoke with Lori today regarding some other options we may have to assist her with her Sedera situation. Lori confirmed that she would not like me to proceed with the other options, and that she is going to file an appeal with Sedera. If her appeal does not get approved, she is going to pay out of pocket for her surgery and submit her bills to Sedera for the 75% they approved to pay for this procedure (oophorectomy). ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-22 14:27:15', '2022-06-22 14:27:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096189008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818001', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, '06/22/22 Daniel McManus called to get rescheduled with the therapist he has been working with. Transferred over to MAP/EAP to get that referral going. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-22 13:41:33', '2022-06-22 13:41:33'),
