  ('zcrm_1579374000096186011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091016', 'Daniel Rife', NULL, '6-22-2022:  I''ve been working on quoting 8 RXs for Jody.  E-mailed I wanted to confirm a few items.  Tried calling but got Dan''s cell I think so I did not LM.  Sent Jody an e-mail &amp; asked if we can chat today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-22 11:27:47', '2022-06-22 11:27:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096189003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921229', 'Jared Allomong', NULL, '06/22/22 Jared Allomong called and was asking about pricing to add a single person to a plan. He is adding a Provider to his practice and wanted to see about that. Told him I would have Wendy  call him back. Emailed Wendy today. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-22 10:52:59', '2022-06-22 10:52:59'),
