  ('zcrm_1579374000096099018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604272', 'Hal Feldman', NULL, '6-21-2022:  Hal called to go over quite a bit:
     - He''s going to Uganda to see the Gorillas in August & is getting his immunizations, prescriptions, etc. in place.  He sent thru an RX Quote & I priced the one pharmaceutical item:
            Vivotif  4caps = 1 pkg (he takes 1 qod) = anti typhoid med.  I sent him the cheapest coupon for $97.09 at Walgreens off WellRX .  But after we talked, in case he get the 2 injectable immunizations at CVS (his reg pharmacy), I also attached that coupon = $108.62 off GoodRX.  [Reid cannot source this item.]
            I mentioned planning ahead because the pharmacy may need to order this item & we may need to refresh the coupons depending on when he''s picking up the RX.
            The other 2 items listed on the RX Quote req are injectable immunizations: Influenza & Hepatitis A.  We went over calling Planstin to see if either/both are considered ''prev'' (influenza might be, but I have no idea on the other).  He''s going to call Planstin to find out.  His reg MD is in the PHCS Ntwk, so at least he can utilize that doc to get the shot/shots if they are covered. 
     - We talked about what happens if he has a medical emerg while he''s gone.  I made sure he has Zion''s ph # & understands to contact them asap if something happens.  That they will help him if needed on how/what to do. 
     - His wife is from Russia & because she can cheaply go there for care, we discussed Medical Tourism.  It wouldn''t be for quite some time since no one can fly into Russia right now, but maybe down the road.  He knows it would have to be pre-approved & there''s no guarantee, but he was happy to hear they would at least consider it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-21 18:19:58', '2022-06-21 18:19:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096099013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', NULL, '6-21-2022:  Katherine called.  Her curr MD says she is part of the MultiPlan, but we cannot bring her doc up using the search tool.  She''s going to get her docs NPI # &amp; try calling PHCS w/that to confirm.  If nothing else, she''ll probably use her since they''ve been together for so long &amp; pay cash.
     - Went over labs, colonoscopies, &amp; mamm on Planstin as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-21 16:30:47', '2022-06-21 16:30:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096099008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636609', 'Kurt Kincel', NULL, '6-21-2022:  Kurt called.  He''s been working on back issues since ~ March, but hasn''t done anything toward his healthsharing ''need'' yet and is sched for surgery Fri am!  I let him know it''s critical he get this going & that if he''s not careful, because he hasn''t been able to do everything required, they could lower his shared amount to only 1/2 the expense!
     Sent him the temp for sub a ''need'' to Sedera.  He''s watching the video right now, will try to sub the ''need'', but will call them for help hopefully, before they close tonight!  Which I think is in about 1/2 h.  He may call back for further guidance, but he seemed to understand it''s crucial he get this done.
     - Very nice guy, just "doing things backwards".  Says he spoke to someone on the concierge line yesterday & did not receive the information they were sending.  Maybe he called another line & didn''t realize?  He agreed, it wasn''t me he spoke with, so we aren''t sure who he spoke to.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-21 15:45:57', '2022-06-21 15:45:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096066024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096108002', 'Lisa Arroyo', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-21 14:33:05', '2022-06-21 14:33:05'),
