  ('zcrm_1579374000096110003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067333056', 'Joe Werne', NULL, '6-21-22 Joe is curious to learn about dental plans and the HMA. We looked at his C4 Delta Dental Delta Dental of Colorado: Individual Summit Plan that he was paying $33.50 a month with e $50 Ded and annual benefit of $2000 compared to HMA 2500 at $40 a month for max $2500 to use for all medical, dental, vision, etc. I''ve never been paid for Delta Dental. C4 cancelled it by accident when he wanted his medical cancelled. So, I suggested we try to get some other options. His dentist is in the Delta Dental network.  Sent him information to look through.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-21 14:01:41', '2022-06-21 14:01:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096095003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082061010', 'Lauren Beattie', NULL, '06/21/22 Call from Lauren Beattie to see if her Porvider is in the PHCS network. I did email her the instructions and tried to help her find out but she didnt know that name of her Provider but the one she had was in network. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-21 13:06:13', '2022-06-21 13:06:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000096066014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094606012', 'Zack Asatani', NULL, '6.21.2022 - Zack called to confirm his Welcome Call appointment. He didn''t realize that he had made it for July 4th, so we switched it to July 5th @10 AM with Vanessa. I will be sending Zack an email confirmation of this change. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-21 13:00:09', '2022-06-21 13:00:09'),
