  ('zcrm_1579374000096030008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096042001', 'Jacqueline Schaible', NULL, '6-21-22 Jackie is 55 and lives in Denver. Great friends with Kim Payes who explained the membership to her and she''s thrilled to have this option. Kim Payes had an accident and needed a knee surgery and the process went smoothly and was paid for appropriately. Kim is super happy giving Jackie confidence in this. Jackie is super healthy, no tobacco, eats well, exercises often, etc. She does take thyroid meds for maintenance since after 2nd child. She also takes hormone replacement therapy of progesterone $55, estrogen $15 and testosterone $100. Hopefully Concierge team can bring those prices down, but she doesn''t seem too concerned. She''s a W2 employee for Remax Brokerage Norcal Gold and declined their insurance which is based in Cali. She is only in CA 1 week per month. She does some blood tests to check thryoid and hormones. I let her know to call Concierge Team when she wants to do those to get the best cash prices for those tests. She''s pleased to do so. She gets her pap screening done every year and that''s it. She will join CARE+ now and claims residency in CO. She is working to get her real estate license in the next 3 or so months. If/when she does so, she knows she can upgrade her membership to SECURE if she wants to. Requesting July 1st start date as well! I sent a note to Patti and waiting to hear back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-21 11:03:48', '2022-06-21 11:03:48'),
