  ('zcrm_1579374000095995041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677086', 'William Kollar', NULL, 'Member''s 7/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 6/21 6/23-sent out 2nd notice &amp; lft VM 6/23-member called in and told me that he was dealing with a funeral and wanted to give me a CC on the phone for a one tine pmt.  Toldhim that I do nto take CC over the phone and to fill out link to Cognito.  He became very rude and said if I couldn''t handle this he would just cancel.  I let Leslie know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-21 08:46:47', '2022-06-23 10:55:01'),
