  ('zcrm_1579374000095971011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '06.20.22:  I texted Joanna Mangohig (Jessica''s assistant who Jessica asked to send the signed signature page back to Patti) to ask if she sent the page back and she responded that she did.  Will confirm with Patti tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-21 06:48:06', '2022-06-21 06:48:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095971003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066645104', 'Geoffrey Booker', NULL, '06.16.22:  Was notified Geoffrey wants to cancel.  Called and spoke w/him.  He is upset because he wants to be tested for every STD possible with no charge.  Our Concierge found out that that ACA preventive care guidelines only include several STD screenings. any others would have to be paid out of pocket.  Geoffrey said he had to pay $1000 for his screenings last year.  I told him our Concierge could help him lower that cost with researching labs that are more affordable.  He refused the help and said our plan, nor any other plan in the U.S. suits his needs, thus he is terminating his membereship.  I emailed him the link for the cancellation form and gave him instructions on submitting it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-21 06:40:27', '2022-06-21 06:40:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095933038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148008', 'Emily Watkins', NULL, '6-20-2022:  Emmy req''d RX quote on her Sertraline (=gen Zoloft) 100mg, #90.  I sent her the best priced Harris Teeter coupon @ $12 from WellRX.  This RX is $4.50 less at Publix, so I also attached that coupon.  Some of the sites make it look like Publix''s reg retail on this is $7.50, others say it''s discounted so I attached the RXGo coupon in case there''s an issue and gave her instructions on the 2 options.     - CA

Emmy replied with a thank you for attaching both coupons, saying Publix is more convenient anyway.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-20 18:41:05', '2022-06-20 18:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715135', 'Sylvia Theisen', NULL, '6-20-22 Sedera sent a confirmation that Sylvia is still an Active member and has completed her migration process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 17:08:41', '2022-06-20 17:08:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121181012', 'Melanie Miller', NULL, '6-20-22 I explained the whole membership to her and it was confusing to her. I forgot to mention the pre-x clause!!!  She doesn''t have any pre-x. Her only health issues are long ago. She had a full hip replacement in Nov. 2010 and a bunyonectomy and screw in foot in Oct. 30th, 2018. She''s paying $793.45 for Golden Rule now. She wants to keep Dr. Rebecca Kierein at Avista Hospital part of Boulder Medical Center.  Their website shows they accept the PHCS/Multi-plan network. Told her to double check but shouldn''t be a problem. She''s self-employed as a realtor with Remax and has been a realtor for 25 years.  She''s 63 turning 64 in Aug. DOB 8/23/1958. 2nd appt set for June 29th at 2:00.  Discussed SECURE $325/$1000. FORGOT Pre-x clause and $125 enrollment fee! 
 She had too much info already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 17:04:43', '2022-06-20 17:04:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093624002', 'Omri Abuhasera', NULL, '6-20-22 Received text from his mom, Hila Benyacov (I think) asking about PT and told he was denied. I sent her a text response to address they probably gave the provider the insurance card for wellness only. Coached her via text the correct process and explained pre-x a little. Gave her the MPB Concierge # too.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 16:26:53', '2022-06-20 16:26:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636609', 'Kurt Kincel', NULL, '6-20-22 Exchanged vm''s bc he was told he doesn''t have coverage for a back issue. I''m guessing he gave the provide the Apex MEC card which is why he''s getting that response. I coached him in my vm and also told him to call MPB Concierge for further assistance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 16:07:52', '2022-06-20 16:07:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096331001', 'Darrell Porter', NULL, '6-20-22 Darrell and his employees will join for Aug. 1st start date. He''s connecting with them to find a time that works for everyone to enroll at once and he''ll input the payment information for each of them while we enroll online. Not enough people yet for a List Bill. Will convert to List Bill group when they add another member later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 16:04:34', '2022-06-20 16:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095963008', 'James Kjellsen', NULL, '6-20-22 Jim and Cathy enrolled today in SECURE ES $1000/$625 for July 1st start date. We looked up Dr. Ann Grace and couldn''t find her in the search but it''s part of Centura Health and they accept PHCS/Multi-plan. I recommended she still double checks before she goes in for her annual wellness visit. She also understands to remove her card from file if they need any other care other than wellness. Jim enrolled as primary since he''s youngest and is self-employed. Cathy will turn 65 next year and they are open to getting referred for Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 15:13:59', '2022-06-20 15:13:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176105', 'Stephen Klein', NULL, '6-20-22 Talked with Steven for a second and he''s not sure what procedures he still needs. He''s ok with RMHP at the moment and may pause on enrolling into SECURE. He said he''d call me back but he''s in the middle of something. I let him know if he''s all set with RMHP now then there''s no rush, unless he wants SECURE for July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 15:09:01', '2022-06-20 15:09:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095966008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715135', 'Sylvia Theisen', NULL, '6-20-22 I talked with John Kach and he showed me the new Sedera price with conversion that is forced upon her will be actually a lower price at $435, down from $458. She didn''t remember what price she saw that was Sedera only but she thinks it was $300+. She wants something in writing confirming her Active status bc she received an email from Sedera stating her membership was cancelled which she does NOT want to cancel. She has already received approval for a future eye surgery and went through the 2nd MD process as well. I am waiting for a confirmation from Sedera to forward to Sylvia about her membership remaining active which I will forward to her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-20 14:59:58', '2022-06-20 14:59:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095894154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-20 14:55:02', '2022-06-20 14:55:02'),
