  ('zcrm_1579374000095933033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094599002', 'Nathanael Huff', NULL, '06/20/22n Call from Nathan Huff wanting to know if he was all set to go for his July 1 start.  He is receiving conflicting info and yes he has a prospective acct and this acct.  I called Patti she said he is ready to go and will be  billed later this evening. Added in his Nathan name as a nickname so we wont have to be confused every time we pull him up as he goes by Nathan not Nathanael . AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-20 14:01:56', '2022-06-20 14:01:56'),
