  ('zcrm_1579374000095945011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '06.20.22:  Texted Jessica to see if she is ready to enroll and she says she is.  Gave me her banking information.  Relayed this info. to Patti who re-enrolled Jessica and took off the $100 enrollment fee.  Patti asked me to have Jessica sign the signature page and send it back to her.  I texted Jessica these instructions.  Jessica responded she''s away from her computer but will grab the form  ASAP.  
