  ('zcrm_1579374000095945003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '06.20.22:  Heard Peggy called to let us know she did not receive the cancellation form we told her should would be getting.  Called and spoke with her and Stan.  Told them I would send the link for the form, for her to complete and submit by today which is the deadline to cancel.  Sent link and told them to call me with any questions.  Also I requested they write a testimonial and email it to me and they send they would.
Received an email from Peggy. She filled out form and sent it in to Patty.
Spoke w/Patti about Peggy not getting notified about approaching Medicare age-out.  Found out from Peggy, her birthday is 8/1.  If your birthday falls on the first of the month, Medicare will allow you to start your Medicare account one month earlier, which Peggy chose to do.  Patti was not aware of this, therefore, did not have Peggy on her "Medicare age-out list" for July 1, but for August 1.  That is why Peggy didn''t get notified by MPB.  Will email Peggy to explain the situation.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-20 10:19:16', '2022-06-21 07:02:51'),
