  ('zcrm_1579374000095847029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, '6-17-2022:  Bob sub an RX Quote req.  We adj to 90-day supply on both items.  The following was most conv for him (since it''s the same pharmacy he was using w/his last ins, where he goes most often, & only $1.65 > than Ralph''s Pharmacy),  I believe he said he was paying $10/fill at a 30-ds = a total of $60 for what I''m sending coupons for at $24.23.  I think he''ll be very happy! 
     - Losartan Potassium 50mg, #90 @ Sav-on = $13.49
