  ('zcrm_1579374000095750033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095546002', 'Brendan Miller', NULL, 'I spoke to member who was under the impression that I did not send him the Change form.  He looked and it had gone to spam.  When I looked it showed it had been opened 4 times.  I told him that I would send him the MEC Plan design that addresses the question "Does the Plan provide Minimum Essential Coverage?  He was satisified with this and said that he would fill out the form after reading', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-16 13:26:19', '2022-06-16 13:26:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095766021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079147245', 'Ekaterina Feldman', NULL, 'Ekaterina just married our member Hal Fedman.  Here''s a post in his acct that also applies to her membership -
6-16-2022:  Hal called.  He & member Ekaterina Khayrulina got married & are working to combine thier lives.  He''s not in a hurry to get it done for a July 1 eff date & he knows this month, the draw will come for both memberships.  He''ll complete Patti''s membership chg form & submit prior to July 15 for an Aug 1 date.  He asked if combining the memberships would mean his wife & her child would be starting over (new waiting periods) (He''s also aware they will most likely use his acct since he''s considerably older than she is, but still 10-yrs from aging into Medicare.).  I told him since it''s Zion to Zion I believe they will honor the longevity, but to confirm w/Patti.  I''ll cut & paste this in Ekaterina''s CRM file too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-16 13:26:17', '2022-06-16 13:26:17'),
