  ('zcrm_1579374000095715018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080702012', 'Jonathan Bill', NULL, '06/16/22 call from Janathan Bill he had an scho cardiogram done that the Dr is referring him to have an MRI done. Directed him to the Zion website to open up a need as he will probably need to have more done and then he will only have to pay the 1000 IUA amount. He found that the MRI is going to be1700 I did look for that as well and that was the lowest price on healthcare bluebook. We went through t the website on the phone. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-16 12:45:48', '2022-06-16 12:45:48'),
