  ('zcrm_1579374000095715008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075974237', 'Kylie Walsh', NULL, '06/16/22 Call from Kylie Walsh  wanting a dentist. I explained we dont have her on a dental plan and directed her to her MPB portal to log on to the Whole health living choices as there is dental providers and discounts on there. She got very "huffy" with me and told me that she needed her ID # to log into the MPB portal I explained to her that we do not have ID #s and accused me of being fraudulent and asked if I was new.  I told her I was newer but know what I am doing.  She said "I dont think you do, and was there someone else I could have her talk to that was better at their job?'' I transferred her to Jennifer. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-16 09:57:17', '2022-06-16 09:57:17'),
