  ('zcrm_1579374000095697022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087126001', 'Kevin Coan', NULL, '6-15-2022:  Kevin sub an RX Quote req for his Atorvastatin.  I sent him an e-mail w/the following coupon & other details:
     - Atorvastatin 40mg, #90 = $13.86 at his chosen pharmacy = Yellow River Pharmacy = coupon attached.  Yellow River disclaimer:  coupons accepted at their discretion. 
     - This medication in the 20mg could be a free ''prev'' medication IF he''s been diag w/CVD (Cardio Vascular Disease, is willing to work w/his doc to get a waiver approved, use spec pharmacies (told him we could see if Yellow River is one of them), possible limit to 30DS, but would be no chg if approved.
     - Could be mail ordered [thru Cost+] if enough time for shipping for $11.60 which includes s&h.
     - Other coupons available:  higher priced for Yellow River on other sites, or other pharmacies running $13.80 - $17.14.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-15 17:35:44', '2022-06-15 17:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095697014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844213', 'Jeffrey Jackson', NULL, '6-15-2022:  Jeff called &amp; wanted to know how to handle his ''prev'' annual appt &amp; ''prev'' derm appt.  We went over everything  (he''ll call to make sure MD still part of the PHCS MultiPlan ntwk), labs, etc.
