  ('zcrm_1579374000095623089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086223002', 'Adam Kobler', NULL, '06/14/22 call from Adam Kobler wanting to get the MAP started for some therapy. Phone was acting up so I could not transfer him.   Gave # AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-15 06:59:28', '2022-06-15 06:59:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095681018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082058002', 'Andrea Andersson', NULL, '6-14-2022:  Linnea called asking about pain from varicose veins & getting treatment in Manhattan.  I sent her the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion.  She says they only started hurting about 2, maybe 3 weeks ago.  She''s never tt or seen an md regarding them.  I sugg starting a ''need'' immed w/the a note saying:  I know I''m resp for the 1k IUA, but I''m having pain due to some veins in my leg(s) and would like guidance.  [just in case they decide it''s not sharable for some reason, I don''t want her having huge bills thinking she''ll have help.]  I trans her directly to Zion to get her memb #.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-14 17:53:15', '2022-06-14 17:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095681013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089798002', 'Kyle Hartung', NULL, '6-14-2022:  Kyle called & asked how to present for (and a non-''prev'' appt) because the doc''s off wouldn''t even let him make an appt w/out his ins info.  We discussed letting them know he is a ''cash-pay'' patient, but if it gets super expensive he has help. (He thought he''d give them his Planstin card & "fool" them.  If they have issues (which they are giving him a hard time about), let them know he''s resp up to the 1k IUA, then his healthsharing company Zion will help w/qual ''needs''.  If they still give him prob, I let him know Zion will advocate for him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-14 17:32:24', '2022-06-14 17:32:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095681008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '6-14-2022:  Janet called back again.  She had forgotten most of what we discussed last week, so we went over a good deal of the same info.
     - I walked thru sub a ''need'' & we did it together from the e-mail I sent last week.  She had the MRI so knows to upload detailed inv w/med coding & receipts.  At the end I trans her directly to Zion to ask for her memb #. 
     - We went over what to do w/surgery again, including don''t sched anything, call us immed so we can get her conn to Care Connect, & how it works.
     - She was concerned because to be ''cash-pay'' she has to sign she won''t be reimb.  We discussed that truly, she is ''cash-pay'' for the 1k IUA, no matter what.
     - Janet asked if she could get a Zion card.  I went over why the do not send them & that made sense to her, however, I req''d one via their new e-mail add:  member@planstin.com, letting her know it takes a while if they do send it.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-14 17:30:46', '2022-06-14 17:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095681003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '6-14-2022:  Maria texted asking for a ph # for the telehealth.  I replied letting her know she can use the app, a computer, smart phone &amp; sent her an invitation to CirrusMD.  Asked if I could call her, but no reply.  The group text included ph # for Derm Spec too (so maybe she used their telehealth?).  I did let her know, there''s no chg for the CirrusMD past the reg mo contribution, so free &amp; they can do a non-sched RX if needed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-14 15:24:29', '2022-06-14 15:24:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095623084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093846012', 'Ashley Owen', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request due tot the fact that she found a better priced plan.  I spoke with Steve and he had spoken to her.  I will notify Planstin and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-14 13:36:30', '2022-06-14 13:36:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095677003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, 'June 14th, 2022 - Marginne Tellez: Mrs. Collins called. She wanted to make sure about her coverage. She has an appointment on the 22nd and she wants to make sure that her knee surgery will be covered. I offered her a call back.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-06-14 12:55:12', '2022-06-14 12:55:12'),
