  ('zcrm_1579374000095655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075689424', 'Jason Redman', NULL, '06/14/22  Call from Jason Redman he and his wife are trying to have a baby and he had asked about at home fertility testing. Yes I gave him a reputable site to go to so that he doesnt have to pay for all kinds of stuff out of pocket.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-14 08:59:54', '2022-06-14 08:59:54'),
