  ('zcrm_1579374000095623003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001171025', 'Larry Booksh', NULL, 'I received cancellation from this member as he thought the plan had too many moving parts.  He will also no longer sell our memberships.  I will notify Planstin and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-14 07:33:19', '2022-06-14 07:33:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095598008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, '6-13-2022:  Michael called.  He went to the ER last week due to his heart racing.  They did EKG, etc, & everything seemed okay, but he had no idea how to use his healthcare.  He thinks he just showed him his insurance card & from what I can tell, it was probably his Planstin card.  Does not sound like the heart issue was anxiety driven, but, I told him starting the ''need'' should be done asap.
     - We did a quick overview of what he purchased & how it has diff components you utilize for diff things.
     - Went over the various cards he has & what the Planstin & MPB.Health cards are for (incl the QR Code & why to register on the site listed).
     - Sent him the temp to sub a ''need'' w/Zion.  As we discussed, he decided his wife needs to help w/this.  He''s going to call tomorrow to go over starting the ''need'' for his recent hosp visit.  I trans him to Zion to get his Memb # so he''ll have it tomorrow.  We also discussed calling the hosp billing dept & letting them know he''s actually a ''cash-pay'' pt, ask for a disc, & pay the 1k IUA so he can upload his receipt when we sub the ''need''.
     - He knew he''d missed his ''Welcome Call''.  So after the fact, I sent the temp to sched a call to both e-mails on file, letting him know it will help with the types of questions he has about his healthcare.  
     - I encouraged him to feel free to always start by calling the concierge line so we can help guide him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-13 18:00:05', '2022-06-13 18:00:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095598003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, '6-13-2022:  Danielle called to verify they had the Secure Plan.  They do not, it''s Care+.  She asked about an HSA &amp; conf the Secure is the only plan that qualifies them for the HSA = Y.  Let her know they could change to the Secure plan for a 7/1/2022 eff date, but need to do it right away (due to the deadline!).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-13 16:10:37', '2022-06-13 16:10:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095552058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001171025', 'Larry Booksh', NULL, 'Member called into cancel as he had no advisor, he submitted Cancellation prior to me sending it to him.  He told me plans were too complicated.  He will be quitting as an advisor as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 14:50:02', '2022-06-13 14:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095556033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480210', 'Rick Graham', NULL, '06/13/22 Call from Kathryn Graham wanting to know if there was any kind of 1055 form for taxes for small business owners. Transferred her to Patti B. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-13 14:43:50', '2022-06-13 14:43:50'),
