  ('zcrm_1579374000095552053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544045', 'Brian Boecker', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation wanted to be cancelled eff 6/1/22.  I will cancel and refund him the $50 billed for June.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 14:16:54', '2022-06-13 14:16:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095552048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268087', 'Jason DePaola', NULL, 'Member has been in touch withe John about splitting him and his spouse into 2 separate plans.  John has quoted him pricing and gotten permission frm Sedera to do this.   1st step I will send him the Change form to remove spouse Jennifer from plan.  She will then enroll with Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 14:01:04', '2022-06-13 14:01:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095559023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '6.13.2022 - John called in and is quite confused about his plan. I explained how to present his MEC and how to find providers in the PHCS network for his preventative services. He gets quite frustrated that there are so many components, but I reassured him to call us on the concierge team any time he needs assistance. I think John could be a good member once he gets a grasp on things. I will be sending John lists of Dermo''s, gastro''s, and Gen Surgeons in his area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-13 13:38:08', '2022-06-13 13:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095559018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, '6.13.2022 - Jeff called because he received a bill from his labs for his preventative service labs.  I transferred Jeff to RCI so that he could check on the status of his bill. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-13 13:11:14', '2022-06-13 13:11:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095556028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442195', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, '06/13/22 Call from Kristin Smith to see if we had records of who she saw for her last Mammogram. Told her we dont have access to those records and to call her referring provider. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-13 13:07:22', '2022-06-13 13:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095556023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '06/13/22 Call from Jennifer Denoyer. Her daughter is in need of a dermatologist and she is in Texas.  Sent her a list of providers and pricing from healthcare blue book.  She will call back if she has any issues. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-13 12:43:35', '2022-08-09 13:14:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095552043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592001', 'Jeffrey Summerville', NULL, 'Member emailed me that he wanted to cancel.  I directed him back to his advisor. Member submitted cancellation.  I will notify Planstin and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 12:43:17', '2022-06-13 12:43:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095552038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095546002', 'Brendan Miller', NULL, 'I received VM from this member letting me know that he needed to change his plan to the Secure since he is located in CA.  I will send him out the link to the change form.  Michele has asked me to copy her and Leslie &amp; Wiley on email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 12:30:14', '2022-06-13 12:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095552033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Tammie called in and asked if her husband had been cancelled.  I advised her that he had been cancelled eff 5/1/2022.   She says that Medicare is not paying for a certain medical bill since they say that David still has medical coverage w/RCI.   I made sure he had been cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 12:01:58', '2022-06-13 12:01:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095592003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095546002', 'Brendan Miller', NULL, '6-13-2022:  Brendan Miller called.  He signed up last night &amp; he wants to make sure the Care+ plan will keep him from having tax implications.  I let him know the Secure plan is the only one that will do that.  We discussed pricing &amp; he is upset because he doesn''t feel like his advisor told him that.  I transferred him to Patti Baron so she can walk him thru how to correct the issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-13 11:53:20', '2022-06-13 11:53:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095552028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082061002', 'Wendy Eidman', NULL, 'I spoke with Guy about this member and he told me that it was ok to cancel this member.  He will reach out to this member as she mentioned the "religious aspect" of our organization as on of the things she would change.  I will cancel and notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 11:35:27', '2022-06-13 11:35:27'),
