  ('zcrm_1579374000095556018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066878139', 'Jennifer MacDonald', NULL, '06/13/22 Call back from Jennifer she spoke to Analisa and told her to have us send the cancelation form to her. Verified with Patti to make sure this was ok.  Sent Email cancelation link. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-13 10:08:16', '2022-06-13 10:08:16'),
