  ('zcrm_1579374000095563003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '06.13.22:  Texted Jessica to ask if she is able to enroll for a July 1 start date.  She said she will know by the end of the week.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-13 09:37:30', '2022-06-20 10:53:39'),
