  ('zcrm_1579374000095556008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '06/13/22 Call from Steve Ellis. Had a few questions about seeing a Provider to get a referral. He feels that he has to see a PCP to go anywhere.  I told him yes that is how it works typically but if he has a provider that he has seen in the past he can go to see them he would just be cash pay and to ask for the discount.  For his preventative visits, he has to make sure he is within the PHCS network. Told him to try an internal Medicine Doc they may be able to do more like he wants. Sent him a list of internal medicine Providers along with the PHCS network search link.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-13 09:04:12', '2022-06-13 09:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095559008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090978002', 'Michael McKenny', NULL, '6.13.2022 - Julie called very ill and was not sure what she needed to do in order to be seen by a doctor. Julie was very emotional and crying, stating that she was severely ill, so I advised Julie to go to the walk-in or ER if she was feeling as horrible as she was sounding. So she was headed to the ER or urgent care. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-13 08:53:45', '2022-06-13 08:53:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095559003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570200', 'Jill Brazell', NULL, '6.13.2022 - Jill called because she had a water skiing accident and went to the urgent care for her injury. She correctly presented herself as a self-pay patient and is in need of an MRI on her knee. I will be sending Jill the HCBB prices in her area for a knee MRI with and without contrast and also the instructions on how to submit her bills to Zion. Jill said her day was made with the service she received today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-13 08:27:07', '2022-06-13 08:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095556003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, '06/13/22 Call from Mary "Allison" Waggener she is calling because she found out she is pregnant. Transferred her to Sedera.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-13 08:10:44', '2022-06-13 08:10:44'),
