Sent by Patti Baron on 6/13/2022.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 07:34:14', '2022-06-13 07:34:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095552003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177385', 'Angela Nail', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I reached out to Denny and he told me he spoke to her.  I will process cancellation &amp; cancel billing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-13 07:31:11', '2022-06-13 07:31:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095530023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067828010', 'Luke Seamans', NULL, '6-10-2022:  Luke sent in RX quote req.  City Mkt is no longer contracted w/Good RX, but I found other sources & tt Luke.  Things have chg''d on his RXs & he req 2 qtys on the 2nd RX because he wasn''t sure since the doc dbl''d the strength which qty he would order.  Also, he thinks the closest Safeway is ~ 1h away.  He''d make the drive, but it doesn''t look nec this time per him.  Here''s what I ended up e-mailing him:
     - Alprazolam 0.5mg, #20 = $4.60 at Cty Mkt on WellRX
     - Bupropion XL 300mg, #60 = $15.40 at City Mkt / #90 = $19.85 at City Mkt (both on RXGo)
[He''s curr going off the gen lexapro, so it''s just these 2 this time.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-10 17:41:29', '2022-06-10 17:56:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095530018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, '6-10-2022:  Patti Baron & I confirmed:  Tonya has the few ''prev'' coverages thru her Zion plan = ''prev'' colonoscopy, mamm, & 1 ann visit (''prev'', sick, specialist) all details also have conditions, but Patti found a Zion brochure that give Tonya all the details.  I called & tt Tonya, e-mailed her the brochure, and went over everything.
     - Tonya asked:  Each yr she does her mammogram & she pays $99 as a ‘cash-pay’ patient. Last yr, she thought, why not use my healthcare (it shows this as a covered procedure, how it''s covered, etc, in the brochure). She had the doc bill Zion.  Zion denied the bill saying it is Tonya''s responsibility & the bill jumped to $350 (I think that was the increase) & she''s still making pymts to them for that procedure. 
         I sent Patti a chat w/those details & asked:  "Do you think maybe Zion forgot that''s part of this contract? I let her know it would be next week, but could we maybe help & remind Zion that should have been paid? Let me know your thoughts. I''m sure we can get dates, etc., from Tonya if needed."  
         Since it''s late Friday, I told her we would try to get with her next Mon or Tues.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-10 16:15:59', '2022-06-10 16:15:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095502023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092115002', 'Nicolas Gossum', NULL, '6.10.2022 - Welcome Call complete. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-10 14:46:05', '2022-06-10 14:46:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095530013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356826', 'Jennifer Woomer', NULL, '6-10-2020:  Jennifer called.  She''s had surgery (hip replacement).  I can see she called & tt Kelly F in March, but still has not started a ''need'' w/Zion!  "The nurse told her it was covered."  Sadly, she had plenty of time & could have used Care Connect to negotiate, but I don''t know if she was even aware of that.
     She wanted to know if home healthcare was covered since they are at her home right now.  Since she hasn''t even started a ''need'' yet, I made sure she has Zion''s ph #, trans her directly to them, and told her to talk to the ''Need'' dept.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-10 12:35:47', '2022-06-10 12:35:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095530008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086453010', 'Robert Girard', NULL, '6-10-2022:  Robert called - Planstin sent him the e-mail about his ''prev'' care.  I explained they have been sending those out to the wrong members.  He was very bummed, he was hoping it meant he has ''prev'' care.  But, he''s a Care+ member, so it does not include Planstin''s ''prev'' care.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-10 12:27:04', '2022-06-10 12:27:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095530003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '6-10-2022:  Dave called.  He just had his annual appt & due to his age (56) doc wants him to do an EKG.  He asked about options, pricing, etc.  He has 2 homes, one in Vail, one in Bldr.  We looked at avg pricing, but it''s diff on HCBB because they didn''t offer the option his doc is sugg.  He''s going to call facilities in both Bldr & Vail & get pricing since it''s a screening and not an emerg.  I sent him the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion in case it looks like this has become diagnostic and will be ongoing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-10 12:04:26', '2022-06-10 12:04:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095502018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '6.10.2022 - Sent a new NP Thyroid coupon from Walmart to Kristen and sent it to both of her emails that are on file. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-10 11:03:26', '2022-06-10 11:03:26'),
