  ('zcrm_1579374000095502003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081508002', 'Greg York', NULL, '06/10/22 Call from Greg York to discuss a lab bill he received from Quest. Said he doesnt remember these being done on the date of service it states. Told him to call the Office that took the blood. to ask about that.  HE also asked what this plan covers because he has no Preventative coverage. He was very confused. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-10 09:55:28', '2022-06-10 09:55:28'),
