  ('zcrm_1579374000095436023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, '6.10.2022 - John called in because his daughter is officially off of his payroll and he would like to remove her from his plan. I sent John the Member Change Form link via email and made sure he knows to fill this out and turn it in BEFORE the 20th of June. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-10 09:16:16', '2022-06-10 09:16:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095436018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, '06/10/22 Call from Amy and Lester Tang with some questions about the letter they received from Zion stating they are no longer going to be in the PHCS network and what does that mean?  Zion has no network so this should not affect them. I did give them their advisors # to talk about changing their IUA amount vas it is currently 5000. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-10 09:10:51', '2022-06-10 09:10:51'),
