  ('zcrm_1579374000095325024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '6-9-2022:  Macay called w/questions regarding a few items:
     - His wife''s back has been hurting her.  (their child is heavy, she''s small)   He wanted to know how alternative care (chiro) works.  Went over req''s prior approval.  We discussed options:  see reg doc first?  see chiro knowing orig appt will not be pre-approved to get a treatment plan.  Start need & get plan sub asap to see if you can get the approval.
     - He thought they had to wait 6 mos to get pregnant.  We went over 60-day waiting period has passed.  Sub maternity need as sson as you know you are pregnant (don''t wait).  Told him how to find maternity guidelines on ZionHealth.org.  
     - Sent him the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-09 20:46:06', '2022-06-09 20:46:06'),
