  ('zcrm_1579374000095160034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '6-8-2022:  Never heard back from the VM or e-mail I sent Kristen, so just sent the cheapest source''s coupon via e-mail today.  Since KS is no longer contracted w/GoodRX, NP Thyroid 120mg, #90 = $48.22 at Walmart on RXGo.com today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-08 18:32:40', '2022-06-08 18:32:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095160029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, '6-8-2022:  Tonya called re: ''prev'' again, saying the only reason she purch this was to have ''prev'' care.  I can see this has been an issue and need to tt Patti tomorrow.   She says she receive a ''guide'' on how to use her ''prev'' care, but I''m concerned it isn''t for this plan.  She knows I''m looking into.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-08 18:03:53', '2022-06-08 18:03:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095160024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, '6-8-2022:  Jacqueline called.  Prev someone sent her a list of PHCS MultiPlan docs in her area.  But, she called every female doc &amp; not a sngl one was taking new patients.  We went over how to access the search tool, look for diff types of docs (to inc who might be available), &amp; I walked her through examples of what to look for. 
     - I also sent her instructions on HCBB so she can see it the doc she finds is listed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-08 17:37:57', '2022-06-08 17:37:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095160016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571414', 'Donald Henig', NULL, '6-8-2022:  Donald called & needed guidance on his ''prev'' colonoscopy.  He had questions re: screening vs diagnostic & how to handle it if it chgs from Planstin to his healthshare.  He knows if that happens he also is resp for his 1k IUA & will call us to help him start a ''need''.     - CA

Donald called back.  His wife just got billed ~3k by LabCorp for her lab work.  We went over seeing if this is the ''cash-pay'' discounted price.  Then letting them know 1 or 2 items may be covered by her PHCS MultiPlan but asking them to bill all of it to find out what they will cover, knowing other ''prev'' items we be declined.  IF the lab work was diagnostic, then we could sub a ''need'' to the healthsharing comm since it''s part of a bigger issue and not ''prev''.  Kind of like we discussed earlier on the colonoscopy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-08 16:54:37', '2022-06-08 17:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095160011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299094', 'Donald Thessen', NULL, '6-8-2022:  Don called.  He was a bit challenging, but it went ok.  He seems frustrated by a lot, but he may not be feeling well.  
     - He receiving his medical bills for a 5-day hospital stay & is frustrated because "I gave them my Sedera card.  Can''t you see all of this?"  We went over how his plan works, how he''s a ''cash-pay'' patient to his 5k IUA, and it''s not insurance where you just hand them your card.  It does sound like he may have presented properly though because one of the hospital bills had a discount & went from 30k+ to around 10k.
         I sent him the temp for the video link w/dir to sub a ''need'' w/Sedera.   Even calling it a ''need'' frustrated him.  Let him know if he has issues with sub the ''need'' Sedera''s ph # is also in the e-mail.  They will walk him thru the entire process and he will have a ''need coordinator'' to wk w/once it''s started.
         He''s already receiving the invoices, so told him to start the ''need'' immediately so they can get the approval for the sharing process.   I let him know Sedera will send him the $ to pay the providers, so it''s time sensitive.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-08 16:51:31', '2022-06-08 16:51:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095160003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109002', 'Anil Gupta', NULL, '6-8-2022:  Anil called - we worked thru several items:
     - He says the e-mail on file is hit & miss as to whether our e-mails make it to him.  He had me send my two e-mails to a diff e-mail than on file:  alliedreality2004@yahoo.com.  I sent him Patti''s chg temp so he can ask to have this added/or replace the curr e-mail he has on file.
     - His wife needs to have an MRI.  Her chiro thinks she has a torn meniscus.  I sent him the temp to sub a ''need'' to Zion & went in detail on what to do.  He actually asked me to stay on a bit while he was filling out the page.  He seemed to have it under control & he actually HAS A ZION CARD, so his memb # was easy.  He will call if he needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-08 16:24:11', '2022-06-08 16:24:47'),
