  ('zcrm_1579374000094992028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881479', 'Desiree Childs', NULL, '06/07/22  Spoke with Desiree Childs asking why she got an email from Planstin stating she needs to have more info sent to them from her provider to cover but she also has to have more visits and should open up a need with Zion just incase. she willc all zion to get that need opened and will call us back if she needs any further assistance. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-07 15:09:58', '2022-06-07 15:09:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095013018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093839002', 'Cynthia McCollum', NULL, '6.7.2022 - Welcome Call complete! Cynthia McCollum, Tupac Manzanarez''s member, is quite confused about the plan that she is on. I just got off of her Welcome Call and she was stating things that are included in the Direct plan and not in the Secure plan. Cynthia was very frustrated, but very nice, and stated that when she was talking with Tupac she had to literally spell her questions out for him. Cynthia requested that another advisor reach out to her to talk about possibly switching plans to the one that is best for her. She was very insistent that she would like someone other than Tupac to reach back out to her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-07 14:33:32', '2022-06-07 14:33:42'),
