  ('zcrm_1579374000095026023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177385', 'Angela Nail', NULL, '6-7-2022:  Angela called & is totally frustrated by Redirect (gets to the doc''s off & they say they know nothing yet Redirect says they''ve set everything up w/the doc), Sedera (calls them w/questions and doesn''t hear back), & Denny (says she hasn''t tt him since she signed up).  I let her know she''s always welcome to start w/our line.  Then, when these issues arrise either we/or Denny need to know so we can see if we can help.
     - Went over deadline to cancel for the 1st of the following month w/out having the auto draw happen.
     - She''s hesitant to tt Denny.  But, I encouraged her, letting her know often the squeeky wheels get the attention he''s a great advisor and always tries to correct the issue.  Worst case scenario, I offered for her to discuss this with Patti Baron and she can potentially help her start the cancellation process.
     - I let her know I don''t see she''s contacted us w/her concerns either.  That contacting us, or him, at any point she needs help is the best way to make sure she''s getting her needs met.  I let her know we can submit Redirect support tickets, talk w/Sedera to find out why they aren''t responding, but we need to know it''s happening to help.
     - She''s waiting to see if she''s "accepted" on trad ins?  At this point, she may not even know how expensive that will be.  So, at this time she''s just gathering info.  She''ll reach out if/when she''s ready to cancel.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-07 13:36:20', '2022-06-17 11:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095013008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656193', 'Char Moe', NULL, '6.7.2022 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-07 13:26:26', '2022-06-07 13:26:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095026018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '6-7-2022:  Rachel called.  She''s wanting to get the kids'' sport physicals, but was hoping to do June, instead of waiting until July (= when she had their physicals last year).  I made sure she has Planstin''s info &amp; trans her directly to them since they will know the details on this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-07 13:18:29', '2022-06-07 13:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094983058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514334', 'Jordan Lubin', NULL, 'Spouse will be turning 65 in 8/22.  I will send out 1st notice to member &amp; Advisor 2nd notice sent - 6/30/22  Plan changed in A123 7/1-Member submitted change form to remove spouse (turning 65) I will send out conf email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-07 13:09:18', '2022-07-06 07:22:08'),
