  ('zcrm_1579374000094983048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641030', 'Anthony Moonen', NULL, 'Member will be turning 60 8/22.  I will notify member &amp; advisor via email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-07 12:54:46', '2022-06-07 12:54:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095026013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366121', 'Brian Trebus', NULL, '6-7-2022:  Brian has a hernia.  He kind of jumped the gun and called Zion yesterday to start a surgery claim -- he hasn''t even seen a doctor yet!
     - He wasn''t sure what type of doc he needs to see.  Sent him the Int Med docs 20 miles &amp; less from HCBB.  
     - Mentioned in the e-mail to contact us PRIOR to his doc appt.  Need to walk him thru Care Connect &amp; surgury pkg if not emerg at that point.  Felt like too much since he''s jumping around on handling this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-07 12:32:57', '2022-06-07 12:32:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094983043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297078', 'Nicholas Olinger', NULL, 'Rachel submitted Change form to add newborn daughter Emma Olinger I will notify Zion and update pricing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-07 12:17:22', '2022-06-07 12:17:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000095026008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, '6-7-2022:  Lafi called &amp; asked about lab work.  We went over Planstin ''prev'' covered tests, staying in ntwk, items not covered, getting a ''cash-pay'' price, but can also try for the disc ntwk price thru Planstin, knowing it will kick back as declined at a discount.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-07 12:03:31', '2022-06-07 12:03:31'),
