  ('zcrm_1579374000095013003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, '6.7.2022 - Amy called with questions regarding how she can guarantee that her preventative colonoscopy would not turn into a diagnostic colonoscopy. I explained to Amy that she should reiterate to her provider that she would like to keep this as a screening colonoscopy. Amy was going to speak with RCI. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-07 09:43:56', '2022-06-07 09:43:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094992008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, '06/07/22 Spoke with Shannon form Mazzatti and Sullivan about eligibility for Jannalee and Cole. Could not find them under Jannalees name.  Yes they are eligible. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-07 09:40:31', '2022-06-07 09:40:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094992003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539203', 'Shine Paul', NULL, '06/07/22 Call from Shine Paul stating he has received an email from Sedera stating that the Platform is changing. Told him he needed to speak to his advisor. Mike Montes.  Transferred him  to Mike Montes voicemail. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-07 09:03:55', '2022-06-07 09:03:55'),
