  ('zcrm_1579374000094928051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '6-6-2022:  Kristen req''d her NP Thy RX coupon.  KS on GoodRX at $41.76 has been the best price in the past, but they are no longer contracted with GoodRX.  ILM &amp; sent an e-mail to let her know new best pricing and the associated pharmacies.  I''ll finish tomorrow once I hear her preference.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 20:45:27', '2022-06-06 20:45:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094949026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401191', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, '6-6-2022:  Nathan called.  He rec''d a Planstin card w/a high ded &amp; had questions about it.  We discussed what that means (qual MEC for HSA), etc.  
     - We went over his $2500 IUA &amp; how IUAs work (he thought it was just like a ded).  
     - He''s very confused by his plan (has had it for years), so I offered a ''Welcome Call'' &amp; sent the temp invite.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 17:59:42', '2022-06-06 17:59:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094949021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, '6-6-2022:  Belinda called - she got all set to have her colonoscropy appt & the billing off called to let her know the facility where they do the procudure is not in the PHCS MultiPlan Ntwk.  She''s going to try someone else on the list Jennifer sent over.  She had purch the RX already too, so I sugg she just let the new doc know.  It hasn''t been mixed yet, so maybe they can use the same thing.  We went over being super redundant: all entities must stay in ntwk. Also, went over IF moves to diagnostic, diff component & she''s resp for her 1k IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 15:36:01', '2022-06-06 15:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094949016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062997012', 'Franklin Rzucek', NULL, '6-6-2022:  LM for Sandy to see how she''s doing and if I can help after last week.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 15:25:08', '2022-06-06 15:25:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094917062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093846012', 'Ashley Owen', NULL, '06/06/22 Spoke with Ashley Owen she needed a link for her welcome call// Sent today. Also sent her a list of GYN providers for her wellness visit. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-06 15:03:54', '2022-06-06 15:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094951008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '6.6.2022 - I have called this member twice this afternoon to do their welcome call. Both times someone picked the phone up and then hung up on me. Unfortunately that means I cannot leave a detailed vm so I will be sending an email to reschedule their welcome call if I cannot reach the members by 4:35 PM EST. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-06 14:33:33', '2022-06-06 14:33:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094949008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082890018', 'Laurie Morse', NULL, '6-6-2022:  Doc off called to confirm their new pt''s elig.  They are a PHCS MultiPlan netwk doc.  I let them know her healthcare has different components, but for ''prev'' care it will go thru Planstin.  So they can confirm &amp; get the information needed, I trans them directly to Planstin.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 13:53:00', '2022-06-06 13:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094951003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094606012', 'Zack Asatani', NULL, '6.6.2022 - Zack reached out to Karina wanting to schedule his welcome call. I left Zack a vm with details on how to schedule his welcome call through the scheduler I sent him via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-06 13:48:53', '2022-06-06 13:48:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094917054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081788002', 'Susan Johnson', NULL, '06/06/22 SPOke with Jeffery Johnson he was tryiing to get into the MPB portal and couldnt remember his password information. Sent him his information to email on file today. AC

Pt called back and stated he was sent an email from Planstin regarding his Annual wellness . But he has care + so he doesnt have preventative  services.  Told him that was sent in error. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-06 13:47:17', '2022-06-06 14:16:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094949003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791050', 'Phillip Mauger', NULL, '6-6-2022:  Phil called.  He sub the sleep apnea ''need'' &amp; w/in ~ 10-minutes rec''d: declined 100%.  It shows in the guidelines they do not do cover this.  Right now he''s going to let it go &amp; will reaccess if it gets expensive.  At that point, if need be, maybe he could reply &amp; ask for help through a "special need"?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 13:36:22', '2022-06-06 13:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094917043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899138', 'Andrew Eisenberg', NULL, '6-6-2022:  Andrew called asking about immunizations for a 60-yr old male.  Because they stipulate "age appropriate" on immunizations, I transferred him to Planstin since they will be able to guide him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 12:58:33', '2022-06-06 12:58:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094917038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, '6-6-2022:  Christine called &amp; ended-up in the ER for a mountain bike accident this weekend.  She broke her collarbone &amp; they are looking at surgery to repair it this Thurs.  She''s already had to pay considerably over her 1k IUA, so she''s going to submit a ''need today (I sent her the temp) &amp; call for guidance.  They are asking for a ton of money up front.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-06 12:57:59', '2022-06-06 12:57:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094917033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003268005', 'Tijana Coso', NULL, '06/06/22 Call from Tijana Coso  called with questions about who MPB is and what we do.  I told her we have the CirrusMD, Concierge assistance for Providers, labs, medications, surgical procedures, imaging centers, MAP/EAP program. She would not let me get a word in edge wise.  She asked about the need if she had to open one and had a receipt from 9 months ago would that be eligible?(no) She wanted to know if she needed imaging could I send her a list of places in her area? (yes) . She is going to need PT with her knee and if I could find her Physical Therapy in her area? (yes) I will send this over to her. AC

in reviewing this call with Jenn I was told that she will get 35 visits of Physical Therapy but will need an order from the Provider.  Sent email to Pt explaining this. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-06 12:54:38', '2022-06-06 13:13:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094877019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090419002', 'David Fuchs', NULL, 'Per notes during welcome call with Vanessa this member was already talking cancellation.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-06 12:43:51', '2022-06-06 12:43:51'),
