  ('zcrm_1579374000094917023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '06/06/22 Spoke with Laura Zaunbrencher She had her baby 2 days early and is going to the Providers office for a visit and wanted to know what to tell them.  Transferred her over to Zion to find out how they would handle that. She will also need to call us back to add baby to plan. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-06 10:32:17', '2022-06-06 10:32:17'),
