  ('zcrm_1579374000094917008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, '06/06/22 Call from Jacqueline Barnett received a bill from her PAP  and she said she spoke with someone who told her to not worry about it and it would be taken care of.   Told her to talk with RCI/APEX she had their # and will give them a call.   AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-06 09:10:49', '2022-06-06 09:10:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094877011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002638010', 'Elyse Larkin', NULL, 'Member let me know that she cancelled her LHS membership eff 5/31.  I will send her out the cancellation link.  Member then submitted cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-06 09:06:27', '2022-06-06 09:23:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094917003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002638010', 'Elyse Larkin', NULL, '06/06/22 call from Elyse Larkin stating she received an invoice from us. Stated she canceled her Liberty Health share last month.  Transferred her to Patti to handle. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-06 09:05:17', '2022-06-06 09:05:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094877006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063826008', 'Dwight McKinney', NULL, 'Member called in he is in Africa and is having a hard time wiring money to his bank account.  I gave him until Wednesday 6/8 to make a payment for June. 6/8- I will send email out of outlook reminding member that today COB is the deadline otherwise cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-06 08:35:29', '2022-06-08 09:16:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094852032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088406002', 'John Blackburn', NULL, '6-3-2022:  John called.  He thinks his son just broke his arm &amp; they are headed to the ER.  He wanted to know how to present.  We went over ''cash-pay'' (ask for ''cash-pay'' discount), pay 1k IUA &amp; ask them to bill you the balance.  Sent him the temp to sub a ''need'' to Zion.  Made sure he knows to keep pymt receipt, detailed invoices.  He will call us next week once he gets past this emerg if he needs help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-03 17:55:27', '2022-06-03 17:55:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094852027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082414002', 'Trinity Bieker', NULL, '6-3-2022:  Trinity had questions on SalesIQ.  We took it to the phones &amp; I walked her thru how to sub a ''need'' w/Zion (sent her the temp) so they can help her know how to handle the clinics req''d "deposit on cash pay patients of 5k", when her IUA is 1k.  That will also allow them to help make sure it''s a qualified issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-03 15:33:49', '2022-06-03 15:33:49'),
