  ('zcrm_1579374000094815013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092115002', 'Nicolas Gossum', NULL, '6.3.2022 - Left Nicolas a detailed vm and sent him another welcome call scheduler so that he can reschedule his call for a more convenient day and time. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-03 14:33:55', '2022-06-03 14:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094860023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093811001', 'Rajan Kukreja', NULL, '6/3/2022-Had extensive conversation with this member as he requested to make manual payments i.e sending in a check.  I explained the short window of time we have and also that we were not the "sharing organization" so $ had to be paid out  another party.  Member did not want to give us control.  He suggested opening a separate bank account, I told him that would be fine.  I asked if he had spoke to an advisor he said no that he enrolled on his own.  This is a potential problem as member had no idea what he bought.  I see that he had a welcome w/Vanessa so hopefully that will help.  Member updated pmt method.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-03 13:11:44', '2022-06-03 13:11:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094815008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093920001', 'Ed Watkins', NULL, '6.3.2022 - Left a detailed vm for Ed. I did not hear back from Ed by 3:05 PM EST so I sent him another welcome call scheduler to reschedule for a better day and time. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-03 13:06:44', '2022-06-03 13:06:44'),
