  ('zcrm_1579374000094860013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'Tracey called in with questions about Optim RX and that it was not on the Planstin card any more.  I shared that it was a buy up and that we had Planstin take it off the members cards to avoid confusion.  She asked about the Prescription options that we had and I explained.  Also shared that we could not share any details with any 3rd party due to privacy laws (son''s camp).', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-03 13:00:30', '2022-06-03 13:00:30'),
