  ('zcrm_1579374000094860003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094775002', 'Jamie Johnson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-03 12:42:11', '2022-06-03 12:42:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094855008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '06/03/22  Spoke with Thelma Dillon sent email to Pt regarding Providers in her area for Family practice and OBGYN. She also asked about getting the Covid Antibodies test. told her she can go where ever it would just be out of pocket.   AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-03 12:15:10', '2022-06-03 12:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094852013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, '6-3-2022:  Carrie called to find out what specific bank she has to use for her HSA.  We went over: she can utilize any financial inst of her choice.  Fees seem to be key.  Poss ck w/the comp she does her retirement planning thru?  But, it is completely up to her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-03 11:31:23', '2022-06-03 11:31:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094852008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090892002', 'Amy Morin', NULL, '6-3-2022:  Amy called for specifics on diff components.  Used post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail to show her how to use that resource:
     - We made sure she & Phil are setup & dwnld CirrusMD.  She''s already registered but I helped her get the app on her smartphone.  I sent the invite to Phil so he can do the same.
     - Planstin = ''prev''.  She did receive their card.  Helped her access & understand how to use the PHCS Netwk Search & HCBB so they can find in ntwk docs for their annual appts.  Went over a little ''prev'', stay in ntwk for everything, labs, etc.  But she had a meeting starting so it was super quick & she''ll need more guidance here.
     - Nutrition:  She was curious if the ''prev'' included nutrition.  We didn''t have time to go over.  Pointed her to the healthcare.gov site (warned her to stay in ''prev'' portion).  Not sure if she''s looking to lose weight or if it''s for another reason.  Mentioned might have other resources WHLC, MAP.  She''ll call back when she''s ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-03 11:15:46', '2022-06-03 11:15:46'),
