  ('zcrm_1579374000094855003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083937002', 'Benjamin Lee', NULL, '06/03/22  Spoke with Benjamin Lees spouse. He is needing a Colonoscopy, sent her a list of Providers within their area.  Also sent a new welcome call scheduling link.  Gave her Zion and Planstins phone #s but also told her that they will not be able to talk to her as she is not on the plan. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-03 11:04:39', '2022-06-03 11:04:39'),
