  ('zcrm_1579374000094790008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081880002', 'Joshua Koen', NULL, 'Received cancellation from this member after clarifying that it was him that wanted to cancel not his father Fredrick.  Member &amp; his mother were unaware that he was on separate membership.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-03 07:48:02', '2022-06-03 07:48:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094815003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695225', 'Kevin Thiemann', NULL, '6.3.2022 - Stephanie called in (she was removed as of 2/1/21) regarding her son getting a covid-19 test. I advised Stephanie that Covid tests are not a covered expense and that is an out of pocket test. I answered Stephanies question because it did not require any in depth answers or research. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-03 07:32:18', '2022-06-03 07:32:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094794003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Spoke with Rhonda and let her know that we would need to have her contact the hospital and the ambulance company and give them permission for us to pay the bills.  Also informed her that we would need to have an email from her stating that she has done so and to give us the contact Info for each of those entities so we can then get a copy of the bill and pay it off.  She was incredibly accommodating and was grateful we were moving in the right direction.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-06-03 07:16:05', '2022-06-03 07:16:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094790003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779293', 'Edward (Ryan) Arnold', NULL, 'Received cancellation from member I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-06-03 07:14:58', '2022-06-03 07:14:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094739049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081805002', 'Evan Chrisman', NULL, '6-2-2022:  Emily called super confused on the various components, cards, etc.  We went over quite a bit:
     - We discussed Planstin in depth, but told her when she''s ready to do anything ''prev'' don''t hesitate to call.  We''ll do refresher.  They have not rec''d their Planstin cards, so I sent e-mail req.  Planstin wrote back saying they started & stopped all on 1/1/22, so they cannot send cards.  Sent req via e-mail, w/e-mail chain from Planstin to John Kach asking for assistance.
     - She thinks she''s gotten all their CirrusMD setup properly.
     - Discussed how to present for non-''prev'' items:  ''Cash-pay'' & ask for discount.  Card not necessary because you pay to IUA then ask them to bill past that.  Discussed why we don''t just give them a card on the healthsharing.. etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-02 19:23:43', '2022-06-02 19:23:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094739044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088333002', 'Anil Salem', NULL, '6-2-2022:  Anil attached all his bills to the instructions on how to sub a need yourself.  I replied w/similar, but more directions letting him know for HIPPA &amp; privacy, he submits the information himself.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-02 18:24:58', '2022-06-02 18:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094741021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, 'Alicia also wants life insurance. She has 2 kids, but she only has one on her taxes. She is getting spousal support for only 3 years and child support ongoing. She does not use tobacco. Her mom was just diagnosed with breast cancer at age 78. Her expected income in 2023 is around $73K with all things included. Her debt is currently $80K mortgage and no other debts. She has good credit history. Lives in Arvada, 80005 and like Dr. Maria Villaverde or (verte).  DOB 1/30/82 and Rose Hutchens is 12/1/2018. Other sibling is not on her taxes. She doesn''t know how much insurance she wants and hasn''t looked into it at all. I ran quotes for NLG for $500K and $1M as a good start. She''s young enough for it to be affordable at the 20 yr term. We''ll talk upon my return.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-02 17:20:12', '2022-06-02 17:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094739033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093042002', 'Sarah Bailey', NULL, '6-2-2022:  Sarah called.  She has a ''Welcome Call'' sched for Monday, but the time''s difficult.  I sent her the temp to ''sched a Welcome Call'' and notified Vanessa of Sarah''s intentions via Teams chat.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-02 17:09:50', '2022-06-02 17:09:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094741013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001669107', 'Fawn Gilmore Kraut', NULL, '6-2-22 Fawn has an open Need with Sedera and is forced to convert. I told her to move forward and the pricing won''t be accurate. This is what they are showing for the pricing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-02 16:12:15', '2022-06-02 16:12:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094741008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067333056', 'Joe Werne', NULL, '6-2-22 Kaiser helped me cancel on May 31st. Kaiser got on the phone together with me and "connect for health" to get "C4H" to escalate my request to a manager, so that C4H would cancel my existing Kaiser plan on May 31. I then went to enroll.healthfirstcolorado.com to request my provider be Kaiser, but apparently I have to wait a few days to be able to do that, FYI.

The C4 Rep accidentally cancelled his Delta Dental also. I sent him new options that should be better anyhow. I will also share the HMA with him as a better option altogether. I was never paid by Delta Dental and I need to fight for that as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-06-02 15:54:35', '2022-06-02 15:54:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094767003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '06.02.22:  Called Jocelyn - l/m to c/b.  Emailed Jocelyn letting her know I spoke w/Eric from Planstin/Zion who said as far as he knows, Zion does not currently share for transgender Needs, however, new guidelines updates will be forthcoming in July.  I included the link for my landing pg. so Jocelyn could take a look at the details for the DIRECT plan she initially called about.  I told her to call me with any questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-06-02 15:50:55', '2022-06-02 15:50:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094739028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595009', 'Michael Sanford', NULL, '6-2-2022:  Ericka called today.  She''s having trouble w/her anxiety meds and wondered how she presents for that & her Graves Disease (she knew this was a pre-x).
     - Her anxiety meds need to be adjusted.  They were asking her for her ins card.  We talked about this & it sounds like this is a maint type situation.  She seemed to be expecting to pay for this herself, so we went over ''cash-pay'' & asking for a ''cash-pay'' discount.
     - "Graves" disease is not something that pulls up in the "find" search in the Zion Memb Guidelines.  Ericka says she disc this w/him (her advisor?) prior to signing up, so she understood it was pre-x.  We discussed that if it''s something they will help with after the ''1 yr waiting'' period, what the stepup of sharing looks like.  So, she may look at sub a ''need'' after 12/1/2022.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-02 15:43:42', '2022-06-02 15:43:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094735053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093412002', 'Aaron Smith', NULL, '6.2.2022 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-06-02 14:46:09', '2022-06-02 14:46:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094739023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '6-2-2022:   Janet called.  She had her ''prev'' appt & the doctor kept everything there "annual" appt.  But, then they moved to doing an ultrasound (I think she said) later & found a baseball sized fibroid so he sent her to have an MRI.  Now he''s referred her to an oncologist (?) for more, moving twds surgery. 
     - I sent her the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion & went over details: watch e-mail, sgn form, what to upload, how to present, etc.  She''ll get the ''need'' sub right away.
     - Went over not sched surg, etc.  Call us asap after that''s what they determine & we''ll get the info to our Care Connect team & what that does for her.  Having the ''need'' process started will make all of this much smoother.  
     She will contact us as she needs us in the process     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-02 14:38:15', '2022-06-02 14:38:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094735048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '06/02/22 Spoke with Adrian Piazza he was to have his welcome call today and he didnt know about it and would like to add his email and phone # to his demographics.  updated in  both systems CRM and Admin123. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-02 14:17:02', '2022-06-02 14:17:02'),
