  ('zcrm_1579374000094739018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093638002', 'Jill Nagle', NULL, '6-2-2022:  Wiley Long''s off called to see if Jill Nagle is showing as an active member, because she''s not listed in their portal.  I can see Jill showing as eff 6/1/2022 in both the CRM &amp; Admin123 systems.  I transferred her to Michele Rebal (hopefully, that''s the right person on this one).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-06-02 13:34:42', '2022-06-02 13:34:42'),
