  ('zcrm_1579374000094739013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077989104', 'Heather Strazinsky', NULL, '6-2-2022:  Heather''s son entered college in FL & they req''d an STD test.  He presented as ''cash-pay'' & they''ve now been billed $1500 by Quest (who is asking for their insurance).  She''s going to confirm the ''cash-pay'' price & will present her Planstin card, knowing it will be declined, but should come back w/a discounted price.  If it stays this high in price, she may try sub a ''need'' to Zion since it was technically a diagnostic tool.
