  ('zcrm_1579374000094641003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083452001', 'Peter Martino', NULL, '06/01/22 Spoke with Alicia Martino she was calling to see what she needed to do as she has her Screening Mammogram tomorrow. I looked up the facility she was having it done at and they are within the PHCS network.  I was going to transfer her to Planstin because I couldnt find it at first but was on hold for a while and couldnt get back to Alicia so I called her back and left her a voice mail that they were in network.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-06-01 08:11:58', '2022-06-01 08:11:58'),
