  ('zcrm_1579374000094561079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '5-31-2022:  Steven called today.  He can''t get his CirrusMD to work &amp; needs to connect w/a doctor.  Sent a supp e-mail to CirrusMD.  Looks like when they chg''d plans w/us, the CirrusMD gave them another memb #, but Luis @ CirrusMD let me know he got the family taken care of, so Steve sb ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-31 18:01:35', '2022-05-31 18:01:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094561074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081805002', 'Evan Chrisman', NULL, '5-31-2022:   Emily called.  Their daughter''s been struggling with a severe UTI & it actually landed her at the hospital.  I sent her the temp on sub a ''need'' to Zion and went over all the details:  ''cash-pay'' ask for a disc, what to upload, watch your e-mail closely, etc.
