  ('zcrm_1579374000094561069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '5-31-2022:  Tania''s trying to login to her memb portal.  I can''t get it to work either &amp; when she tries the ''forgot pw'' link, it tells her it''s not a confirmed e-mail add.  In Admin123, the e-mail looks accurate, as does the username = her e-mail, &amp; the CRM e-mail matches.  I tried the pw in Admin123 too.
