  ('zcrm_1579374000094561064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '5-31-2022:  Larua called asking if we help w/Covid testing.  Let her know that''s not something this plan helps w/BUT, last week a member told me Planstin is helping w/some of the expense (which I have not been able to get a confirmation on) so she''s going to call Planstin to ck.  Went over possibly w/larger issue (Covid hospitalization), they might then add it to the larger ''need'', but there''s the 1k IUA with the healthsharing component.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-31 16:11:23', '2022-05-31 16:11:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094561056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791050', 'Phillip Mauger', NULL, '5-31-2022:  Phil called.  He saw the doc & needs to have some items taken care of.  Sleep Apnea home test is showing he''s really not doing well, so now they want him to buy a machine:
