  ('zcrm_1579374000094575018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967156', 'Alexandria Wright', NULL, '5-31-22 Alexandria just finally responded and said "yes," she wants to keep her membership active. I told her she needs to call her bank immediately and remove the block from her account to pay for past and future payments.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-31 14:27:40', '2022-05-31 14:27:40'),
