  ('zcrm_1579374000094575008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '5-31-22 Elizabeth called bc she''s get forced to convert her Sedera membership and wanted to understand what the changes are. I told her the price is currently the same and we will notify her if/when it changes. She can complete the process and just add her bank account. If she sees a wrong amount to ignore it bc MPB is billing and the price hasn''t changed yet. She has multiple open needs which is why she''s forced now to convert. She''s cool with it. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-31 11:45:18', '2022-05-31 11:45:18'),
