  ('zcrm_1579374000094561016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, '5-31-2022:  Rebecca''s youngest daughter is headed off to college, so Rebecca req''d an MPB.Health card to send w/her so she has the concierge line and other info.  I sent a Teams chat to Kelly F requesting the card.  It looks like Georgia turns 18 in November anyway.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-31 11:20:19', '2022-05-31 11:20:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094575003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '5-31-22 Alicia is most worried about her recent adenoma that she has removed, in case one comes back. It was benign. She will talk with her doctor and find out the risk of that becoming an issue. She would definitely want it biopsied and removed of course. She will also find out the cash price for this in case it''s better to go with traditional insurance. Alicia is also on Propranolol which is as cheap as $3.68 at Costco! We got Alicia signed up with Spirit Dental / Ameritas for SECURE Choice starting June 1st. We also got her signed up for HMA 2500 for $40 a month.  She will decide by June 20th for our next appt if she wants trad ins or SECURE. I will also send her the C4 info and samples of Bronze, Silver and Gold plans.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-31 10:59:09', '2022-05-31 14:30:23'),
