  ('zcrm_1579374000094469003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, '05/27/22 spoke with Christine Dee.  Michael was in the ER 2 weeks and is now receiving bills. Has not opened up a need with Zion yet.Transferred her over to get that started. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-27 14:42:24', '2022-05-27 14:42:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094451011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, 'I received an email from this member who is concerned about doing the "re-enrollment" with Sedera at the same time as her son is in the middle of a need.  Having surgery next week.   I tried to explain to her that  this was not our choice but Sedera revamping their system due to compliance issues.  I tried to explain that her Redirect & MPB costs would remain the same however Sedera is the only cost that would be changing.   She is fixated on having an "agreement" with us and that can not change.  Was not interested in anything I had to say.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 13:18:55', '2022-05-27 13:18:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094455008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003268005', 'Tijana Coso', NULL, '5-27-2022:  Tijana called w/questions about her HMA.  I let her know her advisor Traci McCoid is probably best to tt regarding this, but was able to answer a few questions. 
     - She already had her eye exam, but now needs to get the glasses.  We discussed what HMA shows as covered items, so as long as store is categorized prop, sb ok. (No in club, ex Costco, type because they are not categorized properly.)
     - She didn''t realize for reimb 30-day deadline.  Went to doc yesterday & they are billing her, but doc''s off says it will be 30-days before the bill will go out, so she''s panicking.  I tt HMA Cust Srvc.  In this situation (it''s NOT reimb), so they will go with bill date instead of date of srvc.  She can use her HMA cc when the bill arrives.
     - She mentioned she had not realized HMA was sending her HMA cc to her old CA address.  I dbl ck''d & OH is correct for her at this time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-27 13:09:56', '2022-05-27 13:09:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094455003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '5-27-2022:  Christina called saying she wants to cancel, but realizes she just pd last wk.  She wondered if that was for her May or her June contribution.  I let her know you are always paying for the next month''s membership.  She''s going to contact her advisor Wendy Scipione to get the process started.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-27 13:06:14', '2022-05-27 13:06:14'),
