  ('zcrm_1579374000094413008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '5-27-22 Leslie is super frustrated because she is being forced to convert with Sedera to add the bank account.  Patti talked with her first and we don''t know if/when there will be a price increase. She wants to know the price before she agrees to make the conversion. There is no price increase at the moment. But, she''s afraid it will be too much and her son is having a surgery next week. So, she doesn''t want to go down that path without knowing the new price. Sedera hasn''t given that to us. She believes she has an annual contract with MPB and I told her it''s a month to month contract and her price hasn''t changed since inception. The timing of the Need is bad with the timing of the changes. She''s under significant stress at the moment. Unfortunately there''s nothing more that I can do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-27 12:55:36', '2022-05-27 12:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889025', 'Laurie Testa', NULL, 'I reached out to member after looking at note below.  Member stopped payment because she can not afford this.  She tried to speak to the advisor and "he went round and round with me" at which time she gave up.  She will be sending out cancellation form however I will cancel he now as we have no payment for June.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 12:12:38', '2022-05-27 12:12:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094413003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '5-26-22 5-26-22 My email to Kimberly - Here''s the response from Planstin that I received about the late fees.

"Planstin would not be responsible for any late fees charged to the member as the provider should not be billing the patient until the claims have been adjusted by us in the first place. If they are charging the member late fees, they would be going against their contract with the network."

Here''s more about the time frame.

"They process claims according to the received date and they cannot pull a claim out of order of when it was received unfortunately. They show they received the claims on 4/25/2022, so they are just at week 4. The 7-week turnaround timeframe starts when the claim enters our system."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-27 12:07:06', '2022-05-27 12:07:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094394008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967156', 'Alexandria Wright', NULL, '5-26-22 My email to Kimberly - Here''s the response from Planstin that I received about the late fees.

"Planstin would not be responsible for any late fees charged to the member as the provider should not be billing the patient until the claims have been adjusted by us in the first place. If they are charging the member late fees, they would be going against their contract with the network."

Here''s more about the time frame.

"They process claims according to the received date and they cannot pull a claim out of order of when it was received unfortunately. They show they received the claims on 4/25/2022, so they are just at week 4. The 7-week turnaround timeframe starts when the claim enters our system."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-27 11:54:52', '2022-05-27 11:54:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084968002', 'Robyn Seaton', NULL, 'Member''s 6/22 Payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM-5/27 2nd (final) notice sent via email &amp; VM - 5/31  5/31-member left after hrs VM directing me to retry pmt.  I will monitor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 11:50:31', '2022-06-01 07:02:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094412013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056557001', 'Anders Rasker', NULL, '5-27-2022:  Roseann called wanting to setup an account for Anders, but didn''t understand why she hadn''t received the info since they (Roseann &amp; Arnold = Anders parents) are paying for the plan.  I explained that due to Anders age, everything must go to him, so he may have the information she''s requesting in his e-mail.  I also let her know he can sign a release form to allow her to have access.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-27 11:40:25', '2022-05-27 11:40:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, 'Member''s 6/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 11:37:35', '2022-05-27 11:37:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094412008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, '5-27-2022:  Arnold''s wife Roseann called.  They aren''t being chg''d for Arnold''s plan at this point she doesn''t think, since he aged into Medicare over a year ago, but they just received new Planstin cards for Arnold.  I call &amp; tt Crystal @ Planstin, she can see his Zion cancelled 11-30-2021, but the Planstin MEC plan is still showing as active.  I sent Patti a Teams chat notifying her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-27 11:26:56', '2022-05-27 11:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094412003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091133', 'Roseann Rasker', NULL, '5-27-2022:  Roseann called for mult items (see husb Arnold Rasker''s old CRM acct &amp; Anders = son''s accts too).
     - Roseann wondered why she was chg''d more for this mo''s contribution.  She had chg''d her pymt form to cc &amp; didn''t realize there was a 3% fee.  She tried to chg the pymt online again, but couldn''t get it to allow her to update, so I sent her Patti''s pymt chg temp so she can go back to ACH.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-27 11:17:05', '2022-05-27 11:17:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119010', 'Christian Perry', NULL, 'Members 6/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; Vmail box full-5/27 5/31-3rd notice sent via email VM full 6/3-final notice sent VM left 6/7- I finally received a Pmt upt form with the same banking info on file.  I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 10:30:52', '2022-06-07 07:05:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, 'Member''s 6/22 payment declined 5/27-1st notice sent via email &amp; VM 5/27-member updated bank info I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 10:26:58', '2022-05-27 12:57:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089048002', 'Gregory Von Berg', NULL, '5.27.2022 - I reached out to Greg due to MPB.Health being closed for Memorial day on Monday and he had a Welcome Call scheduled with Vanessa. I spoke with Greg and we rescheduled his Welcome Call for 5.31.2022. I also answered some questions about Greg going to the podiatrist and how to present himself as a self pay patient. I also sent him the instructions on how to submit his bills to Zion Health. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-27 09:13:16', '2022-05-27 09:13:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, 'Member will be aging into 50 age band eff 7/22.  Member &amp; advisor notified', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 08:50:26', '2022-05-27 08:50:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361581', 'Kathryn Johnson', NULL, 'Member will be aging into 50 age band 7/22.  Member &amp; advisor notified', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 08:41:44', '2022-05-27 08:41:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094372013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '05/27/22 SPoke with Patricia Barnett she went to have her wellness exam and bloodwork done and she received a bill from Quest Diagnostics.  TOld her she needed to speak with Planstin. Transferred her to Planstin to discuss. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-27 08:39:30', '2022-05-27 08:39:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094372008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893285', 'Gina Hodgson', NULL, '05/27/22  Call from Gina Hodgson about her refund that she was due back in March. Transfered her to Patti.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-27 08:34:28', '2022-05-27 08:34:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094375003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '05.27.22:  Was notified by Alison Jocelyn wants information about  the Direct plan.  I called and spoke with Jocelyn.  I found out Jocelyn had Angel Lopez as her Advisor and she was not satisfied with him (too inexperienced, etc.)  I offered to take over as her Advisor and she was very grateful, she said, to have me do so, as I was extremely helpful and managed her questions so well.  I told her I would let the Admin. team know to make the change in our system.  She has an HSA so she may stay with her Secure plan.  I told her I would send her my landing page to read about the Direct plan, in case she wishes to change.  Also, she told me she has a trans child and do we have mental health services to deal with this need.  I told her I will check with Zion regarding their guidelines about sharing, but as far as I know, we do not have services currently to manage that particular need.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-05-27 08:05:14', '2022-05-27 08:05:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043541176', 'Megan Bush', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 30 age band.  I have notified member &amp; advisor and changed pricing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 07:55:47', '2022-05-27 07:55:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079410001', 'Christopher Duncan', NULL, 'Dependent Alexander turning 26 7/29/22.  Member &amp; Advisor notified.  I will make task to cancel 7/15/22', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 07:45:50', '2022-05-27 07:45:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094372003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, '05/27/22 Spoke with Jocelyn Luhr. She had left a message about getting a PCR test for Covid.  I told her that it would be out of pocket. She had already received one.  She asked some questions about the Direct Plan, will have someone call her to discuss this with her . AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-27 07:25:39', '2022-05-27 07:25:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094371003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Sent out certified letter regarding missed phone appointment.  Was sent out on 5.26.22.
Her office called and left a message late yesterday.  I have called the office back and left a message with the Office Manager to contact me to set up next available time.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-05-27 07:14:46', '2022-05-27 07:14:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094364003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094340002', 'Homer Savard', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-27 07:00:18', '2022-05-27 07:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094337008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811278', 'Sheri Bowes', NULL, '5-26-2022:  Sheri e-mailed asking what the rate would be for just her husb on the memb.  Let her know they are curr grandfathered on older rate program.  If we proceed, the new rates will be $300 for a memb only, 50-65 yr old at $2500 IUA or $325 to go to the 1k IUA (+$50 surchg if he''s a smoker).  Let her know we cannot just rem her &amp; Kira - I can walk her thru process.  Did not go over deadlines w/her yet.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-26 21:42:32', '2022-05-26 21:42:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094337003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '5-26-2022:  Shelly & I talked & were able to go over her new RX options.  She curr only needs one of her RXs.  I priced both though so she knows what it curr looks like w/other pharmacies/discount sources.
     - Estradiol Twice-Weekly 0.05mg/day patches - 3 cartons - New cheapest price is w/Walgreens @ $83.93 thru GoodRX.  Sent her that coupon.  [Reid priced this as well, but he''s running ~$120 w/shipping.]
     - Her Progesterone 200mg., #90 is cheapest today at Costco (but that''s an hour drive, so unless she''s headed that way is inconvenient @ $43.97 thru RXGo.  She thinks she''ll stay w/City Market that''s near her.  Today RXGo had a price of $57.17.  She''ll let us know when she needs this again.  Walmart was 3rd at $62.36 on GoodRX.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-26 16:36:56', '2022-05-26 16:36:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094308018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967156', 'Alexandria Wright', NULL, '5-25-22 I talked with Alexandria Wright and she had called and talked with someone to cancel but never completed the form. She didn''t understand her membership and all that''s included. I am re-educating her and she''s deciding between keeping SECURE or downgrading to CARE+. Sounding more like keeping SECURE. She''s going through a divorce and just moved to TX, hence re-evaluating her finances and such. I''m inviting her to do a Welcome Call. She was totally in the dark about how to use her membership and all the benefits she has at her fingertips. She will absolutely call her bank and remove the hold on the payment once she reviews everything tonight.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-26 15:53:48', '2022-05-26 15:53:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094308013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094318001', 'Jason Sibson', NULL, '5-26-22 ICQuotes.com, username Abbott and pwd IHCRA2022. He chose the Bright Health Bronze $0 ded plan for $282.24. His portion is $78.70 and Jennifer Abbott''s portion is $203.53. I just have to input the payment information found in ICQuotes under Payment Information and plug it into the Bright Health Enrollment platform. Jennifer signed Jason up for the HMA at $40 a month for 2500 HMA level. I explained to Jason if he changes jobs at any point, he can continue to fund it on his own to keep the account opened and same for VSP.  I send his more info about VSP as well and requested his new digital card from Ameritas and Direct Benefits for VSP Choice Plan B at $12.22 a month. This is all funded by Abbott.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-26 15:14:51', '2022-05-26 15:14:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094308008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '5-25-22 I called Matt and he had already taken care of his payment with Patti. He was very nice. He had a new card bc his was used fraudulently.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-26 15:00:14', '2022-05-26 15:00:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094308003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758457', 'Bradley Steele', NULL, '5.26.2022 - Brad and I were just getting started on his Welcome Call when his daughter arrived to say goodbye before she want on a trip. I told Brad not to worry, that I would send him another link to schedule his call for another day. I sent him another scheduler and look forward to speaking with him about his plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-26 14:35:37', '2022-05-26 14:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094297003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092228002', 'David Bradley', NULL, 'David also submitted Change for to update address.  I will notify Planstin and update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-26 14:04:37', '2022-05-26 14:04:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094228036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082154002', 'Julia Fathe', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-26 13:31:05', '2022-05-26 13:31:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094272011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', NULL, 'May 26th, 2022 - Marginne Tellez: She contacted me through Sales IQ because she hasn''t received the package from Zion or the card. I advised her to reach Zion and then offered her a call back from one of our Concierge, but she said that she didn''t have the time and that she will call back.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-05-26 13:30:51', '2022-05-26 13:30:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094246011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109002', 'Anil Gupta', NULL, '5.26.2022 - Welcome call complete! Anil was very confused about the fact that he and Anita were responsible for 3 IUA''s in a year, he said that if he would have known this he would have gone with someone else but does not feel like changing health sharing companies again so he will stay for the time being. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-26 13:25:38', '2022-05-26 13:25:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094278013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', NULL, '5-26-2022:  Marginne worked w/Patti on SalesIQ &amp; we tried to have me call Patti to educate her on how to present herself (it''s not like just presenting an ''ins'' card).  But Patricia said she''ll call in later or tomorrow.  April &amp; May memb''s had issues with getting the tape sub &amp; sync''d w/Planstin who inputs the Zion members.  She''s a Care+ memb, so hopefully we can go over how to present herself if/when she needs to when she calls in.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-26 13:20:34', '2022-05-26 13:20:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094246006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082154002', 'Julia Fathe', NULL, '5.26.2022 - Member emailed regarding changing her payment information. I sent Julia the payment update form and also sent her a separate email from outlook explaining that I sent her the form. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-26 12:57:41', '2022-05-26 12:57:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094250002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with MPB Health', 'Visit ID : 1772 Question : Hello. I joined April 1 and have not yet received any info from Zion.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-05-26 12:49:17', '2022-05-26 12:49:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094278008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091382002', 'Kathleen Walek', NULL, '5-26-2022:  I confirmed w/CirrusMD - they are HIPPA & HITRUST compliant.  Kathleen e-mailed her concerns re: CirrusMD''s use of data & a questions about MPB / Zion sites.  I fwd''d the CirrusMD concern to their support e-mail w/Kathleen cc''d on the e-mail & asked them to reply all when addressing her concerns.
     - CirrusMD question: "My concern is about my PII data or medical data being shared with non-medical sites or parties who don''t need to know my information for marketing, aggregation or other non-medical  or health related reasons."
     - Questions I fwd''d to Joan (it feels like a Main Off response will be necessary):  "Also, what are the MPowering / Zion, etc names of the sites that are HIPPA-compliant?"
     Sent Kathleen reply to her e-mail letting her know I was requesting answers from the two above parties.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-26 12:18:41', '2022-05-26 12:18:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094245018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, '05/26/22 Spoke with Andrew Racuch  he is calling to see if they have any coverage when they travel out of the country.  Yes they are cash pay and will need superbills and itemized statements translated to english and they can submit those.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-26 12:02:06', '2022-05-26 12:02:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094278003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008680001', 'Sally Arnold', NULL, '5-26-2022:  Sally called.  She needs to change her e-mail address to: sallyaarnold1@gmail.com.  I sent her Patti''s chg temp.  She pulled it up while we were talking &amp; will submit right away.  [She will NOT rec e-mails to her old e-mail address.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-26 11:39:35', '2022-05-26 11:39:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094228019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725199', 'Susan McCormick-Davis', NULL, 'Members'' 6/22 payment declined 5/26- 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM 5/26-2nd (final) notice sent via email &amp; VM 6/1- Member submitted Payment update I will rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-26 09:45:39', '2022-06-01 07:31:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094245013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086318002', 'Zachary Weaver', NULL, '05/26/22 Spoke with Parham Weaver. She was calling to see what her options were for the MAP/EAP she has spoken with Mazzetti and Sullivan about therapists in their area and the  closest one is 45 minutes away. I called Mazzetti and sullivan and told them the issue and they told me to have her call back so they can  get started on getting some providers to take Mazzatti and Sullivan as a client. I called Parham back to tell her to call them back.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-26 09:17:37', '2022-05-26 09:17:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094228011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074523001', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, 'Cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-26 09:00:04', '2022-05-26 09:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094245008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165323', 'Kevin Schill', NULL, '05/26/22  Spoke with Kevin Schill. He was asking about Providers that coded Colonoscopies as Preventative and not diagnostic. I will send him an email list of Providers that are within the network. But I did not know who coded as preventative. Told him to make sure they did at his visit.  Email Sent AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-26 08:31:15', '2022-05-26 08:31:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094245003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093926001', 'Carolyn Haskin', NULL, '05/26/22  Carolyn Haskin called because she needs to reschedule her welcome call. Told her to not schedule until after the first of June. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-26 08:29:02', '2022-05-26 08:29:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094228003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094159002', 'Caelin Viner', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-26 07:45:57', '2022-05-26 07:45:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094223003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088869002', 'Dale Brom', NULL, '05/26/22 Spoke with Dale Brom. He asked about an ID # for MPB ( no ID #). He also asked about how to get into the MPB Portal.  I sent him an email of his Username and Password.  He also asked about getting his "Welcome Packet" from Zion  He has not received it yet. I emailed Ashley from Planstin/Zion to get  one sent out to him ASAP.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-26 07:40:27', '2022-05-26 07:40:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094217008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982010', 'Brandi Rayburn', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-26 07:24:42', '2022-05-26 07:24:42');
