  ('zcrm_1579374000094217003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094005002', 'Randall Kinzel', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-26 07:17:47', '2022-05-26 07:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Called at 9:00am  No one answered the call.  Left message to let her know I would be available when she did call back.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-05-26 07:02:20', '2022-05-26 07:02:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093926001', 'Carolyn Haskin', NULL, '5.26.2022 - Members start date is not until June 1, 2022. I asked member to reschedule her welcome call for some time after her start date. I did try to call Carolyn but there was a consistent busy signal on the number provided in the CRM and Welcome Call scheduler.  ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-26 06:55:07', '2022-05-26 08:31:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094191079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '5-25-2022:  Tina e-mailed.  (I did not know she was talking about her older son that is on his own membership.  I thought she was discussing removing her younger son that''s on this membership.) 
 Anyway, Tina e-mailed me that she hadn''t rec''d the CE link yet from Patti.  I replied letting her know because of his age &amp; being on his own membership, it has to go to his e-mail (have him ck spam fldr too).  Hopefully, Joshua can look and take care of this on his own.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 19:50:57', '2022-05-25 19:50:57'),
