  ('zcrm_1579374000094191069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '5-25-2022:  Shelly (Michelle) sent an e-mail re:  RX Quotes.  KS &amp; City Mkt are no longer contracted w/GoodRX, so she needed new options.  Basalt is so small, I LM after looking up all the prices, asking her to call so we can discuss what will work for her.  Also replied to her e-mail in case she doesn''t find my VM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 19:24:09', '2022-05-25 19:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094191061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090130002', 'Zachary Martin', NULL, '5-25-2022:  Skylar Smith sub an RX Quote req for two items:
     - Escitalopram Oxalate 5mg, #30 tabs at Meijer Pharmacy.  Today RXGo was cheapest & so was Meijer @ only $5.41.  Sent her the coupon. 
     - Levothyroxine  50mcg, #30 was the price req.  But, many variables.  First fill prices (w/$5 disc for 1st fill) at Meijer is best on GoodRX at #30 - $2.80 & #90 - #9.80.  Without disc $7.80 & $14.80 which means Walmart at #30 - $4 would be cheaper.  But only w/out disc & on #30.  I only sent the $2.80 first fill coupon since too many variables, but to contact me if a diff option desired.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 17:40:05', '2022-05-25 18:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094191053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162629', 'Christopher Spencer', NULL, '5-25-2022:  A gal saying she is Christopher Spencer''s fiancee called.  I did NOT disclose any information.  She wanted a form to update his pymt info because they are closing their Chase acct tomorrow &amp; it''ll need to go thru their new WF acct.  I let her know all I could do is a link for the form to the e-mail address on file &amp; she was fine w/that.  She knows to be careful about inverting #s or adding/rem 0s to prevent issues.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 17:28:04', '2022-05-25 17:28:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094191048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096043', 'Melisa (Lisa) Levitt', NULL, '5-25-2022:  Melisa just called asking about getting a COVID Rapid Antigen test on our plan.  She says Planstin told her they help w/the cost, but to call us.  I let her know we are directing people to the free state sites and have not utilized Planstin at all.  We found a site: covidclinic.org/tacoma/ that lists getting results w/in 1 h, but says there is a $129 fee (maybe because it''s the antigen test?).  She''s traveling for an event tomorrow and just found out she must have a negative antigen test same day as her flight to attend.   I suggested that IF Planstin helps, maybe that''s an option, but to make sure to follow their requirements (in network?, etc.?).  She says "I don''t need an office visit", just the test.  She''ll call to see Planstin''s requirements & directions since this is so time sensitive for her.  This would not be on any other component.     
     - She is currently spending time between WA & NY, so it sounds like she needs a new address listed?  She was in such a hurry w/trying to get out-of-town, we did not come back to this before getting off the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 17:03:54', '2022-05-25 17:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094191043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091382002', 'Kathleen Walek', NULL, '5-25-2022:  Kathleen called again.  Says she sent an e-mail to info@mymbp.com (she doesn''t know where she got that address, but hadn''t heard back).  Told her it''s always best to call the concierge line because some answers are so detailed,  e-mail is tough.  I think it''s because of the wrong e-mail address?
     - She''s still extremely upset by CirrusMD''s use of her private info.  We agreed to her e-mailing me her concerns, then I will pass those to their support line & ask them to clarify with her.  She liked that idea.  
     - Otherwise, she''s asking about cancellation.  She knows for a July 1st cancellation date, contacting her advisor by the 2nd week of June (so it can be process prior to the June 20th draw date), would be the next step.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 16:30:58', '2022-05-25 16:30:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176160', 'Kari Mitchell', NULL, '5-25-22 Kari Mitchell is fiance of Steven Klein. Kari is 49 DOB 7/20/72 and currently has just  a few therapy clients. Income is low perhaps $10K. Put best estimate at $20K to remain off Medicaid and in hopes of good biz moving forward. She''s healthy but had a hysterectomy last year but still has ovaries. She will check her record and ask them what risks are involved, if any and to write clean bill of health, if possible.  She enrolled in Bright Health Silver 4200 with $0 Ded / $1000 MOP and her cost is $24.66. She might want to stay on this until they are officially married anytime from Aug-Oct. No date set yet.  His income is currently too high for a subsidy, so he will move to SECURE in July 1st. Kari is set to go for June 1st on the Bright Health plan. Full cost is $473.61. I instructed her to call C4 to request June 1st start date and to let Steven know to do this as well, or do it at once together. I also let them know to call carrier in 7-10 days to make payment and set up ongoing payments, if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-25 15:32:02', '2022-05-25 15:33:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176105', 'Stephen Klein', NULL, '5-25-22 Steven 55, is a Big wave Lead and wants RMHP to have access to UC Health but I told him it doesn''t look like they are in network. But, he plans to only be on this for one month while he gets his records checked and cleared if need be from a cardiology visit and same for a neurology visit. Both visits said nothing wrong, but it''s best to make sure his records reflect that properly or he''ll ask dr. to do so.  He takes diazapam for sleep and that''s it. He just sold his biz but he has other self-employment he can use to show proof of self-employment for SECURE membership. He wants to join SECURE for July 1st at $325/$1000. He also chose RMHP $6500 for now to get coverage for June. Cost is $501 and no APTC. He will be marrying fiance Kari Mitchell, 49 in Aug-Oct. They aren''t sure exactly when yet. Steven is all set with June 1st enrollment RMHP. We will meet on June 20th for enrollment in SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-25 15:22:00', '2022-05-25 15:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094178013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090130002', 'Zachary Martin', NULL, '5.25.2022 - Welcome call complete! Please be patient with Skylar and Zachary as this is quite different from their traditional insurance. They are looking to get pregnant, and I advised about the 60 day waiting period and that once they decide to start conception to give us a call on the concierge line so that we can get them started with a need ASAP. They are still using traditional insurance terms, but are working on using medical cost sharing terms. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-25 14:45:35', '2022-05-25 14:45:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094152018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818001', 'Daniel McManus', NULL, '05/25/22  Spoke with Daniel McManus calling to see if his chiropractic care appointments are covered under his IUA.   He would have to open up that need with Zion. HE said then pay that IUA amount. Yes. He said that he doesnt go that often.  Probably not worth it (he said) AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-25 14:38:50', '2022-05-25 14:38:50'),
