  ('zcrm_1579374000094153114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, '5-25-22 Melinda called bc she''s getting forced to set up her new bank account with the conversion process and she was confused. She''s seeing a $30 fee that they will assess that is news to us. Patti is calling Sedera to find out about that since MPB is collecting the funds. Melinda will wait until the end of the day today or tomorrow to complete the process. I told her the price may reflect incorrectly but her current $501 is the amount that she will be billed. She might need help setting up the account and I told her I''d do my best but I haven''t seen it myself yet either.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-25 12:42:48', '2022-05-25 12:42:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063826008', 'Dwight McKinney', NULL, 'Member''s 6/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; vmbox full-5/25 2nd notice - 5/26 email vmailbox full 5/31-email &amp; Vm Full 6/3 - final notice email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-25 12:14:21', '2022-06-06 07:12:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094191024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '5-25-2022:  Heather wanted to understand the lifetime max with Zion.  Discussed: curr no max per incident, except w/pre-x &amp; went over those limits &amp; how the IUA workswith an ongoing case.  She did not seem to know Zion is diff from Sedera since Sedera has their 3 yr longevity clause w/no cap on pre-x.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 12:10:26', '2022-05-25 12:37:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094191019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290291', 'Fred Blum', NULL, '5-25-2022:  Fred called asking when he added his son to the plan & how much that is costing.  I told him, his plan changed completely (Sedera to Zion; Self-Dir to Care+, etc.) eff: 7/1/21.  He wanted to know what Care+ was, but it was diff because he kept interrupting as I tried to go thru the components.  I finally said it does not include ''prev'' & is not qual for an HSA, & he chg''d subject.  When I told him it looks like w/the plan chg his son was then incl 7/1/21, he didn''t like that answer & kept telling me I was not answering his question.  He asked how much his son is adding to the plan, so I trans him to Patti & let him know to LM if she doesn''t ans.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-25 11:07:17', '2022-05-25 11:07:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '5-25-22 I had multiple other phone conversations with Mariah who often calls me after hours due to her work schedule. I was unable to take notes at those times since I was driving but I wanted to always answer her calls to make sure she received the assistance she needed.  There are at least 3 other conversations not logged here. I just sent her an email letting her know about the $300 refund that the Billing Dept will honor. She should see that in 3-7 days on her end.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-25 11:00:14', '2022-05-25 11:00:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '5-25-22 I spoke with Patti today about Mariah''s refund request. Patti will honor the $300 refund for June and work on that immediately. Mariah completed the cancellation form already. Patti will not refund past months for services that were rendered and already paid out to each service provider. I will notify Mariah via email since she''s at work and agreed that a phone call won''t be answered during the work day. I will cc Nancy Johnson as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-25 10:50:04', '2022-05-25 10:50:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '5-24-22 Mariah called me at 5:38 and is still very angry. She''s not pleased because it took so long to pay this bill from service in July 2021. The bill is from 4/14/22! They reached out to me after receiving the bill and it was paid in full $411 without the discounted rate on 5/24/22 by Redirect with Christian Vasquez''s help.  She still wants her MRI which I''ve told her she''s allowed to do. She should just reach out to her Needs Coordinator Mikey to find out if it will be included in a current need or will be a new Need which she has to then pay her IUA and the rest is shared. She''s not willing to do that and wants me to do so. I don''t have the authority to do so for her personal medical issues and private account. She wants to cancel and wants her money back for the last 2 payments. I told her as long as she completes the cancellation form by June 1st, she will be refunded the $300 for the current payment, but they can''t refund her past months since those services have already been paid and she was protected during that time. She then wanted to speak to my Advisor at 5:45 pm which is 7:45 EST. I asked her who she really was mad at, Redirect or Sedera? She didn''t know, just wants to speak to my Supervisor.  I told her I don''t have a Supervisor. But, I''ll try to figure out the best person to speak with regarding a refund.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-25 10:47:37', '2022-05-25 10:47:37'),
