  ('zcrm_1579374000094153013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086963002', 'Timothy Viner', NULL, 'Came in today to response from Planstin who said that we had to get her re-enrolled ASAP and that there would be now Pre-Ex is there was no gaps in membership.  They also said that her father can enroll for her and fill out a needs request.  I will get back with the team at Planstin and let them know who this is and that they will be opening a need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-25 07:30:42', '2022-05-25 07:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086963002', 'Timothy Viner', NULL, '5/24/22 Karen messaged me in Teams a screen shot of her texts with the member.  Zion advised member that she would be in eligible for coverage under her father eff 6/1 and she would have to re-enroll.   I wanted to make sure that we were doing the right thing so I was in contact with our team at Zion.  I was back in contact with Karen and I told her that I would get back with her when I heard something from Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-25 07:27:12', '2022-05-25 07:27:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000094153003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086963002', 'Timothy Viner', NULL, '5/23/22- Karen called in to me and spoke to John and I about this member''s daughter Sloane.  Karen said that she had gotten married over the weekend and then was in a car accident.  John and I advised that at fault drivers medical coverage would be primary and Zion would be secondary.   We told Karen to be in touch with the member and tell him to at least contact Zion to let them know of the accident and they would advise him further.   She asked if one of the Concierge''s could do this.  We said that this was her job as she had relationship with the member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-25 07:23:01', '2022-05-25 07:23:01'),
