  ('zcrm_1579374000094104038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119002', 'Azeem Tajani', NULL, '5-24-2022:  Orig Azeem was on Sales IQ & I caught his req.  Asked & he allwed me to call him.  Azeem wanted to know if an issue his 3 yr old is having would be pd for.  We went over Planstin = prev only.  I sent the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion w/instructions, then trans him dir to Zion to get his memb #.  He''s going to sub the ''need'' & get it started today because the specialist alone was $400 (not including other items).  They are hoping to have the procedure his son needs done asap, so I think he understands to get this done & monitor e-mail, sign form, make sure Zion rec''d, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-24 17:14:47', '2022-05-24 17:14:47'),
