  ('zcrm_1579374000094104028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', NULL, '5-24-2022:  Steve called back, Planstin is saying her high cholesterol is genetic and therefore not covered.  They called it "Hyperlipodemia".  Doctor says this we be monitored every 3 mos & ongoing.  Since Planstin is not covering it, I''m having him sub a ''need'' to Zion so we can see if they approve the ''need''.  From what Planstin said, they think this will not be a covered item?  He understands that, but also why we are sending it to Zion, to see what they say. (If nothing else, ''spec need''?  or maybe put in front of the panel of docs to see if it can be approved?) She''s not known about this prior to this appt, although she has knows her family can have high cholesterol & that''s why the doc ran this particular test.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-24 16:26:15', '2022-05-24 16:26:15'),
