  ('zcrm_1579374000094101003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165269', 'Nsikakabasi Ekiko', NULL, '5-24-22 I called C4 and spoke with Adrianna re Ekiko''s account. She found two accounts under her name and one was blank and the other shows no broker and not even MPowering Benefits. Since there''s no broker she couldn''t give me anymore information. So, I called Ekiko and she says she''s focused on Medicare now since she''s turning 65 in Aug. But, she also says she is not on Kaiser this year. She found some other off exchange health ins that I haven''t heard of. But, she''s still showing as Active on the Kaiser commission statements under my name but paying out to MPB. The PO Box on MPB isn''t one we know of. Karina will ask Rod. I have statements from Jan 2022-May 2022 showing $18 a month is paid to MPB. We don''t know where that money is going and Ekiko now says she''s not on C4 this year. It''s super bizarre. Ekiko was nice but she works the night shift and was half asleep. She didn''t want to reveal her income. I thought perhaps her income is borderline Medicaid so she''s not paying anything to her Kaiser plan but is still somehow active. She''s definitely not on Medicaid. She''s already working with someone on Medicare. I''m not sure what else to try.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-24 11:27:03', '2022-05-24 11:27:03'),
