  ('zcrm_1579374000093985046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659223', 'James Julian', NULL, '5-23-2022:  Stephanie called, James was in a bad auto accident & they are suggestion super expensive treatments (some are 50k each!).  I sent her the temp to sub a ''need'' to Sedera so they can help her thru the process.  We went over tier:  1st = @fault driver / or if no fault state, their own auto ins.  2nd = their own auto ins if > coverage avail after #1 opt max''d. 3rd = MCS.  However, Sedera can help thru med treatments as a service for members.  She knows to do the 2nd MD for full pymt if Sedera kicks in, plus they have IUA $1500.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-23 16:52:46', '2022-05-23 16:53:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093985041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087126001', 'Kevin Coan', NULL, '5-23-2022:  Kevin sub RX Quote req.  LM to conf info.     - CA

