  ('zcrm_1579374000093985036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818009', 'Troy Conrad', NULL, '5-23-2022:  Troy called.  Their kids have other coverage, so he wants to rem all of the children.  Went over a bit on pricing (he''s grandfathered in to the old pricing structure).  But, it will still save ~$60/mo cont.  Sent him Patti''s chg form temp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-23 15:29:32', '2022-05-23 15:29:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093985031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '5-23-2022:  Maurine called re: her ''prev'' appt in August.  Says she picked someone on the list & wants to confirm they will be on the list in Aug.  She''s super worried she''ll wait for her appt, just to find out they are no longer in netwk.  I let her know they can choose to leave the network at any point, but I wouldn''t expect that.  However, confirm closer to appt w/docs office, at arrival to appt, & make sure all entities, labs, etc., in network. 
