  ('zcrm_1579374000093810026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '5-19-22 Nancy Johnson called on behalf of Mariah Bauer to help her resolve their final bill from her mammogram visit 7/9/21. The final bill owed by Redirect is from Mtn Radiology for $246.60 which was repriced down from $411. This needs to be paid ASAP to maintain the discount. The other part of the same visit was already paid by Redirect. Nancy believes this is all part of a routine wellness visit. This is just the radiology part of the visit. I''ve emailed Christian Vasquez to help get this final bill paid. He''s out of the office today and will be back tomorrow. Nancy''s email is Nancy.Johnson@ROF.net and her phone # is 970-618-9899.  Redirect did give Mariah a debit card to pay for the other part of the visit which is all squared away. Mariah and Nancy also talked with Mikey at Sedera and Sedera has paid all of their bills on her behalf at this point. So, the final item is this $246.60 to be paid.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-19 16:36:48', '2022-05-25 10:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093810018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, '5-19-22 Stephanie called and is sad to say they decided to go with Nathan''s new employer insurance that will only cost them $122 a month for the entire family. They aren''t enthused about going back to regular insurance but you can''t beat the price. They will test it out for a little and they know they can always come back in the future if it''s terrible. She said they went back and forth about it many times and finally just made the decision based on the financial aspect assuming nothing bad happens... She was super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-19 16:30:54', '2022-05-19 16:30:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093766049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086951001', 'Stephanie Baltz', NULL, '5-19-2022:  Stephanie called the conc line 6:20pm Eastern time today to cancel her membership.  She hadn''t spoken to her advisor Wendy Scipione yet, so I made sure she has Wendy''s # &amp; trans her directly.  I told her I didn''t know if we can catch the draw tomorrow or not, but LM if she doesn''t connect w/Wendy so we have the best shot poss.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-19 16:26:43', '2022-05-19 16:26:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093810013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093811009', 'Sharon DePauw', NULL, '5-19-22 Enrolled in CARE+ for June 1st start date. Moving into new home with friend as she was enrolling.  Chose $1000/$240.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-19 16:10:55', '2022-05-19 16:10:55'),
