  ('zcrm_1579374000093766041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059881267', 'Anita Lee', NULL, '5-19-2022:  Anita called & needs to cancel her membership (her husb been out of work & they are really financially stressed).  Her listed advisor Michael Leonetti is listed as ''inactive'', so she LM for Patti Baron.  Her biggest concern is that tomorrow is the draw date & she''s trying to make sure they don''t pull the $.  I sent Patti a Teams chat hoping to help bring her attention to Anita''s situation.  I did NOT send her the cancellation form, but she knows she will need to sign it for the cancellation to be complete.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-19 15:49:14', '2022-05-19 15:52:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093817027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059881267', 'Anita Lee', NULL, 'May 19th, 2022 - Marginne Tellez: Anita contacted through Sales IQ. She was asking to cancel her membership, after I requested her information, she said that she was on the phone who was helping her.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-05-19 15:41:56', '2022-05-19 15:41:56'),
