  ('zcrm_1579374000093764013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088964009', 'John Hanna', NULL, '05/19/22 spoke with John Hanna he called to make sure he didnt add a spouse and updated his IUA amount. I looked at the form and it was filled out correctly.  He also wanted his PDF copy of the Planstin card. I do see that Cari requested that and he should be getting a PDF copy via email within the next 24 hours. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-19 14:41:57', '2022-05-19 14:41:57'),
