  ('zcrm_1579374000093766036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088964009', 'John Hanna', NULL, '5-19-2022:  John called w/multiple questions:
     - Says they rec''d their Planstin card (but I wonder since this is the time period where there has been an issue), but misplaced it.  Asked for new cards.  Let him know they are updating them curr, but he''ll feel better if we can get him a pdf copy until the new hard copies are sent.  I req''d via Planstin Teams chat.  He knows Planstin is purely ''preventative''.
     - Asked what he does for school trips, etc., for insurance info, etc.  Also, let him know Zion can supply a letter to submit showing the healthcare for school, trips, etc.
     - Talked about ''cash-pay'' to $2500 on first three issues per year (he thought it was only once $2500 per year, like a ded).  Asked if he can chg to 1k IUA, so I sent him Patti''s chg form temp & told him she could tell him his options. 
     - He also wanted his Zion Member #, so I made sure he has their # & trans him dir to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-19 14:20:48', '2022-05-19 14:20:48'),
