  ('zcrm_1579374000093819003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091168010', 'Richard Clow', NULL, 'wife Corrina Clow chatted looking for information regarding service for managing stress. Provided MAP number (estefania Andrade)', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-05-19 12:41:13', '2022-05-19 12:41:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093766028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091225002', 'Robert Howell', NULL, '5-19-2022:  Gimena called, asking about lab work.  I got Planstin to send her a pdf copy & she has a Quest or LabCorp near her.  She''s going to take the kids in, ask for the ''cash-pay'' price, but also present her Planstin card (knowing it will kick back as declined, but at the discounted netwk price).  She''ll have the cash pay price from them though, so hopefully they will honor that if the netwk price is higher.
     - Also did a quick price for generic Accutane 30mg., #60 in their area  (= sb the first RX if the lab work looks ok).  Cheapest today is Winn Dixie @ $161.35 or Publix At $162.35 (both on GoodRX).  Even the generic is exp, but w/the shipping time, it doesn''t sound like Reid''s service is a good fit.  Maybe her doc has a better priced source?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-19 12:31:01', '2022-05-19 12:31:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093766023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, '5-19-2022:  Christopher (=Gordy) called again concerned because they have to take the baby back to the doc tomorrow since the last ck up ended in the hosp visit.  He''s concerned because they do not have ''well baby'' on Sophie & he hasn''t heard anything about adding Sophie from his chg form submitted 2 days ago.  Trans him to Patti''s phone, letting him know she''s the only one that can help.  We disc the challenges:  open maternity need, etc., but Patti can guide them.   His biggest concern is Zion is telling them baby Sophie is not on Tess''s plan & therefore has no coverage, even though the baby was born into Zion thru a maternity need.  The doctor visits this week alone (not incl the hosp?) are > $800.     - CA

Gordy called back.  The MD appt today, cking to make sure the baby is doing better, told him once he pays cash they do not provide invoices for billing.  I told him once Zion can add the baby & we start a ''need'', Zion sb able to work with the office.  
     - I spoke to Joanna in Zion''s ''needs'' dept:  She said  she sees advisor Wendy Scipione has req''d combining Tess Weaver & Christopher (Gordy) Megroz'' accounts & it''s in process.  The billing for Sophie has not yet come thru, so Joanna can''t add her to start the ''need'' yet, but it can take 7+ days & we are right at that time curr.  Once she can see Sophie, we can get the need started.  tt Gordy, he understands.   He''ll stay in touch.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-19 12:30:48', '2022-05-19 16:31:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093766018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '5-19-2022:  Carolyn''s daughter has a well child visit at the end of the mo.  She wanted to go over what she needs to do.  She has a good Planstin card &amp; we talked about conf they are still in netwk when they arrive &amp; making sure any labs, etc., are in netwk.  As we started to talk further, she said she had to go &amp; hungup.  So I did not get to go over anything else.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-19 12:26:01', '2022-05-19 12:26:01'),
