  ('zcrm_1579374000093766013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, '5-19-2022:  Valeried called.  The functional doc she''s working w/is concerned due to her morbidly obese size, esp at her age.  She wondered if a dietician would be covered.  Healthcare.gov shows "Obesity &amp; counseling", but the link is dead.  So, she''s going to start by cking w/RCI (made sure she has her card &amp; their curr ph #).  Sedera may also offer guidance, so she''ll try them as well.   She keep track of all det inv w/med coding &amp; recipts in case Sedera can help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-19 12:15:00', '2022-05-19 12:15:00'),
