  ('zcrm_1579374000093810003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, '5-19-22 Per this email I called and my notes are below this message to Patti - "Hey Patti,
Hoping for some help with the member below. He is needing to get a specific eye exam done that would not be covered under his EverydayCARE benefits. We had a team member contact him to explain this to him and he became very angry at us for calling him. He stated we are never supposed to call him and only speak with his wife. We tried explaining his benefits and he stated that if Redirect Health does not pay for the exam that he was just going to not pay entirely. Would you be able to help connecting with his wife? We want to make sure they are confident with the benefits they do have through Redirect Health.

We have also made a note in our system that moving forward we will contact his wife first.

Member: Duane Stearns

