I called and spoke with Deanna and explained that the preventative eye exam she mentioned related to type 2 diabetes is not included in the ACA compliant annual wellness visits, therefore it will be the responsibility of her husband to pay the $250 or so eye exam price. It will fall within a Need and is therefore their responsibility to pay. She understood. She said she had a call from Redirect yesterday that she hadn''t returned yet because they are about to leave for a trip. They are from CA and moved here a few years ago and are used to Kaiser. Of course this it totally different. She will make sure to relay the information to her husband and they will take care of it upon return from their trip.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-19 11:40:33', '2022-05-19 11:40:33'),
