  ('zcrm_1579374000093657008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, '05.19.22:  Have not heard back from Belinda so I emailed her the link to the cancellation form and asked her to complete it and submit it.  I also texted her this information.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-05-19 06:39:26', '2022-05-19 06:39:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093657003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085361002', 'Belinda Fortman', NULL, '05.16.22:  Patti notified me Belinda sent a request to cancel her membership as she has health insurance with a new employer.  I called Belinda and left a message to call me back to get the link to the cancellation form.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-05-19 06:37:56', '2022-05-19 06:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093625021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '5-18-2022:  Whitney sent a chat while I was monitoring SalesIQ, saying he''d been on hold for the concierge line for 6 minutes.  But, it never rang hru to me.  I dbl ck''d & he wasn''t even in my list of calls.  Quite a while later that evening, after we''d talked, his # finally showed on my list of callers, but said it had been declined!  It never even rang thru here for me to decline.  Let Joan know this weird situation since it''s a new one.
     I called him.  He had a health scare last year & the lab work expense is daunting!  He said Planstin got the > 3k worth of tests down to ~1k.  He''s also been working w/Zion, but is still just at his 2500 IUA.  He wondered if we have anyone that can try to negotiate the final 1k down.   I let him know that he''s done a good job so far & even though he''s not at his IUA, Zion will advocate for him, so I sugg he talk w/them.  But, that fact Planstin already got the price down 65%+, I didn''t know how much more wiggle room there would be.  He''s going to call Zion.  I let him know if he ever has a hospital bill, that we have one other resource for negotiating items in the right circumstances.
     Since he''s had such a bad experience w/the 2500 IUA, we talked briefly that he could look  at the 1k IUA to see if the price diff would make the chg worth it.  But, he may want to wait since he''s grandfathered into the old, non-age banded pricing.  Plus, he may have to wait for his 1/1 anniv date?  Just something to think about.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-18 17:28:18', '2022-05-18 17:28:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093582026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032445', 'David Hammer', NULL, '05/18/22 Spoke with Dave Hammer he called in for information on an in network Provider for his Colonoscopy. Sent him the Provider search in an email.  Also sent him the info on how to submit a need to ZIon and The wellness information email.  He will call back if he has further questions. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-18 14:23:01', '2022-05-18 14:23:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093630008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566026', 'MaiLan Boris', NULL, '5.18.2022 - Called Mailan to do her Welcome Call today but unfortunately she had a family emergency and needs to reschedule. I sent Mailan a new scheduler so that she can choose a new day and time for her call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-18 13:36:55', '2022-05-18 13:36:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093582021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038088', 'Lisa Campbell', NULL, '05/18/22 Received a message to call Lisa Campbell regarding her MPB portal. Left VM stating I would send her an email of the directions on how to get on to the portal  and to call back if she had any further questions. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-18 13:36:01', '2022-05-18 13:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093625013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152460072', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, '5-18-2022:  Nathan & I had a good conversation and they seem to qualify for the Secure Prog.  He may need to be primary (even though younger than his wife) because he is the owner of the business.  We talked about options not only for himself, but I sugg offering to his 12 emp?  He''s watching the 9.5 min video, then we have an appt to talk again.  Curr paying 2k+ on exchg prog.  He is a disabled vet, but very frustrated because he can''t even get appts.  Discussed how it would work w/that cov as well.  Only pre-x for family (2 yrs of symp, treatments, etc.) seems to be his hypertension, but it is well maintained w/medication & he has not been hosp in the last 1 yr.  He is a cigar smoker, & knows there is a mo surcharge, but he''s fine w/that.  Went over tax ded port as bus owner is the ins component = $135/mo x # of mos that year for a family membership.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-18 13:33:58', '2022-05-18 16:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093630003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090712002', 'Beverly Gamblin', NULL, '5.18.2022 - Beverly had accidentally scheduled her call for today and had tried to cancel but there was no where to do that in the confirmation email she received from MPB. She must have rescheduled through someone on the concierge team, and I went ahead and cancelled her call for today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-18 13:09:28', '2022-05-18 13:09:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093625008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '5-18-2022:  Elsa called, her son is going on a European school trip &amp; they need a letter to prove healthcare.  I made sure she has Zion''s ph #, then trans her directly.
     - We also went over what the various cards are:  MPB.Health (&amp; QRCode), &amp; Planstin.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-18 13:03:53', '2022-05-18 13:03:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093600033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, 'Member called into update her payment info.  I will send out email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-18 12:06:16', '2022-05-18 12:06:16'),
