  ('zcrm_1579374000093572002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083099001', 'julia avalon', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with MPB Health', 'Visit ID : 1730 Question : hi gabriel, i wanted to find out more about health sharing and mental health.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-05-18 11:12:36', '2022-05-18 11:12:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093605023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088732002', 'Sean Saulsbury', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-18 10:58:30', '2022-05-18 10:58:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093582016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084640027', 'Malinda Russo', NULL, '05/18/22 Spoke with Malinda Russo regarding a possible surgery she may need.  Transferred her to Zion to get that started. Sent her email of how to submit a need with Zion as will.AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-18 10:33:36', '2022-05-18 10:33:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093621015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093624002', 'Omri Abuhasera', NULL, '5-18-22 Enrolled in SECURE $1000/$300 for a June 1st start date. I am the referring individual. He is a citizen as well.  The enrollment name went through as a strange sentence. But, Patti was able to correct it to his correct name on her end. All is well now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-18 10:16:04', '2022-05-18 10:38:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093622003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Rhonda''s office manager left a message last night at 7:41pm.
I called back a couple of times this morning and finally able to get through.  The office Manager as per request from Rhonda to set up a time to talk next Thursday, May 27 at 9am since Rhonda is out of town on speaking engagements. Time has been set.

Spoke with Stacey Hay with Hospital Bill eraser at 12:00 today to get an update.  She is emailing me the results and recommendations on how to pay the hospital bill.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-05-18 10:14:14', '2022-05-18 10:14:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093621003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093624002', 'Omri Abuhasera', NULL, '5-15-22 Omri is 33 6/19/89. Healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Yes, he does his wellness visits. Will make $120K in 2022. He''s self-employed. I re-explained the pre-x clause and Hila understands. Omri watched the video and read the overview email as well. Hila is simply enrolling for Omri. Omri is without health insurance right now and wasn''t able to get onto C4 because of no SEP. They are happy to join this now instead! SS 093 67 3231', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-18 10:10:09', '2022-05-18 10:14:29'),
