  ('zcrm_1579374000093582008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091125002', 'Kevin Whalen', NULL, '05/18/22  Call to Kevin Whalen left Vm to return call. AC

05/18/22 Spoke with Kevin Whalen he was asking about Providers for a colonoscopy. I sent him the list of Providers within his area for His Colonoscopy. He has his welcome call tomorrow.  Jenn also requested his Planstin Card for him as he has not received that.  He also stated that we had his address incorrect in our system. I updated this in both Admin123 and the CRM.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-18 09:10:01', '2022-05-18 09:33:34'),
