  ('zcrm_1579374000093582003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '05/18/22  Spoke with Brian Guarneros, he tested positive for Covid and has talked with the Telehealth provider and was doing everything he needed to and it has now settled in his nose and he feels he has a sinus infection. TOld him to go anywhere he can because he considered self pay . he will go today. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-18 08:04:45', '2022-05-18 08:04:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093561001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359037', 'Erich Bichsel', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1726 Question : Just making sure you have all the paperwork for my cancellation', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-05-18 05:49:54', '2022-05-18 05:49:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093503082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090937012', 'Samantha Danz', NULL, '5-17-2022:  Samantha called.  She orig called 5/11/22 req info for cancelling.  She agreed to call her Advisor:  HSA''s Whitney &amp; did tt her, but says she hasn''t rec''d a form to sign or have any instructions on how to cancel.  Since she''s already tt her advisor, I sent Patti Baron a Teams chat to find out our next step.  Samantha did say she wants a 7/1/2022 cancel date &amp; pulling the draw on the 20th is fine.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 18:39:50', '2022-05-17 18:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093503074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086956124', 'Brandon Pham', NULL, '5-17-2022:  Brandon called.  He has pain in his wisdom teeth & wondered how to handle payment for that.   We talked about dental vs medical & I suggested he check w/Zion to see if since he''s having so much pain, would it move to the ''medical'' category?
     - He also is having trouble fitting in his ''Welcome Call'' but does want to resched.  Sent him the link.
     - He needed a bit of guidance on his plan, so we discussed very briefly the components.
     - He''s already signed-up for CirrusMD, so he''ll get the app downloaded too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 18:36:33', '2022-05-17 18:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093503069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '5-17-2022:  Chris called today.  The ''well baby'' visit yesterday turned into a ''need'' & diagnostic.  The doc sent the baby to the hospital, but Sophie''s doing better.  Because the baby was just born, he''s going to contact the maternity ''need'' coordinator to find out what they do to start the ''need'' since it''ll be on Sophie spec.  He knows they''re ''cash-pay'' to the 1k IUA since this will be on Sophie.  
     - He did get a request to Patti today to see if/when they can combine all three of them onto one plan &/or to make sure Sophie is added to the plan (she was born ~1 week ago).  I warned him that w/the birth and possibly an open ''need'', Patti would have to guide them on how it will work.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 18:33:59', '2022-05-17 18:33:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093503064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, '5-17-2022:  Chris called today.  The ''well baby'' visit yesterday turned into a ''need'' & diagnostic.  The doc sent the baby to the hospital, but Sophie''s doing better.  Because the baby was just born, he''s going to contact the maternity ''need'' coordinator to find out what they do to start the ''need'' since it''ll be on Sophie spec.  He knows they''re ''cash-pay'' to the 1k IUA since this will be on Sophie.  
     - He did get a request to Patti today to see if/when they can combine all three of them onto one plan &/or to make sure Sophie is added to the plan (she was born ~1 week ago).  I warned him that w/the birth and possibly an open ''need'', Patti would have to guide them on how it will work.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 18:33:47', '2022-05-17 18:33:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093503059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, '5-17-2022:  Elgin called again.  He saw a specialist for his knee today &amp; they prescribed Naproxen 500mg., #60.  He likes Walgreens because it''s nearby.  The cheapest Walgreens coup today was w/RXGo at $12.49.  He knows he can save ~$2 at another pharmacy if he desires, or gets a refill &amp; wants to go elsewhere.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 18:15:07', '2022-05-17 18:15:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093503037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089148022', 'Jeff Weisberg', NULL, '5-17-2022:  A call came from this person/mobile # on the caller ID.  I was on w/another memb when he called.  I called him back the second I completed that call, but no one answered so I LM.     - CA

Jeff called back & said he did not rec his ''card''.  We went over the various cards: Planstin = ''prev'' (which are still being corrected even now, so it''s a few weeks from being available correctly.  See below, he won''t need it for his appt because he already had it!*), MPB.Health & QRCode. & no card for Zion (present as ''cash-pay'',) & all details.  
     * HOWEVER, he is one of our Planstin memb who already had his ''prev'' appt & labs w/NO card due to the issues w/Planstin memb & cards.  (I did NOT mention in netwk to him.) 
 In the concierge meeting today we discussed coordinating a list of members needing reimb for Planstin.   I sent a Teams chat to Jennifer Thorin-Savard to see if she can add Jeff to that list for Planstin list for reim.  We need to let Jeff know the status.  I asked her to tell me if I need follow-up w/him.  
     - Jeff wanted his Zion memb #, so I trans him to Zion, but he got someone who did not know what they were doing & they trans him back to me.  I then did a warm trans & tt Alex  at Zion, who understand they provide that info & he said no worries, he''d take care of Jeff; so I trans Jeff to Alex.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 15:51:42', '2022-05-17 17:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093537003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089444002', 'Cassandra Taylor', NULL, '5.17.2022 - Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-17 14:51:59', '2022-05-17 14:51:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093514013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, '05/17/22 spoke with Jessica Ramey she is calling about her WWE she had but  will need to talk with Planstin. She also had an Ultrasound with an endometrial biopsy and are awaiting results but the provider said it could result in needing a hysterectomy. I transferred her over to Zion to start opening up a need.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-17 14:36:39', '2022-05-17 14:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093469068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077408229', 'Dennis Burd', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation link I will notify Planstin, cancel billing &amp; notify member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-17 14:34:53', '2022-05-17 14:34:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093469063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088875001', 'Samantha Raskow', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after only 2 mos on the plan.  Did not know that i wasn''t insurance.  I have reach out to Zach to be in contact with Justin to make sure he is presenting right.  I will notify Zion &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-17 14:29:16', '2022-05-17 14:29:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093530008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057253057', 'Tobin Ortenblad', NULL, '5-16-22 Patti told me Tobin had an ER visit and gave the hospital MPB''s information. I called him now and coached him to pay his $1000 IUA and ask for the cash price as a self-pay patient. Also ask for the super bill for ease of the process. Then once he has the bill to call MPB Concierge Team for instructions on how to process the Need. He will do that. He had a huge gash that he had to deal with from bike crash I think. ER bill was $10K. Hopefully Zion can negotiate that rate down.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-17 14:26:59', '2022-05-17 14:26:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093514008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068994062', 'Sean Herrin', NULL, '05/17/22  Spoke with Sean Herrin calling for a list of Providers for his colonoscopy and a PCP will send this to him via email that is on file.  He requested the Provider be in Kingman AZ. will send to Him AC

Sent email of Providers to Sean AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-17 14:23:52', '2022-05-17 14:53:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093530003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '5-16-22 Martha called in to make sure Zion was still doing well. She had a great experience with them last year for a surgery she needed and it went really smoothly. Valley View hospital was in the PHCS network and they ran all of the bills through the system that way. This year her son needs an ACL surgery and she was just told by Zion that they are no longer using the PHCS network. This concerned her. I explained that going in as self-pay is typically easier and with greater discounts. I instructed her to tell them she is self-pay, remove her card and ask for the Super Bill and pay her $1000. She''s already asked for the bills and will pay her $1000 next and submit it all to Zion.
 Next she remembered my email about dental, vision, IUA payment options so I explained the HMA to her and she''s interested in that as well. She understands there''s a waiting period before it makes sense to use the HMA, so not ideal for current IUA and surgery situation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-17 14:12:29', '2022-05-17 14:12:29');
