  ('zcrm_1579374000093503032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, '5-17-2022:  Called Elgin back after he caught the NHP team while the concierge team was in a concierge meeting.  He had questions on his 2nd MD appt.  I trans him to Sedera, letting him know they can better answer those questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 13:52:13', '2022-05-17 13:52:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093503027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089999002', 'Sean Covel', NULL, '5-17-2022:  Sean is having his ''prev'' care appt &amp; made sure he picked someone listed as in network.  Reminded him to make sure everything in network.  Also, since the Planstin cards have been an issue, I trans him to them to req a pdf version for his appt tomorrow.  He seems to have a good grasp on ''prev'' vs diagnostic/treatment as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-17 13:51:36', '2022-05-17 13:51:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093469058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077408229', 'Dennis Burd', NULL, 'Member called and got the Nicaragua team who sent them to me.  He is looking to cancel.  I will send him out the Cancellation Link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-17 13:36:13', '2022-05-17 13:36:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093469053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088875001', 'Samantha Raskow', NULL, 'May 17th, 2022 - Marginne Tellez: Kenneth Garrett called asking for a Cancellation Form for Samantha, so, I sent it to her email on file.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-05-17 13:29:21', '2022-05-17 13:29:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093469048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644183', 'Carolann Nevitt', NULL, 'I have cancelled HES ahead of billing for next month.  I have refunded the customary $2 mos ($100) to members credit card and cancelled further payments.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-17 12:35:54', '2022-05-17 12:35:54'),
