  ('zcrm_1579374000093395076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592249', 'Gregory Meell', NULL, '5-16-2022:  A gal called to notify us Gregory passed.  She tried calling his advisor Jane Kassel first, but Jane is in Mexico for the week &amp; she doesn''t want this mos draw to happen because there''s no $ in the acct.  Trans her to Patti Baron''s VM (she''s out for the day already) &amp; sent a Teams chat to Patti so she''ll have a heads-up for tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-16 15:26:55', '2022-05-16 15:26:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093423029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125227018', 'Jennifer Abbott', NULL, '5-15-22 Jennifer is psyched to offer the HMA to her employees and pay for it via a List Bill. I let her know it''s post-tax vs the HSA that''s pre-tax. It''s separate from ICHRA as well. She also wants to offer VSP to her employees. I will send her the info to choose from on that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-16 15:20:45', '2022-05-16 15:20:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093395071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, '5-16-2022:  Caterina called to chg her pymt info.  Sent her Patti''s pymt chg temp.  Reminded her to dbl ck the #s &amp; that there is a fee for cc pymts.  She''s fine w/the add fee.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-16 15:05:50', '2022-05-16 15:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093423024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084637032', 'Hila Benyacov', NULL, '5-15-22 Hila called and wanted to add her partner to his kids plan. But, he doesn''t have a Life Change Event. But, he will be getting officially divorced from his spouse soon. They are about to start the paperwork and it will take at least 3 months or more. Hila and he have lived together since they met. They are not married since he''s still married to his x. He doesn''t have any new changes in life to get a SEP. he doesn''t have insurance right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-16 15:02:43', '2022-05-16 15:02:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093395066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088875001', 'Samantha Raskow', NULL, '5-16-2022:  Samantha called - they''ve decided this is their last mo w/MPB.  She''s calling Kenneth &amp; will LM if she doesn''t catch him.  She knows Patti will send cancellation once Kenneth notifies Patti ok to process cancellation.  Plus, I sent Patti Baron a Teams chat (especially since we are so close to next month''s draw) so she has a heads up.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-16 14:50:22', '2022-05-16 14:50:22'),
