  ('zcrm_1579374000093377023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, '5.16.2022 - Belinda called in and spoke with Cari regarding the list of Gastroenterologists that I sent her on 4.26.2022 and she stated she did not receive it. I ran a new PHCS network search and sent it to Belinda who confirmed via email that she received it. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-16 13:49:01', '2022-05-16 13:49:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093395058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086964002', 'Lani Cordova', NULL, '5-16-2022:  Lani called needing an RX price for Azithromycin 250mg, #12.  Today (w/the $5 first fill discount) Safeway was $5.40 thru GoodRX.  I let her know if they need a refill to recontact us because she can the 2nd fill cheaper through another site (RXGo would save her about $1, but still at Safeway).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-16 13:40:50', '2022-05-16 13:53:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093423013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, '5-15-22 Jill Fields was forced to update her account with Sedera and the conversion to get her current Needs handled. She lives in GA and she thinks her monthly fees will be pulled from her bank account from Sedera now. What are we doing about this? This will eliminate her additional benefits and cause problems. I have a note into Patti about this.  Also, Jill has some open needs, so it''s not a good time to make any changes. She''s happy with her membership and understands basic wellness isn''t included but preventative mammos and colonoscopies are included.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-16 13:11:36', '2022-05-16 13:20:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093395053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594002', 'Guy Ralfe', NULL, '5-16-2022:  Belinda called requesting the same info as Jennifer sent on the 26th, but Belinda says she didn''t rec it.  Jennifer''s going to resend &amp; I reminded Belinda to ck her spam folder too.
     - Also, sent her the ''Welcome Call'' invite &amp; let her know it''s a great way to understand the resources in her memb.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-16 12:59:03', '2022-05-16 12:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093395048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, '05/16/22  Spoke with Danielle Howley she was asking about getting an HSA. Will contact Mike Montes to call her to discuss this. She also asked about getting her dependents set up on CirrusMD .  Looked in Admin123 and all the emails were in there so I sent the links to them individually AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-16 12:56:09', '2022-05-16 12:56:09'),
