  ('zcrm_1579374000093355051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093341002', 'Christina Sayre', NULL, 'I was forwarded an email by Julia about this member needing colonoscopies prior to 45 since she has a family history.  She will be scheduled for one just after her start date of 6/1. I reached out to Zion who told me that since she would be considered "High Risk" that she would have to open a need and pay the $1000 IUA then medical records would then be ordered and based on that decided  on a case by case basis.    I emailed Jane and the member of this and spoke to the member personally.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-16 12:40:11', '2022-05-16 12:40:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093423008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191087', 'Drew Tarkington', NULL, '5-15-22 I left vm letting Brittany know some of the many benefits of the $50 fee.  I mentioned the virtual healthcare and Life Care. I''ll send her an email as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-16 12:27:42', '2022-05-16 12:27:42'),
