  ('zcrm_1579374000093377018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086838017', 'Brooke Dillow', NULL, '5.16.2022 - Brooke called to find out if her PCP, OBGYN, and sons pediatrician are in the PHCS network. The only provider she had on her list that was in-network was her son''s pediatrician. Brooke will be sending me a list via email to check to see if the providers are in-network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-16 08:34:34', '2022-05-16 08:34:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093377013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '5.16.2022 - Brandee called because she is taking her daughter to the pediatrician and she does not have her Planstin card. I advised Brandee that I will request a PDF copy of her Planstin card be sent to her ASAP this morning so that she has something to present to the office. I requested that copy via Planstin teams. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-16 08:31:36', '2022-05-16 08:31:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093377008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119002', 'Azeem Tajani', NULL, '5.16.2022 - Alice called regarding an EOB she recently received from Planstin pertaining to her daughters bloodwork she had done. I advised Alice that there are only 2 panels included in their preventative services, and that the EOB she received was already discounted and that it would be an out of pocket expense. Alice advised that Planstin told her to call us to see if MPB.Health could pay anything towards the bill she received. I let Alice know that this is not something that MPB does. She understood and said she would be sending in the payment soon. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-16 08:12:16', '2022-05-16 08:12:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093377003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090892002', 'Amy Morin', NULL, '5.16.2022 - Amy called because she has a mammogram today and wanted to know what the process would be. I searched for the facility that Amy was going to have this done, Providence Hospital, and it is not in the PHCS network. Amy wasn''t very happy about this and wanted to know what she had to do to get this paid for. I explained to Amy that she does have to find a facility within the PHCS network for this mammogram to be paid as a preventative service, and the nearest facility was 95.54 miles away. She asked to be transferred to Planstin to speak with them even though I told her there was not going to be an alternative. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-16 08:08:45', '2022-05-16 08:08:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093355006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093341002', 'Christina Sayre', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-16 07:45:39', '2022-05-16 07:45:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093320036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, '5-13-2022:  Janalee called.  Her daughter Kennedy is going in for an IUD Mon &amp; she wanted to understand the proper proc.  She did conf when they made the appt, the gyno is part of the PHCS MultiPlan network.  Because the appt is Mon &amp; it''s later on Fri, I''m having her call Planstin to conf the best procedure &amp; to ask for a pdf copy of her Planstin card since those have been an issue lately.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-13 17:19:50', '2022-05-13 17:19:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093320031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '5-13-2022:  A young gentleman calling from this # said he was looking for ins.  I asked who referred him, he said his Mom, so I''m assuming that''s Eliz Collins.  Made sure he had her advisor Wendy Scipione''s ph # &amp; let him know she can help him get setup.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-13 16:16:57', '2022-05-13 16:16:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093320026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, '5-13-2022:  Elgin was unsure if he''s signed-up on Sedera''s site yet, so he can start a ''need''.  We went over what to try &amp; he seems comfortable w/those options.  I gave him Sedera''s ph # in case he continues to have issues since they need to help him if so.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-13 15:07:05', '2022-05-13 15:07:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093320018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076009', 'Jasmine Buckelew', NULL, '5-13-2022:  Reid got back to me on the 2 more expensive items.  Epiduo Forte Comp #45 = a compound drug & they cannot source compounded formulas.  He sent a price for Epiduo Forte 3%, which I let Jasmine know, but she has a much cheaper source in TX, so I don''t think this will help.
     Azelaic Acid Gel 15%, 50gm = $54.98 @ Walmart.  (Reid only has brand & it''s dbl the price + shipping.)  I sent Jasmine the Walmart Coup = cheapest today thru RXGo, but she can get this for ~$50 thru her TX source.  Sent her coupon in case w/shipping thru TX, this works better for her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-13 14:57:13', '2022-05-13 15:02:46'),
