  ('zcrm_1579374000093282038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644183', 'Carolann Nevitt', NULL, 'Member called in and wondered why she continued to be charged for our services after she cancelled LHS I told her that we were a separate company and that had to cancelled separately.  She argued with me that this was the program she was forced to be in because she was overweight.  I told her that that was another program.  I could not convince her otherwise. She just wants to cancel.  I will send out cancellation form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-13 13:40:49', '2022-05-13 13:40:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093282033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Member emailed in and asked about Prescription reimbursement since she has been informed that the Optum RX is a extra.  I explained about our Pharmacy program and new program to be rolled out.  She told me that this would be for the Shingles Shot.  I explained in network requirement and she said that she went to someone in-network.  I told her to submit to Planstin.  She also asked about adding a dependent to the plan.  I explained about the form and emailed to her advised of deadline.  She to fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-13 13:04:43', '2022-05-13 13:04:43'),
