  ('zcrm_1579374000093329003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '5.13.2022 - Matt called in with a lot of questions about his plan. We got him situated with CirrusMD, I explained how to present himself as a self-pay patient, and how to submit bills to Zion and open a Need. Matt was very satisfied with his service. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-13 12:16:26', '2022-05-13 12:16:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093325003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094318001', 'Jason Sibson', NULL, '5-13-22 We had a Zoom call with Sean Burke - 303-782-0123. We logged into ICQuotes.com and username is Abbott and Pwd is ICHRA2022. Showed Jason all of the plan choices and I gave him a quick rundown of the good and bad of the companies and options. He wants to browse on his own for a bit before he picks. Once he choose a plan and completes the application on his end I will receive an email and I asked him to send me one as well. Then I need to have Sean help me complete the enrollment process on my end with Jennifer Abbott''s payment information she hopefully plugged in on her end already as the employer paying for 75% of his plan and taking the rest from his paycheck.  He''s healthy and no pre-x or meds or anything. He just moved to CO and really just wants to establish a PCP in Denver to start doing his annual wellness visits. I suggested he ask around for recommendations for doctors in the area and find out what plans they accept as well. He agreed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-13 12:08:23', '2022-05-13 12:08:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093320003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '5-13-2022:  Thelma is Covid posititve.  She called to see if we could find a coupon for the RX they prescribed.  The Paxlovid 150-100mg, #30 (1 carton) only came up on WellRX.com @ $2.51, so I sent her the Walmart coupon.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-13 11:54:38', '2022-05-13 11:54:38'),
