  ('zcrm_1579374000093265003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090937012', 'Samantha Danz', NULL, 'I left a VM for this member in response to a email that was sent to Julia saying that member was "connecting" with Gina at Zion to upgrade her plan.  I called her to find out what she wanted to do. Left VM.  However due to Cari''s note look''s like she is cancelling.  Vanessa called me to ask about this as she has a welcome call with her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-13 09:08:16', '2022-05-13 09:08:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093232013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083247001', 'Michael Kjelgaard', NULL, '05/13/22  spoke with Constance Kjelgaard she was asking about the in-network providers search she was telling the offices she has Planstin and not MultiPlan . TOld her to tell them she has MultiPlan and they will be in network. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-13 08:58:49', '2022-05-13 08:58:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093232008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601108', 'Kevin Fechtmeyer', NULL, '05/13/22  called Kevin  Fechtmeyer to discuss the conversation.  He is on Secure plan so he would need to send a need to  Zion.  Will send him the info on PHCS provider search and Zion Need info.  He was very confused about how t  all worked. I explained the preventative services and how the IUA works and he was better understanding  with how I explained it all.   Sent emails today. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-13 08:23:58', '2022-05-13 08:23:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089798002', 'Kyle Hartung', NULL, '5.13.2022 - Kyle called because he was confused as to why Planstin would not cover a diagnostic mammogram that his wife''s doctor is requiring her to have soon. I explained to Kyle that Planstin is only for their preventative services, but that if this went above his IUA amount that they could submit the bills for payment for anything above his IUA amount. Kyle then explained that this is a follow up request from a mammogram 6 months ago. I then explained to Kyle that this may be considered a pre-existing condition. He completely understood, and I sent him the HCBB fair price for both a 2D and 3D diagnostic mammogram. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-13 08:01:36', '2022-05-13 08:01:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093241003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  Per Wendy''s note below she has spoken to her.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-13 08:01:28', '2022-05-13 08:01:28'),
