  ('zcrm_1579374000093010061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007369033', 'James Sorensen', NULL, '5-11-2022:  James called.  He needs to sub a ''need'' to Zion, but was very hush, hush and did not disclose for what.  He did confirm it is not a ''prev'' care item.  Sent him the temp &amp; went over instructions in detail.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 16:12:13', '2022-05-11 16:12:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093010053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082418002', 'Patricia Sweeney', NULL, '5-11-2022:  Patricia called re: a mammogram (she hasn''t had one since joining Zion on this ''Direct'' plan).  Let her know this will be handled as a ''Prev Needs Req''.  Sent her temp for sub ''need'' to Zion w/instructions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 16:01:18', '2022-05-11 16:01:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093010048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090937012', 'Samantha Danz', NULL, '5-11-2022:  Samantha called.  She''s getting her IUD inserted tomorrow at an obgyn from her old ins days.  Wondered if this was covered.  She has a diff type of DPC (memb includes spec items for annual fee - not tech a DPC as we normally think of, so they cannot help w/the IUD).  Ck''d the Zion Guidelines, but since an IUD I got her over to Zion so they can specifically go over her options.     - CA

Samantha called back & is cancelling.  She''s going to e-mail her advisor Whitney right now (I''m guessing Zion swayed her to go directly w/them instead?)  She knows Whitney will notify our Ben Admin ok to send cancellation form for her to sign & cancellation will be effective: 6/1/2022 as long as it gets done right away.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 15:51:34', '2022-05-11 16:08:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093010034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089142002', 'Michael Baker', NULL, '5-11-2020:  Michael called to let me know his doc is telling him they do not take his ins.  Turns out he was telling them MPB Health on a ''preventative'' care appointment.  He does have his Planstin card pdf.  He''s going to call to make sure they are in the PHCS MultiPlan network & knows to use that card instead. 
     He says he already tt someone today, so I did NOT go over ''prev'' care details.     - CA

Michael called back confused (Had quest re: ded on card, etc.).  We did go over quite a bit on how the ''prev'' care works.  He seemed to have a better grasp when we got off the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 15:18:02', '2022-05-11 15:31:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093010029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '5-11-2022:  A female from this # (I''m assuming Christina) thought she was dialing Mazzitti &amp; Sullivan.  I offered to trans her to their assistance #, but she just took their # from me &amp; said she''s actually getting the # for someone else (I think her counselor from the brief comments?).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 14:41:20', '2022-05-11 14:41:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092976057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820161', 'Tammy Bertolette', NULL, 'Member called into cancel.  I directed her to JC to speak with her.  I did not send her the cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-11 14:32:01', '2022-05-11 14:32:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093010024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088333002', 'Anil Salem', NULL, '5-11-2022:  Anil hurt his knee at the end of April.  He''s been presenting himself as self-pay and seeing doctors for it.  Had an MRI  & the ACL may req surg.  Getting diff diag (partial & full tear) so referred for 2nd opinion tomorrow.  Sent him temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion which he will do today.  Knows to closely watch e-mail for comm & to call to confirm Zion can see submission on their end after about 48-hours (just to be sure uploads ok).
     - Went over IF surg = call us prior to making any appts, etc., for Care Conn = disc on IUA & convenient
     - His Mom (or father''s wife) = physician.
     - Asked about card(s).  Went over MPB.Health for reference.  Will rec Planstin = ''Prev'' Care only.  No Zion card = present as ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA & once approved Zion will work on pymt for him via their ph #.
     They seem to have a good grasp on the situation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 13:41:51', '2022-05-11 13:41:51'),
