  ('zcrm_1579374000093010016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, '5-11-2022:  Laurie never rec''d the RX coupons/e-mail I sent on the 6th.  We tried several times from Outlook, but it never arrived.  We finally sent it from my gmail acct to her daughters &amp; that worked.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 12:22:48', '2022-05-11 12:22:48'),
