  ('zcrm_1579374000092976031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086838002', 'Joshua Barker', NULL, 'I followed up with member since I hadn''t heard from him on the deadline day that I gave him to pay for May after declining.  I sent him the Cancellation Link, however i will cancel him ahead of getting it.  Member responded acting unaware that we had to cancel him if he did not pay.  Doesn''t look like he will be filling out the  Cancellation.  I made sure Zac was aware of this.  He will follow up with him in a couple of months.  I will cancel wit Planstin and billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-11 12:11:06', '2022-05-11 14:05:12'),
