  ('zcrm_1579374000092976023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419076', 'Dana Michie', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know if I could send her a copy of the 1095.  I told her that it would have come from Apex and that she had been a member all of last year.  Said she had it however needed how much she could deduct from her taxes.  I advised that only "insurance" portion would be deductible.  I gave her amount of $66 per month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-11 10:32:31', '2022-05-11 10:32:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000093010008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243184', 'Mark Capsalors', NULL, '5-11-2022:  Jan Capodi called.  Mark called &amp; had a heart attach yesterday &amp; is in the ICU.  Jan wondered what his next step is since the hosp fin off keeps asking for info.  She''s going to provide Sedera''s # to them because they want more than the ''cash-pay'' presentation.  She knows he has the 1k IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-11 10:30:08', '2022-05-11 12:24:24'),
