  ('zcrm_1579374000092943049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '5-10-2022:  Ashley let me know she''s pregnant!  Sent her link to start her ''Maternity Need'' right away. Went over uploading maternity plan from her midwives.  That midwives need to be licensed in her state, but Zion sb able to work w/them.  Sent curr Zion ''Maternity Guidelines'' dwnloaded today so I know they are up to date.  I think she''s got a good grasp on this!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-10 18:28:43', '2022-05-10 18:28:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092943044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081302002', 'David Pearson', NULL, '5-10-2020:  Lisa e-mailed back re: the RX quotes I sent over on the 6th.  She didn''t really need these, she was checking out the prices.  I responded to let us know when she''s ready & a bit about our pricing process.  She was upset that I sent $13.90 at Winn Dixie when she can get it at Publix for $13.71.  I explained that on the day I sent the coupons I did see Publix''s price, but at that time she could get the 2 prescriptions at Winn Dixie cheaper and for the .19 cents, I was trying to save her 2 trips.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-10 16:49:22', '2022-05-10 16:49:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092943039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078746049', 'Suzanne Swearengen', NULL, '5-10-2020:  Suzanne e-mailed back.  She found the RX Quote request very confusing and was sorry.  I let her know I completely understand and it was no issue, I just wanted to make sure she had what she needed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-10 16:38:50', '2022-05-10 16:38:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092935018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083771001', 'Robert Godfrey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! Robert and Rebekah are going to be amazing on this plan! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-10 14:58:43', '2022-05-10 14:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092885033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737144', 'Catherine Rongey', NULL, 'Member called in and was referred to me by someone from Boulder Family Health.  I let her know that she had cancelled with us eff 1/1/21.  She was totally unaware of this.  She had a card from a Jericho Health Share that said that she was a member since 4/1/22.  I told her that we were not Jericho Health Share and that she should reach out to them for guidance.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-10 14:31:37', '2022-05-10 14:31:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092949003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162245', 'Rhonda Savage', NULL, 'Rhonda left a message with me on Friday May 3 about speaking with her regarding the hospital bill.  I place a call with her on Monday, May 9 around 945am and then again around 315pm  I left a message both times.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-05-10 14:15:47', '2022-05-10 14:15:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092910044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090144002', 'Charlotte Williams', NULL, '05/10/22 sent Provider search email per Welcome call with Jenn today.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-10 14:12:09', '2022-05-10 14:12:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092935013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090144002', 'Charlotte Williams', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! Charlotte advised me that she was never told she had to use providers in the PHCS network for her preventative services. I suggested that I (practice for Alison) run a network search for her current providers before connecting her with her advisor, Louis, to explain this information to her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-10 13:57:36', '2022-05-10 13:57:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092943023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, '5-10-2022:  Jeff called.  His ''prev'' annual appt is today.  He''s going to present his old Planstin card that shows the PHCS Network on it &amp; conf when he arrives.  Already had his labs done at the hosp (knew they offer cheap labs to those w/out insurance.  Pd about $140 for 1k of labs per him.  Knows to make sure all ''prev'' to help make sure they pay for everything.  He seems to have a good grasp on the program.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-10 13:44:26', '2022-05-10 13:44:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092935008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085646002', 'Karen Lapchinsky', NULL, '5.10.2022 - Returned Karen''s call regarding her child''s ENT visit and the fact that he needs to have tubes put in his ears. I advised Karen that we need to get her started with opening a Need with Zion Health. I explained to Karen the process with Zion Health and warm transferred over to their concierge team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-10 13:20:28', '2022-05-10 13:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092943013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, '5-10-2022:  Tammy''s been seeing a PT (self prescribed) for her shoulder, but it looks like the problem persists.  She wanted to know how the plan works.  She''s going to ask the PT to recommend someone to see for the prob.  I suggested HCBB as well.  I sent her the temp to sub a ''need'' to Zion.  She''s going to do that & will follow-up w/them on how quickly things proc.  She knows she''s resp for the 1k IUA as a ''cash-pay'' pt.  I let her know re: the PT (part of the 1k?) since PT generally requires prior approval.   She was upset because "she didn''t know PT req''d prior approval".  I told her w/alternative treatments, they like to pre-approve the appts, but it can''t hurt to turn it in.  I think she was ok at the end of the conv.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-10 11:29:03', '2022-05-10 11:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092943008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, '5-10-2022:  Brandi called asking how to cancel her plan.  I let her know it''s best to start w/the advisor: Wendy Scipione.  She was fine w/me doing a direct trans to Wendy &amp; she will LM if she does not catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-10 11:16:55', '2022-05-10 11:16:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092885028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092940002', 'Curt Freeman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-10 10:45:47', '2022-05-10 10:45:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092885023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617067', 'Robert Picheco', NULL, 'I received Cancellation from this member.  I will process and refund 2 mos.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-10 10:37:57', '2022-05-10 10:37:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092910039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, '05/10/22  Ron Flake called  asking if Zion health covers Mental Health issues. Guidelines per Zion do not cover Mental Health. I sent over information about the MAP program to see if that program will be able to help them.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-10 10:21:54', '2022-05-10 10:21:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092910034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '05/10/22  received call from Scott Meyer to see if he was all set up for his June 1 start. It says in the system he is a July 1 start. He is ok with that.   AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-10 09:56:20', '2022-05-10 09:56:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092885018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617067', 'Robert Picheco', NULL, 'Member''s wife called in because she had noticed that the $50 was still being charged to the CC.  Member turned 65 11/2021.  I advised that LHS does not share that information, so we would have no way of knowing.  I will refund her the standard 2 mos when I receive Cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-10 09:55:57', '2022-05-10 09:55:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092935003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617067', 'Robert Picheco', NULL, '5.10.2022 - Helen called regarding a bill she recently received from HES. I transferred her to Patti to speak with her about why Robert is being charged $50 monthly. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-10 09:50:02', '2022-05-10 09:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092910029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401086', 'Andrew Brinkmeyer', NULL, '05/10/22 spoke with William from Arizona Dermatology. He was handed the MPB Health card and was told to call us for the information.  Pt is considered self pay and responsible for 5000 IUA then will submit bills to the health share once he meets that IUA amount.  AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-10 09:48:17', '2022-05-10 09:48:17'),
