  ('zcrm_1579374000092847008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078746049', 'Suzanne Swearengen', NULL, '5-9-2020:  RX Quote Req:  Tried to confirm info w/Suzanne, but did not catch her.  It''s the kind of stuff she''ll be wanting immed.  20-drops/ml, 5ml = ~25 ds.  She needs 14-30ds. Therefore, sent 4 coupons for the 2 items = 5ml & 10ml qty on both eye drops at Walgreens (pharmacy she listed).  Can get @ diff pharmacies for little bit less, but for ease of 1 stop:
