  ('zcrm_1579374000092847003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919765', 'Benjamin Jackson', NULL, '5-9-2022:  Advisor Andrea Hinman replied and took care of Betzi''s questions from last Friday.  Then for clarification I ''replied all'' to explain no waiting period on SECURE for ''prev'' care thru diff component than Zion for this plan.  But, 60-day wait before conception for Maternity.  Per Andrea''s request.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-09 21:18:04', '2022-05-09 21:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092788038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079422002', 'Aaron Handler', NULL, '5-9-2022:  Sent a reply to Aaron re: the missed chat shown above.  Sugg he sub a ''need'' so Zion can determine if qualified.  Went over no dental/vision, unless attached to a larger ''need'' or it moves to the ''medical'' category vs dent/vision.  Sent him detailed e-mail on how to sub a ''need'' w/link to see how they categorize this & whether they will share after their 1k IUA.  Present as ''cash-pay'' to that point if shared.     - CA

