  ('zcrm_1579374000092788028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '5-9-2022:  Jim called from Hy-vee pharmacy.  He just left the eye doc &amp; wanted to see how we work RX pricing.  I ran both items &amp; he can get them at Hy-vee for just $1.29 more than the cheapest location.  We agreed he might as well pick them up there since he''s already at the store.  Both priced best on GoodRx today: Gen Pred Forte 1%, 10ml = $45.43.  Brimonidine 0.2%, 5ml = $6.64.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-09 16:21:56', '2022-05-09 16:21:56'),
