  ('zcrm_1579374000092815003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043191048', 'William Bradford', NULL, '5-9-22 Will is paying $277 for himself and $800+ for son Theo! They are both super healthy, no issues at all. Will is 43 turning 44 this year. He''s W2 and also has a side business selling his artwork on EBay at about $500 a month! Very cool. He will get a CO business license to show proof of that business and qualify for SECURE at $1000/$525. He''s thrilled to save all of this money since they never use their healthcare and he likes the virtual healthcare, Concierge Team and self-pay. He will share it with his wife and we will meet again next Monday to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-09 12:23:19', '2022-05-09 12:23:19'),
