  ('zcrm_1579374000092722023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091159010', 'Corinne Blagg', NULL, '5.9.2022 - Corinne called with questions about dental discounts with her dental plan that Mike Montes told her she had. I explained that we do not offer dental plans, but I would be happy to transfer her to Mike so that he could clarify a few things with her. She also stated that Mike told her that the concierge team would do "anything she wanted us to do" for her. I explained that yes, as long as it has to do with her plan, we are more than willing to assist her. I sent her a list of PCP''s in her area along with instructions on how to access her WHLC account. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-09 09:05:48', '2022-05-09 09:05:48'),
