  ('zcrm_1579374000092682003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053916930', 'Zachary Irisawa', NULL, 'May 7th, 2022 - Marginne Tellez: Mr. Irisawa reach us through Sales IQ,  code # 33089. He was asking for his membership number and a 24/7 Sedera phone number, and what information he needed since he needed urgent care. I gave him Sedera''s phone number, but it was closed today. So, I told him that he was a cost-sharing member which makes him a cash-paying member, and usually, the cost-sharing plans may pay the bill directly after the UIA or by reimbursement. Depending on the plan.', 'MPB Southern District Agents', 'MPB Southern District Agents', '2022-05-07 09:47:01', '2022-05-07 09:47:01'),
