  ('zcrm_1579374000092637026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919765', 'Benjamin Jackson', NULL, '5-6-2022:  Betzi sent me an e-mail late on Thurs asking about ''prev'' care items.  She''s on a plan I don''t think has ''prev'' care, but it''s the old bridge & I''ve seen this plan used in ways I would not expect in the past & have assumed wrong.  tt Jennifer yesterday & neither of us is sure.  Called Wendy & she sugg I ck w/Andrea Hinman.  Got busy & forgot to call Andrea until late Friday, but she''s going to ck her notes when she gets home & call Betzi next week.  I replied to Betzi''s e-mail (cc''ing Andrea so it''s easier for her to remember since she''s out of the office) & LM for Betzi as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-06 17:56:32', '2022-05-06 17:56:32'),
