  ('zcrm_1579374000092637013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, '5-6-2022:  Laurie called yesterday.  The pharmacy is limiting her prescription and she''s confused what''s happening & why.  I priced all of the following, then called pharmacy to help figure out the issue. [They were being limited on qty & pricing was more exp, but several items were linked to & being pd using Optum RX  (2 of her RXs).  Asked Cassidy at Wegmans to rem that as Laurie will have coupons = cheaper.]
     Today''s prices have decreased in price slightly.  The best coupons listed below, were sent to Laurie today.  She knows she can get things slightly cheaper by going to diff pharmacies, but for the ease of 1 stop, she likes Wegmans for everything: 
          - Spironolactone 50mg, 1bid, #180  =  $13.62 on GoodRX  [Cassidy let me know Lisa must call to request #180 quantity refill specifically.  She''s out of refills & they will only req #60 if she isn''t specific.]
          - Metoprolol ER (= Gen Toprol XL) 25mg, #90 = $11.99 on RXGo
          - Lisinopril 5mg, #90 = $8.15 on WellRx
          - Atorvastatin 20mg, #90 = $10.76 on RXGo [This may be N/C as ''prev'' medication, but requires approved ''waiver'' & they limit to 30-day supply.  She seems to appreciate convenience, so I let her know we can look at getting this covered for free w/ds limit = 3 trips.  W/price at $10.76 she may decide not worth the trouble.  Asked her to call us IF she''d like to look at that route.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-06 15:02:35', '2022-05-11 12:21:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092637008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '5-6-2022:  Peggy''s husband (Stan ?) called wanting to know the procedure since Peggy''s Medicare will start 7/1/22.  Let him know they will rec e-mail to Peggy''s e-mail (conf = good address = Y).  In e-mail is link, but to wait until about 2nd week ok June to sign &amp; submit the cancellation.  He was thrilled it will be this easy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-06 14:51:06', '2022-05-06 14:51:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092596008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081593002', 'Heather Bacchus', NULL, '05/06/22 Heather Bacchus called today to request Provider information. Sent search results along with the MAP instructions to her email on file. AC', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-06 13:44:36', '2022-05-06 13:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092637003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052755096', 'Kathryn Sparacino', NULL, '5-6-2022:  Kathryn is thinking of having a mammogram &amp; wondered how it works w/her plan.  We disc no ''prev'' care, but it if become diagnostic (which her last one a few years ago did), she may have help if the exp &gt; her ''cash-pay'' 1k IUA resp.  Sent her temp for sub a ''need'' to Sedera &amp; to keep/upload all detailed inv &amp; receipts.  She''ll call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-06 12:35:47', '2022-05-06 12:35:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092585031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089233002', 'Alexander Myers', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-06 11:31:29', '2022-05-06 11:31:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092585026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090933002', 'Mary Sheehan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-06 10:46:21', '2022-05-06 10:46:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092572008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176037', 'Kathleen Burke', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  Per Cari''s note member has been wanting to cancel since early February.  I will process this cancellation and refund May payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-06 10:10:04', '2022-05-06 10:10:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092585021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091159010', 'Corinne Blagg', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-06 10:04:30', '2022-05-06 10:04:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092585016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090937012', 'Samantha Danz', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-06 09:34:11', '2022-05-06 09:34:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092596003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085759046', 'James Brown', NULL, '05/06/22 resent script quotes for James Brown one for CVS and one for Walmart.  Also emailed him to tell him to call the pharmacy to see if they will price match so he doesnt have to run all over town.', 'Alison Cary', 'Alison Cary', '2022-05-06 09:31:39', '2022-05-06 09:31:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092595003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081205002', 'Tessa Tarr', NULL, '5.6.2022 - Tessa called because she was slightly confused about how to submit her bills to Zion. I clarified all of her questions regarding that and then I will also be running 2 network searches for her for preventative care. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-06 09:30:59', '2022-05-06 09:30:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092585011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089441002', 'Jason Roberg', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-06 09:05:51', '2022-05-06 09:05:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092585003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, 'he called me at 4:00 pm. He is a business owner interested in hsa secure plan. also looking to get his employees on a plan  as well.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-05-06 09:03:47', '2022-05-06 09:04:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092572003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361667', 'Deborah Caulfield', NULL, 'Member called in and let me know that her CC had expired and wanted me to check on it.  She is one of the List Bill/CC members being billed out of FTNI.  I told her to fill it out and resubmit it and then I could put it in A123.  She will submit it to me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-06 08:36:53', '2022-05-06 08:36:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092565013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079840001', 'Eric Lindsay', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-06 08:16:57', '2022-05-06 08:16:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092566016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '05.05.22:  Heard from Patti she spoke w/Jessica who told her Jessica''s assistant, Joanna Mangohig  (joannamangohig@gmail.com) will be dealing with us for Jess''s plan. Patti told Jessica the cancellation deadline is today. I emailed Joanna and explained Patti needs her to complete and submit our Payment Update form by end of day today or Jess''s plan will be cancelled.  Texted Jess to give me Joanna''s cell phone # but Jess told me she lives in Thailand, so no number available.  Found out from Jess she doesn''t currently have enough funds in her account to cover the $650 needed to enroll and won''t have it until after June 5th.  I asked if it was ok with her if she starts July 1.  She said yes, so Patti will hold her application for a July 1 start.  Joanna did send in the payment update information which Patti will hold and use for the July 1 start.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-05-06 08:12:22', '2022-05-06 09:16:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092528013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297078', 'Nicholas Olinger', NULL, '5.6.2022 - Rachael was transferred to me by Desiree from Planstin. Rachael was wanting to use her CirrusMD services but for some reason I was not able to send her an invitation. I have reached out to CirrusMD support and tagged Rachael in the email so that we can get her into her CirruMD account. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-06 08:08:51', '2022-05-06 08:08:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092565008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109390001', 'Jessica Houston', NULL, 'Called at 9:50, she is 1099 and interested in HSA PLANS.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-05-06 08:08:28', '2022-05-06 08:08:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092566011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '05.03.22:  Texted Jessica Patti told me she hasn''t heard from her about payment of her plan.  Asked Jess to call Patti with correct acct. # or call me with it ASAP and I''ll get it to Patti.  Warned Jess that if she doesn''t do this, her plan will be cancelled  and I gave her Patti''s phone number.  Jess replied she would call Patti this morning.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-05-06 08:00:50', '2022-05-06 08:00:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092566006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '4.26.22:  Heard from Patti Jessica''s payment was declined because she didn''t have the correct routing number for her bank acct. on her application.  Texted Jessica this info. and told her Patti sent her 2 notices but hadn''t heard back from her.  Asked Jessica to give Patti the correct number. Jessica texted back she''d give Patti a call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-05-06 07:57:54', '2022-05-06 07:57:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092565003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090931002', 'Rodney WIlliams', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Added secondary email. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-05-06 07:53:03', '2022-05-06 07:53:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092559008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086223002', 'Adam Kobler', NULL, 'Dayra forwarded me an email from member requesting to update his payment method.  I emailed him the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-06 07:41:21', '2022-05-06 07:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092559003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  I entered information in A123 so it is there for when member re-enrolls.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-06 07:36:04', '2022-05-06 07:36:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092500018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153615', 'Roger Nigg', NULL, '5-5-2022:  Had 3 people all calling in while I was on ph w/another memb.  ILM for Roger that I am here &amp; was trying them back.  Gave her my hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-05 15:23:36', '2022-05-05 15:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092500013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, '5-5-2022:  3 people were all calling in at once.  ILM for Mark on the # that shows on caller id: (801) 649-4929 &amp; tried the CRM listed #: (801) 503-5575, but it sounds like both are ringing into the same VM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-05 15:20:21', '2022-05-05 15:20:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092500008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '5-5-2022:  Had 3 people all calling in while I was on ph w/another memb.  ILM for Elz that I am here &amp; was trying her back.  Gave her my hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-05 15:13:57', '2022-05-05 15:13:57'),
