  ('zcrm_1579374000092339026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083247001', 'Michael Kjelgaard', NULL, '5.4.2022 - Michael called because he is having Basel cell removal surgery on his nose. I explained that he should speak with Zion Health about getting a Need open for this surgery ASAP. I warm transferred Mike to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-04 14:08:20', '2022-05-04 14:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092339021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '5-4-22 Jim called to understand why his HMA card was rejected at Walgreens for his medication. It should have been accepted since it was only for a med and nothing else. I suggested he calls HMA to find out the issue.  He also has a need mentioned above that he will submit. I recommended he ask the provider to create one super bill of everything done and all proof of what he''s paid already to simplify the Needs process and he will do that. They aren''t very helpful in the cash pay arena with a $250 nebulizer that he was tricked into buying. He thought he''d give it back when he was done, but they say he bought it.  He will work through the process. He knows of the 6 month time limit to submit. He''s on track.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-04 14:01:27', '2022-05-04 14:01:27'),
