  ('zcrm_1579374000092135109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082612012', 'Ken Carpenter', NULL, '5-3-2022:  Ken called about his son - he needed a sports physical for school.  But, his wife took their youngest son to his old doc.  Ken wondered if he was part of the plan.  He''s not.  Ken knows Dr Patterson well, but was confused because his off said they could not see his older son except for illness because he was a new pt.  However, part of a new membership is to have that new memb physicals, so he will let me know if they can''t get everyone in relatively soon since that''s supposed to happen right away w/the OPD membership (they became members >5 mos ago on 1/1/22).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-03 17:55:18', '2022-05-03 17:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092135104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', NULL, '5-3-2022:  Katherine e-mailed.  She hadn''t used the coup from the end of March, so I ran a new search.  She likes staying at Rite Aid.  This time it was cheaper at Rite Aid thru RxGo.com: Lisinopril 10mg, #90 = $12.59.  Sent her new coup.  [Still considerably cheaper at other pharmacies...]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-03 17:33:37', '2022-05-03 17:33:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092135099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069620083', 'Patrick Gahman', NULL, '5-3-2022:  Patrick called to see if he could pre-pay several mos of his mo contribution (he has a new cc where he gets a bonus if he spends a certain amt in a certain amt of time).  Told him I didn''t think we could do that, but put him into Patti Baron''s VM (it''s past 5pm Eastern) because she will be able to confirm if I am correct.
     - He asked about his member portal.  I thought I couldn''t get in, but showed him how to access the diff forms on the MPB.Health site under: Member Updates.  [I realized after the fact, I''d missed a letter in his access.  So, it does work.  He decided he didn''t really care whether he could get in, otherside I''d have called him back.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-03 17:02:50', '2022-05-03 17:02:50'),
