  ('zcrm_1579374000092135084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032830004', 'Thomas Schell', NULL, '5.3.2022 - Thomas called regarding the information from Cari''s note below. I spoke with Wendy, who advised that any changes to Sedera are not taking place until June 1,2022. She also advised that Thomas speak with Patti to get further clarification on the payments. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-03 14:30:46', '2022-05-03 14:30:46'),
