  ('zcrm_1579374000092135069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077408229', 'Dennis Burd', NULL, '5-3-2022:  Dennis called thinking he had ''prev'' care.  He''s a new advisor &amp; thinks he set himself up on the wrong plan.  He LM for Patti to get help in correcting &amp; going to the SECURE Plan.  Also went over new pricing on Secure in 50-65 Age band is only $25/mo cont for the 1k IUA vs the $2500 IUA he''s on.  For $300/yr at this price point, the MCS would start @ $1500 less.  Might be worth it?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-03 10:57:11', '2022-05-03 10:57:11'),
