  ('zcrm_1579374000092135064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091002', 'Christian Tonsberg', NULL, '5-3-2022:  Christian called.  I confirmed the RX info & currently Stop n Shop thru RxGo is best for the Atorvastatin (=gen Lipitor) 20mg, 1d, #90 @ $11.36.  The Sildenafil (=gen Viag) 100mg, #6 is best at Costco thru GoodRx @ $4.60 - he can however get #20 @ Walmart for $8.48.  He doesn''t need these right now, he''s just seeing what prices look like for when he''s ready.
     - They just sold their house in CT & are packing/moving.  They are traveling for the next few months, then have an apartment in FL.  The new address is out a ways, so I did not supply/go over the chg form yet.  He sounds totally overwhelmed.
