  ('zcrm_1579374000092135039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '5.3.2022 - John emailed in asking questions about making an appointment and letting me know that he feels very uninformed about his plan. I explained how to search the PHCS network for a preventative services provider and how to present his MEC, I also explained how to present himself as a cash-pay patient. I did also advise John that I am only on until 5 PM EST, so if he does have questions that need a response right away, he should call the concierge line. I provided the concierge number, instructions on how to search the PHCS network and a link to the healthcare.gov website for a list of preventative services his MEC will cover. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-05-03 08:20:00', '2022-05-03 08:20:00'),
