  ('zcrm_1579374000092144018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086838010', 'Mary Jane Rushlow', NULL, '5-2-2022:  Mary Jane was challenging.  She "doesn''t want an education, just answer her questions".  I tried...  Showed her different paragraphs and links in her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail thinking it would give her tools so she''s not just hearing it, but seeing it as well.
     - Does her plan include dental & vision: helped her get onto the WHLC site & showed her the discounts available.  Sugg she could try her advisor for possible dental/vision plans.  She says she has his #.
     - Had ''prev'' derm appt she thought should be covered.  Now, because it was billed to Planstin, doctor''s off won''t look at cash discount.  They took 2 moles for testing (= no long prev anyway) & now she has" to pay the $300+?"  The moles are not an issue, so there will not be further treatment = < her $2500 IUA.  "Will it go towards my ded?"  Tried to explain she has an IUA, not a ded. "My Planstin card says I have a $3000/$6000 deductible... so I do have a deductible...will this go towards that?"  Explained, diff components, the diagnosis of the moles = HealthSharing & $2500 IUA.  She just wants me to answer her questions (but it''s not that simple).  It''s not a yes or no answer)!
     - She asked if seeing her in netwk MD for her pap will be covered.  I said that sb cov.  Tried to show her the healthcare.gov, but she''s been on the phone too much today because she started w/Planstin who had her on this site. & now she''s just done.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-02 14:29:21', '2022-05-02 16:37:32'),
