  ('zcrm_1579374000092120076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092127002', 'Lisa Hyser', NULL, 'Per Leo who followed up with member since they came in via the Sales Funnel member wants to sign up for the Care + membership.  Member did no speak to an advisor nor had a presentation.  So was uninformed about all aspects of membership.  She now wants to change selection to Care +.  I will make the change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-05-02 12:25:41', '2022-05-02 12:25:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092144013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, '5-2-2022:  Kia called needing:
     - Hurt her shoulder skiing this season & it''s not healing as well as expected.  Wondered if PT would be pd for & how to go about.  Went over ''need''s and how they work.  Poss PT included in a need, but she does have the 1k IUA first & all PT must be pre-approved w/a Treatment plan.  Hasnt''t seen anyone for this injury yet, we disc options.  Sent her temp to sub ''need'' to Zion.  She''ll call if she needs help.
     - CirrusMD - made sure she''s registered.  She''s going to get app on her phone so she can use if injury w/no comp avail.  Plus, maybe they can stear her in the right dir around the above shoulder issue. 
     - Wanted to know about mental health:  Got her on & into the MAP site.  Explained who to call, what to ask, and expect.   Disc pattern of appts, pymt during waiting periods, etc.  (Also went over sub categories that could be helpful.)  She asked about mental health w/CirrusMD & we disc what''s available for mental health there as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-02 12:11:36', '2022-05-02 12:11:36'),
