Acct # 4006051811.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-02 12:04:26', '2022-05-02 12:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092144008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659218', 'Julie Harriman', NULL, '5-2-2022:  Julie called because she''s moved &amp; needs to update her address.  Sent her Patti''s Plan Chg form temp &amp; walked her thru submitting it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-05-02 12:02:36', '2022-05-02 12:02:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092099013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '5-1-22 Jani called because she got the new Planstin card and never heard of them before. Sounds like she never had the original card. She wants to go to her annual ob/gyn visit and no drs. show up in the network in Truckee. Same for her colonoscopy that she needs to do soon. I told her to call the # on Planstins card to get moved to their Reference Based Price group to remove the network for these visits. I also explained the ded and mop since that''s on the card now too. She also wants to use the Life Care for counseling and I told her to call MPB Concierge Team for help with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-02 11:59:06', '2022-05-02 11:59:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092099008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092077036', 'Daniel Sosalla', NULL, '5-1-22 Daniel reached out to MPB for some unknown reason.  Tony Manzanarez let me know once he discovered this is already my client. Daniel isn''t a good candidate for MPB with his pre-x. Also he needs insurance to start May 1st which he missed the deadline for MPB as well. I just left him a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-05-02 11:36:39', '2022-05-02 11:36:39'),
