  ('zcrm_1579374000092120008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, 'I receive a call from member on 4/27 asking why his Preventative visit wasn''t shared.  I asked if provider was in Network and also if had been coded as preventative.  He called back 4/29 after speaking w?provider who said had been coded as prev.   I left VM telling him that next call should be to RCI asking why.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-30 09:06:25', '2022-04-30 09:06:25'),
