  ('zcrm_1579374000092085026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001266025', 'Patricia Cornejo', NULL, '4-29-2022:  Someone called concierge line from this #, but I could not hear anything until the very end as they were hanging up.   I called back &amp; a woman said hello.  I introduced myself and she hung-up.  I''m leaving this for Jeff as I think she may be trying to call him. Maybe she couldn''t hear me?  Tried calling Jeff  Kanter using the # listed in the CRM advisor file to let him know, but VM did not say his name &amp; it didn''t sound like him, so I did not LM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-29 16:04:23', '2022-04-29 17:25:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092085021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '4-29-2022:  Elsa is having issues &amp; has appt today to see gatroenterologist.  She wanted to go over how to present.  She''s going to use her HSA, present as ''cash-pay''.  Knows she can start a ''need'' if she thinks it will be ongoing &amp; over her 1k IUA (sent her temp for sub need to Zion).  Also, if they prescribe RX, let her know we can search for best price &amp; went over options there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-29 14:57:17', '2022-04-29 14:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092085013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086707002', 'Linda Pringle', NULL, '4-29-2022:   Linda is challenging.  She doesn''t understand IUAs, how Planstin works, when to submit items, gets frustrated if you ask questions...
     - Her ''prev'' care appt is 5/4/22.  She conf''d doc is in network & was frustrated when we talked about using an in network lab. "You mean, I''ve been using this doctor and the lab down the hall my whole life & I can''t do that anymore?"  I explained that since her doctor is in network, maybe the lab is too?  They should be able to tell her.  That LabCorp & Quest seem to be easy to find & in network nationwide.  She did seem to understand keeping the appt ''prev'' care only.
     - Planstin sent her an accurate pdf of her Planstin card.  BUT, they sent her the new one that doesn''t show PHCS, includes Optum RX...  She''s going to use the accurate pdf, but really frustrated she doesn''t have a card.  Told her the hard copy would work, it''s just not the best representation. "Now I have to print it out."  I apologized for the inconvenience, we are working to corrent the situation.  Also req''d a correct hard copy for her via Planstin Teams chat.
     - She saw a dermatologist (who chg''d her $85) and thought this would take care of her IUA.  When I tried to understand what she went for, if this would be ongoing, she became frustrated.  She wondered how we keep track her expenses towards her IUA then.  We went over in depth IUAs, & that if this will be ongoing, yes start a ''need''. But, she got frustrated & said "well, I''m not the doctor, these are doctor questions,".  So I kindly asked if he feels she needs to come see him again or how they left it?  "No, this is pretty much done, but it takes care of my IUA, right?"  We again discussed how IUAs work.
     - She''s struggling to understand.  But, I think she at least understood how to handle the above items when we got off.
     - Reminded her that when she gets a prescription, we are here to search for prices if she would like.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-29 13:59:11', '2022-04-29 14:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Ann called and asked to speak to Patti. I let her know that Patti was out of the office today and asked if there was anything I could assist her with. She explained that Patti has been the one helping her with this huge problem she has with her account and being active with Planstin and OptumRX, etc. I was able to speak with Patti and she said the best she can do right now is contact Planstin on Monday when she is back in the office. I relayed the message to Ann, and she said she would rather that be the case because she only wants Patti to be the one involved since she has been the one working on everything with her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-04-29 13:13:31', '2022-04-29 13:13:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092100008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391005', 'John Colver', NULL, 'John called to cancel his membership, I advised John that he needed to speak with Analisa Cleland so that she could get the cancelation process started for John. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-29 13:10:40', '2022-04-29 13:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092085008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', NULL, '4-29-2022:  Hermilo called.  Zion let him know it''s a pre-x &amp; went over the pre-x step-up in benefits.  He tt them &amp; is just going to keep uploading (they told him that''s just fine.  The expenses this year they told him will not go twds his IUA though).  
     - It was great news though!  The specialist said the baby''s # are not such that it''s going to be much of an issue.  They are doing some genetic testing (which he knows is not covered) for the baby''s records.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-29 12:21:37', '2022-04-29 12:21:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092100003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, 'Returned Daniela''s call regarding her Zion and Planstin cards. I explained that the issues should be resolved within the next 10-14 business days and I will call her to let her know that her cards are on their way. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-29 12:15:34', '2022-04-29 12:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092099003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '4-28-22 Daniela called me bc she hasn''t received her Planstin or Zion cards yet and she already had a kids well check to manage. She also called into our Concierge Team and the phone rang for 10 minutes and nobody picked up. Jennifer was on her lunch break but nobody else picked up. The phone system is failing. I also left a vm for Steve Schone to find out a back up solution for clients who aren''t showing up in Planstin''s system and already have visits for these members who had April 1st start dates. I had no idea there was any issue this month. This is the first I''ve heard that MPB and Planstin/Zion have a rate issue they are sorting out with the new age banding and cards associated with it. Jennifer is calling Daniela now to help her. I also sent Daniela the HSA instructions so she can get that set up even without the cards. She wants to get that going before her next child''s well check. Although, she shouldn''t be paying for anything since she should have the Plantsin card.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-29 12:10:31', '2022-04-29 12:10:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000092085003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, '4-29-2022:  Hasn''t used & now not sure how to proceed:
     - Years and years ago, she had her knee repaired with absolutely no issues until a few weeks ago.  She overextended it & is worried it''s not healing properly.  Sent her HCBB sugg high qual, fair priced docs at a specific clinic & in her area.  Sent her temp to start a ''need'' w/Zion once she sees the doctor.  Will present as ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA.
     - Let her know it''s fine to call if she''s still confused as she goes thru the process.  That''s why we are here.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-29 11:34:35', '2022-04-29 11:34:35'),
