  ('zcrm_1579374000092040003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018019042', 'Alexandria (Lexie) Hall', NULL, '4-29-22 Lexie called me back and she''s getting onto her husband''s insurance plan on May 1st. She wishes she could stay bc she "loves us to death!"  But it makes more sense for her to switch.  She was super nice and will complete the form online today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-29 10:52:32', '2022-04-29 10:52:32'),
