  ('zcrm_1579374000091925033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002647007', 'Benjamin Pieper', NULL, 'Ben called in because he is having kidney stone removal surgery tomorrow. I explained to Ben that we needed to get a Need opened right away. I warm transferred Ben to Zion so that we could also give Zion a head up as well. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-28 13:52:33', '2022-04-28 13:52:33'),
