  ('zcrm_1579374000091925008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, 'Jennifer called with questions about her Lo Loestrin being so expensive. I explained (thanks to Alison) to Jennifer that due to the fact that this birth control is the only form, there is no generic form of this birth control, and they are able to charge whatever price they like. I also advised her to speak with the company to see if there is anything they can do for her as far as pricing goes. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-28 08:54:56', '2022-04-28 08:54:56'),
