  ('zcrm_1579374000091791018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755162', 'Scott Yarbrough', NULL, '4.27.2022 - Scott called because his doctor may do an in-office procedure on his hemorrhoids today. I advised Scott to inquire about the price prior to having the procedure done because if it is above $5k we want to not have the procedure today and have the Zion negotiations team assist with the price. Scott said he believes it will be below his IUA amount, but he will contact us if it is above $5k.  I also advised Scott that if it is under his IUA amount, to ask for the best cash price and present himself as a self-pay patient. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-27 07:52:43', '2022-04-27 07:54:28'),
