  ('zcrm_1579374000091757013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153273', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, '4-26-2022:  Luis Varona (Marcel''s husb) called to find out what urologists are options under Marcel''s plan (since he''s on a diff plan than Marcel).  He had heard of a doc Daniel Cooper in Pheonix, AZ area at Affiliated Urologists (I think that was the name), but this group is rating as high priced.  He was open to at least looking at the HCBB list of high quality, fair priced options.  I sent the list of those near them.
