  ('zcrm_1579374000091518008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '4-22-2022:  Michelle had more questions.  We went over more details on her husband''s shoulder issue (he saw the doc today & now needs an MRI), so we discussed starting a ''need'' w/Sedera.  She''s been working w/a Sedera Needs Counselor & wants to see if he can help her w/this other need.  She''ll get back to us if she needs help from us.
