  ('zcrm_1579374000091518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256010', 'Marc DiNunzio', NULL, '4-22-2022:  Marc wants to chg his pymt method.  We got him into his Memb Portal.  As we talked, we realized he wants to use his HRA (Health Reim Acct) to pay his monthly contribution.  Since I wasn''t sure how it works with the HRA, processing fee, etc., I sent him Patti''s temp for the pymt update.  He''s going to ask Patti specifics next week before he sends in the form.  That way, she can help make sure there are no issues.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-22 17:32:10', '2022-04-22 17:32:10'),
