  ('zcrm_1579374000091508003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050956676', 'Elizabeth Card', NULL, '4-22-22 Liz asked to cancel bc she''s pregnant and able to get more benefits on her husband''s company insurance. It''s too bad since Sedera''s maternity isn''t great but we couldn''t move her to Zion in time. They feel better protected with his Anthem plan for May 1st. She''s 5 months pregnant.  She will submit cancellation form and I let her know Patti will reimburse her for the May payment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-22 12:27:42', '2022-04-22 12:27:42'),
