  ('zcrm_1579374000091472021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, 'This member is among the members that are affected by the file issue.  They are in the Planstin system , however they have no plan associated with them.  This is being worked on.  Member had a dr''s appt for son and did not receive any cards.  Per Planstin I gave her Payer ID &amp; Claims address.  Planstin supplied Member #.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-22 11:24:50', '2022-04-22 11:24:50'),
