  ('zcrm_1579374000091419003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, 'Rebecca emailed in because she has not received her Zion Health OR Planstin cards yet. We had issues with the April 1 files transferring over to Zion properly and the IT department has been working on this issue. I have reached out to both Jordell with Planstin and John Kach to see where we are at in this process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-22 07:19:23', '2022-04-22 07:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091416006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050956676', 'Elizabeth Card', NULL, 'Received VM &amp; email from member wanting to cancel.  I messaged Wendy in Teams to advise.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-22 07:18:58', '2022-04-22 07:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091359026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '4-21-2022:  Michelle replied to my e-mail for yesterday w/a bunch of questions on multiple topics.  In the e-mail she says if it''s easier we can talk over the phone, which will be way easier.  I let her know our hours (mtn time), ph #, that anyone can help her, she can ask for me if she prefers, &amp; that I''m cc''ing Jennifer on the reply so she''ll know her questions if she speaks w/her.  I left it, to give us a ring at her convenience and we''ll walk her thru everything!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-21 18:07:52', '2022-04-21 18:07:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091359021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '4-21-2022:  Matt called asking if he has telehealth.  I tried to send him an invitation, but he prev setup an acct.  I walked him thru dwnloading the app, & resetting his pw.  Let him know the minor children can be attached to his & his wife''s accts, the children 18+ must have own accts, & all accts must have own unique e-mail add.  (Because he''s feeling crummy, we did not worry about getting the kids attached right now.)   Before we were off the phone, I made sure he was connected to the system.  He seemed set when we were done.   Let him know I''m here 20-minutes yet tonight & can search RX pricing in his area if he needs & would like once he talks to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-21 17:45:53', '2022-04-21 17:45:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091359013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919765', 'Benjamin Jackson', NULL, '4-21-2022:  Eliz called - totally overwhelmed & frustrated by this healthcare, saying it''s just too confusing & she never knows what to do.  She''s been paying a ton of $ for something she''s not using, plus paying out of pocket, etc.  By the end, she was super grateful and I think in a much better place:
     - Can always start w/the Concierge Line for help on how to utilize the plan.
     - Sent her the temp for updating their e-mail addresses.  She''ll submit to Patti and once that''s complete, she wants to get their username & pw for the MPB Memb Portal updated.  We tried & we cannot get it working.  To make sure there''s no confusion, she''ll do this afterward they update the e-mail records.  Explained what''s in her portal, it''s not what she was thinking anyway, but it''ll be good for her to get in later.
     - Went over how to access & what''s included w/the MAP program.  We walked thru that & how the mental health works (pattern, how to find a prov, etc.)
     - Helped her access the WHLC.  She''s out-of-town for a while & she tried both zip codes.  She''s wondering about dental, vision, and I showed her the disc on the site, but also sugg she call her advisor:  Andrea Hinman.  She may have good options.
     - She asked me to send her the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion - she may need it soon.  Plus, it gives her their ph # which she req''d.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-21 16:41:42', '2022-04-21 16:45:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091329029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152148', 'Justin Acker', NULL, 'Member''s 5/22 payment declined 1st notice (em &amp; VM) 4/21 member called in asking what card payment was on.  He will be updating pmt info &amp; submitting Pmt update 4/25-2nd notice sent 4/26- Member submitted update Pmt info I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-21 13:22:16', '2022-04-26 07:53:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091329024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064705055', 'Douglas Whitney', NULL, 'Member called me back and told me that he now has Medicade thru State of AZ.  I directed him to speak to Jane and fill out the Cancellation form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-21 13:19:55', '2022-04-21 13:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091359008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, '4-21-2022:  Took care of several items:
     - Caterina had to go to the ER last week.  She didn''t realize s he had telehealth thru her MPB Membership so she called another telehealth she found online & they told her she should go to the ER ( she was dbl''d over in pain for almost a week).  Her advisor told her to present as ''cash-pay'' & she was worried she''d totally screwed-up, because the hospital is now sending her hardship letters.
       We discussed why you present as ''cash-pay''.  My example was the ER is disc their bill 90%.  So, when she rec''s bills for the CT Scan, etc, she''ll call to ask about ''cash-pay'' discounts.
       I sent her the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion, but she''s going to call us at the end of May to start the ''need'' so she''ll have more info (she has nothing right now).  I warned her about the deadline, but she''ll be safe end of May.
     - Tried to get her setup on CirrusMD.  Say no matching rec.  Sent supp e-mail to them & she knows to watch her e-mail for their assistance.  Then she''ll be setup for next time.
     - She asked if I have a direct # because she''d really like to keep working w/me.  I let her know she can call the Concierge Line like she did today.  Anyone can help her.  However, if it''s more comfortable, she can just ask for me & I gave her my curr hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-21 13:06:37', '2022-04-21 13:06:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091329019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089148022', 'Jeff Weisberg', NULL, 'Member''s 5/22 payment declined 1st notice (em&amp; VM) sent 4/21 4/25- sent out 2nd email &amp; left VM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-21 12:33:59', '2022-04-25 13:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091359003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035027012', 'Paul Wetzelberger', NULL, '4-21-2022:  Paul''s wife Schaana called.  He''s aging into Medicare & she wondered what she needed to do so she doesn''t lose her program.  Orig, I told her to talk w/Wendy thinking they were both on the same plan.  As I went to look at the spelling of her name I realized they are already on separate plans!  I called her back almost immediately & LM:  "Noticed after we hung-up.  You two are actually on your own plans already, so there''s really nothing you''ll be required to do.  When Paul ages into his Medicare this plan will automatically cancel August 1st.  Your plan being sep will remain as is.  Plez let me know if you have questions."     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-21 12:11:51', '2022-04-21 12:11:51'),
