  ('zcrm_1579374000091328003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091124009', 'Sara Forrest', NULL, '4-21-22 Sara called bc her work won''t allow her to have an end date of 4-30-22. So, we will have a lapse or overlap in insurance. Cobra is $1800. But, she can keep Cobra as a backup plan in case something bad happens in the short time between her end date and May 1st start of her new Kaiser plan with C4. She will make sure she can backdate Cobra if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-21 11:27:41', '2022-04-21 11:27:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091246073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032273', 'Kari Reed', NULL, 'Member''s 5/22 Payment declined 1st notice (em&amp;VM) sent 4/21 Basically got the run around directing me to contact the NE Masonry office.  This is not a list bill so individual member is responsible.  4/21- spoke to D. Petrick in the office.  I will send Pmt Update email to her and she will update.  4/28- left VM for Debbie FU on where the update CC was. 5/2-Debbie submitted bank acct for pmt I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-21 11:20:45', '2022-05-02 12:05:28'),
