  ('zcrm_1579374000091246041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086961002', 'Brandon Blake', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he was told that we bill on the 22nd and he got paid today so he incurred an overdraft fee.  I found that the FTNI receipts still said that we billed 22nd of the month.  This has been changed.  I refunded the $25 overdraft fee out of FTNI.  I left VM for member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-21 09:18:54', '2022-04-21 09:20:15'),
