  ('zcrm_1579374000091279003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080015002', 'Betsy Muller', NULL, '4.21.2022 - Betsy called because she was wondering what the procedure was for reimbursement for her neck ultrasound she had done. I advised Betsy that if she felt that the bills that will accumulate from the ultrasound will go above her $1,000 IUA, that she should open a Need immediately with Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-21 08:49:38', '2022-04-21 08:49:38'),
