  ('zcrm_1579374000091193042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073437039', 'Karyn Griffin', NULL, '4-20-2022:  Kay needed RX pricing for:  Propranolol ER 60mg, #90 (= 90 DS).  She''s trying a diff Albertson''s Sav-On Pharmacy this time.  For 1st time price of $21.39, e-mailed her coupon from GoodRx.  Mentioned Costco might be cheaper when price inc next fill.  Both pharmacies charge ~0.01cent more per tab at 90ds.  She could go to #83 (83 ds) &amp; save ~$1 per fill?  Told her to let us know.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-20 18:11:54', '2022-04-20 18:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091193034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070112023', 'Johanna Parsano', NULL, '4-20-2022:  Johanna called.  Her advisor Leslie helped her find other ins so she wanted to cancel.  I let her know Leslie just needs to notify MPB that it''s ok to process the cancellation.  Then we will need her to sign a form because it requires a written request.  Also let her know that the draw for next month''s contribution was today, so they''ll have to work on a refund after they process this thru.  I did NOT send her the cancellation form link, but did trans her directly to Leslie.  Sent a Teams chat to Patti so she has a heads up.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-20 17:58:30', '2022-04-20 18:00:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091193029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '4-20-2022:  Joy sent over a letter she rec''d from Zion yesterday saying she doesn''t understand it.  I looked at her plan, the letter, and LM for her to call so we can discuss.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-20 17:55:46', '2022-04-20 17:55:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091193021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '4-20-2022:  Michelle was surfing in Hawaii & the board hit her in the face!  She ended-up in the ER.  The hosp just notified her that her ins doesn''t recognize her (she had give them her RCI card!). 
     - I went over RCI = ''prev'' care only.
     - Sent her the temp for starting a ''Need'' w/Sedera & went over all details.  She''ll contact the hosp, let them know she''s ''cash-pay'', ask for a disc, & pay her $500 IUA.  Then will get started w/Sedera.  Knows to be on lookout for ''Need Counselor''s'' contact info, etc.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-20 15:39:30', '2022-04-20 17:22:56'),
