  ('zcrm_1579374000091193016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066677171', 'Zachary Karle', NULL, '4-20-2022:   Went to the ER , they did blood work, then sent him to a derm, who also did blood work - now he''s wanting reimb.  Sent him the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion &amp; went over 1k IUA, and all detials.  He seems to have a good grasp on how to do this.  He''ll call if he needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-20 12:38:30', '2022-04-20 12:38:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091193011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115365', 'Elizabeth Bennett', NULL, '4-20-2022:  Eliz called, she''s been diagnosed w/skin cancer on her shoulder.  They''ve already done a biopsy, and are expecting to do "Mo''s surgery (?)".  She''s spent ~$1200 so far, we discussed her 5k IUA, she''s in her 3rd year of membership so sb able to take adv of the longevity clause & no limit if for some reason it comes up as pre-x.  Sent her the temp for sub a need to Sedera.  Walked thru their process, 2nd MD, etc.  She seems to understand & can get this taken care of.  She''ll call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-20 12:28:09', '2022-04-20 12:28:09'),
