  ('zcrm_1579374000091193003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', NULL, '4-20-2022:  Not sure Krista is really understanding how her ''prev'' care w/Planstin works.  She seemed clueless on understanding the in network portion and did not have the doc bill Planstin.  She had her mammogram (& an ultrasound following, but it was preventative) done & is now wondering who she submits the bills to.
