  ('zcrm_1579374000091179003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '04.18.22:  Enrolled Jessica and her sons in SECURE.  Told her to make sure she schedules a welcome call to learn about her new plan and to call me with any questions.  Jessica said she has a friend who is an insurance agent who may be interested in offering our plans.  I told her to ask him if he''d like to speak with me about becoming an MPB Advisor.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-04-20 06:46:38', '2022-04-20 06:51:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091162056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, '4-19-2022:  tt Frances after she rec''d the declination letter regarding her oral surgery since it was not related to an injury or accident.  It''s really just regular dental issues, not medical.  Everything''s much better now.  I let her know they''d been trying to find a way to use the ''Special Need'' funds or something & just hadn''t been able to come up w/the extra $ in the comm =hence the delay.  [I did NOT tell Frances they are going to discuss this when the Med Dir returns.  They don''t think the declination will chg, but I love they are still asking.  IF they do come back w/a yes, it will be a pleasant surprise!  per JoAnna @ Zion Needs Dept.]
     - Frances & I discussed her need for > dental coverage.  I sugg she call her advisor.  They may offer plans w/more cov & she could at least get pricing.  Or maybe an HMA, etc.  To call & ask, which she will do.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-19 17:59:26', '2022-04-19 17:59:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091162051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '4-19-2022:  Kyle e-mailed me.  Her grandson was born early w/serious complications &amp; she''s been in Hawaii helping out her daughter the last few months.  She was concerned her healthcare had lapsed, but I let her know everything was on auto ACH &amp; looks good.
     - Sent her the temp from me as an advisor to sched a ''Welcome Call'' now that she''s home.  She wants/needs to start the learning process again.  Now that she can think.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-19 17:29:00', '2022-04-19 17:29:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091162046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '4-19-2022:  Karen rec''d a new Planstin card &amp; wanted to make sure Solina rec''d hers.  However, I went over w/Karen that Planstin''s new cards seem to be inaccurate, so to keep her old card.  Not to use the OptumRX and to realize the PHCS Network is still important.  She was super nice about it.  [Also, see Solina Kennedy''s CRM notes for more info.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-19 16:52:30', '2022-04-19 16:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091162041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090406002', 'Solina Kennedy', NULL, '4-19-2022:  Solina''s mom Karen Lavine called looking for Solina''s Planstin card.  I explained there was an issue w/the new memberships not completing properly.  That Solina does have cov, however they are working to fix the glitch and send the cards.  In a Teams chat w/Melissa Lilley, she conf they have not fixed the issue yet &amp; cards will automatically go out once they have.  No need to keep track because all of the corr members accts will automatically rec cards once the corr is done.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-19 16:50:23', '2022-04-19 16:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091162036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080584001', 'Zubair Niazi', NULL, '4-19-2022:  Zubair Niazi is totally confused.  He has no understanding from what I can tell re: what he''s purchased.  He kept telling me how it should work & is struggling to understand how he can do this without an insurance card.  I went thru the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & showed him what a valuable resource it is (links, directions, etc.) to which he said, it''s too long and continued to tell me what we should have.
     - His wife is having an issue & needing help from a cardiologist, etc.  It sounds like they both have high BP,  but it''s been well maintained for years w/no hosp in the 12-mos prior to memb.  Went over starting a need, what to sub, ''cash-pay'' to the $2500 IUA, Zion will be able to help guide him once it''s started, etc.  At this point he doesn''t even know if they will go over the $2500 IUA.
     - I encouraged him to call us each step of the way, because he really does not understand the healthcare option he has signed up for.  "It''s just too difficult.  Everything should be with one company."  Really no comprehension of how/what is SECURE plan is.  I tried & was extremely patient...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-19 16:46:06', '2022-04-19 16:46:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091080114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029295143', 'Guy Travis', NULL, 'Guy was in contact with me about cancelling.  He got other coverage.  I will process cancellation and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-19 13:36:20', '2022-04-19 13:36:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091162031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918128', 'Kimber Eastman', NULL, '4-19-2022:  Kimber called.  Her husb is having issues on his ''good'' shoulder.  He saw the doc & they want him to see an orthopedic surgeon.   I looked up the name in HCBB, but he''s not listed.  He has they appt, so they are going to start there.
        Her husb has had trouble w/his other should before, but this one is new, so should not be pre-x.
     - Sent them the temp to start a ''need''., will monitor her e-mail to make sure they sign the forms & get Zion what they req for this process.  Went over Care Conn in case they do decide surgery is going to happen.  If >5k, she knows to call us so we can get Care Conn involved.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-19 13:28:01', '2022-04-19 13:28:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091080109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091159002', 'Daniel Cody', NULL, 'Member called in and did not see anywhere to put in banking information.  I will send him the Payment Update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-19 12:53:02', '2022-04-19 12:53:02'),
