  ('zcrm_1579374000091162013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089149002', 'Daniel Connelly', NULL, '4-19-2022:  Cynthia called.  They hadn''t rec''d their Planstin card yet, so I req''d a new one.  There''s been a glitch due to the new plan name/pricing, but I sent the request in case that''s been resolved.  I asked them to send the pdf to their e-mail:  Purecore777@gmail.com.
