  ('zcrm_1579374000091040071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '4-18-2022:  ** ALWAYS USE WALGREENS FOR RX PRICING **
They travel & using Walgreens nationwide, it keeps track of drug interactions, etc., no matter which Walgreens they go to.

     - Lisa called, her husb just came from the pharmacy & he''d used the OptumRX card we sent $9.99 at Walgreens.  (Planstin sent out new cards w/this on the back).  When he got home Lisa was able to tell him our coup works better.  Walgreens is willing to correct, so I sent Amox 500mg, #21 $6.49 from RxGO.  
     - She also wants to complete the ''Welcome Call'' & Jennifer told her just to reschedule the 2nd half.  Sent her the link to sched that & mentioned to sched w/Jennifer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 17:04:10', '2022-04-18 17:04:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091040066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714101', 'Ryan Keefe', NULL, '4-18-2022:  Ryan called - he got a job that is providing health ins.  I gave him his advisor''s name &amp; ph #:  Analisa Cleland, @ at the end of the call trans him directly to her line.  He will LM if he does not catch her.  NO cancellation form has been sent, but he''s aware he will have to confirm in writing after they talk.  Due to timeline, sent Patti Baron a Teams chat because the auto ACH is 2-days from now &amp; he''s hoping we won''t pull that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 16:21:13', '2022-04-18 16:21:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091040061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, '4-18-2022:  Nancy called.  She called CirrusMD & they told her to go to the Urg Care to make sure it wasn''t broken.  She went last Fri & although she told them she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt, they are billing her.  She thinks she''s already at ~$700.  She wants to know how to see a chiropractor next.
     - Went over must be part of a ''need'' & pre-approved.  She''s frustrated because she''s in pain & wants immed treatment.  She says she can''t even get a treatment plan until she see the chiro.  I reminded her that it may not matter since she hasn''t paid the initail 1k IUA anyway.  She''ll get treatment plan & start ''need'' w/Zion asap (sent her the temp).  She seemed very confused on how alternative treatments are handled by Zion.  Hopefully, our conversation helps.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 15:53:20', '2022-04-18 15:53:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091040053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887044', 'Jack Pardo', NULL, '4-18-2022:  Karen called.  She e-mailed Patti Baron about a pymt issue &amp; hadn''t heard back, so she called to see if she could tt Patti.  I let her know Patti''s back in FL &amp; prob already gone, but trans her direct to Patti''s VM so she can LM.  She seemed fine w/that and will call in a day or two if still trying to connect.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 15:28:43', '2022-04-18 15:28:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091040048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '4-18-2022:  Daniela''s work just sched a meeting during her new ''Welcome Call'' time slot.  I let Vanessa know via Teams chat that this Thurs, 1pm Eastern doesn''t work for Daniela &amp; sent Daniela the link to reschedule.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 15:24:32', '2022-04-18 15:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091040043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090406002', 'Solina Kennedy', NULL, '4-18-2022:  A gal called in for Solina Kennedy to ck on the status of a ''need''.  Explained that would go thru Zion the MCS comp, made sure she had their ph # for later use, then trans her directely.  She was very grateful.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 15:17:14', '2022-04-18 15:17:14'),
