  ('zcrm_1579374000091040035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012010011', 'Elizabeth Wood', NULL, '4-18-2022:  Eliz called.  She & her husb will be trav separately again.  She has a QRCode card, but they don''t have one for her husb.  She would like to get one.  Curr they are changing the cards, so I am cking w/Kelly F to see if we can get this for her.     - CA
----------------------------------     
     - Called Eliz back.  Let her know:  Req''d 2 new QRCode cards from Dayra.  Expect 7-14 bus days for deliery.
     - We went over what the various cards are because she had no idea (thought the QRCode is what they present when they are at the ER, as their ins).
          ~ QRCodes:  explained usage & what they are for
          ~ RCI Card (which she does have):  ''Preventative'' care
          ~ Talked about ''cash-pay'' pt for larger items to $1500 IUA.  Sedera = Healthshare comp & how that works.  Generally tell Urg Care, ER, etc., ''cash-pay'', pay up to $1500 IUA & ask them to bill you balance.  She has Sedera''s ph # in case it''s an issue.
     - Her husb is having shoulder surgery 5/3/22.  She has that very under control.  Has sub ''need'' to Sedera, has their ''need'' coordinator, had the 2nd MD appt, & has shopped the surgery w/huge discounts for ''cash-pay''!  She''ll let us know if they need anything here, but she seems to have this well covered.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 13:45:21', '2022-04-18 15:51:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091040030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, '4-18-2022:  JoAnna said she could not get an answer on the concierge #, so she called Mazzitti & Sullivan, then Jessica called from there & got me no issue.  She gave me the information re: JoAnna calling for husband.  His reg doc sugg he see a parasite specialist, but has no idea who they should see.  It looks like that specialty is a ''parasitologist''.  Nothing comes up in that specialty in their AZ zip 85213 via HCBB.  I went to a google search & the one thing that comes up is not a doctor as sugg, but when Jose Ernesto calls, it''s just a website where you can order things.  They are willing to travel, but we cannot even find someone for them to go to.
     - We decided he will try calling CirrusMD to see if they have any sugg.  He''s been tested for a ton of stuff (MS, etc) & right now the parasitic aspect seems to be the next thing to ck.  He thinks he''s used his CirrusMD before, but neither of us could get in using any combination of his first & last names.  I sent a support e-mail to CirrusMD & Jose Ernesto knows to closely monitor his jera@jeragallery.com e-mail for their resp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 13:43:38', '2022-04-18 13:43:38'),
