  ('zcrm_1579374000091040025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084818009', 'Troy Conrad', NULL, '4-18-2022:  Troy has something going on.  He thinks it''s like a sinus infection, his family''s afraid it''s a stroke.  He''s going to start w/CirrusMD because they can help him decide if it''s an emerg.   I helped him get setup on CirrusMD &amp; he''s going to contact them right now.  He will call for RX pricing if needed.  He knows he''s a ''cash-pay'' patient to the 1k IUA.  Will call for help if &gt; IUA and needs to sub to Zion.  Went over deadlines for starting a ''need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 12:59:08', '2022-04-18 12:59:08'),
