  ('zcrm_1579374000091040015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082589012', 'Bryan Moore', NULL, '4-18-2022:  Stephanie called.  
     - They moved to UT & she''s trying to get new docs setup.  Today''s focus = her son.  I e-mailed her a list of 105 PHCS Fam Prac docs (when she ran the search, it came up w/a diff #, so I wanted to make sure she had a complete, accurately run search).   That way, they can find a PHCS doc so when they are ready for ''prev'' care they are in network.
     - She wanted to have a mole on her son''s back looked at by a derm.  Their old PCP told her to keep an eye on it & it''s chg''d.  We discussed, ''cash-pay'' to their 1k IUA unless it becomes an elig ''need''.  Went over how that works w/her.  She has a derm she''s used.  We looked her up & she''s high quality, her appt''s show fair priced, but her facility use is ''high priced''.  She thinks prob < 1k IUA & ''cash-pay'' anyway.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-18 12:09:20', '2022-04-18 12:09:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091040010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086950002', 'Summer Deaton', NULL, 'Summer called in for lists of mammography centers and breast surgeons in her area. She had previously spoken with Cari, who provided her with information on mammography centers in her area, but she seemed as though she wanted another search done. In my efforts to do another search, it appears that I have received the same results as Cari, with 2 exceptions. I have asked Summer to provide what type of imaging they are needing to do so that I may find the fairest price in her area for her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-18 12:05:23', '2022-04-18 12:05:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091052003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091124009', 'Sara Forrest', NULL, '4-18-22 Sara and I got through the application process to a determination. Jantinee (Jani) doesn''t have any income at the moment and may not for 2022. Sara has a 1 time inheritance of about $9K but there''s no place to include gifts/inheritances and it''s only 1 time, so we left the estimated income alone at around $39K including all other income estimates. She''s hoping to have a new job by end of the summer with benefits, if lucky. But, they will be traveling to Thailand and have other plans in the meantime. She''s ok with having Finn on CHP+ if he''s approved. She''s also fine if not and we need to add him to her chosen plan with a start date of May 1st. She will talk with her supervisor to discuss her end date of April 30th and become a PRN after that to help with the transition for the new employee. She works at Centennial Peaks Psychiatric Facility which is right next to Avista Hospital in Louisville. Someone came into Centennial Peaks and stole badge of current employee and then posed as an employee and then was wielding a gun around threatening everyone recently. This is the impetus for her to choose to stop working there soon. UGH!  We looked at Bright Health but network doesn''t include BCH. So, moved onto Oscar which is showing BCH. She looking at the Oscar Silver Simple Specialist Saver for $79.92 or Silver Simple HSA Choice if she funds and HSA. Finally they''ve been with Kaiser for the past 6 years and are comfortable with Kaiser and their drs. But, she sees the value is not nearly as good. So, she will talk it over with Jani and decide. She will either enroll on her own or call me for help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-18 11:56:13', '2022-04-18 11:56:13'),
