  ('zcrm_1579374000091006008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090939002', 'Tamara Haas', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-18 07:13:56', '2022-04-18 07:13:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000091006003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090937012', 'Samantha Danz', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-18 07:10:35', '2022-04-18 07:10:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088568002', 'Thomas Parsons', NULL, '4-15-2022:  Tom called - he''s trying to get his daughter bc''s approved thru Planstin &amp; they are telling him his start &amp; end date are 4/1/2022.  tt John Kach &amp; it''s because he chg''d plans, so John sub req to fix the issue, but we hadn''t heard back by end of day (=Fri).  I LM for Tom that they are working to corr the issue, but he will have cov.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-15 17:45:12', '2022-04-15 17:45:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086950002', 'Summer Deaton', NULL, '4-15-2022:  Summer called, they found a lump in her breast & want her to get a diagnostic mamm.  We looked on HCBB for local imaging centers & nothing but Lakewood comes up.  Went online & gave her three local Lgmt centers w/high ratings, did sugg she look at them though because I cannot speak to them specifically.  She''s going to call & price (& get a feel for the offices) once she know the specific item the doc wants (2D, 3D, digital, unilateral/bilateral, etc.).  
     - Went over ''cash-pay'' on this issue to 1k IUA, starting a ''need'' including the off visit she just had w/MD, pymts, etc.  She thinks she saw how to submit a ''need'' when she was on Zion''s site & doesn''t need me to send the directions.  She''ll call later if that chgs.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-15 17:05:19', '2022-04-15 17:05:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, '4-15-2022:  Frances called completely frustrated.  She''s started 2 ''needs'' w/Zion & they keep pushing her off & giving her excuses as to why they still don''t know if the items are shareable or not.  
     - I called Zion & tt Gina in the ''Need''s dept.  She actually pulled the records while I was on the ph & got an adjudicator wking on this.  They have combined the 2 sep needs into 1 (so only 1 IUA if approved! ).  She wants me to call Monday to see what has been decided after 2pm Mtn.   
     - Let Frances know.  She was curious why taking so long, let her know I didn''t have that ans.  We are planning on my calling her by 4:30pm Mtn time Mon, or she will try me too  (just in case).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-15 16:48:25', '2022-04-15 16:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090927034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088258002', 'Meghan Cleary', NULL, 'Left member a vm and sent her another welcome call scheduler so she can reschedule another welcome call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-15 14:37:54', '2022-04-15 14:37:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090927029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089148022', 'Jeff Weisberg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Jeff was wondering about a plan with preventative services including a wellness/physical visit. I will have Mike Montes reach out to him, but it appears he may have already changed his plan once. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-15 14:16:50', '2022-04-15 14:16:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090934011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, '4-15-22 Kathleen is a bit edgy and resolved the billing problem directly with Planstin or Zion. She was very short with me. I offered to help for anything else necessary and she thanked me. All set at the moment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-15 13:50:51', '2022-04-15 13:50:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090917028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090935002', 'Tracy McKinney', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-15 13:45:24', '2022-04-15 13:45:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090917023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090933002', 'Mary Sheehan', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-15 13:42:31', '2022-04-15 13:42:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090934003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125227018', 'Jennifer Abbott', NULL, '4-15-22 Jennifer wants ICHRA for sure even with one client. Benefit Bay doesn''t help clients with only  employee. They need 2 at least. So, we need to keep her plan with the current ICHRA Systems that it looks like she''s using. She was going through Kelmeg and Assoc and was not pleased with them. She forwarded me the emails to show which ICHRA company she''s working with. Also getting billed by Sean Burke. She''s still getting billed for her former employee Tatiana who left job March 9th. She''s eager to get this done ASAP.  She wants to give the employee choices for their insurance options. Salary will be $123K for new employee, too much for subsidy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-15 13:23:01', '2022-04-15 13:23:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090879041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084457009', 'Eugena Bring', NULL, 'Old QR Codes H008S - H008R', 'Scott Harter', 'Scott Harter', '2022-04-15 13:16:35', '2022-04-15 13:16:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090879036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, 'Old QR code H02E4', 'Scott Harter', 'Scott Harter', '2022-04-15 13:07:53', '2022-04-15 13:07:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '4-15-2022:  Christina is traveling & seeing an accupuncturist for her finger & wondered how she might get that pd for.  We went over all alt healthcare required prior approval & would be part of a bigger ''need''.  She hasn''t / isn''t ready to start a ''need'' for her finger (no trad dr appts, etc as I understand it yet).  It sounds like she''s self treating the issue to date.  She seemed to understand. 
     - Also mentioned she had trouble last yr w/other hand (realized it was before her eff date.  Discussed waiting period & 2nd yr would have up to 25k potential sharing for that pre-x item.  Again she seemed to understand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-15 13:00:01', '2022-04-15 13:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078228183', 'Whitney Kline', NULL, '4-15-2022:  Whitney called wondering if maternity is part of the Direct plan = Yes.  Has prosp memb, disc 60-day from eff date waiting period on maternity cov.  Start ''need'' as soon as find out pregnant (don''t wait, they have deadline on maternity).  Colonoscopies, mamm, &amp; for wellchild immun (they already have a 2-yr old) = 6 mos waiting period.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-15 12:50:44', '2022-04-15 12:50:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090917018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel after speaking with advisor.  I verified and sent out cancellation link email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-15 11:26:43', '2022-04-15 11:26:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, '4-15-2022:  Someone called from this # while I was on the ph w/another member (Jennifer''s lunch hour).  Called &amp; LM 7 min after they called that I am here &amp; would love to be of assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-15 11:26:34', '2022-04-15 11:26:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090928048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084457009', 'Eugena Bring', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Dayra to resend out QR Life code cards for member and husband. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-15 11:24:09', '2022-04-15 11:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090927024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, 'Nancy called regarding her ankle issue she has been experiencing recently. She followed her Welcome Call instructions and called the concierge team first where we decided that she was going to start with CirrusMD first and then go to Urgent Care if the CirrusMD doc suggested or could not help her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-15 10:47:20', '2022-04-15 10:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090928043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003268005', 'Tijana Coso', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-15 10:17:18', '2022-04-15 10:17:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090927016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson just called and she was being very ignorant and swearing towards me. She had some EOB''s that she received from Planstin and stated that she was "very pissed off and that it was bullshit". I apologized for her frustrations and was trying to look into what happened when she continued to make snide remarks and swear at me. I explained to her that I was trying to help her and that her snide comments she was making while I was trying to help her were making things more difficult. She told me as a concierge it is my job to deal with her comments. I explained to her that as the concierge, I am to help her but I do not have to take verbal abuse from her. I was going to transfer her to Wendy directly because I felt the need to escalate it to her. Kathleen hung up on me before I could transfer her. ~JTS

**Update** I have sent Kathleen an email (tagged Wendy) to apologize that we could not resolve her issue on our call this morning and that I have asked Wendy to reach out to her directly to assist her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-15 09:51:20', '2022-04-15 10:41:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090928038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086854001', 'Ronald Olibas', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-15 09:48:33', '2022-04-15 09:48:33'),
