  ('zcrm_1579374000090927011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937066', 'Margaret Tiscornia', NULL, 'Margaret called because she received bills from Planstin stating that her son''s wellness visits were rejected for payment. I transferred Margaret to Planstin so she could speak with them about any billing issues. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-15 09:10:32', '2022-04-15 09:10:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090928013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086963002', 'Timothy Viner', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-15 09:09:09', '2022-04-15 09:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090928008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088688002', 'Perry Thomas', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-15 08:35:01', '2022-04-15 08:35:01');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000090928003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088406002', 'John Blackburn', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-15 08:14:50', '2022-04-15 08:14:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090917003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086456001', 'Nancy Kubas', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to update address.  I will notify Planstin &amp; update in CRM &amp; A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-15 07:07:04', '2022-04-15 07:07:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090879031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082141001', 'Richard Caravetta', NULL, '4-14-2022:  Richard just got a corp job that''s providing healthcare, so he wants to cancel.  He was open to my trans him directly to his advisor Michael Montes.  He will LM if he doesn''t catch him.  I did NOT send cancellation form yet.  Also, let Patti know via Teams chat it''s in process so she''s kind of on the lookout.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-14 17:53:22', '2022-04-14 17:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125227018', 'Jennifer Abbott', NULL, '4-14-22 I spoke with Barbara Ciudad with Benefit Bay re ICHRA for 1 or 2 person group. They don''t bother with 1 person groups bc of the fees and the time involved. There''s a $200 annual Admin fee, $15 per member, per month fee and I could add a fee if I chose, which I won''t.  For one person that''s an extra $200/$12 = $16.67 + $15 = $31.67 per month. If her employees qualify for a subsidy then they can''t also get a payment from employer for health ins. It''s one or the other. Therefore, ICHRA would be of no value in that case. Employer will pay full amount and then remove the employee cost from the employee''s paycheck.  We could possibly look at this for Sept. if they both earn enough.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-14 16:45:33', '2022-04-14 16:45:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090879026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084632010', 'William Spokes', NULL, '4-14-2022:  William''s son is possibly having an allergic reaction in his eyes & they wanted to know best process.  He was worried they didn''t have a new provider setup for this new healthcare yet.  Let him know the following:
     - Since free, maybe start w/CirrusMD?  Won''t hurt anything.
     - Unless ''prev'' care, network not required, seeing curr PCP fine.  Present as ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA, ask for a discount, and pay.  If looks like may be ongoing, disc deadline to sub a need.  He''ll call for instructions if this is anything more than just a one-time appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-14 16:19:13', '2022-04-14 16:19:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090911013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '04.14.22:  Jessica called.  I explained the SECURE plan to her.  She likes it and wants to sign up for it.  We scheduled enrollment on Monday, 4/18/22 at  12:30 p.m..  I told her to call me then.
Texted her my landing page so she could read about SECURE and told her to watch the video.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-04-14 15:46:43', '2022-04-14 15:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090911008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, 'Bren called asking if a bone density test is included with her preventative services. I read her the following from the healthcare.gov website: Bone density screening for all women over age 65 or women age 64 and younger that have gone through menopause. I also advised Bren to speak with Planstin regarding being under 65 and having a bone density test just to verify that if she has gone through menopause that the bone density test is included in her preventative services. I transferred Bren to Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-14 14:05:25', '2022-04-14 14:05:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090879018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, '4-14-2022:  Janalee called.  Their daughter has a Well-woman visit in 15-minutes & she wanted to know what to do.  They do not see a Planstin pdf and have not yet rec''d the physical cards yet.  Gave her Planstin''s ph # for doc to call to verify cov & get info to bill appt.  We tried looking-up the doc in the PHCS MultiPlan search & after 6 times, I gave her the # for PHCS to call to see if doc is in network.  We discussed if not in network not cov & will be out of pkt.  If labs, stay in network.  Req''d new pdf copies of Planstin card via Teams chat to both Mark: carmanmr@gmail.com & Janalee: carmanjb@gmail.com.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-14 13:54:48', '2022-04-14 13:54:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090882028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081875009', 'Mary Stubblefield', 'New Plan eff 5/1/22', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-14 13:52:28', '2022-04-14 13:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090882023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081875009', 'Mary Stubblefield', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change to the Secure plan.  I will make the change and send out template w/application for signature.  Also will notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-14 13:51:51', '2022-04-14 13:51:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090911003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356826', 'Jennifer Woomer', NULL, 'Jennifer called because she is going to get her screening colonoscopy and wanted to verify that the doctor/practice was in the PHCS network. Both are (Dr. Ari Wiesen at the Cleveland Gastroenterology Clinic), but I advised her to clarify that with the office when she calls to schedule her procedure. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-14 13:43:25', '2022-04-14 13:43:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090879013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, '4-14-2022:  Daniela called &amp; realized she cannot make her ''Welcome Call'' appt tomorrow.  Let Jennifer know via Teams chat &amp; phone.  Also, sent the link to reschedule her ''Welcome Call''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-14 13:19:44', '2022-04-14 13:19:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090879008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, '4-14-2022: Elgin needs to see a specialist re: his knee issue.  He decided he''s going to start a ''need'' with Sedera with the info he already has (sent him the temp).  Knows he has a $2500 IUA and will get everything started.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-14 13:15:11', '2022-04-14 13:15:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090904003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090811002', 'Kristopher Stewart', NULL, 'Sent a Welcome Email personally from me that I typed up on the spot. Just welcoming him and his family to our family here at MPB.Health. I let him know I am here for him anytime throughout the whole time they are members here and about their Member Concierge. That yes he can call me anytime for anything but the member concierge is there for him for that reason and they provide many different services as well. I lastly told him to make sure to schedule his Welcome Call on or around his start date not before, so he has all the material that is being sent to him in the next few weeks so to look out for that as well. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-04-14 13:11:54', '2022-04-14 13:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086950002', 'Summer Deaton', NULL, '4-14-22 I''ve responded to Summer about adding her kids. We will have a follow up call next week to determine if it makes sense.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-14 12:44:01', '2022-04-14 12:44:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102938002', 'James Cotter', NULL, '4-14-22 Jim is 42 and Dr. Domenic Monaco is in West Nyack, NY. He''s not showing in the PHCS network  but Crystal Run Healthcare shows they accept PHCS and Multiplan! I told him to call them and verify. He covered by his wife''s health insurance for 6 more months. Therefore, he''s looking at this for around Oct. 2022. He was surprised by the low cost of SECURE $1000/$300 and if dr. is not in network for wellness he''s fine with paying cash for his annual visit. Doesn''t need colonoscopy any time soon. He''s an ASHI member, so I let him know he gets a $100 fee waived and I will walk him through app to make sure he gets discount! He will run it all by his wife and reach back out when the time comes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-14 12:21:55', '2022-04-14 12:21:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090882018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090892002', 'Amy Morin', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-14 12:20:23', '2022-04-14 12:20:23'),
