  ('zcrm_1579374000090879003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067740001', 'Jessica Ramey', NULL, '4-14-2022:  Transvaginal diagnostic ultrasound May 17, 2022 due to intermittent bleeding.  She will present as ''cash-pay'' &amp; ask for disc.  Curr expects $226.  Knows she has a 1k IUA.  She''ll decide if this will continue &amp; may start a ''need'' w/Zion after 5/17/22.  She''ll call us for the next step if so.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-14 11:38:04', '2022-04-14 11:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090877003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, '4-14-22 Call 888-890-1944 or go to https://directvisioninsurance.com

