  ('zcrm_1579374000090765023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081704002', 'Carmen Davis', NULL, '4-13-2022:  Carmen had her annual physical today &amp; the  $300 for mammogram &amp; $150 for a catscan in about 2 mos.  We went over how to start a ''need'' w/Zion &amp; I sent her the temp.  Also disc today''s ''prev'' care appt could kickback depending on how it''s coded and she could add that to the 1k IUA.  She may call as she gets closer for a review.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-13 18:10:25', '2022-04-13 18:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090792028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091124009', 'Sara Forrest', NULL, '4-13-22 Sara is leaving her job at Centaurus Peaks in 2 weeks. Sounds like she doesn''t want Medicaid. Planning to be out of work for 2 months and then get another job. Income is about $39K for 2022. Has family but husband on his own plan through work, I think.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-13 17:15:00', '2022-04-13 17:15:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090792018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125227018', 'Jennifer Abbott', NULL, '4-13-22 Jennifer called me since I''m on the recommended agent Peak Health Alliance list. She wants to switch her ICHRA away from her current agency who was acting shady and wouldn''t communicate well with her and she believes one of the main people has a mental health issue. She no longer wants them to have access to her personal information.  She already has her own insurance through her husband''s employer. But, she has one new employee as of May 1st that she wants to offer a plan to and plans to hire another employee in Sept of 2022. I educated her about SECURE which she likes the sounds of and also wants to offer regular insurance in case of a pre-x.   Wants me to figure out how to move from former agent to me. Company is Abbott Therapeutic Solutions Acct ID is 80452 with ICQuotes.com. She wants to pay 75% of employee cost up to cap of $300 or could pay 100% if chooses SECURE for the 18-49 year old employees. She believes everyone is healthy and non-tobacco.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-13 16:37:13', '2022-04-13 16:37:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090792013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '4-13-22 Julie is switching to become a member with Dr. Tusek soon, perhaps for May 1st or any day now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-13 16:29:53', '2022-04-13 16:29:53'),
