  ('zcrm_1579374000090792008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102938002', 'James Cotter', NULL, '4-13-22 "I had received your contact information from my ASHI (American Society of Home Inspectors) website.  My wife''s employer will not cover me under her plan because I''m self-employed.  I had gone on your MPB website and it appears that the Secure group may be right for me, but not really sure.  I''m looking for some basic coverage only for myself since my wife is covering the kids under her.  Just looking to cover basic visits and possible emergencies.  I do not have any pre-existing conditions and do not use tobacco products.  Also, can you direct me to a link to see the doctor network?  

