  ('zcrm_1579374000090719029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084951011', 'Paul Notartomaso', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! I advised Meg that if she needs another Welcome Call to go through more information with her (she wants to make sure she knows the plan inside and out) to let us know and we will be happy to send her another scheduling link. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-13 14:34:26', '2022-04-13 14:34:26'),
