  ('zcrm_1579374000090719013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, 'Richard called because his wife was having some issues, she was seen by a CirrusMD doc 2 times and was advised to go see her OBGYN. Richard was wondering how things will be paid if this is above the IUA amount. I explained opening a need and then transferred him to Zion so that he could give them a heads up. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-13 09:12:32', '2022-04-13 09:12:32'),
