  ('zcrm_1579374000090742013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'I received VM from this member asking for a letter stating that his dependent was removed from the membership due to the fact that he turned 26.  I sent via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-13 08:49:24', '2022-04-13 08:49:24'),
