  ('zcrm_1579374000090732003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090419002', 'David Fuchs', NULL, 'I emailed advisor the member enrollment fee &amp; refund were declined by his bank.  Most Likely because of a typo in the account #.  I sent link to Payment Update and told advisor that I would then charge the $25 enrollment fee.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-13 07:47:39', '2022-04-13 07:47:39'),
