  ('zcrm_1579374000090690026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611025', 'Michael deAnda', NULL, '4-12-2022:  Michael called very confused by his plan (he''s had his Welcome Call, but still struggling).  He needed to understand some basics.  I got interupted right after his call &amp; cannot remember exactly what we discussed.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-12 17:54:42', '2022-04-12 17:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090690021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689074', 'Frank Becvar', NULL, '4-12-2022:  Jennifer texted wondering if Sterling''s req''d MMR titer blood test to attend college (CSU) this fall would be a cover ''prev'' test.  I called &amp; tt Carmen at Planstin (~3:08pm), she ck''d &amp; came back to let me know -- they have no idea.  Her suggestion, have them use an in network lab &amp; minimally it will come back at the discounted price.  I found a list of in network labs in the area &amp; will give it to Jennifer tonight  w/bal of instructions too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-12 17:53:18', '2022-04-12 17:53:18'),
