  ('zcrm_1579374000090690011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084632002', 'Jon Deem', NULL, '4-12-2022:  Sharon called.  Jon had a scare w/his heart today, so they called &amp; ambulance,  They EMT sugg they see a doctor at an Urg Care Cntr today (he did not go w/the ambulance).
     - Went over being a ''cash-pay'' pt to 5k IUA.  IF they have issues w/''cash-pay'' then Zion''s ph # is in the temp I sent for sub a ''need'' to Zion.  She may call back once they are past the scare for more directions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-12 12:00:12', '2022-04-12 12:00:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090694008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '4-12-22 Shoshana and Sam are still on Medicaid and at the threshold of not qualifying soon with their self-employment income. But, they want to check out dental insurance and I reviewed the Spirit Dental choices which are still expensive for very little. They could spend $138 for Spirit for Choice plan and have up to $1250 cap vs HMA pay $140 a month and have access to up to $10K in month 35! They use Dr. Ashley Niles at Niles Family Dentistry.  They could pay $125 per year at dentist''s office for 15% discount on all services for the year.  She will discuss with Sam and likes the idea of building up the account for future when they move off of Medicaid to help pay for the IUA. I described $40 and $140 levels.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-12 11:40:00', '2022-04-12 11:40:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090662023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089798002', 'Kyle Hartung', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule online the welcome call after start date of May 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-12 10:50:55', '2022-04-12 10:50:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090690003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '4-12-2022:  Asiye called (it sounded like she''s in the drive thru at her pharmacy).  She wondered what the best price is for her medication, but she didn''t have the strength or qty.  So she said she''ll go park, go in, and call me back.     - CA

I priced Hydroxyzine HCL 25mg, #60 on 7 sites.  She''s at Walmart & they are not the cheapest.  The normal price looks like: $8.18, but I found a WellRX coupon for $7.41.  I let her know if she gets refills, it is cheaper (on GoodRX) at Giant Eagle Pharmacy: $4.42, Meijer: $6.35, or RiteAid: $6.56 in case one of those is close to her as well.  - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-12 10:17:20', '2022-04-12 10:38:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090639008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-12 10:07:25', '2022-04-12 10:07:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090662018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088571001', 'Roxanna Chavez', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-12 09:35:00', '2022-04-12 09:35:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090662013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088241002', 'Matthew Osborn', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-12 09:24:48', '2022-04-12 09:24:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090662008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087127002', 'Nazra Sultana', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-12 09:11:25', '2022-04-12 09:11:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090652008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, 'Rebecca called back to have me do PHCS network searches for her while she was on the phone with me. We did find one of her preferred providers in the PHCS network, but we did not have any luck with the others. I will be sending Rebecca a list of PHCS in-network OBGYN''s and she will be calling me back with the name of the PA that she sees so that we can determine if they are in-network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-12 08:49:17', '2022-04-12 08:49:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090662003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088964009', 'John Hanna', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-12 08:45:13', '2022-04-12 08:45:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090652003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, 'Rebecca called because she wanted to know if she could use her out of network doctors for her preventative services. I let Rebecca know that if she went that route, that she would be responsible for all of the bills from those appointments because she would be using out of network providers. Rebecca was not happy about that and states that she was never told she had to use PPO (PHCS) in-network providers for her preventative services. I advised Rebecca that she should speak with her advisor, Mike Montes, if she feels that this was never stated to her during her enrollment. She also let me know that when she called Zion because she hadn''t received her welcome information, they informed her that she was not in their system. I explained to Rebecca that we have been working on our file transmissions and that I would reach out to our IT department to resolve this issue. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-12 08:30:42', '2022-04-12 08:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090643003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090811002', 'Kristopher Stewart', NULL, 'Talking with Kris on the phone for about 30 mins going over the Care+ & Secure plans for him. He was more interested in the Care+ for the $1000 IUA for $555/mo. Kris stated that he has had a health sharing organization in the past called Medishare? But that is an important thing because he is used to how this type of program works. What drew him to us was the fact that we are not faith based and all the services that are included in the plans. Kris said he has never seen this before where all of the services are included in the monthly premium and not all separate charges. Loves that aspect. He has a wife and 5 children, everyone is very healthy, him and his wife are both 45 years old and his children range from 11-21 years old. I sent him an email after our call with a few links to check some things out about our services and just a brief overview of the Care+ & Secure plans. He will speak with his wife and get back to me. Seemed about 85% sure with enrolling. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-04-12 08:09:14', '2022-04-12 08:09:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090639003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form on 4/11/22 to remove both dependents Carlo &amp; Elaina from membership eff 4/1.  I will address both:
1. Carlo removed eff 4/1/22 due to turning 26 (email sent to member 2/28/22)
2. Elaina will be removed eff 5/1/22 since request was submitted 4/11 (past deadline of 20th of month prior) as this will effect price of the plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-12 08:06:14', '2022-04-12 08:06:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090608033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, 'Per Wendy''s note she has spoken to member ok to cancel.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-12 07:43:59', '2022-04-12 07:43:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090627038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692197', 'Scott Ritterbuck', NULL, '4-11-2022:  Scott called looking for info on potential Dental Plan savings (his son is having his wisdom teeth out tomorrow).  He doesn''t have his ''Welcome Call'' until Thursday, but it''s sched''d.  I helped him learn how to get into WHLC &amp; he sees the DentalPlans.com.  He may also ck w/his advisor Diane Border (I made sure he has her ph #), although he''s in CA, so I let him know I did not know if she would have dental plans avail.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-11 17:15:20', '2022-04-11 17:39:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090627033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080702012', 'Jonathan Bill', NULL, '4-11-202:  Jonathan called, his wife isn''t feeling well &amp; they were trying to get into the telehealth.  Turns out he was trying to access an old company from his last insurance.  Before we got off the phone, he was able to get into CirrusMD.  He will call w/in the next hour if he needs help (before the end of my shift).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-11 17:00:54', '2022-04-11 17:00:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090627028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', NULL, '4-11-2022:  Hermilo called asking if the newborn hearing screening is covered.  I let him know his ''prev'' care thru Planstin could let him know if it''s part of the Well Baby care coverage &amp; trans him to Planstin directly.  I also told him that should there be an issue, potentially, it would be a healthshare item w/a $2500 IUA.  However, I wasn''t 100% sure (see their eff date), Zion would have to let them know if they get to that point.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-11 15:17:05', '2022-04-11 15:17:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090608028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, 'Script quote complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-11 14:55:02', '2022-04-11 14:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090627023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '4-11-2022:  Maria texted asking if I can provide how much was paid on her knee issue.  I let her know we can''t see med bills, shared amts, etc., but if it was after 11/1/2020, it would have been thru Zion.  I gave her their dir # &amp; let her know their memb srvcs sb able to help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-11 14:52:59', '2022-04-11 14:52:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090632003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, '4-11-22 Called to cancel bc they got a plan through ACA. She wouldn''t reveal what the life change event was. She did let me know after prodding that they did use their membership for colonoscopies. Her''s might have been done before they were members with MPB but Alan''s was more recent and she believes within the past 6 months. His was diagnostic and expensive. They paid outright. I coached her to call Concierge and submit immediately a Need. I also let her know if the 6 month deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-11 14:25:02', '2022-04-11 14:25:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090608023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, 'Darrin called in with many questions. He wanted to know how Zion determines what is preexisting and what isn''t if he went to a provider to be seen for all of his new and preexisting conditions. I explained to Darrin that he has allowed Zion Health to view his records. Darrin then asked how would Zion know what to pay and what not to pay, how did they decipher what was pre-ex and what wasn''t. I then directed Darrin to Zion with those questions as I feel they would be best answered by Zion directly. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-11 14:16:26', '2022-04-11 14:16:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090627018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, '4-11-2022:  Kathleen called.  She wants to cancel because they found other ins.  She hadn''t tt her advisor Wendy Scipione yet, so I made sure she has Wendy''s ph#, trans her directly to Wendy, &amp; let her know Wendy can get her cancellation going for her.  I have NOT sent her the cancellation form link yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-11 14:15:27', '2022-04-11 14:15:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090608018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete but Lisa will be scheduling another call with me so that we can make sure she is secure in using her plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-11 14:04:59', '2022-04-11 14:04:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090595023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090397002', 'Marianna Midkiff', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to remove spouse from membership prior to enrollment.  I will notify Planstin and change billing amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-11 13:55:30', '2022-04-11 13:55:30'),
