  ('zcrm_1579374000090595018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088509002', 'Jason Frederick', NULL, 'Checked in with Leo on this member''s cancellation.  He told me that it was not saveable.   Member should not be cancelling after 11 days on membership.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-11 13:42:40', '2022-04-11 13:42:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090595013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086538002', 'Grace Hansen', NULL, 'Email below was forwarded to me by advisor Darius.  After speaking with Vanessa, member hadn''t registered w/Cirrus MD so maybe she misunderstood the directions.  I contacted Darius and explained to him that I thought she had enrolled in Zion direct.  She will have to contact them directly and cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-11 13:27:49', '2022-04-11 13:27:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090595008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086538002', 'Grace Hansen', NULL, '---------- Forwarded message ---------
From: Grace Abanto <grabanto@yahoo.com>
