Thanks,
Grace Hansen', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-11 13:20:28', '2022-04-11 13:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090631013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071157012', 'Kia Tolan', NULL, '4-11-22 Kia joined the HMA on Aug. 31st, 2021. She had a few questions about how and when to use it which I answered and also asked about dental. I told her there''s really nothing new but to ask her dentist if they have any programs to help or suggested plans for individuals. She will wait a bit to tap into her HMA since hasn''t reached 1 year yet. She chose the $5000 level at $84 a month. She''s showing up successfully in my HMA account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-11 12:53:54', '2022-04-11 12:53:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090627013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084951011', 'Paul Notartomaso', NULL, '4-11-2022:  Meghan called - we worked on several items:
     - I worked w/her & she found the link & she resched her ''Welcome Call'' w/Jennifer while we were on the phone.
     - She wanted to sched an appt w/their telehealth so her child could get a school phys for an event.  I told her that might require her ''prev'' care instead = Planstin.  She''s going to go over ''prev'' care & Planstin when she has her ''Welcome Call'' & will call if she needs further help after that call.
     - CirrusMD, I was able to send an invite to her husb, but when I tried w/her it errored as no matching info.  I sent a support e-mail to CirrusMD asking for them to help her.  Let them know I sent him an invite.  Prov both parents'' e-mails & mentioned both need the child attached to their accounts.  Meghan knows to watch her e-mail because that''s how they communicate.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-11 12:35:13', '2022-04-11 12:35:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090608008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477526', 'Richard Bausch', NULL, 'Richard called for an explanation as to why his wellness visit was not covered by Planstin. I warm transferred Richard to Planstin so he could speak with them regarding his bill. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-11 12:17:24', '2022-04-11 12:17:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090631008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090312001', 'Graham Wellington', NULL, '04.11.22:  Called Graham - could not leave a message.  Texted him - told him I was notified he passed test and got certified. I asked to schedule a phone call to discuss on boarding to give him access to our platforms, etc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-04-11 12:12:52', '2022-04-11 12:12:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090631003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090312001', 'Graham Wellington', NULL, '03.28.22:  Called Graham, per referral by Bern Philipp.  Graham is a Healthcare Advisor with U.H., Etna, Signa, Humana, gap cos., such as Colonial, etc.  Wants to add our plans to his menu of services.  I directed him to go through the MPB Playbook training and take the test for certification.  He said he will do that.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-04-11 12:10:48', '2022-04-11 12:10:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090627008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, '4-11-2022:  Ron called re: his neck pain ''need''.  He started the need & sgnd the form from Zion, but hasn''t uploaded anything.  We went thru how to upload his pymt receipts, det Inv w/med coding, him paying as a ''cash-pay'' pt to the 1k IUA, etc.  He has an MRI today & chose a facility 1-1/2h away because they are ~$900 vs the $3500 his local cntr wants.  He seems to have a good grasp on it.  We went over if surg >5k call us unless an emerg & we''ll get him started w/Care Connect.  PT or alt treatments req prior approval - sub Treatment Plan from alt care doc to Zion to see if they will cover it.  He sounds miserable.  Hopefully, they''ll find a way to help!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-11 11:26:26', '2022-04-11 11:26:26'),
