  ('zcrm_1579374000090524003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, '**UPDATE** Jeff did call back and he has done all of his research: the facility and doc are in network, but he cannot get around the fact that the anesthesiologist is not in-network because they are the only group in his area that do procedures. Jeff just wanted to verify that he did not have a waiting period for his preventative colonoscopy, and I confirmed this for him. Jeff is a wonderful candidate for his plan! ~JTS

I called Jeff first thing this morning but had to leave a vm. Hopefully he will call back prior to having his preventative colonoscopy done so that we may verify the provider/facility is in the PHCS network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-11 07:13:02', '2022-04-11 07:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090444039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1559 Question : Hi, I have the SECURE individual membership with MPB...My coverage had an effective date of January 1, 2022. I am scheduled for a screening colonoscopy (preventative) tomorrow morning and I am trying to verify that there is no waiting period before I am able to have this procedure.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-04-10 08:56:46', '2022-04-10 08:56:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090474011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Rod', 'Visit ID : 1558 Question : I’ma current member, effective January 1, 2022.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-04-10 07:50:55', '2022-04-10 07:50:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090503003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601108', 'Kevin Fechtmeyer', NULL, '4-8-2022:  Kevin has an ear ache & wondered how to best handle it.  He''s had them before & thinks CirrusMD might work.  However, we both rec a "record not found" type error mess.  Sent support e-mail to CirrusMD w/family names & Kevin''s e-mail so they can connect.     - CA

4-9-2022:  Sat am:  Rec''d e-mail from CirrusMD - they had not yet heard back from Kevin.  Since he was in pain, I tried calling from GoTo & they system won''t come up this am.  Called him from my pers # & he found their e-mail in his spam fldr.  He''s out of the house, but will work on it when he gets home.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-09 11:46:45', '2022-04-09 11:46:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090469043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085148008', 'Emily Watkins', NULL, '4-8-2022:  Emily req''d price for gen Cytomel 5mcg, #30 (= only a 15 ds).  I''m not sure what was filled 1 mo ago.  It was end of day today &amp; she didn''t ans when I called.  Sent her 2 coupons since it''s Fri night:  Harris Teeter $10.98 (=she lists as her reg pharmacy) off RxGO  &amp;  Costco $9 on GoodRX w/disc for first fill.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-08 17:55:35', '2022-04-08 17:55:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090469038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109010', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, '4-8-2022:  Rick called & is very disappointed & frustrated he hasn''t rec''d his Planstin pdf yet since he was eff 4-1-22.  He''s waiting to get his ''prev'' care done.  I saw Jennifer tagged John when Planstin told us he was not in their system, but I don''t think we know where this issue stands.  Since Rick & Jenn have been working together, I only know a little.  I sent Jennifer Thorin-Savard a Teams chat for Mon am -- letting her know Rick needs card asap & to plez call him.  She mentioned she was working on this today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-08 16:07:42', '2022-04-08 16:07:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090449028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165404', 'Kathryn DiFrank', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-08 14:50:34', '2022-04-08 14:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090449023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153615', 'Roger Nigg', NULL, 'Cornea Ophthalmologist called to verify Roger''s "insurance". I explained what his plan entails, the self-pay process, and how anything above his $1000 IUA will be eligible for sharing with Zion Health. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-08 13:20:37', '2022-04-08 13:20:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090469023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083082002', 'Wendy Ali', NULL, '4-8-2022:   Wendy called while in line at CVS Pharmacy.  She had her knee looked at today & they prescribed Meloxicam 15mg, #30 & Capsaicin Cream 0.25%.  According to GoodRX, the Meloxicam alone sb $29.09 at CVS & I found it for $5+ 2 other places.  When she got to the front of the line her total for both items was just $14+ -- I told her that seemed like a decent price (no need to have her leave the line, etc., when I have no idea how much the capsaicin cr will add to the $5 Meloxicam).  For ease, I just let it be.  Especially, she sounds exhausted - chronic pain will do that to you.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-08 12:25:38', '2022-04-08 12:25:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090441018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153628', 'Mojisola Collins', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled eff 5/1/22.  Previous enrollment 4/1/21 to 2/1/2022', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-08 12:06:33', '2022-04-08 12:06:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090469018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477440', 'Richelle Entenmann', NULL, '4-8-2022:  Richelle called re: her son crashed on his mtn bike yesterday.  Pd ~$1600 already (which was almost 50% off for paying in cash &amp; at time of srvc).  He suffered a concusion &amp; they will be doing more (MRI, follow-up visit if nothing else), so we decided she''s going to go ahead and start a ''need'' with Zion.  She thinks it may go over the $2500 IUA.  I sent her the temp to sub a need to Zion.  She will monitor her e-mail &amp; seems set for now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-08 12:05:29', '2022-04-08 12:05:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090449018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939002', 'Ashraf Said', NULL, 'Called member back several times and she could not hear me. I believe it is her connection since everyone I have spoken to today has heard me just fine. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-08 11:58:41', '2022-04-08 11:58:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090449013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'Brian called because his therapist accepted his nomination into the MAP program, and he was wondering how the therapist was supposed to bill the MAP program. I transferred Brian over to MAP. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-08 11:56:53', '2022-04-08 11:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090441013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, 'Sent out cancellation link to cancel previous Sedera plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-08 11:42:24', '2022-04-08 11:42:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090469013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032313', 'Colette Krasnow', NULL, '4-8-2022:   Colette & her husband called.  He called 911 for an issue Colette was having yesterday.  She went to an emerg type cntr, but was not admitted to the hosp.  They did let the facility know they were ''cash-pay'' patients & pd the intial $120.  Sent them the temp for starting a ''need'' with Zion & went over uploading detailed inv w/med coding, receipts for pymts, etc.  They will call to confirm Zion can see the ''need'' ~ 48-hours after they start it.  They seem to have a good grasp on how to handle this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-08 11:16:45', '2022-04-08 11:16:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090469008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, '4-8-2022:  Jeff called again re:  Network info on his colonoscopy.  He''s just confirming because it''s next week.  He''s had a difficult time making sure all the entities are in the PHCS MultiPlan netwk.  We came up w/a plan of action & he seemed much happier when we got off the phone.
     - Saw PCP as initial visit.  Wants labs done.  Which labs?  Talked about what is cov as ''prev''.  LabCorp & Quest curr seem to be in netwk nationwide, so good place to start.  He knows to have them bill everything & it''ll kickback at discounted netwk rates.  He seemed good on this when we got done too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-08 11:12:59', '2022-04-08 11:12:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090461008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088688010', 'Caroline Jackson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-08 10:43:01', '2022-04-08 10:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090441008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088647001', 'Lee Geiger', NULL, 'After many attempts leaving VM''s w/member and HSA for America.  I have not received any Payment information for this member I will be cancelling him prior to enrolling', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-08 10:09:03', '2022-04-08 10:09:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090461003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086538002', 'Grace Hansen', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-08 09:45:13', '2022-04-08 09:45:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090449008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, 'Dayra informed me that we have received some return mail for Trent. I did call and leave a detailed vm for Trent with the concierge number and I also sent him a change form link via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-08 09:37:31', '2022-04-08 09:37:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090449003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, 'Ron called because he wants to go to an urgent care or ER for side effects from a head injury he sustained. I explained to Ron the cash pay process and sent him instructions for uploading his bills to Zion. Ron did call back again, and I found him a significantly better fair priced head/neck CT scan outside of his area. It would have been 5 times the amount if he would have gone to his local hospital. I advised Ron that if the desk staff at the hospital insist that he show an insurance card, to just have the hospital call the concierge team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-08 09:02:19', '2022-04-08 09:02:19'),
