  ('zcrm_1579374000090362079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083676002', 'Shannon Carley', NULL, '4-7-2022:  Shannon needed an RX quote:  Sent her coupon for Amox/Clavulanate 200/28.5mg/5ml, 4 x 100ml bottles (taking 20ml 2 x daily) = 10 day supp.  After talking w/Shannon, Safeway was best for her at $18.49 from GoodRX.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-07 18:07:34', '2022-04-07 18:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409010', 'Julie Macki', NULL, '4-7-2022:  Julie &amp; Jennifer have been working together.  Julie is struggling to understand when in network matters, specialists,etc.  To help out, I answered an e-mail Julie sent that Jennifer got late in the day.  Returned an e-mail w/details on everything Planstin/preventative &amp; specialist/needs.  Hopefully, it will help Julie understand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-07 18:05:04', '2022-04-07 18:05:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090383018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675217', 'Andrea Davis', NULL, 'Andrea called just to get a refresher on how to present herself as a self-pay patient at the dermatologist and if she needed to find an OBGYN and gastro doc in network for her mammo/colonoscopy. I explained the self-pay process and confirmed that she does need to find an OBGYN and Gastro in the network for her preventative care. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-07 14:55:11', '2022-04-07 14:55:11'),
