  ('zcrm_1579374000090394024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '4-7-22 Karen was not able to login to Solina''s account to upload proof of 1099 work. But, I was able to do so and I submitted it to her account. She''s all set on that front. Karen is making sure Zion receives the letter from Dr. Tusek stating that she did follow doctor''s orders. 
Patti called me back and said Planstin will honor the original start date without any lapse in membership. Planstin notifies Zion. Patti will bill Karen right now for April''s membership and they will be back on the regular billing schedule moving forward.  She re-enrolled in SECURE $1000/$275 and I waived the $100 fee but couldn''t remove the $25 fee. They are thrilled and working to sort out Solina''s current need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-07 13:34:22', '2022-04-07 13:34:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090394019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '4-7-22 Karen called in panicked bc her daughter Solina Kennedy was cancelled due to her aging into Medicare and having an April 1st end date. She never received the emails sent into her icloud email. So, Patti cancelled out the entire account. Karen didn''t complete anything on her end. Solina has an open Need from getting malaria while traveling in Ecuador. She was in the hospital for 3 days with a 107 fever. The doctor notes from Ecaudor say she refused malaria meds which was not true!  Dr. Tusek is also writing her a letter stating she didn''t refuse the meds, she wanted them per his direction. They are going to appeal the refusal.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-07 13:27:54', '2022-04-07 13:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090406002', 'Solina Kennedy', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-07 13:27:54', '2022-04-07 13:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090406002', 'Solina Kennedy', NULL, 'Wendy re-enrolled this member as she was previously enrolled under her mother.  She has an Open need and needs to be eff 4/1/22.  This was ok''ed by Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-07 13:26:27', '2022-04-07 13:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090394014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020161', 'Joshua Duffy', NULL, '4-7-22 Looks like this should possibly be Karen Levine''s account for tracking purposes, no Joshua''s bc he was cancelled a while back. Patti''s looking into it and will let me know. Otherwise, Karen''s acct is MIA but she''s getting billed correctly at $335 a month for PDHC $1500/$335.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-07 13:16:07', '2022-04-07 13:16:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, '4-7-2022:  Dylan just got a bill from Quest &amp; wondered if it''s all his resp.  We realized it may not have been billed to APEX, so he''s going to call to see if that''s where things went wrong.  He does have his RCI card &amp; presented that at the appt, so I think he''s on the right track.  We went over the only 2 items cov &amp; bal w/kickback at disc network rates.  He seemed happy when we got off the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-07 12:45:28', '2022-04-07 12:45:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '4-7-2022:  Matt called confused about his plan.  He''s trying to absorb what he''s learning. 
     - Went over everything Planstin & ''prev'' care:  Curr all entities must be in network, coded as prev, etc.
     - He thought the counseling is part of Planstin, but was in a hurry, so I let him know it''s a diff entity & sent him the MAP temp w/directions.
     - He had no idea how the IUA worked and was upset he had chosen the $2500 level once he realized it wasn''t a deductible.  Sent him the plan change form, did warn him there will be a 60-day wait period if he lowers to the 1k.  He sounds frustrated because he feels like he didn''t know the facts, but at least he has the form to contact Patti if he decides he does want to move forward.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-07 12:40:02', '2022-04-07 12:40:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529495', 'Keith Purcell', NULL, '4-7-2022:  Susan called to ask about her ''prev'' care.  Went over everything APEX, all entities must be 
 in netwk, doc must bill, labs, colonoscopies, mamm, etc.  She doesn''t know where her card is so I trans her directely at the end of the call to APEX &amp; gave her their # as well.
     - Went over the cards she does have &amp; helped her sort thru them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-07 12:19:12', '2022-04-07 12:19:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090383008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, 'Holly called in to receive instructions for submitting her bills to Zion, I sent them to her via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-07 11:58:07', '2022-04-07 11:58:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, 'Member is still trying to get a copy of her tax form from Redirect from 2021.  I advised her that we do not have copies of theose form and she would have to be in contact w/ Redirect.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-07 10:58:56', '2022-04-07 10:58:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090362018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '4-7-2022:  a female called from this #.  She was quite upset because she "just can''t get the tax forms" she''s req''d.  I don''t see anything in our notes, but she says she''s escalated this several times.  She was supposed to have them last Sat and now it''s Thurs & she still doesn''t have them.  She upset because she doesn''t know who she''s talked with, has no direct #, or a name.  First I confirmed she was trying to talk with MPB for a form re: her healthcare.  Then, I let her know Patti does the tax forms and would be the person to talk to & trans her directly to Patti''s line.     - CA

1/2-hour later:  Lady calls back & says she doesn''t understand why she can''t talk to anyone.  When I ask her what happened when I trans her just a short while ago she says "I haven''t talked to you this morning."  I''m not sure why so much confusion, but I trans her to Patti again & made sure she knew I was trans her to the person that can help her.  Told her to LM if Patti cannot pickup.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-07 10:43:22', '2022-04-07 11:11:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090383003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063952012', 'Donald Schoonover', NULL, 'Donald called in today to let me know that he feels that MPB.Health is not a legitimate company. He wanted to know his "insurance policy term" and when I tried to explain to Donald that belonging to a medical cost sharing group is quite different than have traditional insurance, he was not happy. I will be requesting a new MPB.Health membership card for Donald, I sent him a new welcome call scheduler so that he can have a welcome call, and I have also asked his advisor (Zac Masters) to reach out to him so that he could ease Donald''s doubts. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-07 10:12:08', '2022-04-07 10:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090358008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088875001', 'Samantha Raskow', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-07 09:53:36', '2022-04-07 09:53:36'),
