  ('zcrm_1579374000090362003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', NULL, 'Member contacted Sedera to get their RCI member number.  I gave Sedera what I had available on the RCI website.  Other than that they would need to be in contact w/RCI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-07 09:25:02', '2022-04-12 12:15:54'),
