  ('zcrm_1579374000090286013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, 'Jayne called for a little refresher about her plan. I clarified that it is 3 IUA''s per family, not per member, and explained how IUA''s work. Jayne was so happy to have a human being on the other end of the phone this AM. I thanked her for the kind words and being a valuable MPB member. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-07 09:05:09', '2022-04-07 09:05:09'),
