  ('zcrm_1579374000090286008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611010', 'Margo Hrabak', NULL, 'Margo called back because she had not gotten my email with the payment update form yet, but she realized she received it during our call. She is also having some issues with the vision in her left eye, I explained that if she went to a physician to be sure to present herself as a self-pay and collect all detailed billing. She stated that she was going to go to her eye doctor, and I explained that if she went to her eye doctor that it would be an out of pocket expense for her. She understood and would still like to see her eye doctor for this issue. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-07 07:25:28', '2022-04-07 07:25:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090286003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611010', 'Margo Hrabak', NULL, 'Margo called because she needs to change her payment and personal info we have on file. I emailed Margo the member change form link. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-07 07:12:54', '2022-04-07 07:12:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090231049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088568002', 'Thomas Parsons', NULL, '4-6-2022:  Tom submitted several requests for diff family members'' RX quotes (& I tt Tom).  Both Jennifer & I are working on these.  He prefers = Rite Aid, Walmart, CVS:
