     - Serena Raber:  Adapalene Benzoyl Peroxide 0.1% / 2.5%, 45gm Gel Pump.  Best Prices on RxGo.com = Giant Eagle: $26.10 (don''t know if location works) & Rite Aid $31.90.  E-mailed both coupons
     - Landon:  tt Jennifer, Landon''s Albuterol price will be the same as Tom''s [I included this info in the e-mail I sent]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-06 17:01:04', '2022-04-06 17:45:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090231031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '4-6-22 Kim wants to remember why she switched from Sedera to Zion bc Dr. Tusek asked her and she couldn''t remember. She also had some blood work done and not sure why Planstin isn''t covering it. Left vm for her just now at 3:30.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-06 15:30:42', '2022-04-06 15:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090231026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089146002', 'Pamela Garrett', NULL, '4-6-2022:  Kenneth (goes by Justin) tried to register for CirrusMD, but was using his nickname &amp; Pamela''s e-mail.  I was able to send him the invitation from CirrusMD &amp; made sure he knows to use "Kenneth" and his "justintimeinsurance@gmail.com" e-mail address as that''s what CirrusMD will recognize.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-06 15:29:27', '2022-04-06 15:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090227043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038331', 'Ari Newman', NULL, '4-6-22 Ari started his own company in 2020 and Sedera was good for while they were traveling and in general. But, now they feel like they need more coverage and prefer traditional ins for new employees. Wife cancelled already as of May 1st, 2022. They already got a new plan set up. He said he was very happy with my help and will let me know if they need anything in the future. I didn''t bother letting him know I could have helped set up their new small group with ins. Too late to change it anyhow. He was super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-06 15:24:48', '2022-04-06 15:24:48'),
