  ('zcrm_1579374000090231021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077371001', 'Linda Blake', NULL, '4-6-2022:  Linda''s husb Donald (w/Linda in the background) called to update her cc exp date.  I sent Patti''s pymt update temp to both their e-mails per their req.  They''ll get it filled out &amp; sub.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-06 13:44:29', '2022-04-06 13:44:29'),
