  ('zcrm_1579374000090196043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088593002', 'Marija Nadel', NULL, 'Marija called expecting the concierge team to negotiate her exam prices for her. She states that Karen told her that is something that the concierge team does for her. I explained that we do give the members the best rate in their area to use as a negotiation tool. She explained again that Karen told her that it is our job to negotiate her pricing for her. I explained again that we do not do that, and that I would provide her with pricing in her area for a PCP visit. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-06 10:52:12', '2022-04-06 10:52:12'),
