  ('zcrm_1579374000090196023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086528002', 'Cynthia Colandrea', NULL, 'Cynthia called because she received a bill from her preventative mammogram she recently had done. I asked if she had verified that the facility was in-network and she said yes, she even called the facility to verify. I warm transferred Cynthia over to Planstin so that they can explain her bill to her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-06 08:15:38', '2022-04-06 08:15:38'),
