  ('zcrm_1579374000090196013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, 'Lisa called to schedule her Welcome call. I sent her a link via email and she will be scheduling her call soon! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-06 07:40:14', '2022-04-06 07:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090196008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109010', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, 'Rick did not send his lab list to until later in the day and there were quite a few labs that I needed to research for pricing. I had let Rick know that it may take until the next business day to get his lab pricing done since he did not send his email with the list of labs until later in the day. I have followed up with Rick and sent him the fair pricing for the lab work in his area. I also advised Rick that he can also order his labs online through www.jasonhealth.com, print out the lab slip and bring it to his nearest Quest Diagnostics lab, which is in Philadelphia, PA. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-06 07:29:26', '2022-04-06 07:29:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090218023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763225', 'David Lung', NULL, '4-5-2022:  Dave called minutes before the conc line is set to close asking about RX pricing on 2 things CirrusMD just call to CVS for him to go get right now.  Stayed &amp; priced.  Even though CVS more, he said this time it''s easy so I sent him the two coupons: Pred 20mg, #10 = $6.80 &amp; Benzonatate 100mg, #21 = $9.28.  Only ran on GoodRX due to time &amp; pricing decent.  He may look at Costco or other pharmacies next time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-05 18:16:41', '2022-04-05 18:16:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090218018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084951011', 'Paul Notartomaso', NULL, '4-5-2022:  Meghan called -- no idea what they''ve purchased & she''s in the medical field.  She handles their medical stuff and the video was the only info she''d seen.   We did a ton:
     - Her husb must have done the ''Welcome Call'' per her.  She asked &  I sent her the link to sched one for herself.  I don''t see the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail (I think they system was down then), but since she''s doing a call, I''ll just let whomever does that call send it.  ** To her e-mail maybe?!? **
     - She had receipts she''d copied & uploaded to info@mympb.com for reimb...  After discussing, most are from prior to her membership 2/1/22 that Cigna had only pd about $20 towards.  
       The one item after her eff date (3/9/22?), she pd cash & rec''d 15% cash-pay disc from MD.  She wanted reim for this issue w/her daughter''s foot.  She doesn''t think it''s ongoing or anywhere near the 1k IUA.  Went over Healthsharing, IUAs(which she still seems to struggle with), deadline for having expenses considered for the IUAs, sub a ''need'', etc.  She''s definitely at the beg of the learning curve!
     - Discussed her HSA qualification, funds can then be used for things like her daughter''s visit if desired.  Acct can help her understand better the tax adv.
     - CirrusMD might be good option to keep from all the office visit fees she''s experiencing?  If it''s for something they can help with.  Hearing again in her ''Welcome Call'' sb helpful.
     - She didn''t even realize they were paying a monthly contribution, she thought this was free.
     - Hopefully, with her having a ''Welcome Call'' & hearing a lot of the same info a 2nd time, she''ll start to understand.  I think she & her husb had not comm on what this healthcare option is.
     - I asked if someone had gone over pre-x w/her several times, but did not get an answer.  The fact she''s trying to turn in receipts from before the eff date, concerns me that there could be issues there..     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-05 18:12:28', '2022-04-05 18:12:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090218013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '4-5-2022:  tt Lindsey (female) at APEX.  She ord new ID card,  sb ~14-21 days for arrival.   Call Ref #: FL0955542.   April  already had appt, so when card comes may need to have doc bill.
     - April &amp; I went over everything MEC: must be in netwk, what''s cov, MD must bill, etc.  
     - Gave her PHCS # to locate in network docs 1-800-922-4362
     - April''s cell #: 480-694-5338', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-05 18:09:27', '2022-04-05 18:09:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090220003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '4-5-22 Sammy called into Sedera to find out what to do to keep her membership active after she received emails from Sedera to update account by June 16th.  Patti and John said to wait until MPB has more information to share with the clients in the next few weeks. Sammy agreed to hold tight until we could provide greater information. She lives in TX, so she''s in the first group to need to add her bank account and update her account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-05 17:21:32', '2022-04-05 17:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090218008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109010', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, '4-5-2022:  Rick called back looking for information on the lab list he sent in.  Jennifer is gone for the day.  I sent her a chat.  He''d like the 3 of us to work together so he has someone after 5pm Eastern to talk with.  He''s fine if we talk about it tomorrow.  He''s concerned about pricing for 9 lab tests.  It would have been $46 on his old plan, now it''s?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-05 16:04:12', '2022-04-05 16:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090175026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088964002', 'Christopher Cucullu', NULL, '4.5.22 - Chris called to get his MPB.health portal information. I sent him an email with the info in it. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-05 14:15:56', '2022-07-28 12:43:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090175018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088509010', 'Scott Blossom', NULL, 'No-show for his welcome call. Left a detailed message and sent another scheduler via email so that Scott can reschedule for a better date and time. ~JTS

***NOTE*** Please remind members that it is of the utmost importance that they are on time for their Welcome calls as we are fully booked on a daily basis***', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-05 13:34:00', '2022-04-05 13:38:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088259002', 'Ian McGiffen', NULL, '4-5-2022:  Ian called at 9 min after the hour.  I let him know Jennifer Thorin-Savard sent him the resched link, because at this point it would run into her next call.  He''ll reschedule.
     - His son has his ''prev'' appt tomorrow.  He hasn''t rec''d his Planstin card yet, doesn''t know if the doc is in network, etc.  I went over everything Planstin.  Since it''s so time sensitive, I gave him Planstin''s ph # (in case he has to use it tomorrow from the office) to:
          1)  Ask for an immed digital card.  Our process would possibly take it past tomorrow.  
          2)  Told him to have them trans him to the PHCS  MultiPlan conf # so he can find out if the doc is part of the netwk.  He understands if they are not, it would not be pd for.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-05 13:32:31', '2022-04-05 13:32:31'),
