  ('zcrm_1579374000090200011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, 'Member emailed me asking what the payment increase was.  I advised that extra $25 would be the yearly renewal fee and that would be assessed each year in the April share Amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-05 10:04:03', '2022-04-05 10:04:03'),
