  ('zcrm_1579374000090175003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109010', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, 'Rick called with quite a few questions and some misunderstanding about dental/vision being included in his plan. I explained to Rick that as of right now, his plan does not offer dental/vision benefits (but they may be offered in the future) and then I directed him to the WHLC website for discounts. I will be researching lab pricing for Rick once he sends me a list of lab tests that are being ordered from his provider. He is also looking for a new PCP/Urgent care doc in his area. I will send him all the info via email once I have received his lab list. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-05 08:33:20', '2022-04-05 08:33:20'),
