  ('zcrm_1579374000090029043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965002', 'Robert Houvener', NULL, 'I was notified by Kevin Michaels &amp; Jane that this member had enrolled under Jane''s platform by mistake.  They have requested that I change member to Kevin in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-05 07:23:44', '2022-04-05 07:23:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990301', 'Sheri Razee Karner', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Sheri called w/questions:
     - Hurt her back. She saw a doc & has a few invoices, receipts, etc., but now they want to do PT.  She thought this would be Planstin.  Went over this will use her healthshare since she hurt herself & not ''preventative care''.  Sent her temp for sub ''need'' to Zion, 1k IUA, & PT will req she sub ''treatment plan'' from PT to Zion for prior approval.
     - Then she had questions on how to use her ''prev care'' through Planstin.  Went over everything Planstin & sent her the temp for ''Prev Care''.    
     [Had a bunch of calls.  I think that''s all we went over, but had to finish doc afterwards.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 18:07:07', '2022-04-04 18:07:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '4-4-2022:  April called w/quest re:  ''prev'' care.  She doen''t have a card any longer for APEX.  When I tried calling them they are already gone for the day.  Because I''ve had issue w/this comp before, we left it I will get further info &amp; call her back.  She was fine w/that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 17:18:58', '2022-04-04 17:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082589012', 'Bryan Moore', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Stephanie called re: Dental Disc site.  A long time ago she noticed their dentist:  Dr. Abraham in Park City, UT is listed, but she didn''t know how to get the disc.  I went into WHLC & there is a "DentalPlans.com" that comes up.  But, you have to join it, so I gave her the disc code: April22 & thier "Join Now" ph #.  Let her know I do not know their plans, but it shows "30-day Money Back Guar".  Read her a little info incl Suze Orman''s quote.  Then also let her know her advisor Traci McCoid, may have sugg on dental ins, but due to state lic may or may not be able to help there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 17:04:17', '2022-04-04 17:04:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088593002', 'Marija Nadel', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Marija & advisor Karen Torsoe called in together.  Marija is quite frustrated.  She did not feel the ''Welcome Call'' was helpful.  Didn''t rec the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail, which I can see Vanessa sent, so I cut & past including the time sent this am by Vanessa, which she did finally receive.  
     - She was frustrated that she doesn''t have everything she needs to sign-in to MAP.  She''s making it way more diff, so Karen had her on a zoom call, showed her how to do it, but then as I got off the phone, Marija didn''t seem to understand how to get into the MAP prog & Karen was going to do it w/Marija by having Marija share her screen so they can do it together.
     - Marija says she''s been calling all day 2/no answer.  I cannot see her in my log, so even though we confirmed the # she''s dialing is accurate, I have no idea where the call is going.  This is not the only person right now to complain about this!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 16:41:19', '2022-04-04 16:41:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006496003', 'Charles Grosel', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Wendy called re:  Liberty Healthshare.  After discussing she''s wondering if there''s another solution due to the inc in mo contribution w/Liberty.  I let her know her advisor Jane Kassel would be the best person to talk to re this.  She is still paying MPB $50/mo now per Admin123.   Made sure she has Jane''s #, but she needs to call a little later so she''ll call her directly when she gets a moment.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 16:20:28', '2022-04-04 16:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090124031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583032', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, '4-4-22 Called to see if she needed a 1095 tax form but she doesn''t have a MEC, so no. She was fine with that and lives in CO, so not an issue.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-04 16:12:49', '2022-04-04 16:12:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090124026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091727004', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '4-4-22 Jessica recently moved here from NYC to Denver and is setting up her own LLC which she is proud of doing. She''s been on Medicaid in NY and needs to update her status to prompt the cancellation. She has MS and gets infusions called Ocrevus every 6 months. These are crazy expensive but she''s able to join an Ocrevus Co-Pay plan with a $0 copay for the infusions. She''s checking to make sure the Bright Health $0 Ded Bronze Plan will suffice to qualify her for the Ocrevus plan. Bright Health will cost about $274 a month without a subsidy. DOB 8/11/88. She came to me via a Christina who''s part of a sound healing group. The Christina is deaf in one ear. I mentioned Christina Turco and she doesn''t think that''s the right person and I don''t believe BSU Christina Johnson has a hearing problem.  So, she''s not sure. But, she doesn''t qualify for MCS anyhow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-04 15:48:41', '2022-04-04 15:48:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, '4-4-2022:  With Paloma from UCLA Health.  Carlos is there to ''establish care'' with their doc'' & it''s not nec ''prev'' care.  She''s not sure if they are in the PHCS MultiPlan network.  I let her know depends on what he''s having done & his memb was eff: 1-1-21:
     - ''Prev'' care: Planstin, she''s going to tt PHCS to see if they are in network & has their # if questions on what is & is not cov.  Talked about even if doc not in network, labs @ network lab can be covered: Lipid & Vit D panels w/non-cov kicking back at netwk disc rate, colonoscopy appt, etc.
     - Other, non-''prev'' care = he''s ''cash-pay''.  IF > 1k, could qualify for help.  Please call us & we can guide.  
Paloma was super nice & seemed willing to help Carlos & wk w/us.  Really nice to have a doc''s off looking to cooperate!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 15:39:43', '2022-04-04 15:39:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601108', 'Kevin Fechtmeyer', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Bella from Assoc Retina Consultants called to understand how a medical expense for retina issues are handled (not std vision, it is medically necessary).  He has seen the doctor for several years, so she doesn''t think this has ever been discussed prev & doesn''t think pre-x.
     - She''ll make sure he knows he is ''cash-pay'' (sb < 1k today).  
     - Will let him know to call us when he gets home to learn how to start a ''need''.  If surgical, will eventaully be > 1k.  Will also make sure he has detailed invoice (w/med coding) & pymt receipt for submitting the ''need'' to Zion.
     She''ll call if further questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 15:36:06', '2022-04-04 15:36:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, '4-4-2022: Mary from the eye specialist for medical issues, called.  They''d given them their MPB.Health card & she wasn''t sure what that meant.  I went over w/Mary, depends on:
     - New Med ''need'', they are resp as ''cash-pay'' pts to 1k.  IF, this is part of the issue(s) she''s been having they may have already pd that. 
     - Then, pt starts a ''need'' w/Zion.  Zion will determine if qualified (she understood if not, pt pays).  But, if it is, she was worried they wouldn''t pay.  I went into MCS pays, etc. , and she sounded much more positive.
     Mary was very nice and sounds like she will work thru this w/both Yadira & MPB.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 15:25:36', '2022-04-04 15:25:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090115033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081753002', 'Anja Price', NULL, 'Anja called with questions regarding her annual wellness visit. She has 2 different doctors who perform her wellness visits: an OBGYN and a PCP. I will be looking into this for her as I have never had someone use 2 different physicians for a wellness visit. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-04 15:00:36', '2022-04-04 15:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755369', 'Rachel Allen', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update form I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 14:44:46', '2022-04-04 14:44:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '4-4-2022:  John had questions:
     - Redirect - download app.   - Call them w/questions, esp since he''s trying to make appt w/primary.
     - Asked about Sedera:  larger ''need'' items (outside of ''everyday'' care).  ''Cash-pay'' to $500, then we can help if he needs to sub a need.
     - MAP Prog - he just got off the phone w/his advisor Wendy Scipione.  She told him about the MAP prog & he wanted instructions.  Cheat sheet shows they did not have this before, but I''m assuming that''s been corr & helped him learn how to get in & what it was about.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 14:13:56', '2022-04-04 14:13:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090124016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '4-4-22 John wanted to review his membership. He has truly the best membership at this moment. He''s been using the chiropractic care and he''s planning to find a new PCP to start doing his wellness visits. He now understands the value of each component, MPB, Redirect, Sedera and I explained Life Care which he had no knowledge about. He will call Concierge to get help downloading Redirect''s app and understanding Life Care better. He asked about DPC as well since he saw some nearby. But, not really worth the extra money for his good health status.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-04 14:02:36', '2022-04-04 14:02:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090115028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-04 13:56:42', '2022-04-04 13:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540021', 'Paulena Shapiro', NULL, 'Member needed to update her address.  I sent out Change form link and also called to let her know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 13:48:13', '2022-04-04 13:48:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, 'Member submitted email to info to cancel.  Her HES Member ship is cancelled eff 4/1/22 also will cancel her complementary Care Membership eff 5/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 13:33:11', '2022-04-04 13:33:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, 'Member requested that email be sent to her husband to verify when her children were added to the plan.  Letter sent 4/4/22 via CRM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 13:28:14', '2022-04-04 13:28:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090115023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088055002', 'Deborah Sonnentag', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-04 13:20:24', '2022-04-04 13:20:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051098033', 'Scott Wiatric', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Scott''s son had to go to the hospital &amp; he just rec''d the invoices worth ~$2600.  Because of Covid, they didn''t let him into the hosp, so he''s going to call to see if they will give him a ''cash-pay'' discount.  Then, he knows he is resp for the first 1k IUA and will start a ''need''.  Sent him the temp to sub a ''need'' w/Sedera.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 13:16:42', '2022-04-04 13:16:42');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000090124011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '4-4-22 Emily was super nice and shared with me what she found which is Freedom Life through UHC PPO for $920 EF and includes dental and vision. She gets bonus $250 back for doing mammo and other $ incentives by doing dental cleanings, well visits, etc. She was ready to have true insurance so she can help get PT for her hips after birth of kids. They had to qualify for the plan and you can''t find it online. After submitting her # to an online thing where she got 100''s on calls, one nice agent helped remove her from the list and share Freedom Life with her. She''s tired of paying cash. She''s also a nutritionist and likes getting benefits from doing the wellness visits. Cancelled for May 1st, 2022.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-04 13:09:54', '2022-04-04 13:09:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Michekke cakked again.  Her ex-husb is not paying as he''s supposed to.  She wants a conf to send to him.  I fwd the call to Patti''s line, but it looks like she''s on the phone, so she''ll LM for Patti if she isn''t able to answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 12:56:21', '2022-04-04 13:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781071', 'Dante Ali', NULL, 'Per Traci this member will be able to pay on the 10th.  Same payment info but will have monies then.  I asked Traci to have them communicate this via email to me.  That they need to be in contact with us.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 12:41:27', '2022-04-04 12:41:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689015', 'Erica Hough', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add daughter Halle Hough.  She will be effective 5/1.  I will let member know via confirmation email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 12:16:59', '2022-04-04 12:16:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007186031', 'Michael Martone Jr', NULL, 'Member called in letting me know that he never got the cancellation request.  I resent to another email.  He then submitted cancellation.  I will cancel him as of 4/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 12:09:26', '2022-04-04 12:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090061013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, '4-4-2022:  Bren called.  She''s new & wondered what part of her ''prev'' appt/labwork Zion pd for...
     - Went over everything Planstin:  must be in network & show card at arrival for appt (says her new dr is) incl labs, facitilites, anesthesiologist, etc.  Dr/Lab must bill.  Labs not cov kickback at disc ( the Lipid & Vit D curr only cov as prev).  All must be coded as prev, etc.
     - Discussed what Zion is for, when it applies, deadline for starting needs, etc.
     - CirrusMD = she''s reg & we talked about how to use.
     - Traveling out-of-state, or country: disc out-of-state same, out-of-country = stab,  in Engl preferred, call as soon as poss, etc.
     - RX pricing.
     - Colonoscopy:  discussed everything.  Find something = goes to Zion & details how to hndl.
     - Partner just lost her job.  Has pre-x (6-12 mos ago).   Referred her to advisor Andrea Hinman to discuss options & let her know chg form to Ben Admin if/when they want to add her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-04 11:24:21', '2022-04-04 12:03:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090124003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084637032', 'Hila Benyacov', NULL, '4-4-22 Hila is super sweet. She called into C4 to make her as the primary, not her son. Someone with C4 instructed her to remove me as her agent for them to continue to help her. She was happy to put me back on as her agent immediately which she did and she didn''t need instructions to do so since it was fresh in her memory. I called C4 to verify her tkt # was resolved 220401000654. Liliana looked it up and then we got disconnected. But, she verified all was well. When I called back I got Simone and she could see Liliana had checked everything and the account was corrected with Hila as primary and her 1 year old son is now as secondary. They needed 5 pieces of identifying information which is just nuts! They couldn''t see why I was removed from the account. The new Tkt # is 220404-000479. All is set and I''m her broker still!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-04-04 11:23:58', '2022-04-04 11:51:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090120018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088568002', 'Thomas Parsons', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-04 11:15:18', '2022-04-04 11:15:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090120013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088967009', 'Jean Melenbrink', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-04 10:58:06', '2022-04-04 10:58:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090115018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, 'Yadira called in regard to her recent illness and billing for it with Zion. She needed to speak with Zion Health to verify that they received her signed form to gain access to her medical records. Yadira said that her experience has been great, I wanted to follow up with her after her ER situation. She said it is going well and I offered to transfer her directly to Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-04 09:51:48', '2022-04-04 09:51:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090120008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630187', 'Paula Amicarelli', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-04 09:48:04', '2022-04-04 09:48:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090115013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080496010', 'Wendy Plambeck', NULL, 'Wendy called regarding a preventative mammogram. I explained how to present herself as a self-pay patient, to collect any bills associated with the mammogram in case it goes about her $1,000 IUA amount. I also sent her the fair pricing from HCBB for a 2D &amp; 3D mammogram. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-04 09:32:37', '2022-04-04 09:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090115008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, 'Tara called regarding a pediatrician for her daughter. I explained that she can go to any provider and present themselves as self-paying patience. I explained to Tara to be sure to collect all bills and receipts associated with the pediatrician visit in case it goes above her $500 IUA amount. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-04 09:23:38', '2022-04-04 09:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090120003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087734002', 'Jocelyn Luhr', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-04 09:19:51', '2022-04-04 09:19:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090115003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630081', 'Dennis Orlov', NULL, 'Dennis called because he has not received any information regarding his plan. I asked if he had scheduled a Welcome Call yet and he stated he hadn''t. I resent the Welcome Call email to Dennis and asked if I could assist him with anything else and he stated no, that his Welcome call should be enough to explain his plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-04-04 08:59:25', '2022-04-04 08:59:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090104003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088593002', 'Marija Nadel', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-04-04 08:04:07', '2022-04-04 08:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410109', 'Steven Lodge', NULL, 'Member requested copy of his 1095.  Since he was on Redirect I directed him to them and gave him their contact number', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 07:38:29', '2022-04-04 07:38:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090086003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090048002', 'Lisa Chlysta', NULL, 'Karen requested start date to change from 5/1 to 6/1', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2022-04-04 07:27:44', '2022-04-04 07:27:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496009', 'Jo Reilly', NULL, 'I will send out email to advisor to be in contact with member. (via A123).', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-04 07:26:11', '2022-04-06 08:40:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090082003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088406002', 'John Blackburn', NULL, 'Received email from John regarding above note. Sent him another welcome email just now', 'Julia Avalon', 'Julia Avalon', '2022-04-04 07:20:25', '2022-04-04 07:20:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090054030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088406002', 'John Blackburn', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Rod', 'Visit ID : 1537 Question : I never received a welcome email for my membership', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-04-03 14:35:59', '2022-04-03 14:35:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522143', 'Steve Remmel', NULL, '4-1-2022:  Steve''s going to Singapore &amp; wondered if a typhoid immunization was covered by his Planstin ''prev'' care.  That''s such an unusal item, I trans him to Planstin to find out.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-01 16:46:34', '2022-04-01 16:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088951002', 'Kevin Rose', NULL, '4-1-2022:  Kevin sub req for RX pricing.  tt Kevin:  Kroger, Costco, Publix all right near them.  They use Kroger & Costco curr.
     - Kevin''s RX''s:  Losartan-HCTZ 100-25mg, #180 = $23.90 @ Kroger thru WeRx today.  Amlodipine Besylate (Besylate looks like std Amlodipine) 10mg, #180 = $12.81 @ Kroger thru WeRX as well.
     - After talking w/him, he had me run 2 of his wife Jacqueline''s items (he''ll get price on her patches later):   Venlafaxine ER 75mg, #30 - sent 2 coupons:  $5.99 @ Costco thru GoodRx (says includes disc for first fill.  In case they give her issues (is this first fill?), sent this second coupon: $7.99 @ Costco from RxGo).  Progesterone 100mg., #180 = $29.71 @ Kroger from GoodRX.  
     -  Sent coupons in 2 e-mails: 1=Kevin''s coupons, 2nd=Jacqueline''s.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-04-01 14:19:51', '2022-04-01 15:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090029038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090048010', 'Phillip Kirby', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-01 12:41:04', '2022-04-01 12:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090029033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937123', 'Tracey Nauright', NULL, 'Leslie contacted me about this member she wanted to know if she had been cancelled.  I let her know that I had sent her out the link however it was never submitted.  I gave her until today to submit.  I received the form and I will cancel member &amp; refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-04-01 12:13:16', '2022-04-01 12:13:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000090073008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, '4-1-2022:  Brian called, he needed direction:
     - He setup his ''prev'' appt.  Dr is in network & he''s conf w/them.  We went over everything Planstin, incl labs, etc.  He seems setup on this one quite nicely & seems good w/keeping everything prev.
     - He''s a conductor & notice a little pull a day or two ago.  He said he thinks it''s maybe a hernia.  At least curr, he thinks he''ll setup a sep appt to keep his prev, 100% prev.  Sent him temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion & went over ''cash-pay'' to $2500 IUA, keeping receipts, deadline for sub, etc.  He seemed to have a good handle on how to handle accurately & will contact us if surgery >$5k is sugg because he doesn''t think it''ll be an emergency, so he''ll have time to work w/Care Conn.
