  ('zcrm_1579374000089951123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071380029', 'Trevor Berry', NULL, '3-31-2022:  Melissa (& Trevor in the background) called re: a colonoscopy she has sched for Mon.  She asked if their plan helps cover those.  I went over her Planstin Prev would cover this since she''s never had one before as long as it''s in Network (doc, facitiliy, anesthesiologist, etc., all must be in Network) and how it could switch if they pull polyps to her healthshare since it becomes diagnostic w/a 1k IUA.
