  ('zcrm_1579374000089951113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085957002', 'Carl Ross', NULL, '3-31-2022:  Carl called.  Back in Dec 2021, their daughter had some immunizations done (they were on their old plan Self Directed Plan (27197) at that time).  He submitted things to Sedera & was told those are not cov on Sedera, so somehow/someone sugg he try APEX (I don''t see anything in the notes for this family''s accts).  APEX did not have any record for him.  While I was trying to bring things up (before I could see their accts, I let him know if there was an issue w/his MEC I could get him to our back office).
     - Finally got both of their accts (new & old up).  The old plan has NO MEC on it, so I''m not sure why he was directed to APEX/RCI.  When I saw their old plan (I wanted to verify I was correct and there was no MEC, so I called Patti).  After confirming, I called Carl back & let him know the old plan does NOT have the prev coverage on it.  He''s sure they were told otherwise & is going to ck their notes.  I let him know if they find something, please let us know and we will get him to the main office, because I won''t be able to do anything more for him on this.
     - I did let him know w/their new Secure Plan, they will have age appropriate immunizations thru the Planstin prev MEC plan.  (His replay, was, well that''s what we were told before ...  I can hear his frustration).  He seemed okay w/me, but frustrated w/what he feels is misrepresentation from prev communication.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-31 13:30:12', '2022-03-31 13:30:12'),
