  ('zcrm_1579374000089951059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089959012', 'Matthew Wyckoff', NULL, '3-31-22 Matthew is 44 and healthy, only has propecia which is balding and takes a med for that.  Propecia is cheapest $5-$22 and he thinks he''s paying about $40 right now. So, he will call Concierge for best price.  He watched the video. He thinks he wants/needs a colonoscopy soon. So, he will work on setting up his business or making sure it''s still active. He''s working as a W2 employee now but did have a side biz which he will revamp. He just joined CARE+ $1000/$240 for now starting May 1st. He will upgrade if/when able to show proof of biz. He also has an HSA from old job which he will look into how to access and fund in the future too.  Nice and easy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-31 10:25:16', '2022-03-31 10:25:16'),
