  ('zcrm_1579374000089896041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165404', 'Kathryn DiFrank', NULL, '3-30-2022:  Jennifer Thorin-Savard has been out this week.  On 4-1-2022 there''s a sched ''Welcome Call'' at 4:30pm Eastern on her calendar for Kathryn.  Joan asked me to resched due to the situation.   I sent an e-mail letting her know we are sorry, but we need to resched the call and included the rescheduling link.  ILM on the ph # listed in both the sched appt &amp; this acct.  Hopefully, between the 2 items, she will be aware of the issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-30 18:45:23', '2022-03-30 18:45:23'),
