  ('zcrm_1579374000089896023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954036', 'Teresa Fox', NULL, '3-30-2022:  Wendy cc''d me on an e-mail with Terri.  She''s been trying to call the concierge line & says no one is answering and there''s no VM.  I ''replied all'' letting Terri know I''m sorry she hasn''t caught us.  The log isn''t showing her #, so maybe I need to try her on a diff one?  I asked her to either try us again or to let me know the best # & I''ll call her.    
