  ('zcrm_1579374000089896018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964202', 'Tracy Goodemote', NULL, '3-30-2022:  Tracy called.  He has a lot he''s trying to accomplish:
     - He hasn''t done his ''Welcome Call'' yet, so I sent him the link to sched that & encouraged him to have his wife & other fam members on the call.  It''s a great way to have everyone able to help each other.
     - They are looking to have their ''prev care'' appts.  Went over everything Planstin & showed him how to use the PHCS search tool & gvmt site for the MEC plan.  They are at the age they need their colonoscopies & nothing would come up near them.  He''ll call PHCS for help with the network.  We discussed making sure all entities are in netwk & what happens if it become diagnostic - now resp for 1k IUA and it''s a need on their healthsharing.
     - Daughter''s having an issue with her eye.  It may be medical because of pressure and they need to do an MRI.  We walked through HCBB together.  I let him know it will need to fall into the ''medical'' realm for it to be shareable on his Zion.  Sent him the temp to start the ''need'' because they are already incurring expenses and the avg price for the MRI in his are is >$1200.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-30 16:21:43', '2022-03-30 16:21:43'),
