  ('zcrm_1579374000089896008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820032', 'Ottis Fausett', NULL, '3-30-2022:  Suzanne called.  She was trying to do a lot.  
     - She was looking for a neurologist in the PHCS network.  We went over that the network matters w/her preventative care.  She''s looking for diagnostic, so for this we went over HCBB together.
     - Next she wanted to see if her hospital is in the PHCS Network for getting her mamm done.  She hasn''t had one in a few years and they are the ones that provide them in her area.  We could not find anything in the PHCS MultiPlan Network search, so she is going to call the PHCS # on the back of her Planstin card to see if they can help her on this.
     - Her husband Ottis is listed as Female, I sent her Patti''s Plan Chg form to request that be updated to male.
     - We discussed the MAP Prog & how to access their site.  This could be a great resource with their concerns over dementia.  When she pulled up the site, it didn''t show the Assistance #, so I made sure she had their ph #.  [This isn''t the first person who says that # is not showing on their screen.  I have no idea why that''s happening.]
     - She also had never been into her Memb Portal, so I helped her get in & made sure she was aware of the User Name & PW for future ref.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-30 13:36:43', '2022-03-30 13:36:43'),
