  ('zcrm_1579374000089896003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965009', 'Melissa Rubinstein', NULL, '3-30-2022:  Melissa called, she rec''d my VM, but the e-mail did not make it to her.  She asked if I could resend it.  I cut &amp; pasted yesterday''s e-mail into my Outlook e-mail and sent it from there.  She knows it sb there shortly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-30 12:31:58', '2022-03-30 12:31:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089823043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746228', 'Tanya Hodder', NULL, 'Received Cancellation from this member after speaking with Joan.  She now has an employer plan.  I will refund the 4/22/ Share Amount &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-30 11:56:51', '2023-06-19 10:37:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089872008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746228', 'Tanya Hodder', NULL, '3-30-2022:  Tanya called to cancel.  I got another call immed following my trans her directly to her advisor Joan Phelps.  (see her note above).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-30 11:56:30', '2022-03-31 09:55:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089872003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065477440', 'Richelle Entenmann', NULL, '3-30-2022:  Richelle called totally confused & frustrated by her plan.  We went over a ton:
     - Prev = Planstin (went over everything Planstin).  She just had an appt w/a PHCS Network doc (per her) but told them she was cash pay.  We went over going back to them to have them bill.  She''s headed to LabCorp (a location I found near her) for labs & is aware not everything they''ve ordered will by prev.  Is going to have them bill to get the network disc, but knows she''ll be paying for some items.
     - Healthshare = Zion, no card.  Went over what this is used for & how it is used.  She was unaware of 3 x $2500 on IUAs and we talked a bit about lowering that.  She may call back to tt Patti at another time to see what that would look like.  Knows her 5/1/22 anniv date may be best opp & 60-day wait.
     -Mammogram:  Her docs sugg she have a mamm, but I didn''t find anything in network near her.  She will call the PHCS # on the back of her Planstin card to see if they have suggestions.
     - When she called she was very frustrated w/the system.  She thanked me when we were getting off saying she felt much better about staying with us and using her healthcare.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-30 11:54:56', '2022-03-30 11:54:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089866019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005454035', 'William Valentine', NULL, '3-30-22 It looks like I was paid for Jan and Feb of 2022 which might be reversed in the upcoming months judging from Sharon telling me she''s using her friend now and did so back in Dec. of 2021. :-(', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-30 11:45:09', '2022-11-04 15:25:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089823038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064746228', 'Tanya Hodder', NULL, '03.30.22:  Tanya called. Needs to terminate her membership, as she was recently hired for a new job with health insurance.  I asked Patti if we could cancel her membership for April 1, 2022, even though it''s after the 20th of th month.  Patti said we could if Tanya submits the cancellation form today. Called and left a message letting Tanya know and sent Tanya the link to the cancellation form to submit today.  Also emailed our Testimonial (Satisfaction Summary) form and asked if she would complete and submit it to us.  Told her, if she refers a member, I''ll give her the referral fee.  Tanya completed her testimonial form.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-03-30 11:27:58', '2023-06-19 10:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089859003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Sales Assistant & Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 1521 Question : Hi,', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-30 11:24:54', '2022-03-30 11:24:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089866014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, '3-30-22 Colleen asked her final questions and she''s ready to enroll once she sets up her new biz. We didn''t find Dr. Carolyn Ramsey DO in the PHCS network in Cldye, NC or Canton, NC or Dr. Vicky Scott Ob/Gyn in Asheville. But, I let her know we will hopefully have a solution any day now to take care of out of network clients with limited network. She really wants to keep doctor since worked with them for 20 years and has various allergic reactions to meds, etc. She will send me an email once biz is set up and she''s available to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-30 10:59:20', '2022-03-30 10:59:20'),
