  ('zcrm_1579374000089823018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480124', 'Wendy Summerfield', NULL, 'I spoke to Planstin and they said that Logan &amp; Keegan could stay on the membership until 4/30.  When I spoke to her I told her to be in contact w/Planstin to open a need.  Also that if there was any issue moving forward that Logan should re-enroll on his own fro 5/1.  I also let Zach know all of this.  Now I have to figure out how to charge member an additional  $175. for difference between Member Only &amp; Member &amp; Ch.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-30 08:30:19', '2022-03-30 08:30:19'),
