  ('zcrm_1579374000089772069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667061', 'orpheo mccord', NULL, '3/29/2022:  Orpheo called.  He accidentally backed over his 4 yr old today.  Thankfully, the dmg doesn''t seem catastrophic, but is in the ICU.  Diane Border had him call the concierge line.  We talked and decided the best thing to do was for him to talk directly with Zion.  Due to the severity of what''s happening we know it will easily be over his $2500 IUA.  That sometimes for ease, you can pay that amount directly to Zion and have things go faster.  I made sure he has Zion''s ph#, then trans him directly.  I made sure he was aware they''d have a form he''d need to sign too, so that things don''t get stuck if he doesn''t see that request come in since he has so much on his mind.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-29 18:39:37', '2022-03-29 18:39:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089772064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965009', 'Melissa Rubinstein', NULL, '3-29-2022:  Jennifer Thorin-Savard needs to be out of the office tomorrow &amp; there''s a listing for a ''Welcome Call'' at 3:00pm Eastern on her calendar.   I sent an e-mail letting her know we are sorry, but we need to resched the call and included the rescheduling link.  ILM on the ph # listed in both the sched appt &amp; this acct.  Hopefully, between the 2 items, she will be aware of the issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-29 18:33:46', '2022-03-29 18:33:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089772059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086950002', 'Summer Deaton', NULL, '3-29-2022:  Jennifer Thorin-Savard needs to be out of the office tomorrow &amp; there''s a listing for a ''Welcome Call'' at 3:00pm Eastern on her calendar.   I sent an e-mail letting her know we are sorry, but we need to resched the call and included the rescheduling link.  ILM on the ph # listed in both the sched appt &amp; this acct.  Hopefully, between the 2 items, she will be aware of the issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-29 18:26:32', '2022-03-29 18:26:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089772054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089146002', 'Pamela Garrett', NULL, '3-29-2022:  Jennifer Thorin-Savard needed to be out of the office today & there was a listing for a ''Welcome Call'' at 3:30pm Eastern on her calendar.  When Joan & I realized, we decided I should try to reschedule.  The garrettmail33@gmail.com listed on this account was the e-mail linked to the appt, but the names were listed as:  Nikki & Justin (which I do not see on this account).  But, I sent an e-mail letting them know we were sorry, but we needed to resched the call and included the rescheduling link.  Then ILM on the ph # listed (which did say "Justin" in the message).  Hopefully, between the 2 items, they were aware of the issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-29 18:10:44', '2022-03-29 18:10:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089772049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083247001', 'Michael Kjelgaard', NULL, '3-29-2022:  Michael (the son) called.  His parents told him to contact us to make sure he''s on the account (?).  We went over a lot!:
     - I sent him the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail sent to his parents so he has everything for reference.  Then we walked thru the following:
     - CirrusMD:  It doesn''t recog his info.  I submitted a support e-mail for him & cc''d him.  Asked them to contact him so he can get setup.  Mentioned it is the ''son'' Michael needing help.
     - Looking for a new PCP & cardiologist:
          - PHCS Network - we did a search together.  On my side it pulled up 454 Fam Prac.  On his it told him nothing matched his search.  I sent him the list.  We talked about using this to find doctors who he might want to see.  Then ck HCBB.
          - Showed him HCBB, how docs are rated, etc.  Explained when not prev no network req''d, but since he''s looking for a new doc, might be nice to have prev & reg care at same office.  Reminded him docs can come & go from the PHCS Network, but at least it''s worth a try.  Then gave him healthgrades.com & google as good resources to see more info on the docs.
     - Went over everything Planstin & prev care, the gvmt site, etc. (a lot via e-mail in response to his reply).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-29 18:00:51', '2022-03-29 18:00:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089793031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, '3-29-22 "Hi thank you. It had been so wonderful to be a part of this organization.  I will truly miss health Sharing with you all.
I am all set on Medicare and thinkI will hold off on the portion below. Thank you for everything!!
