Margie"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-29 17:16:31', '2022-03-29 17:16:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089793026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089959012', 'Matthew Wyckoff', NULL, '3-29-22 Came via ASHI. He''s looking to join ASAP.  Wife is 44.  No tobacco, no health issues in past 24 months, yes to meds. Goal is to reduce financial exposure. Talking with him on Thursday at 10:00 MST.  See Attached Questionnaire completed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-29 17:08:24', '2022-03-31 10:26:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089793016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091189002', 'Sarrah Claman', NULL, '3-29-22 Sarrah is 23 and healthy, no tobacco, no issues. She did have a kayaking accident where she cut her leg but no ongoing issue with that. She just returned from Peru. She will be living in ID and traveling a  bit to WA and other states. She will return to Canada in fall and may land back in US for grad school shortly thereafter. It''s all up in the air at the moment. She needs to ponder if she can afford this right now. But, income is about $40K for 2022, so not eligible for APTC. She''s super active in tons of sports per the Questionnaire attached. She will let me know if she wants to join. I will waive the $100 since she''s daughter of Tova Jacober. I need to let Tova know. Sarrah will be a river rafting guide this summer. She currently has travel insurance for Canadians. She knows of the deadline of April 20th for May 1st start date. CARE+ is best at $215/$1000 or $165/$2500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-29 16:37:47', '2022-03-29 16:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089772041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, '3-29-2022:  Kathleen called &amp; needed help getting into CirrusMD.  We were able to conf she has her acct setup w/her son on there (although, in looking after we got off the phone, he''s now &gt;18 years old &amp; will need to setup his own acct).  While we were on the phone she got in to her acct - she''s dealing w/either major allergies or a really bad cold (which is going around right now).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-29 16:04:04', '2022-03-29 16:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089772036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '3-29-2022:  Michelle called to verify what date her kids were added to her plan.  I let her know that next to their names, it shows 3-1-21.  That''s all she needed today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-29 15:47:53', '2022-03-29 15:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089772028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480124', 'Wendy Summerfield', NULL, '3-29-2022:  Wendy called, they''ve been having trouble w/their computer & e-mail system.   She''s going to reach out to Zion & I made sure she has their #.  They need to start a ''need'' for their son & have already pd > their 1k IUA.
