  ('zcrm_1579374000089793003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, '3-29-22 AJ wants to cancel bc she says her mammo isn''t getting paid for. I left her a vm to try to help her and to walk her through the cancellation process. I let her know she must complete the cancellation form and sign it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-29 14:22:19', '2022-03-29 14:22:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089780008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Liz called in asking if she was correct or was missing any information about coverage for Eye appointments. I let her know they only time it would be covered or shared would be if it turned into anything like Injury/Illness, if something were to be found that is wrong. Explained her cash pay patient up to her IUA and thereafter submit bills to Zion and start a Need. Sent Need Process & let her know about the Discount Program with WHLC and if there was a discount in her area, I would send the discount. Loved all of that and lastly mentioned she got an email from Wendy about her using her 12 free counseling sessions through the MAP program. I explained how to start that, and she has the phone number for them in her email. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-29 14:17:32', '2022-03-29 14:17:32'),
