  ('zcrm_1579374000089780003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089965012', 'Michele Palumbo', NULL, 'I have been speaking with Michele over SalesIQ chat for the last hour or so, answering questions that Michele had about the SECURE plan for her and her 2 children. I provided the pricing for all IUA''s in her age band of 45 years old. She said she wants to pick the $5000 IUA SECURE MF $565/mo, and wants to pay with ACH to avoid the 3% fee per transaction. She LOVES the WHLC Discount Program and being HSA Compatible. Michele has asked me to walk her through the enrollment process and will do so with the help of Patti as this will be my first time going through an enrollment. Michele seems to be very interested and ready to enroll now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-29 10:25:42', '2022-03-29 10:25:42'),
