  ('zcrm_1579374000089674043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496009', 'Jo Reilly', NULL, '3-28-2022:  Jo called saying she wants to cancel because her employer is now offering healthcare.  It just says ''sales'' in the advisor information, so I transferred her to Patti''s line.  She should know how best to proceed on this one.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-28 13:21:18', '2022-03-28 13:21:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089663075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838117', 'Allan Tidwell', NULL, 'Member emailed in requesting copy of 1095C.  I sent member copy in response to email that was sent to Dayra.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-28 13:06:02', '2022-03-28 13:06:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089674038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, '3-28-2022:  Bill called.  He meant to be calling Zion because they were working on getting the HIPPA form signed.  The doctor forgot to put certain items in his notes as well, so they were discussing that.  Yadira had a bleed prev, but curr it is a diff issue.  After talking w/Zion, he thinks they are on the right track now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-28 13:05:12', '2022-03-28 13:05:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089674033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060475077', 'James Brown', NULL, '3-28-2022:  James called.  He''s receiving collections notices on items he thought Zion should have been paying for his wife''s surgery in 2021.  I gave him Zion''s # &amp; transferred him directly so he can go over that with them.  He''s was grateful for the help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-28 12:38:51', '2022-03-28 12:38:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089674028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069442190', 'Julius Comia', NULL, '3-28-2022:  Julius called to find out what he needs to do since his son is turning 26 and what the pricing will look like when that happens.  I transferred him directly to Patti''s line since she helps people with this &amp; especially since it will involve pricing changes.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-28 12:37:15', '2022-03-28 12:37:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089663070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330064', 'Diane VanWeelden', NULL, 'Member''s daughter Jenna will be turning 26 eff 5/1/2022.  I will notify member and advisor.  No change due to still family.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-28 12:33:44', '2022-03-28 12:33:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089663065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163282', 'Zina Murray', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare eff 5/1/2022.  I will send out notification to member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-28 12:24:48', '2022-03-28 12:24:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089662013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356826', 'Jennifer Woomer', NULL, 'Jennifer called in and said that she has recently found out that she is going to need to have her Hip replaced. She has been having a lot of pain and issues with her right side of her Hip and was told she needs to replace her hip. She asked me to look up a specific doctor she is being sent to and make sure he is in the network. I explained to her she does not need to go to a provider in the network for this type of issue. Only for things that are Preventative mandated by the ACA. For anything Injury/Illness she can go anywhere she likes and is a cash paying patient up to her $2500 IUA. Everything else she is to submit to Zion and start a Need with them. I informed her it would be best for her to call Zion after she is done with me and tell them what is going on and she needs a hip replacement. Especially for something this major and big. Lastly, she asked if all the appointments she went to a month or so ago in relation to her hip pain, if all of that would go to her IUA as well. I said yes of course since this is for the same exact incident. Anything pertaining to her hip, any appointments, prescriptions, etc. All of that goes towards her IUA. Everything AFTER her IUA is covered by Zion. I sent her the how to submit bills to Zion email with the link to the list of Preventative Items covered under her plan as requested. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-28 12:24:02', '2022-03-28 12:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089663057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, 'Member''s spouse will be aging into Medicare eff 5/1/22.  I will notify member &amp; advisor of this.  i will await members Change form submission prior to notifying Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-28 12:10:59', '2022-03-28 12:22:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089679008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '3-28-22 She found a place on her own that worked for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-28 11:46:30', '2022-03-28 11:46:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089679003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061317', 'Patricia Barnett', NULL, '3-28-22 Patricia wants to know where/how the best place is to get covid test to travel soon. Last time she paid $200 at Urgent Care and wants to avoid.  I sent her an email on Thurs to respond and told her to call Concierge but I don''t see any notes indicating she called. So, I left a vm just now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-03-28 11:42:26', '2022-03-28 11:42:26'),
