  ('zcrm_1579374000089663029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077408229', 'Dennis Burd', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-28 10:35:44', '2022-03-28 10:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089674003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080864013', 'Marian Townsend', NULL, '3-28-2022:  Marian called re: her mammogram & the PHCS Network.  She''s concerned because she lives in a tiny town in CO w/16k people.  There are not many people in Network.  What if the person that reads the mamm isn''t in netwk?  We went over everything Planstin & she''s very upset.  This is NOT what she was told when it was presented to her.  She was told there are no netwks.
     - So then we discussed the diff entities.  No Network w/MCS portion.  Prev must be in netwk.  How it can go from prev to diag & chg entities. 
     - She was at work & had to go.  I tried to help her thru this, but she truly didn''t understand what she purch & I can tell is having a hard time understanding.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-28 10:34:26', '2022-03-28 10:34:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089663024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084653001', 'Marianne Aultz', NULL, 'Member''s dependent Alec will be aging out 5/22.  I will notify member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-28 10:17:02', '2022-03-28 10:17:02'),
