  ('zcrm_1579374000089663006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084286002', 'Jacob Cranman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-03-28 09:42:28', '2022-03-28 09:42:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089662003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'Elizabeth called because she is going through paperwork and wanted to know if some blood work she had done for checking her thyroid, A1c, etc, would be covered with her plan. I told her with her plan there is no Preventative coverage and that would be all out of pocket. She also asked about Sedera not having Preventative coverage anymore and I confirmed with her that is true. The last question she had was about a Mammogram. I told her the mammogram, colonoscopy are covered through sedera she would just need to call them and they can walk her through the process. She was perfectly fine with that and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-03-28 09:04:58', '2022-03-28 09:04:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089603003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032281037', 'Tammie Petty', NULL, '3-25-2022:  Husb on disability &amp; Medicare.  Guy told her she needs the 1099 from their bus.  But, she called because they sold their CO Farmer''s Agency &amp; the only 1099 she has is from 2020.  We went thru the list of acceptable items &amp; she''s going to try to get a cert of part from an MLM she works with.  She''ll call if she has further questions.  I didn''t say anything, but we could ck to see if that old 1099 would be acceptable if she has issues getting the other MLM cert.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-25 16:08:13', '2022-03-25 16:08:13'),
