  ('zcrm_1579374000089570008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, 'Drew called in regard to dental/vision benefits included with his Redirect plan. I explained to Drew that I was unaware of any dental or vision benefits included with his plan and advised him to speak with Redirect Health. He then started asking me specifics on who decides what when it comes to the elements included in the plans and I explained that I did not know the definitive answer to that question. He was then asking me for pricing to add his son, Cole, and I explained that he would need to speak with his advisor, Wendy, for that information as we here on the concierge team do not handle any sales aspects of the plans. Drew is very frustrated because he just does not understand why he has several different numbers and cards. I did attempt to explain everything to him, but I believe he was honestly so frustrated that he did not want to listen to what I was saying. I did advise Drew to speak with Wendy about adding his son to his plan and transferred him over to Wendy. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-25 09:24:08', '2022-03-25 09:24:08'),
