  ('zcrm_1579374000089543013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089510002', 'Tyler Farrish', NULL, 'I spoke with Angel about this member living in CA re: State Mandate.  He said that he spoke with them about it and that Tyler is a Preventative provider so he took care of that service.  However that since he is coming off a membership w/ Liberty that had exemption, he would consult a Tax Professional about this.  Member is aware.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-25 07:19:19', '2022-03-25 07:19:19'),
