  ('zcrm_1579374000089501024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '3-24-2022:  Mat called - he''s been told to have Phys Therapy to regain range of motion, he wondered how they work that.  I told him to get a ''Treatment Plan'' from the doctor &amp; sub asap -- that for alt therapies they want to pre-approve the plan.  He asked if his orthopedic surgeon also needed to do that &amp; I explained it''s more for the alt therapies.  He''s going to get that from them &amp; add it to the ''need'' he already started.  He''s resched the appt he had for tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-24 15:29:37', '2022-03-24 15:29:37'),
