  ('zcrm_1579374000089472013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'David called because he had received and EOB from Planstin and now a bill from the provider that his wife saw for her annual physical. He is wondering why certain items were covered and why some were not, because it seems to change ever enrollment year. I explained that I would have to have David speak with Planstin regarding this bill and EOB since I cannot see any of these items. I warm transferred David to Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-24 11:53:58', '2022-03-24 11:53:58'),
