  ('zcrm_1579374000089501003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240001', 'Samuel Haefner', NULL, '3-24-2022:  Samuel was having a hard time getting into the portal on MPB.Health.  We walked thru it together & he''s in.     - CA

Samuel e-mailed in asking for more help.  He was trying to setup a counseling appointment and needed help doing that (I asked in the prev call if I could help w/anything else, so he must have realized after the fact, what he was looking for was not in the MPB.Health section.  Then he e-mailed the office, so I called him back.)  When he logged into the MAP Program, he did not see the Assistance #.  He was going to try a different browser, but we got disconnected.  I sent him a screenshot, so now he at least has their Ph# & knows what the landing page should look like.  I was able to call him back & go over everything.  He''s using Chrom & is sending a screen shot because that''s not what he''s seeing.  I told him I''d fwd the comparison shots to our IT Dept.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-24 10:20:45', '2022-03-24 11:26:30'),
