  ('zcrm_1579374000089472003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083475009', 'Mark Stevens', NULL, 'Michelle Stevens called in regarding 2 labs she is needing done. I sent her the following email on how to purchase these labs from Jason Health and take them to the nearest Quest Diagnostics lab near her: 

Good morning, Michelle!

I have found a Quest Diagnostics lab in your area ? and I am also providing information on how to purchase these 2 labs from Jason Health so that you may pay for these two tests online and print off the lab slip to take to your nearest Quest Diagnostics Lab. This will be your least expensive option for these labs. Please follow these instructions:

1. Vist www.jasonhealth.com
2. Choose "Find a Lab" and enter your zip code (this was the nearest Quest Diagnostics Lab I found near you):
Quest Diagnostics
5901 E Riverside Blvd
Rockford, IL 61114-4935
Open: M-F, Sa, Sa (show hours)
3. Search the lab tests you are needing from the drop-down box on the top of the page (the total for the 2 labs and any fees associated should be $38.00).
4. Proceed to checkout and pay for all labs.
5. Print off the lab order and simply bring it to the Quest Diagnostics Lab near you ?
Please let me know if there is anything else that I can assist with, I am always happy to help!

I hope you have a wonderful day!

Best Wishes,
Jennifer Thorin-Savard
MPB.Health Concierge Team
1-800-519-2969', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-24 07:47:05', '2022-03-24 07:47:05'),
