  ('zcrm_1579374000089442013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', NULL, '3-23-2022:  Katherine sub RX quote request.  We went over pharmacy options (her RiteAid is >dbl other pharmacies), but, for convenience she was thrilled with a GoodRX coupon at any RiteAid, Lisinopril 10mg, (increased #:) #90 for $13.90 on GoodRX.  She liked the convenience of staying at the same pharmacy & its location. 
      I let her know Safeway, Vons, and Pavilions Pharmacy all have coupons today for $5.44 if any of those are convenient (all on GoodRX).  
     After we got off the ph, I reran the new qty on several sites & let her know I found a RiteAid location specific coupon for $12.61 if she wants to provide the location.  However, she just responded w/"Awesome, thank you so much!".  The specific location, slightly cheaper coupons came up on both  the WeRX & PharmacyChecker sites.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-23 16:38:11', '2022-03-23 16:38:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089442008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833045', 'John Mendocha', NULL, '3-23-2022:  Responded to the missed chat doc above.  Gave him the link &amp; details to free COVID testing in his area &amp; that if they ask for ins info, he''s a ''cash-pay'' pt, so no ins.  
     - Also sent HCBB list of derm w/in 20-miles of his zip code 92324 w/''cash-pay'' min to his $1000 IUA.  If expense is going may go beyond that we can help him sub a need to Zion to see if it is a qual ''need'' for sharing.  Didn''t go into too much detail because most derm items are far less than the IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-23 16:22:56', '2022-03-23 16:22:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089442003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064068018', 'Robert Coray', NULL, '3-23-2022:  Robert''s advisor Misty Berryman had him call us to make sure he''s handling his ''need'' correctly on his knee accident (no pre-x.  hurt it last fall & mos after his eff date.  nothing prior to that).  He''s done great!  He started a ''need'' w/Zion, sgnd the form, & they''ve offered him pymt options.  He''s a doctor, so he''s been able to get really good pricing on things - it can''t hurt to point out his efforts, before & after pricing, to see if they''d honor the reduced IUA.  He knows that will be up to them though.  We did discuss if surgery later, > 5k we have a gr to help w/pkgs, no bills, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-23 15:29:10', '2022-03-23 15:29:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089414024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833045', 'John Mendocha', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 1499 Question : I am a member and I think I have cover. I have a rash and have lost my sense of taste. my primary doc can''t d', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-03-23 15:06:35', '2022-03-23 15:06:35'),
