  ('zcrm_1579374000089413052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052500084', 'Marie Green', NULL, 'Member called in asking how to remove her daughter that now has employer benefits.  I will email her the Member Change Form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-23 13:23:42', '2022-03-23 13:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089418015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, 'Rossana called with questions regarding the PHCS network. She was wondering how to go about getting her husband''s preventative colonoscopy. I explained that she needed to find someone in the PHCS network for this, along with the preventative bloodwork that may be done. Rossana said it best when she said "so I don''t just assume that the doctor knows that I need to use facilities and providers in the PHCS network?" She was all set and ready to use the information I shared with her. I also did another request for her Planstin cards. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-03-23 13:08:19', '2022-03-23 13:08:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089413047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603201', 'Kamaljeet Singh', NULL, 'Member called in asking for copies of his father''s (Amrik Singh) 1095.  I sent out to him.  He also asked why his payment was still being drafted from old bank account.  I looked in A123 and he updated that after the March payment was drafted and April was drafted from new account.  He has incurred some overdraft charges.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-23 12:49:06', '2022-03-23 12:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089413039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919315', 'Dillon Roy', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know why he was being billed still after he cancelled.  I had no record of him calling in and speaking to anyone here.  Last note was when he did his welcome call.  Also spoke to Andrea who has no record of speaking to him. I advised that I could refund him the April payment but nothing else.  Will send him the cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-23 12:44:15', '2022-03-23 12:44:45'),
