  ('zcrm_1579374000089347023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078716002', 'Jack Sevison', NULL, 'Member called and left VM after hours asking if he needed some proof of the fact that he was on our plan for the month of Dec.  I responded via email and let him know since he has Care + there is no Insurance and that there is no Individual Mandate anymore.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-03-23 07:24:06', '2022-03-23 07:24:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089353052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067828010', 'Luke Seamans', NULL, '3-22-2022:  Luke e-mailed the info.  I completed everything thru City Mkt in Aspen, CO &amp; sent him the coupons.  [Safeway was $3 less on Buproprion XL, but with these items I thought a single stop would be more convenient &amp; best.] 1)  Alprazolam 0.5mg, #20 = $4.60 thru WellRX.com;   2)  Gen Lexapro = Escitalopram Oxalate 10mg, #90 = $10.83 thru WellRX.com;   3)  Gen Wellbutrin XL = Buproprion XL 150mg, #90 = $16.27 for a 90-day supp on GoodRX.com.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-22 18:40:28', '2022-03-22 18:40:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089353047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, '3-22-2022:  Marty called &amp; we discussed.  He has enough to get him thru &amp; is thrilled the Reid''s quote came in = Eliquis 5mg, #168 tabs: $211.75 + $9.95 shipping.  [Locally the cheapest $168 tabs came in at $1462.37. ]  Sent him Reid''s info &amp; quote.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-22 18:31:17', '2022-03-22 18:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089353039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063666179', 'Monique Jensen', NULL, '3-22-2022:  Monique just got an RX for an antibiotic &amp; wondered how that works on our plan.  I found her $5.27 at Costco (Cephalexin 500mg, #30) and sent her the coupon.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-22 17:28:28', '2022-03-22 17:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000089353031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '3-22-2022:  Jayne called while I was on the phone w/another member.  Tried calling her & had to LM.     - CA

Jayne called back re: getting her blood drawn.  Wanted to know if LabCorp was part of the network because they told her they don''t take Planstin.  I explained to show them the back of the card where "PHCS" is listed, that they should recognize.  Told her anything other than the 2 panels the prev covers will kickback as denied, but will be at the network discounted rate.  So at least she''ll still get a good rate for the other items.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-03-22 15:46:33', '2022-03-22 15:55:56'),
